  ('769937780928470787', 'Thank You, Next', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ece Yörenç', 'Ece Yörenç', 'Serenay Sarıkaya, Hakan Kurtaş', null, 'After a painful breakup, a young lawyer dives head first into the confusing world of modern dating, with the unwavering support of her best friends.', 'After a painful breakup, a young lawyer dives head first into the confusing world of modern dating, with the unwavering support of her best friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3tO7n5GbRcnPwnTfbimY4y3yv4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:251883'),
  ('344750473950169380', 'TharnType', 2019, 'Drama', 'MAME', null, 'Suppasit Jongcheveevat, Kanawut Traipipattanapong, Napat Srinakluan, Phachara Suansri, Chalongrat Nobsamrong, Becky Armstrong, Tanatorn Saenangkanikorn, Pattarabut Kiennukul', null, 'Type hated the idea of sharing a room with a gay guy. But now, he''s starting to question what he thought he knew.', 'Type hated the idea of sharing a room with a gay guy. But now, he''s starting to question what he thought he knew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofK4Z2zGyLfjKqSTQyQhtdrU43O.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93975'),
  ('806194135143784632', 'That ''70s Show', 1998, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Mark Brazill, Bonnie Turner, Terry Turner', null, 'Mila Kunis, Danny Masterson, Laura Prepon, Wilmer Valderrama, Debra Jo Rupp, Kurtwood Smith, Don Stark, Tommy Chong', 'TV-PG', 'Crank up the 8-track and flash back to a time when platform shoes and puka shells were all the rage in this hilarious retro-sitcom. For Eric, Kelso, Jackie, Hyde, Donna and Fez, a group of high school teens who spend most of their time hanging out in Eric’s basement, life in the ‘70s isn’t always so groovy. But between trying to figure out the meaning of life, avoiding their parents, and dealing with out-of-control hormones, they’ve learned one thing for sure: they’ll always get by with a little help from their friends.', 'Crank up the 8-track and flash back to a time when platform shoes and puka shells were all the rage in this hilarious retro-sitcom. For Eric, Kelso, Jackie, Hyde, Donna and Fez, a group of high school teens who spend most of their time hanging out in Eric’s basement, life in the ‘70s isn’t always so groovy. But between trying to figure out the meaning of life, avoiding their parents, and dealing with out-of-control hormones, they’ve learned one thing for sure: they’ll always get by with a little help from their friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laEZvTqM80UaplUaDSCCbWhlyEV.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:52'),
  ('945065498812724943', 'That ''80s Show', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Mark Brazill, Terry Turner, Linda Wallem', null, 'Glenn Howerton, Tinsley Grimes, Chyler Leigh, Eddie Shin, Brittany Daniel, Margaret Smith, Geoff Pierson', null, 'That ''80s Show is an American sitcom that aired from January through May 2002. Despite having a similar name, show structure, and many of the same writers and production staff, it is not considered a direct spin-off of the more successful That ''70s Show. The characters and storylines from both shows never crossed paths. It was a separate decade-based show created because of That ''70s Show''s popularity at the time.', 'That ''80s Show is an American sitcom that aired from January through May 2002. Despite having a similar name, show structure, and many of the same writers and production staff, it is not considered a direct spin-off of the more successful That ''70s Show. The characters and storylines from both shows never crossed paths. It was a separate decade-based show created because of That ''70s Show''s popularity at the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/G3o231392GAHrxgZzx8pACD9IX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2689'),
  ('567080000527453021', 'That ''90s Show', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Gregg Mettler, Bonnie Turner, Lindsay Turner', null, 'Kurtwood Smith, Debra Jo Rupp, Callie Haverda, Ashley Aufderheide, Mace Coronel, Reyn Doi, Sam Morelos, Maxwell Acee Donovan', 'TV-14', 'Hello, Wisconsin! It''s 1995 and Leia Forman, daughter of Eric and Donna, is visiting her grandparents for the summer where she bonds with a new generation of Point Place kids under the watchful eye of Kitty and the stern glare of Red. Sex, drugs and rock ''n roll never dies, it just changes clothes.', 'Hello, Wisconsin! It''s 1995 and Leia Forman, daughter of Eric and Donna, is visiting her grandparents for the summer where she bonds with a new generation of Point Place kids under the watchful eye of Kitty and the stern glare of Red. Sex, drugs and rock ''n roll never dies, it just changes clothes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZcufEuqZqNYMx6mNjlh2rmjDqx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:135959'),
  ('57568657151356805', 'That Damn Michael Che', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Michael Che', null, 'Michael Che', 'TV-MA', 'Michael Che shares his unique perspective on controversial topics with the help of fellow Saturday Night Live stars, sketches, and vignettes to illustrate what it feels like to experience various every-day situations including racial profiling, unemployment, falling in love and more.', 'Michael Che shares his unique perspective on controversial topics with the help of fellow Saturday Night Live stars, sketches, and vignettes to illustrate what it feels like to experience various every-day situations including racial profiling, unemployment, falling in love and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9VQefDLjVyaZlBd4UWumOyyOua.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:124152'),
  ('714135689819578396', 'That Dirty Black Bag', 2022, 'Western, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Mauro Aragoni', null, 'Dominic Cooper, Niv Sultan, Douglas Booth, Travis Fimmel, Paterson Joseph, Rose Williams, Zoe Boyle, Eugene Brave Rock', 'TV-MA', 'The 8-day clash between Arthur McCoy — an incorruptible sheriff with a troubled past — and Red Bill, an infamous, solitary bounty hunter known for decapitating his victims and stuffing their heads into a dirty black bag.', 'The 8-day clash between Arthur McCoy — an incorruptible sheriff with a troubled past — and Red Bill, an infamous, solitary bounty hunter known for decapitating his victims and stuffing their heads into a dirty black bag.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSk9On9NPZKX9e4zlu7ribuRIMB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157084'),
  ('908743113084582543', 'That Girl', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Bill Persky', null, 'Marlo Thomas, Ted Bessell, Lew Parker', 'TV-PG', 'That Girl is an American sitcom that ran on ABC from 1966 to 1971. It stars Marlo Thomas as the title character Ann Marie, an aspiring actress, who moves from her hometown of Brewster, New York to try to make it big in New York City. Ann has to take a number of offbeat "temp" jobs to support herself in between her various auditions and bit parts. Ted Bessell played her boyfriend Donald Hollinger, a writer for Newsview Magazine; Lew Parker and Rosemary DeCamp played Lew Marie and Helen Marie, her concerned parents. Bernie Kopell, Ruth Buzzi and Reva Rose played Ann and Donald''s friends. That Girl was developed by writers Bill Persky and Sam Denoff, who had served as head writers on The Dick Van Dyke Show earlier in the 1960s.', 'That Girl is an American sitcom that ran on ABC from 1966 to 1971. It stars Marlo Thomas as the title character Ann Marie, an aspiring actress, who moves from her hometown of Brewster, New York to try to make it big in New York City. Ann has to take a number of offbeat "temp" jobs to support herself in between her various auditions and bit parts. Ted Bessell played her boyfriend Donald Hollinger, a writer for Newsview Magazine; Lew Parker and Rosemary DeCamp played Lew Marie and Helen Marie, her concerned parents. Bernie Kopell, Ruth Buzzi and Reva Rose played Ann and Donald''s friends. That Girl was developed by writers Bill Persky and Sam Denoff, who had served as head writers on The Dick Van Dyke Show earlier in the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQtkMZZQre3Kf17tSnOy41ijAfV.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1925'),
  ('677607899804701898', 'That Girl Lay Lay', 2021, 'Comedy', 'David A. Arnold', null, 'Alaya High, Peyton R. Perrine III, Gabrielle Nevaeh, Caleb Brown, Thomas Hobson, Tiffany Daniels', 'TV-G', 'That Girl Lay Lay follows Lay Lay, the perfect hype girl and best friend that anyone could ever want from their personal affirmation app. Struggling to make her mark at school and needing a best friend to talk to, Sadie wishes upon a star that Lay Lay was real and could help teach her how to stand out. When her wish comes true and Lay Lay is magically brought to life, the two friends learn that when they are together, they can accomplish anything, and navigate life as teenagers and discover who they truly are.', 'That Girl Lay Lay follows Lay Lay, the perfect hype girl and best friend that anyone could ever want from their personal affirmation app. Struggling to make her mark at school and needing a best friend to talk to, Sadie wishes upon a star that Lay Lay was real and could help teach her how to stand out. When her wish comes true and Lay Lay is magically brought to life, the two friends learn that when they are together, they can accomplish anything, and navigate life as teenagers and discover who they truly are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqHF8bo8YjqMKZoHqXCAZRDiwoS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:135037'),
  ('979214636357271139', 'That Mitchell and Webb Look', 2006, 'Comedy', 'David Mitchell, Robert Webb', 'David Mitchell, Robert Webb, James Bachman', 'David Mitchell, Robert Webb, Olivia Colman, Paterson Joseph, James Bachman, Mark Evans', null, 'A comedy sketch show featuring David Mitchell and Robert Webb.', 'A comedy sketch show featuring David Mitchell and Robert Webb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TqlyrCZ5Pk2oQyj2QKI5slcsyQ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2852'),
  ('432592784347822437', 'That Night', 2026, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jason George', null, 'Clara Galle, Claudia Salas, Paula Usero, Null García, Raidher Díaz, Gabriel Polanco, Pedro Casablanc', 'TV-MA', 'When a young, naïve single mother gets embroiled in a murder during an island getaway, her sisters rush to help. But they only make things worse.', 'When a young, naïve single mother gets embroiled in a murder during an island getaway, her sisters rush to help. But they only make things worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOB3odcE8pbTPK0FHzfwgRTneoS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283673'),
  ('350403120670005655', 'That Peter Kay Thing', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Peter Kay', null, 'Neil Fitzmaurice, Paddy McGuinness, Toby Foster, Mark Jackson, Jo Enright, Andrew Sachs, Peter Kay, Steve Edge', null, 'That Peter Kay Thing is a series of six spoof documentaries shown on Channel 4 in January 1999. Set in and around Bolton, these follows the lives of different characters and stars Peter Kay as the subject of each documentary. All of the episodes display Kay''s penchant for nostalgic humour and unsympathetic lead characters. The series was narrated by Andrew Sachs. Many of the plot lines were based around actual events from Kay''s life. At least six of the characters appear in the spin-off series Peter Kay''s Phoenix Nights.', 'That Peter Kay Thing is a series of six spoof documentaries shown on Channel 4 in January 1999. Set in and around Bolton, these follows the lives of different characters and stars Peter Kay as the subject of each documentary. All of the episodes display Kay''s penchant for nostalgic humour and unsympathetic lead characters. The series was narrated by Andrew Sachs. Many of the plot lines were based around actual events from Kay''s life. At least six of the characters appear in the spin-off series Peter Kay''s Phoenix Nights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90HCiW3dyrWa8QttqAlM5bXnVjz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1012'),
  ('954611395173235582', 'That Thrifting Show with Lara Spencer', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Lara Spencer', 'TV-14', 'Vintage design expert Lara Spencer presents two designer duos with identical rooms. With limited time and budget, teams must treasure hunt for vintage and thrift store finds to design their way to beautiful, layered, finished rooms. It’s style and sustainability in a race against the clock.', 'Vintage design expert Lara Spencer presents two designer duos with identical rooms. With limited time and budget, teams must treasure hunt for vintage and thrift store finds to design their way to beautiful, layered, finished rooms. It’s style and sustainability in a race against the clock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gC7sHx1aIxkk3PVS3KHWHz1Pfx6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315295'),
  ('739146889951809147', 'That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Miho Okasaki, Tomoaki Maeno, Takuya Eguchi, Hochu Otsuka, Asuna Tomari, Chikahiro Kobayashi, Jun Fukushima, Rie Tanaka', 'TV-14', 'Corporate worker Mikami Satoru is stabbed by a random killer, and is reborn to an alternate world. But he turns out to be reborn a slime! Thrown into this new world with the name Rimuru, he begins his quest to create a world that’s welcoming to all races.', 'Corporate worker Mikami Satoru is stabbed by a random killer, and is reborn to an alternate world. But he turns out to be reborn a slime! Thrown into this new world with the name Rimuru, he begins his quest to create a world that’s welcoming to all races.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzujcdPAoH361NObVrtbA7zACE7.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:82684'),
  ('408181556671802270', 'That Winter, the Wind Blows', 2013, 'Drama', 'Noh Hee-kyung', 'Noh Hee-kyung', 'Zo In-sung, Song Hye-kyo, Kim Bum, Jung Eun-ji, Bae Jong-ok, Kim Tae-woo, Lim Se-mi, Seo Hyo-rim', 'TV-MA', 'Circumstances condemn Oh Soo and Oh Young to loveless lives. After the untimely death of his first love, Oh Soo turns to an ambitionless life as a derelict gambler. The gorgeous Oh Young should be leading the perfect life as an heiress, but when her parents’ divorce crumbles the family, she faces the reality of living life alone—particularly in light of her increasingly impaired vision. When these two heavy souls cross paths, fate delivers a chance meeting that will change their lives forever.', 'Circumstances condemn Oh Soo and Oh Young to loveless lives. After the untimely death of his first love, Oh Soo turns to an ambitionless life as a derelict gambler. The gorgeous Oh Young should be leading the perfect life as an heiress, but when her parents’ divorce crumbles the family, she faces the reality of living life alone—particularly in light of her increasingly impaired vision. When these two heavy souls cross paths, fate delivers a chance meeting that will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibBjm3Bh4hw0uo4sTyK6cwzCRjg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47091'),
  ('808939095808723901', 'That''s Life!', 1973, 'Documentary, Comedy, Family, News', null, null, 'Esther Rantzen, Cyril Fletcher, Chris Serle, Richard Stilgoe, George Layton', null, 'A magazine-style television series on BBC1 which was broadcast from May 1973 to June 1994, presented by Esther Rantzen, with various changes of co-presenters. The show presented hard-hitting investigations alongside satire and occasional light entertainment.', 'A magazine-style television series on BBC1 which was broadcast from May 1973 to June 1994, presented by Esther Rantzen, with various changes of co-presenters. The show presented hard-hitting investigations alongside satire and occasional light entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w92eGLtdxJ037OQm80uZnkQ9G6W.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:6078'),
  ('84069486538421092', 'That''s My Bush!', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Matt Stone, Trey Parker', 'Jonathan Kimmel', 'Timothy Bottoms, Carrie Quinn Dolin, Kurt Fuller, Marcia Wallace, Kristen Miller, John D''Aquino', 'TV-MA', 'That''s My Bush! is an American comedy television series that aired on Comedy Central from April 4 to May 23, 2001. Created by Trey Parker and Matt Stone, best known for also creating South Park, the series centers on the fictitious personal life of President George W. Bush, as played by Timothy Bottoms. Carrie Quinn Dolin played Laura Bush, and Kurt Fuller played Karl Rove. Despite the political overtones, the show itself was actually a broad lampoon of American sitcoms, including lame jokes, a laugh track, and stock characters such as klutzy bimbo secretary Princess, know-it-all maid Maggie, and supposedly helpful "wacky" next-door neighbor Larry.', 'That''s My Bush! is an American comedy television series that aired on Comedy Central from April 4 to May 23, 2001. Created by Trey Parker and Matt Stone, best known for also creating South Park, the series centers on the fictitious personal life of President George W. Bush, as played by Timothy Bottoms. Carrie Quinn Dolin played Laura Bush, and Kurt Fuller played Karl Rove. Despite the political overtones, the show itself was actually a broad lampoon of American sitcoms, including lame jokes, a laugh track, and stock characters such as klutzy bimbo secretary Princess, know-it-all maid Maggie, and supposedly helpful "wacky" next-door neighbor Larry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsj64zEKadkrHq0mia6LmKqHN1N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:555'),
  ('390789631430904578', 'That''s My Jam', 2021, 'Reality', 'Jimmy Fallon', null, 'Jimmy Fallon', 'TV-PG', 'This star-studded, music-comedy game show from Executive Producer Jimmy Fallon is infused with his one-of-a-kind comedic style and feel-good energy, featuring a carousel of his classic and brand new music-based games, like "Wheel of Musical Impressions," "Musical Genre Challenge" and "History of Rap." Each week, a new group of celebrities go head-to-head and mic-to-mic in a variety of music- and dance-inspired games, sketches and challenges that promise unforgettable -- and hilarious -- performances.', 'This star-studded, music-comedy game show from Executive Producer Jimmy Fallon is infused with his one-of-a-kind comedic style and feel-good energy, featuring a carousel of his classic and brand new music-based games, like "Wheel of Musical Impressions," "Musical Genre Challenge" and "History of Rap." Each week, a new group of celebrities go head-to-head and mic-to-mic in a variety of music- and dance-inspired games, sketches and challenges that promise unforgettable -- and hilarious -- performances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9gySjJuo5jsPZuvsXOK1BTItrk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:146129'),
  ('828604680003712571', 'That''s My Life', 2014, 'Soap, Drama', 'Esin Gök', null, 'Ezgi Asaroğlu, Keremcem, Sinan Albayrak, Ahu Sungur, Didem İnselel, Bahar Şahin, Erdal Cindoruk, Cahit Gök', 'NR', 'Bahar and Efsun grow up as sisters even though they don''t share the same blood. Their parents work under a rich man named Mehmet Emin. Later, he finds out that Efsun is his long-lost daughter. At least, that''s what the parents of the girls tell him.', 'Bahar and Efsun grow up as sisters even though they don''t share the same blood. Their parents work under a rich man named Mehmet Emin. Later, he finds out that Efsun is his long-lost daughter. At least, that''s what the parents of the girls tell him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfNZ9KS0EF59GdBsnjv2tPtlzZz.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:66124'),
  ('43161091224808389', 'That''s So Raven', 2003, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Michael Poryes', null, 'Raven-Symoné, Orlando Brown, Kyle Massey, Anneliese Van Der Pol, Rondell Sheridan', 'TV-G', 'No ordinary teenager; Raven Baxter can see glimpses of the future! Watch her schemes and misadventures as she enlists the help of friends, including best friends Eddie and Chelsea, to change life''s little outcomes. Raven''s younger brother, Cory, is obsessed with money and creates get-rich-quick schemes to try to earn cash.', 'No ordinary teenager; Raven Baxter can see glimpses of the future! Watch her schemes and misadventures as she enlists the help of friends, including best friends Eddie and Chelsea, to change life''s little outcomes. Raven''s younger brother, Cory, is obsessed with money and creates get-rich-quick schemes to try to earn cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pSH9b3XKKLBhdlsK9bz0AWYc7C.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4602'),
  ('622040354078523971', 'The ''80s: The Decade That Made Us', 2013, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Rob Lowe', 'TV-14', 'The defining biography of a decade, as told through exclusive interviews with more than 40 icons, entertainers and innovators who shaped its identity.', 'The defining biography of a decade, as told through exclusive interviews with more than 40 icons, entertainers and innovators who shaped its identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZbGWfmywfXNHbh9OjQPwlVD4RI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49313'),
  ('688313593213620994', 'The ''Burbs', 2026, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Celeste Hughey', 'Dana Olsen', 'Keke Palmer, Jack Whitehall, Julia Duffy, Paula Pell, Mark Proksch, Kapil Talwalkar', 'TV-MA', 'Set in present-day suburbia, a young couple returns to the husband''s childhood home. Their world is upended when new neighbors move in across the street, bringing old secrets of the cul-de-sac to light, and new deadly threats shatter the illusion of their quiet little neighborhood.', 'Set in present-day suburbia, a young couple returns to the husband''s childhood home. Their world is upended when new neighbors move in across the street, bringing old secrets of the cul-de-sac to light, and new deadly threats shatter the illusion of their quiet little neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1Ere9Lash2d6aOMStkRHfsixZC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270600'),
  ('727764768060185265', 'The ''Other'' Love Story', 2016, 'Drama', 'Roopa Rao', 'Roopa Rao', 'Shweta Gupta, Spoorthi Gumaste, Archana Mittal, Kalpana Rao, Anirvan Bhattacharya, Nikita', null, 'Two Indian teenage girls fall in love in the 1990''s in Bangalore when there were no cell phones or internet - a pure, intense, passionate love story against all odds.', 'Two Indian teenage girls fall in love in the 1990''s in Bangalore when there were no cell phones or internet - a pure, intense, passionate love story against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNgR7vw7aKTIsWIvOFicuHfgYNY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72808'),
  ('682567881482653041', 'The $100,000 Pyramid', 2016, 'Reality, Talk', 'Bob Stewart', null, 'Michael Strahan', 'TV-G', 'In $100,000 Pyramid, contestants are in teams of two. The goal of the game is to help your partner guess an answer, by listing items that would be included in said answer, or synonymous. For instance, if the answer is “Things That Bounce”, clues would be “Po-Go Sticks”, “Kangaroos”, “Basketballs”, etc. To add to the challenge, the contestant who is giving the clues has their hands strapped to their chair, so they’re unable to gesture in order to help the guessing process.', 'In $100,000 Pyramid, contestants are in teams of two. The goal of the game is to help your partner guess an answer, by listing items that would be included in said answer, or synonymous. For instance, if the answer is “Things That Bounce”, clues would be “Po-Go Sticks”, “Kangaroos”, “Basketballs”, etc. To add to the challenge, the contestant who is giving the clues has their hands strapped to their chair, so they’re unable to gesture in order to help the guessing process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4M2OYBvyDgmmSCKgj5PgbFBY1y.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:67141'),
  ('619584630940838966', 'The 1% Club', 2025, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Joel McHale', 'TV-PG', 'A unique, compelling and funny game show where contestants vie for a cash prize by attempting to answer questions that only 1% of the population can answer.', 'A unique, compelling and funny game show where contestants vie for a cash prize by attempting to answer questions that only 1% of the population can answer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMKxgfs9t0YHRT3Yq07yM3PvUSA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:294440'),
  ('380067177227984362', 'The 100', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Jason Rothenberg', null, 'Eliza Taylor, Bob Morley, Lindsey Morgan, Marie Avgeropoulos, Richard Harmon, Tasya Teles, JR Bourne, Shannon Kook', 'TV-14', '100 years in the future, when the Earth has been abandoned due to radioactivity, the last surviving humans live on an ark orbiting the planet — but the ark won''t last forever. So the repressive regime picks 100 expendable juvenile delinquents to send down to Earth to see if the planet is still habitable.', '100 years in the future, when the Earth has been abandoned due to radioactivity, the last surviving humans live on an ark orbiting the planet — but the ark won''t last forever. So the repressive regime picks 100 expendable juvenile delinquents to send down to Earth to see if the planet is still habitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcaDIAG1QdXQLRaj4vC1EFdBT2.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:48866'),
  ('846052870047588523', 'The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really, Really, Really, REALLY Love You', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Wataru Katoh, Kaede Hondo, Miyu Tomita, Maria Naganawa, Asami Seto, Ayaka Asai, Shigeru Chiba', 'TV-14', 'Rentaro Aijo was rejected 100 times in middle school. He visits a shrine and prays for better luck in high school. The God of Love appears and promises that he''ll soon meet 100 people he''s destined to date. But there''s a catch—once destiny introduces someone to him, the two must happily love each other. If they don''t, they''ll die. What will befall Rentaro and his 100 girlfriends in high school?', 'Rentaro Aijo was rejected 100 times in middle school. He visits a shrine and prays for better luck in high school. The God of Love appears and promises that he''ll soon meet 100 people he''s destined to date. But there''s a catch—once destiny introduces someone to him, the two must happily love each other. If they don''t, they''ll die. What will befall Rentaro and his 100 girlfriends in high school?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBiPU7I7TEJdDXu8tHgVrgL5zAU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223564'),
  ('457574171161378968', 'The 101 Scariest Horror Movie Moments of All Time', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tony Todd, Greg Nicotero, Keith David, Alex Essoe, Ernest R. Dickerson, Brea Grant, Tananarive Due, Rebekah McKendry', null, 'In this Shudder Original series, master filmmakers and genre experts celebrate and dissect the most terrifying moments of the greatest horror films ever made, exploring how these scenes were created and why they burned themselves into the brains of audiences around the world.', 'In this Shudder Original series, master filmmakers and genre experts celebrate and dissect the most terrifying moments of the greatest horror films ever made, exploring how these scenes were created and why they burned themselves into the brains of audiences around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMelZobbdmqIeP4SXgHKcGWS5nN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208880'),
  ('924589947620505493', 'The 101st Proposal', 1991, 'Drama', 'Shinji Nojima', 'Shinji Nojima', 'Atsuko Asano, Tetsuya Takeda, Yosuke Eguchi, Ritsuko Tanaka, Yuriko Ishida, Hatsunori Hasegawa, Miyoko Asada, Riki Takeuchi', null, 'After 99 failed dates, an earnest bachelor meets a guarded classical musician. He''s all in — she''s not so sure. Can his persistence lead to love?', 'After 99 failed dates, an earnest bachelor meets a guarded classical musician. He''s all in — she''s not so sure. Can his persistence lead to love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQFPgZkQJ6QJOPSfBUhKqdptc7q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48455'),
  ('749654556201379347', 'The 101st Proposal', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Lee Moon-sik, Park Sun-young, Song Chang-eui, Jeong Seong-hwan, Hong Soo-ah, Lee Joong-moon, Kim Hyung-ja, Jung Kyung-ho', 'NR', 'The 101st Proposal is a 2006 South Korean television series starring Lee Moon-sik and Park Sun-young. It aired on SBS from May 29 to July 25, 2006 on Mondays and Tuesdays at 21:55 for 15 episodes. It is a remake of the Japanese drama 101st Marriage Proposal which aired on Fuji TV in 1991.', 'The 101st Proposal is a 2006 South Korean television series starring Lee Moon-sik and Park Sun-young. It aired on SBS from May 29 to July 25, 2006 on Mondays and Tuesdays at 21:55 for 15 episodes. It is a remake of the Japanese drama 101st Marriage Proposal which aired on Fuji TV in 1991.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzzqKO8GbCYHY7K6qAc4Vel3OrT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30925'),
  ('878217118965124686', 'The 10th Kingdom', 2000, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Mystery', null, null, 'Kimberly Williams-Paisley, John Larroquette, Scott Cohen, Dianne Wiest, Daniel Lapaine, Rutger Hauer, Ed O''Neill, Dawnn Lewis', 'TV-G', 'Virginia and Tony, a father and daughter living in Manhattan, find themselves in a parallel universe where Snow White, Cinderella and Little Red Riding Hood are struggling to maintain order. Their kingdoms have been fragmented by trolls, giants and goblins.', 'Virginia and Tony, a father and daughter living in Manhattan, find themselves in a parallel universe where Snow White, Cinderella and Little Red Riding Hood are struggling to maintain order. Their kingdoms have been fragmented by trolls, giants and goblins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aD5ISjx3AG1rygncAdv7eb8KYYo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40546'),
  ('318830858041133664', 'The 12 from Oldenheim', 2017, 'Mystery', null, 'Lex Passchier, Martin van Steijn', 'Noortje Herlaar, Nasrdin Dchar, Bahareh Borzuee, Reinout Bussemaker, Fedja van Huêt, Michiel Nooter, Ko Zandvliet, Saskia Temmink', null, 'Follow the lives of the inhabitants of Oldenheim, an ancient Dutch village where families have lived for generations. The terror is great when the inhabitants of the village are confronted with a series of mysterious disappearances.', 'Follow the lives of the inhabitants of Oldenheim, an ancient Dutch village where families have lived for generations. The terror is great when the inhabitants of the village are confronted with a series of mysterious disappearances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9qmmxAd0185gqhxvgKa60YEkIm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71916'),
  ('401451220311803468', 'The 12th Victim', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Caril Ann Fugate, Charles Starkweather', 'TV-MA', 'A four-part docuseries that sheds new light on the infamous 1958 Charles Starkweather and Caril Ann Fugate murder case, in which the teenage couple was charged and convicted of brutally killing 11 victims at random.', 'A four-part docuseries that sheds new light on the infamous 1958 Charles Starkweather and Caril Ann Fugate murder case, in which the teenage couple was charged and convicted of brutally killing 11 victims at random.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cF4ad2vFJPFfuLGU72rzFRuY9Cr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219001'),
  ('848560651353235089', 'The 13 Ghosts of Scooby-Doo', 1985, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Family', 'Joe Ruby, Ken Spears, Tom Ruegger', null, 'Don Messick, Casey Kasem, Heather North, Susan Blu, Arte Johnson, Howard Morris, Vincent Price', 'TV-PG', 'Shaggy and Scooby-Doo and friends must return 13 ghosts which they inadvertently released to a magical chest. Together with Daphne and Scrappy-Doo, along with newcomer Flim-Flam, they travel the world facing the ghosts that must be returned to the chest.', 'Shaggy and Scooby-Doo and friends must return 13 ghosts which they inadvertently released to a magical chest. Together with Daphne and Scrappy-Doo, along with newcomer Flim-Flam, they travel the world facing the ghosts that must be returned to the chest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7S15heYWQSJLM60uZjim7Y9nzG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1069'),
  ('108632420798262636', 'The 13 Lords of the Shogun', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Shun Oguri, Eiko Koike, Kataoka Ainosuke VI, Emma Miyazawa, Bando Yajuro, Rie Miyazawa, Yo Oizumi, Yui Aragaki', null, 'Following the ascension to power of Taira no Kiyomori, the Minamoto clan is exiled. Minamoto no Yoritomo meets Masako, the sister of Hōjō Yoshitoki and later marries her. Following this marriage, the gears of Yoshitoki''s destiny begin to turn.', 'Following the ascension to power of Taira no Kiyomori, the Minamoto clan is exiled. Minamoto no Yoritomo meets Masako, the sister of Hōjō Yoshitoki and later marries her. Following this marriage, the gears of Yoshitoki''s destiny begin to turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cv4Sj1Xwlsng6bEMt1A8WDgfNEx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125215'),
  ('564773768872178912', 'The 1619 Project', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Nikole Hannah-Jones', 'TV-MA', 'In keeping with the original project, this series seeks to reframe the country''s history by placing the consequences of slavery and the contributions of black Americans at the very center of our national narrative.', 'In keeping with the original project, this series seeks to reframe the country''s history by placing the consequences of slavery and the contributions of black Americans at the very center of our national narrative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sNYUV5l130HIryGj4RdhzDtn7A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216429'),
  ('1042914230101403331', 'The 2000s', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Explore the cultural and political milestones of the 2000s decade, including technological triumphs like the iPhone and social media, President George W. Bush’s war on terror and response to Hurricane Katrina, Barack Obama’s presidential election and the financial crisis, hip-hop’s rise to dominance and a creative renaissance in television.', 'Explore the cultural and political milestones of the 2000s decade, including technological triumphs like the iPhone and social media, President George W. Bush’s war on terror and response to Hurricane Katrina, Barack Obama’s presidential election and the financial crisis, hip-hop’s rise to dominance and a creative renaissance in television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjGk5aJLsatgY55Dwh6zJEpVUFp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80446'),
  ('649667380762292971', 'The 20th Century Fox Hour', 1955, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'The 20th Century Fox Hour is an American drama anthology series televised in the United States on CBS from 1955 to 1957. Some of the shows in this series were restored, remastered and shown on the Fox Movie Channel in 2002 under the title Hour of Stars. The season one episode Overnight Haul, starring Richard Conte and Lizabeth Scott, was released in Australia as a feature film.', 'The 20th Century Fox Hour is an American drama anthology series televised in the United States on CBS from 1955 to 1957. Some of the shows in this series were restored, remastered and shown on the Fox Movie Channel in 2002 under the title Hour of Stars. The season one episode Overnight Haul, starring Richard Conte and Lizabeth Scott, was released in Australia as a feature film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZ60QHto5O2GfFcylHKfdAHLwyI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10642'),
  ('80792428822997079', 'The 40th Anniversary of Chinese Film Since China''s Reform and Opening-Up', 2018, 'Documentary', '丁晓娇', null, null, null, 'Documentary about China''s film industry and the monumental changes in the past 40 years from beginning with propaganda films to the "5th generation" filmmakers and beyond, who embraced art and commercial films to make China the second largest box office market in the world after Hollywood.', 'Documentary about China''s film industry and the monumental changes in the past 40 years from beginning with propaganda films to the "5th generation" filmmakers and beyond, who embraced art and commercial films to make China the second largest box office market in the world after Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mI4A9bfB8IFTLVgfvcics8i4O3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235970'),
  ('605585517988449037', 'The 43', 2019, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Matías Gueilburt', 'Nicolás Gueilburt', 'Paco Ignacio Taibo II, Paula Mónaco, John Gibler, Omar García', null, 'This docuseries disputes the Mexican government''s account of how and why 43 students from Ayotzinapa Rural Teachers'' College vanished in Iguala in 2014.', 'This docuseries disputes the Mexican government''s account of how and why 43 students from Ayotzinapa Rural Teachers'' College vanished in Iguala in 2014.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1Ae3QjwFBWTHnmlQ9dNGuSE3LB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90921'),
  ('823142747694855735', 'The 4400', 2004, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Scott Peters, René Echevarria', null, 'Jacqueline McKenzie, Joel Gretsch, Patrick John Flueger, Megalyn Echikunwoke, Chad Faust, Billy Campbell, Conchita Campbell, Jenni Baird', 'TV-14', '4400 centers on the return of 4400 people who, previously presumed dead or reported missing, reappear on Earth. Though they have not aged physically, some of them seem to have deeper alterations ranging from superhuman strength to an unexplained healing touch. A government agency is formed to track the 4400 people after one of them commits a murder.', '4400 centers on the return of 4400 people who, previously presumed dead or reported missing, reappear on Earth. Though they have not aged physically, some of them seem to have deeper alterations ranging from superhuman strength to an unexplained healing touch. A government agency is formed to track the 4400 people after one of them commits a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWpatnVtPVxjsn7mMiRZNAalEMf.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1481'),
  ('319292105648518909', 'The 7 Lives of Lea', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Charlotte Sanson', 'Charlotte Sanson', 'Raïka Hazanavicius, Khalil Ben Gharbia, Marguerite Thiam, Maïra Schmitt, Théo Fernandez, Rebecca Williams, Anne Azoulay, Alexander Ferrario', 'TV-MA', 'After finding a young man''s remains, Léa wakes up in the 90s and body swaps seven times as she tries to solve the mystery of his death — and prevent it.', 'After finding a young man''s remains, Léa wakes up in the 90s and body swaps seven times as she tries to solve the mystery of his death — and prevent it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXKnfvTnpmyStp3R49NBQSjOVCk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195928'),
  ('882692028855487172', 'The 7.39', 2014, 'Drama', 'David Nicholls', 'David Nicholls', 'David Morrissey, Sheridan Smith, Olivia Colman, Sean Maguire, Izzy Meikle-Small, Justin Salinger, Lashana Lynch', 'NR', 'Carl Matthews commutes by train to London where he works in a property management office under a boss who is pressuring him to dismiss an employee. He has a kind and supportive wife Maggie and two teenage children who he feels do not appreciate him. One morning he complains to a woman called Sally that she has taken his seat on the train. He later apologises to her and they start chatting, a relationship develops and she reveals that she is divorced but about to marry again, although scenes with her fiancée suggest she is going cold on the idea. She works at a health club and Carl joins it so that he can see more of her. They fall in love and one evening when the train is not running they spend the night together at a hotel. The second part of the drama deals with the repercussions of their affair.', 'Carl Matthews commutes by train to London where he works in a property management office under a boss who is pressuring him to dismiss an employee. He has a kind and supportive wife Maggie and two teenage children who he feels do not appreciate him. One morning he complains to a woman called Sally that she has taken his seat on the train. He later apologises to her and they start chatting, a relationship develops and she reveals that she is divorced but about to marry again, although scenes with her fiancée suggest she is going cold on the idea. She works at a health club and Carl joins it so that he can see more of her. They fall in love and one evening when the train is not running they spend the night together at a hotel. The second part of the drama deals with the repercussions of their affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUwU7MnvzVCXLE9COfHTSasQFYW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60649'),
  ('1008159711613078282', 'The 7D', 2014, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Noah Z. Jones', null, 'Bill Farmer, Dee Bradley Baker, Billy West, Maurice LaMarche, Kevin Michael Richardson, Scott Menville, Stephen Stanton, Jess Harnell', 'TV-Y', 'In the whimsical world of Jollywood a Queen Delightful relies on the 7D, a group of seven dwarves, to keep the kingdom in order. Standing in their way are two laughably evil villains, Grim and Hildy Gloom, who plot to take over the kingdom by stealing the magical jewels in the 7D''s mine. With seven very distinct personalities, the 7D always manage to save the day and send Grim and Hildy running back to their evil lair to try another day.', 'In the whimsical world of Jollywood a Queen Delightful relies on the 7D, a group of seven dwarves, to keep the kingdom in order. Standing in their way are two laughably evil villains, Grim and Hildy Gloom, who plot to take over the kingdom by stealing the magical jewels in the 7D''s mine. With seven very distinct personalities, the 7D always manage to save the day and send Grim and Hildy running back to their evil lair to try another day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCqDaSf4ZRi1iiw8dHcMlsFmL80.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61119'),
  ('745457060893023868', 'The 8 Show', 2024, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'Han Jae-rim', 'Han Jae-rim, 이현지, 송수린', 'Ryu Jun-yeol, Chun Woo-hee, Park Jeong-min, Lee Yul-eum, Park Hae-joon, Lee Zoo-young, Moon Jeong-hee, Bae Sung-woo', 'TV-MA', 'Eight individuals trapped in a mysterious 8-story building participate in a tempting but dangerous show where they earn money as time passes.', 'Eight individuals trapped in a mysterious 8-story building participate in a tempting but dangerous show where they earn money as time passes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umBNBnKThMmF1QQZixZ7rsYOowq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156484'),
  ('897452472108180461', 'The 8th Son? Are You Kidding Me?', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Asuka Nishi, Junya Enoki, Daisuke Namikawa, Hiro Shimono, Mao Ichimichi, Masashi Yamane, Mikako Komatsu, Shizuka Ishigami', 'TV-14', 'Ichinomiya Shingo, an everyday twenty-five-year-old office worker, wakes up as Wendelin, the 8th son of an impoverished noble family out in the sticks. He soon despairs at his lack of succession rights and knowledge to navigate the political world, but finds hope in his aptitude for magic. This is the story of that young man earning his keep and his freedom through magic, with no world saving involved, and spending quite a while escaping his solitude. Ultimately, it is also the story of him being unable to escape the shackles of society.', 'Ichinomiya Shingo, an everyday twenty-five-year-old office worker, wakes up as Wendelin, the 8th son of an impoverished noble family out in the sticks. He soon despairs at his lack of succession rights and knowledge to navigate the political world, but finds hope in his aptitude for magic. This is the story of that young man earning his keep and his freedom through magic, with no world saving involved, and spending quite a while escaping his solitude. Ultimately, it is also the story of him being unable to escape the shackles of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vczlgbCyJPIzjhyyiI9mGVL1gTg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99624'),
  ('373920927202100522', 'The A List', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Family', 'Dan Berlinka, Nina Metivier', null, 'Rosie Dwyer, Savannah Baker, Dylan Brady, Byron Easmon, Barnaby Tobias, Micheal Ward', 'TV-PG', 'Romance, rivalry and radical mystery collide as a group of teens attend a remote island sleepaway camp in this suspenseful, supernatural drama.', 'Romance, rivalry and radical mystery collide as a group of teens attend a remote island sleepaway camp in this suspenseful, supernatural drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbYZv30YGh0bwCNslXkw0NFHTpy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85427'),
  ('1030721213783913574', 'The A Word', 2016, 'Drama', 'Keren Margalit', null, 'Max Vento, Molly Wright, Morven Christie, Lee Ingleby, David Gyasi', 'TV-14', 'The various generations of the Hughes family, who all love, work and fight like any other clan, find they must learn to communicate all over again when the youngest member is diagnosed with autism.', 'The various generations of the Hughes family, who all love, work and fight like any other clan, find they must learn to communicate all over again when the youngest member is diagnosed with autism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVFwwL4mYmfPMTSRkddFRQv9wZ0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65978'),
  ('1092459092944673200', 'The A-Team', 1983, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Frank Lupo, Stephen J. Cannell', null, 'George Peppard, Dirk Benedict, Mr. T, Dwight Schultz, Eddie Velez, Robert Vaughn', 'TV-PG', 'A fictional group of ex-United States Army Special Forces personnel work as soldiers of fortune while on the run from the Army after being branded as war criminals for a "crime they didn''t commit."', 'A fictional group of ex-United States Army Special Forces personnel work as soldiers of fortune while on the run from the Army after being branded as war criminals for a "crime they didn''t commit."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2qWJJ7Wyaq2xvgIHuBw4zVNBij.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1516'),
  ('456620917375676448', 'The Abandons', 2025, 'Drama, Western', 'Kurt Sutter', null, 'Lena Headey, Gillian Anderson, Nick Robinson, Diana Silvers, Lucas Till, Lamar Johnson, Aisling Franciosi, Michiel Huisman', 'TV-MA', 'In 1850s Washington, two families led by powerful matriarchs — one wealthy, one poor but deeply loyal — battle for supremacy on the lawless frontier.', 'In 1850s Washington, two families led by powerful matriarchs — one wealthy, one poor but deeply loyal — battle for supremacy on the lawless frontier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQRzdfc0IlyiwM5HdzHdSYag9FG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223300'),
  ('216809545026610048', 'The Abbott and Costello Show', 1952, 'Comedy, Family', 'Lou Costello, Sid Fields, Clyde Bruckman', null, 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello', 'TV-G', 'Bud and Lou are unemployed actors living in Mr. Fields’ boarding house. Lou’s girlfriend Hillary lives across the hall. Many situations arise leading to slapstick and puns.', 'Bud and Lou are unemployed actors living in Mr. Fields’ boarding house. Lou’s girlfriend Hillary lives across the hall. Many situations arise leading to slapstick and puns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vorrWqNL7alMqScKhrNLdZZcMOt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11821'),
  ('263527483876541104', 'The ABC Murders', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'John Malkovich, Rupert Grint, Eamon Farren, Andrew Buchan, Bronwyn James, Tara Fitzgerald, Anya Chalotra, Freya Mavor', 'TV-14', '1933. Hercule Poirot, older and greyer, receives letters threatening murder. The sender signs themselves only as “A.B.C.” When he takes the letters to the police looking for help, Hercule finds all his old friends have moved on. But soon there is a murder and the once-great detective must take matters into his own hands.', '1933. Hercule Poirot, older and greyer, receives letters threatening murder. The sender signs themselves only as “A.B.C.” When he takes the letters to the police looking for help, Hercule finds all his old friends have moved on. But soon there is a murder and the once-great detective must take matters into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYfF6mK8DQIhi96kzOC9ULdDjTp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81049'),
  ('471163204124478234', 'The Absent Voice', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Benjamín Vicuña, Gimena Accardi, Jazmín Stuart, Federico Olivera, Susú Pecoraro, Gonzalo Urtizberea, Lorena Meritano, Germán de Silva', null, 'When his older brother is found dead, apparently by suicide, the renowned psychoanalyst Pablo Rouviot is the only one convinced that it is a murder. With the assistance of Officer Cecilia Bermúdez as his sole ally, Pablo takes on the investigation, uncovering a much larger scheme with a serial killer at its core.', 'When his older brother is found dead, apparently by suicide, the renowned psychoanalyst Pablo Rouviot is the only one convinced that it is a murder. With the assistance of Officer Cecilia Bermúdez as his sole ally, Pablo takes on the investigation, uncovering a much larger scheme with a serial killer at its core.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vCVomJCoLPff6LZoAUETjtCPsH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260877'),
  ('681936051999656939', 'The Accident', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jack Thorne', 'Jack Thorne', 'Sarah Lancashire, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Mark Lewis Jones, Joanna Scanlan, Genevieve Barr, Jade Croot, Shaun Parkes, Nabhaan Rizwan', null, 'Tragedy strikes the welsh town of Glyngolau when an accident on a construction site kills a group of trespassing children. Grief quickly turns to anger and the families cry for justice. But as the gears of justice slowly turn, challenging truths begin to emerge. It falls to the Council Leader’s wife, Polly, to hold the community together, all the while also caring for a daughter – the only survivor of the collapse. And as those in charge fail to deliver closure for the town, it’s up to her to lead them on the march for justice, no matter what the cost.', 'Tragedy strikes the welsh town of Glyngolau when an accident on a construction site kills a group of trespassing children. Grief quickly turns to anger and the families cry for justice. But as the gears of justice slowly turn, challenging truths begin to emerge. It falls to the Council Leader’s wife, Polly, to hold the community together, all the while also caring for a daughter – the only survivor of the collapse. And as those in charge fail to deliver closure for the town, it’s up to her to lead them on the march for justice, no matter what the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4Dy7lzjRtDz5bBdDaZMfzQGsur.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94755'),
  ('188103698431054464', 'The Accident', 2024, 'Drama', 'Leonardo Padrón', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'When a birthday party takes a tragic turn, its ripples shatter a close-knit community — tearing families, friendships and hearts apart.', 'When a birthday party takes a tragic turn, its ripples shatter a close-knit community — tearing families, friendships and hearts apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMD1rnBwYAUe12JT6NHYaguXofs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:259730'),
  ('529967987541559874', 'The Acolyte', 2024, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Leslye Headland', 'George Lucas, Jasmyne Flournoy', 'Amandla Stenberg, Lee Jung-jae', 'TV-14', 'A hundred years before the rise of the Empire, the Jedi Order and the Galactic Republic have prospered for centuries without war. During this time, an investigation into a shocking crime spree pits a Jedi Master against a dangerous warrior from his past.', 'A hundred years before the rise of the Empire, the Jedi Order and the Galactic Republic have prospered for centuries without war. During this time, an investigation into a shocking crime spree pits a Jedi Master against a dangerous warrior from his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fW2nOB5EXEOh64qufAxeW4AU3AB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114479'),
  ('202276428232725248', 'The Act', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nick Antosca, Michelle Dean', null, 'Patricia Arquette, Joey King, AnnaSophia Robb, Chloë Sevigny, Calum Worthy', 'TV-MA', 'A seasonal anthology series that tells startling, stranger-than-fiction true crime stories with the first season following Gypsy Blanchard, a girl trying to escape the toxic relationship she has with her overprotective mother.', 'A seasonal anthology series that tells startling, stranger-than-fiction true crime stories with the first season following Gypsy Blanchard, a girl trying to escape the toxic relationship she has with her overprotective mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vb1sQLC2MqfCPOFqHd8SyVsyDVB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82883'),
  ('1119052137668348093', 'The Actress', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Soner Caner', 'Hakan Bonomo', 'Pınar Deniz, Uraz Kaygılaroğlu, İpek Çiçek, Şebnem Hassanisoughi, Serhat Kılıç, Ahmet Rıfat Şungar, Tolga Tekin', 'TV-MA', 'Yasemin Derin, a famous actress in Turkey, has been living a double life for many years. Hiding behind her fame, this unexpected second life of Yasemin drags her into the middle of an adventure full of secrets.', 'Yasemin Derin, a famous actress in Turkey, has been living a double life for many years. Hiding behind her fame, this unexpected second life of Yasemin drags her into the middle of an adventure full of secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whJkC6iQP51Af38zpz3a3nT4zvU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224773'),
  ('566472432162913421', 'The Addams Family', 1964, 'Comedy, Family', 'Charles Addams', 'Charles Addams', 'Carolyn Jones, John Astin, Jackie Coogan, Ted Cassidy, Marie Blake, Lisa Loring, Ken Weatherwax', 'TV-G', 'A satirical inversion of the ideal of the perfect American nuclear family, they are an eccentric wealthy family who delight in everything grotesque and macabre, and are never really aware that people find them bizarre or frightening. In fact, they themselves are often terrified by "normal" people.', 'A satirical inversion of the ideal of the perfect American nuclear family, they are an eccentric wealthy family who delight in everything grotesque and macabre, and are never really aware that people find them bizarre or frightening. In fact, they themselves are often terrified by "normal" people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twfSYEw4cp5KS9HaxSLh6Q0Bmi6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14009'),
  ('844551421843886823', 'The Addams Family', 1973, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'David Levy', null, 'Ted Cassidy, Jackie Coogan, Cindy Henderson, Lennie Weinrib, Jodie Foster, Janet Waldo', 'NR', 'The Addams Family is an animated adaptation of the Charles Addams cartoons produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions in 1973. Many of the original actor''s from the 1960"s television series returned in voice-over roles.', 'The Addams Family is an animated adaptation of the Charles Addams cartoons produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions in 1973. Many of the original actor''s from the 1960"s television series returned in voice-over roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QVgN8UOB9BHHSS6Z5B0UNwHD1V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13015'),
  ('167437822876519426', 'The Addams Family', 1992, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Charles Addams', null, 'John Astin, Nancy Linari, Debi Derryberry, Jeannie Elias, Rip Taylor, Jim Cummings, Pat Fraley, Carol Channing', null, 'The Addams Family is an American animated series based on the eponymous comic strip characters and the second Addams Family Cartoon.', 'The Addams Family is an American animated series based on the eponymous comic strip characters and the second Addams Family Cartoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxkc73w4Qv2vN3doRcd24qjZjaj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12925'),
  ('764434912145986350', 'The Adulterer', 2011, 'Drama', 'Frank Ketelaar', 'Frank Ketelaar', 'Ramsey Nasr, Sylvia Hoeks, Rifka Lodeizen, Kees Prins, Fedja van Huêt, Sigrid ten Napel, Guido Pollemans, Jeffrey Hamilton', null, 'After a photographer and a lawyer start a steamy affair, their lives and those around them get entangled in dirty business and family secrets.', 'After a photographer and a lawyer start a steamy affair, their lives and those around them get entangled in dirty business and family secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNlRrKkfjwRbiet1U4rmi3yZ40G.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43757'),
  ('369705431276594933', 'The Adventurer', 1972, 'Action & Adventure', 'Monty Berman, Dennis Spooner', null, 'Gene Barry, Barry Morse', null, 'The Adventurer is an ITC Entertainment TV adventure series created by Dennis Spooner that ran for one season from 1972 to 1973. It premiered in the UK on 29 September 1972. The show starred Gene Barry as Gene Bradley, a government agent of independent means who poses as a glamorous American movie star.', 'The Adventurer is an ITC Entertainment TV adventure series created by Dennis Spooner that ran for one season from 1972 to 1973. It premiered in the UK on 29 September 1972. The show starred Gene Barry as Gene Bradley, a government agent of independent means who poses as a glamorous American movie star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uw02HZWeMMq0W5mANpsRul9qKdR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8968'),
  ('1138021968613844045', 'The Adventures of Batman', 1968, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Olan Soule, Casey Kasem, Ted Knight', 'NR', 'The adventures of Batman, with Robin, the Boy Wonder! Batman and Robin, the Dynamic Duo against crime and corruption, whose real identities as millionaire philanthropist Bruce Wayne and his young ward Dick Grayson and known only to Alfred, the faithful butler. Ever alert, they respond swiftly to a signal from the police, and moments later, from the secret Batcave deep beneath Wayne Manor, they roar out to protect life, limb and property as Batman and Robin, caped crimefighters! Batman and Robin, scourge of Gotham City''s kooky criminals: The Joker, Clown Prince of Crime - The Penguin, pudgy purveyor of perfidy - and the cool, cruel, Mr. Freeze! Watch out, villains, here come... Batman and Robin!', 'The adventures of Batman, with Robin, the Boy Wonder! Batman and Robin, the Dynamic Duo against crime and corruption, whose real identities as millionaire philanthropist Bruce Wayne and his young ward Dick Grayson and known only to Alfred, the faithful butler. Ever alert, they respond swiftly to a signal from the police, and moments later, from the secret Batcave deep beneath Wayne Manor, they roar out to protect life, limb and property as Batman and Robin, caped crimefighters! Batman and Robin, scourge of Gotham City''s kooky criminals: The Joker, Clown Prince of Crime - The Penguin, pudgy purveyor of perfidy - and the cool, cruel, Mr. Freeze! Watch out, villains, here come... Batman and Robin!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ivr9EEA9ZGKGXiM7EStE0pJSFR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31749'),
  ('8158208868417753', 'The Adventures of Black Beauty', 1972, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Anna Sewell, Ted Willis', null, 'William Lucas, Charlotte Mitchell, Roderick Shaw, Stacy Dorning, Michael Culver', null, 'The Adventures of Black Beauty is a British family adventure series broadcast on ITV1. Produced by London Weekend Television, the 52-episode series was inspired by Anna Sewell''s novel but featured new characters, including Dr James Gordon and his children, who, in 19th century rural England, take in the horse Black Beauty.', 'The Adventures of Black Beauty is a British family adventure series broadcast on ITV1. Produced by London Weekend Television, the 52-episode series was inspired by Anna Sewell''s novel but featured new characters, including Dr James Gordon and his children, who, in 19th century rural England, take in the horse Black Beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qe5mPiAr0cxWrlmbhsTGkmlIzX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6498'),
  ('142350147304372627', 'The Adventures of Blinky Bill', 1993, 'Animation, Kids', 'Dorothy Wall', null, 'Robyn Moore, Keith Scott, Sarah Aubrey, Drew Forsythe, Nick Jasprizza, Rachel King, Troy Planet', 'TV-Y', 'The Adventures Of Blinky Bill is an animated television series based on Dorothy Wall''s books about Blinky Bill. The series is produced by Yoram Gross. Set in Greenpatch, a fictional Australian town, the series presents stories of conservation and nature through the activities of Blinky Bill and his family and friends.', 'The Adventures Of Blinky Bill is an animated television series based on Dorothy Wall''s books about Blinky Bill. The series is produced by Yoram Gross. Set in Greenpatch, a fictional Australian town, the series presents stories of conservation and nature through the activities of Blinky Bill and his family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYtRLOo218EegHh2loeJ70jql6J.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3560'),
  ('336227521503716740', 'The Adventures of Brisco County, Jr.', 1993, 'Western, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jeffrey Boam, Carlton Cuse', null, 'Bruce Campbell, Julius Carry, Christian Clemenson', null, 'A tough-as-rawhide cowpoke, debonair ladies'' man and Harvard-educated smarty-britches roams from Frisco to Jalisco in pursuit of outlaws who killed his father...and in search of a mysterious orb possessing out-of-this world powers. Hot lead and cool anachronisms await Brisco as he and his sidekicks - including Comet, the intellectual equine who doesn''t know he''s a horse - fight for justice in the way, way, way-out West.', 'A tough-as-rawhide cowpoke, debonair ladies'' man and Harvard-educated smarty-britches roams from Frisco to Jalisco in pursuit of outlaws who killed his father...and in search of a mysterious orb possessing out-of-this world powers. Hot lead and cool anachronisms await Brisco as he and his sidekicks - including Comet, the intellectual equine who doesn''t know he''s a horse - fight for justice in the way, way, way-out West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoKekFNOsz8UsacZ6SaHbEmRcmu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1463'),
  ('685322598610425043', 'The Adventures of Captain Alatriste', 2015, 'Action & Adventure', 'José Manuel Lorenzo', null, 'Aitor Luna, Natasha Yarovenko, Lucía Jiménez, Patricia Vico, Aura Garrido, Marcos Ruiz, Gary Piquer, Miguel Hermoso Arnao', 'TV-PG', 'In a society, the proud and arrogant Golden Age Spain, riding blind towards the end of the Empire and in which the honor and loyalty are all, a Spanish soldier who has travelled Europe fighting under the flag of "Tercio Viejo de Cartagena", survives in the Austrias'' Madrid as a mercenary swordsman hired four coppers on request. Brave, honest and loyal man, Diego Alatriste will be involved in intrigues and conspiracies of various kinds that require him to make good use of his steel.', 'In a society, the proud and arrogant Golden Age Spain, riding blind towards the end of the Empire and in which the honor and loyalty are all, a Spanish soldier who has travelled Europe fighting under the flag of "Tercio Viejo de Cartagena", survives in the Austrias'' Madrid as a mercenary swordsman hired four coppers on request. Brave, honest and loyal man, Diego Alatriste will be involved in intrigues and conspiracies of various kinds that require him to make good use of his steel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5lNJe9awcFSrfsfratgb2HRAq2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62279'),
  ('257628844873689609', 'The Adventures of Jim Bowie', 1956, 'Western', null, null, 'Scott Forbes', 'NR', 'The Adventures of Jim Bowie is an American Western television series that aired on ABC from 1956 to 1958. Its setting was the 1830s-era Louisiana Territory. The series was an adaptation of the book Tempered Blade, by Monte Barrett. The series stars Scott Forbes as the real-life adventurer Jim Bowie. The series initially portrayed Jim Bowie as something of an outdoors-man, riding his horse through the wilderness near his home in Opelousas, where he would stumble across someone needing his assistance. He was aided by the Bowie Knife, his ever-present weapon. He designed it in the first episode, The Birth of the Blade.', 'The Adventures of Jim Bowie is an American Western television series that aired on ABC from 1956 to 1958. Its setting was the 1830s-era Louisiana Territory. The series was an adaptation of the book Tempered Blade, by Monte Barrett. The series stars Scott Forbes as the real-life adventurer Jim Bowie. The series initially portrayed Jim Bowie as something of an outdoors-man, riding his horse through the wilderness near his home in Opelousas, where he would stumble across someone needing his assistance. He was aided by the Bowie Knife, his ever-present weapon. He designed it in the first episode, The Birth of the Blade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNjQ6G2mHMVdCOzSik6QosvLIVn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13508'),
  ('92091281626658532', 'The Adventures of Jimmy Neutron: Boy Genius', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'John A. Davis, Steve Oedekerk', null, 'Debi Derryberry, Jeffrey Garcia, Rob Paulsen', 'TV-Y7', 'Jimmy Neutron is the smartest kid in town. As a genius, Jimmy thinks most things can be solved with the invention of a new gizmo. But Jimmy usually takes the easy way out, and his backfiring gadgets result in comedic adventures.', 'Jimmy Neutron is the smartest kid in town. As a genius, Jimmy thinks most things can be solved with the invention of a new gizmo. But Jimmy usually takes the easy way out, and his backfiring gadgets result in comedic adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxUNSVBU03LuVSZ3rriui6a7Xvk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2129'),
  ('1114853539100575496', 'The Adventures of Kid Danger', 2018, 'Animation', 'Dan Schneider', null, 'Jace Norman, Cooper Barnes, Michael D. Cohen, Riele Downs, Sean Ryan Fox, Ella Anderson, Jeffrey Nicholas Brown', 'TV-Y7', 'Henry Hart is a regular kid in the eighth grade who has a not-so-regular, part-time gig as Kid Danger. Kid Danger and his sidekick-in-training Captain Man embark on new adventures as they battle bizarre criminals and super villains.', 'Henry Hart is a regular kid in the eighth grade who has a not-so-regular, part-time gig as Kid Danger. Kid Danger and his sidekick-in-training Captain Man embark on new adventures as they battle bizarre criminals and super villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JqQ473UkYpFBjvpGMydI5sjoCI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76534'),
  ('207192264282781393', 'The Adventures of Munchausen', 1973, 'Animation', 'Roman Sef', 'Roman Sef', 'Sergei Tseits, Grigoriy Shpigel, Garri Grinevich, Aleksandr Pozharov, Garri Bardin', null, 'A drawn animated series about the incredible and very funny adventures of Baron Munchausen, so similar to the hero of the German writer Rudolf Erich Raspe - Baron Munchausen. The same dreamer, inventor and liar. And you will believe in these amazingly true stories?', 'A drawn animated series about the incredible and very funny adventures of Baron Munchausen, so similar to the hero of the German writer Rudolf Erich Raspe - Baron Munchausen. The same dreamer, inventor and liar. And you will believe in these amazingly true stories?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u07dZ9tCma1nql1D2GJImgjGiBo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72562'),
  ('926786361559048305', 'The Adventures of Ozzie and Harriet', 1952, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Ozzie Nelson, Harriet Nelson, David Nelson, Ricky Nelson', 'TV-G', 'The Adventures of Ozzie and Harriet is an American sitcom, airing on ABC from October 3, 1952 through March 26, 1966, starring the real life Nelson family. After a long run on radio, the show was brought to television where it continued its success, running on both radio and television for a few years. The series stars Ozzie Nelson and his wife, singer Harriet Nelson, and their young sons, David and Eric "Ricky" Nelson. Don DeFore had a recurring role as the Nelsons'' friendly neighbor "Thorny".', 'The Adventures of Ozzie and Harriet is an American sitcom, airing on ABC from October 3, 1952 through March 26, 1966, starring the real life Nelson family. After a long run on radio, the show was brought to television where it continued its success, running on both radio and television for a few years. The series stars Ozzie Nelson and his wife, singer Harriet Nelson, and their young sons, David and Eric "Ricky" Nelson. Don DeFore had a recurring role as the Nelsons'' friendly neighbor "Thorny".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9Kqsng08I3CtA5m2GVq52NVUIL.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:952'),
  ('582845564740975534', 'The Adventures of Paddington', 2019, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Jon Foster, James Lamont, Adam Shaw', null, 'Ben Whishaw, Morwenna Banks, Darren Boyd, Bobby Beynon, Phyllis Logan', 'TV-Y', 'Journey to London for heart-warming adventures with beloved British bear Paddington in this CG-animated series, which centres on a younger Paddington as he writes letters to Aunt Lucy celebrating the new things he has discovered through the day’s exciting activities.', 'Journey to London for heart-warming adventures with beloved British bear Paddington in this CG-animated series, which centres on a younger Paddington as he writes letters to Aunt Lucy celebrating the new things he has discovered through the day’s exciting activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kueFMhO5zvrXgBtM8mdEOJRV2D.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:96650'),
  ('821408338146017412', 'The Adventures of Paddington Bear', 1997, 'Kids, Animation, Family', 'Michael Bond', null, 'Nigel Lambert, Jonathan Kydd, Jade Williams, Eve Karpf, Moir Leslie, Steven Webb, Cyril Shaps', 'NR', 'The Adventures of Paddington Bear was a Canadian/French animated children''s television series. It was based on the book Paddington Bear by Michael Bond and written by Bruce Robb. It was produced by Cinar and Protecrea and ran for 117 episodes. The show aired in the United States on the Cookie Jar Toons block on This TV from November 2008 - August 2009. However, all CINAR references in these broadcasts have been replaced by Cookie Jar references. It was also shown on HBO.', 'The Adventures of Paddington Bear was a Canadian/French animated children''s television series. It was based on the book Paddington Bear by Michael Bond and written by Bruce Robb. It was produced by Cinar and Protecrea and ran for 117 episodes. The show aired in the United States on the Cookie Jar Toons block on This TV from November 2008 - August 2009. However, all CINAR references in these broadcasts have been replaced by Cookie Jar references. It was also shown on HBO.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDERiKarYbrC9mYymXMoKibSNLA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:11732'),
  ('999734908730491022', 'The Adventures of Pete & Pete', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy, Kids', 'Will McRobb, Chris Viscardi', null, 'Michael C. Maronna, Danny Tamberelli, Alison Fanelli, Judy Grafe, Hardy Rawls', 'TV-Y', 'Pete and Pete are two redheaded brothers living in the somewhat surreal town of Wellsville. Pete, the older of the two, narrates the stories about their adventures in everyday life.', 'Pete and Pete are two redheaded brothers living in the somewhat surreal town of Wellsville. Pete, the older of the two, narrates the stories about their adventures in everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWg499OrdZlnW6V0L38XsORvYnu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2824'),
  ('863126363934264507', 'The Adventures of Peter Pan', 1989, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Noriko Hidaka, Naoko Matsui, Chikao Ohtsuka, Sumi Shimamoto, Hisako Kyoda, Hiroko Emori, Maria Kawamura, Kazue Ikura', null, 'The anime starts with Wendy having a dream about Peter Pan rescuing her and having a sword fight with Captain Hook. Wendy and her two brothers later on the episode go to Never Never land and Wendy becomes the ''mother'' of the Lost boys. Throughout the series a romance blooms between Peter and Wendy as they go on fights with pirates . The last half of the series go to a different direction then the original story line and also introduce a new character ( Princess Luna ) who becomes an important part of the last episodes.', 'The anime starts with Wendy having a dream about Peter Pan rescuing her and having a sword fight with Captain Hook. Wendy and her two brothers later on the episode go to Never Never land and Wendy becomes the ''mother'' of the Lost boys. Throughout the series a romance blooms between Peter and Wendy as they go on fights with pirates . The last half of the series go to a different direction then the original story line and also introduce a new character ( Princess Luna ) who becomes an important part of the last episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPeTO5cvRdhgXCFCVo7wbn52qtn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14578'),
  ('493520178709320708', 'The Adventures of Pinocchio', 1972, 'Comedy, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Carlo Collodi', 'Andrea Balestri, Gina Lollobrigida, Mario Scaccia, Mario Adorf, Renzo Montagnani, Galliano Sbarra, Pino Ferrara, Siria Betti', 'TV-Y', 'Mastro Geppetto is a poor carpenter with no wife and no children. The man is very lonely, and when trading a piece of wood with his colleague Mastero Cherry, he decides to build himself a puppet to make him company.', 'Mastro Geppetto is a poor carpenter with no wife and no children. The man is very lonely, and when trading a piece of wood with his colleague Mastero Cherry, he decides to build himself a puppet to make him company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTXbqcnBPNQr18qsXtUCpulYw6h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86662'),
  ('613577837314803227', 'The Adventures of Puss in Boots', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Doug Langdale', null, 'Eric Bauza, Grey DeLisle, Jayma Mays, Joshua Rush, Paul Rugg, Candi Milo', 'TV-Y7', 'The world''s greatest feline fighter, lover and milk connoisseur is back in this original series filled with daring adventures, great boots, and laugh-out-loud fun! The entire family will be entranced by Puss'' fantastical CG world filled with new characters, exotic locations and mystical tales that make up the stuff of legends. There''s nothing that can get in this celebrated swashbuckling kitty''s way...except maybe a hairball.', 'The world''s greatest feline fighter, lover and milk connoisseur is back in this original series filled with daring adventures, great boots, and laugh-out-loud fun! The entire family will be entranced by Puss'' fantastical CG world filled with new characters, exotic locations and mystical tales that make up the stuff of legends. There''s nothing that can get in this celebrated swashbuckling kitty''s way...except maybe a hairball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHpUlyWCqXXUDY7zekQdJmf6QkP.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:61886'),
  ('696226659202237465', 'The Adventures of Rin Tin Tin', 1954, 'Western, Family', null, null, 'James Brown, Lee Aaker, Joe Sawyer, Rand Brooks, Rin-Tin-Tin II', null, 'The Adventures of Rin Tin Tin is an American children''s television program. Beginning in October 1954 until May 1959, 166 episodes originally aired on ABC television network. It starred child actor Lee Aaker as Rusty, a boy orphaned in an Indian raid, who was being raised by the soldiers at a US Cavalry post known as Fort Apache. He and his German shepherd dog, Rin Tin Tin, helped the soldiers to establish order in the American West. Texas-born actor James Brown appeared as Lieutenant Ripley "Rip" Masters. Co-stars included veteran actor Joe Sawyer and actor Rand Brooks from Gone with the Wind fame.', 'The Adventures of Rin Tin Tin is an American children''s television program. Beginning in October 1954 until May 1959, 166 episodes originally aired on ABC television network. It starred child actor Lee Aaker as Rusty, a boy orphaned in an Indian raid, who was being raised by the soldiers at a US Cavalry post known as Fort Apache. He and his German shepherd dog, Rin Tin Tin, helped the soldiers to establish order in the American West. Texas-born actor James Brown appeared as Lieutenant Ripley "Rip" Masters. Co-stars included veteran actor Joe Sawyer and actor Rand Brooks from Gone with the Wind fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/325dZgSWTdsu2xlSJIlhkDBteUa.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:10794'),
  ('1037362289683581398', 'The Adventures of Robin Hood', 1955, 'Action & Adventure, Family', null, null, 'Richard Greene, Archie Duncan, Alexander Gauge, Alan Wheatley, Bernadette O''Farrell, Ian Hunter, John Arnatt, Patricia Driscoll', 'TV-PG', 'The legendary character Robin Hood and his band of merry men in Sherwood Forest and the surrounding vicinity. While some episodes dramatised the traditional Robin Hood tales, most episodes were original dramas created by the show''s writers and producers.', 'The legendary character Robin Hood and his band of merry men in Sherwood Forest and the surrounding vicinity. While some episodes dramatised the traditional Robin Hood tales, most episodes were original dramas created by the show''s writers and producers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDlzPHsz0iVNjspLZlsSKWfLc3g.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:10393'),
  ('424047724081166414', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson', 1980, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Crime', null, 'Yuli Dunsky', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Vitali Solomin, Rina Zelyonaya', null, 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson is a series of five films produced by Lenfilm for the Soviet Central Television, split into eleven episodes, starring Vasily Livanov as Sherlock Holmes and Vitaly Solomin as Dr. Watson. They were directed by Igor Maslennikov and filmed in Russia (the then Soviet Union) between 1979 and 1986, and the series was one of the most successful in the history of Russian television.', 'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson is a series of five films produced by Lenfilm for the Soviet Central Television, split into eleven episodes, starring Vasily Livanov as Sherlock Holmes and Vitaly Solomin as Dr. Watson. They were directed by Igor Maslennikov and filmed in Russia (the then Soviet Union) between 1979 and 1986, and the series was one of the most successful in the history of Russian television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WxfaKH4KkruJROkoto84xIpVAf.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:63915'),
  ('405194994450364857', 'The Adventures of Sinbad', 1996, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ed Naha', null, 'Zen Gesner, George Buza, Tim Progosh, Oris Erhuero, Mariah Shirley', null, 'The Adventures of Sinbad is a Canadian television series which aired from 1996 to 1998. It follows on the story from the pilot of the same name, and revolves around the series'' protagonist, Sinbad. The series is a re-telling of the adventures of Sinbad from The Arabian Nights.', 'The Adventures of Sinbad is a Canadian television series which aired from 1996 to 1998. It follows on the story from the pilot of the same name, and revolves around the series'' protagonist, Sinbad. The series is a re-telling of the adventures of Sinbad from The Arabian Nights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dakx8dktuEWOZ28AmDtCiKOKxTF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1841'),
  ('523660500148550502', 'The Adventures of Super Mario Bros. 3', 1990, 'Family, Animation, Kids', 'Reed Shelly, Bruce Shelly', null, 'Walker Boone, Tony Rosato, Tracey Moore, Harvey Atkin, John Stocker, Dan Hennessey, Tara Strong, Tabitha St. Germain', 'TV-Y7', 'The Mario Bros., Princess Toadstool, and Toad protect the Mushroom Kingdom against the evil forces of Bowser and his seven Koopa Kids.', 'The Mario Bros., Princess Toadstool, and Toad protect the Mushroom Kingdom against the evil forces of Bowser and his seven Koopa Kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhOmMbTkQ8PtuB65YLUftVWRuvu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14396'),
  ('1004534595396299654', 'The Adventures of the Black Stallion', 1992, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Steven DeNore, Boudjemaa Dahmane, Jacques Méthé', null, 'Mickey Rooney, Richard Ian Cox, David Taylor, Jean-Paul Solal, Michèle Goodger, Docs Keepin Time', null, 'After being shipwrecked on a remote desert island, courageous, young Alec Ramsay and a wild Arabian stallion named the "Black," form an irrevocable bond that continues after their rescue. Now teammates in the horse-racing circuit, they are poised to take the racing world by storm. No one else can ride the stunning fire and silk stallion but Alec; and though the Black''s spirit is untamed, his speed is unmatched and he is swiftly becoming the fastest racehorse in the world.', 'After being shipwrecked on a remote desert island, courageous, young Alec Ramsay and a wild Arabian stallion named the "Black," form an irrevocable bond that continues after their rescue. Now teammates in the horse-racing circuit, they are poised to take the racing world by storm. No one else can ride the stunning fire and silk stallion but Alec; and though the Black''s spirit is untamed, his speed is unmatched and he is swiftly becoming the fastest racehorse in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sANB1VJvGxC5F5gTFAUljGrgbNK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1244'),
  ('145281015199393304', 'The Adventures of the Galaxy Rangers', 1986, 'Animation, Western, Action & Adventure', 'Robert Mandell', null, 'Jerry Orbach, Earl Hammond, Laura Dean, Ray Owens, Corinne Orr, Hubert Kelly, Doug Preis, Maia Danziger', null, 'The Adventures of the Galaxy Rangers is an American animated Space Western television series created by Robert Mandell and Gaylord Entertainment Company. The series combines sci-fi stories with traditional wild west themes. It is one of the first anime-style shows produced mainly in the USA, although the actual animation was done by the Japanese animation studio Tokyo Movie Shinsha. At the time it aired, The Adventures of the Galaxy Rangers was considered a revolutionary children''s show.', 'The Adventures of the Galaxy Rangers is an American animated Space Western television series created by Robert Mandell and Gaylord Entertainment Company. The series combines sci-fi stories with traditional wild west themes. It is one of the first anime-style shows produced mainly in the USA, although the actual animation was done by the Japanese animation studio Tokyo Movie Shinsha. At the time it aired, The Adventures of the Galaxy Rangers was considered a revolutionary children''s show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeEDA90HHD925AD0Henrln9N3o6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:325'),
  ('1095437576101719067', 'The Adventures of the Little Prince', 1978, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Taiki Matsuno, Masaaki Yajima, Hiroko Maruyama, Nobuo Tanaka', null, 'Anime series based on the book by Antoine de Saint-Exupéry. The series showed the extended adventures of the Little Prince, Swifty The Space Bird, and the Rose Girl.', 'Anime series based on the book by Antoine de Saint-Exupéry. The series showed the extended adventures of the Little Prince, Swifty The Space Bird, and the Rose Girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTNgb8120H2FmMWQ2GnTQkEfL9k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27436'),
  ('168427778429867162', 'The Adventures of the Mole', 1957, 'Animation, Kids', 'Zdeněk Miler', null, 'Antonín Jedlička, František Filipovský, Josef Hlinomaz, Artuš Kalous, P. Kysela, E. Smítková, Viola Zinková', 'TV-G', 'Created by Czech director and animator Zdeněk Miler in 1956, Krtek, or The Mole in English, was an international hit with children. Because the cartoons were presented with no dialogue, Krtek was held to no national boundaries. Milers daughter voiced the noises and grunts that Krtek made, and gave Miler the feedback from a child''s perspective he needed to keep his stories focus on his young fans.', 'Created by Czech director and animator Zdeněk Miler in 1956, Krtek, or The Mole in English, was an international hit with children. Because the cartoons were presented with no dialogue, Krtek was held to no national boundaries. Milers daughter voiced the noises and grunts that Krtek made, and gave Miler the feedback from a child''s perspective he needed to keep his stories focus on his young fans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkuoiW7Q8iOHBckBEePhwV8SVLI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44256'),
  ('743574298043079025', 'The Adventures of Tintin', 1991, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Hergé', null, 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Susan Roman, Michel Ruhl, Marie Vincent', 'TV-Y7', 'Travel with Tintin, the young and intrepid Belgian reporter, and his faithful dog Snowy as they take you from Tibet to the Moon, or from Egypt to the depths of the sea -- solving mysteries, pursuing truth and justice, and gambling with their lives.', 'Travel with Tintin, the young and intrepid Belgian reporter, and his faithful dog Snowy as they take you from Tibet to the Moon, or from Egypt to the depths of the sea -- solving mysteries, pursuing truth and justice, and gambling with their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uzAVoVlZr6Pv6IaquReoMWQqne.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1570'),
  ('380395121869586550', 'The Adventures of Tom Sawyer', 1980, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Masako Nozawa, Kazuyo Aoki, Keiko Han, Ichiro Nagai, Ikuo Nishikawa, Sumiko Shirakawa, Kazuhiko Inoue, Kaoru Kurosu', 'NR', 'Tom Sawyer is a young boy growing up along the Mississippi River in the mid 1800s. Along with his best friend Huckleberry Finn, he spends his days ditching school, fishing, climbing trees and having adventures.', 'Tom Sawyer is a young boy growing up along the Mississippi River in the mid 1800s. Along with his best friend Huckleberry Finn, he spends his days ditching school, fishing, climbing trees and having adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b08ZN0isUCr6WG5GvUbNaW8GpeL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43513'),
  ('314837389969021833', 'The Adventures of Wild Bill Hickok', 1951, 'Western', null, null, 'Guy Madison, Andy Devine', null, 'The Adventures of Wild Bill Hickok is an American Western television series which ran for eight seasons from 1951 through 1958. The Screen Gems series began in syndication, but ran on CBS from 1955 through 1958, and, at the same time, on ABC from 1957 through 1958.', 'The Adventures of Wild Bill Hickok is an American Western television series which ran for eight seasons from 1951 through 1958. The Screen Gems series began in syndication, but ran on CBS from 1955 through 1958, and, at the same time, on ABC from 1957 through 1958.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovzbqb1cvM754k0cC4mSP6HyDAm.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:13658'),
  ('295184656413779289', 'The Advisors Alliance', 2017, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Wu Xiubo, Liu Tao, Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Jerry Lee, Tang Yixin, Zhang Chenghe, Wang Dong, Xiao Shunyao', null, 'The story of Sima Yi, a great politician and strategist who lived during the Three Kingdoms era. By his side, Sima Yi has his politically-astute distaff members of his household, and pitted against them are the formidable Cao Cao and his heirs. After defending the Kingdom of Wei from Kongming formidable talents, who will end up with the ultimate power?', 'The story of Sima Yi, a great politician and strategist who lived during the Three Kingdoms era. By his side, Sima Yi has his politically-astute distaff members of his household, and pitted against them are the formidable Cao Cao and his heirs. After defending the Kingdom of Wei from Kongming formidable talents, who will end up with the ultimate power?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdlltLF34oFEJ0yIQ64JROFR2VN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72311'),
  ('130709339552653825', 'The Affair', 2014, 'Drama', 'Sarah Treem, Hagai Levi', null, 'Dominic West, Maura Tierney, Julia Goldani Telles, Jadon Sand, Anna Paquin, Sanaa Lathan, Abigail Dylan Harrison', 'TV-MA', 'The emotional effects of an extramarital relationship between Noah, a New York City schoolteacher and budding novelist with a wife of twenty years and four children and Alison, a young waitress and wife from Montauk at the end of Long Island, trying to piece her life back together in the wake of a tragedy.', 'The emotional effects of an extramarital relationship between Noah, a New York City schoolteacher and budding novelist with a wife of twenty years and four children and Alison, a young waitress and wife from Montauk at the end of Long Island, trying to piece her life back together in the wake of a tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8scKJeu6GoxMqpt7UO5aMeU0TOn.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61463'),
  ('835564785122679134', 'The After', 2014, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chris Carter', null, 'Aldis Hodge, Andrew Howard, Jaina Lee Ortiz, Jason Lewis, Arielle Kebbel', null, 'Eight strangers are thrown together by mysterious forces and must help each other survive in a violent world that defies explanation.', 'Eight strangers are thrown together by mysterious forces and must help each other survive in a violent world that defies explanation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kP8Rvq5C6zRWzYZJJlk3f1jXstY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60607'),
  ('236797470591792356', 'The Afternoon Play', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Will Trotter', null, null, null, 'The Afternoon Play is a British television anthology series of standalone contemporary dramas aired during the afternoons of 2003–07 on BBC One, featuring well-known actors in one-off stories. A daytime drama strand showcasing a variety of genres, from comedy to mystery, it was part of a long tradition of afternoon plays on BBC Radio 4, which would go on to influence the television version.', 'The Afternoon Play is a British television anthology series of standalone contemporary dramas aired during the afternoons of 2003–07 on BBC One, featuring well-known actors in one-off stories. A daytime drama strand showcasing a variety of genres, from comedy to mystery, it was part of a long tradition of afternoon plays on BBC Radio 4, which would go on to influence the television version.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39dlEVXchiBT3Gf1PTHkZjTSsLt.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:18337'),
  ('388063724928012181', 'The Afterparty', 2022, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime', 'Christopher Miller', null, 'Tiffany Haddish, Sam Richardson, Zoë Chao, John Cho, Paul Walter Hauser, Ken Jeong, Anna Konkle, Poppy Liu', 'TV-MA', 'Nothing is as it seems in this hilarious murder mystery where each suspect''s story is told through a different film genre.', 'Nothing is as it seems in this hilarious murder mystery where each suspect''s story is told through a different film genre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iAxAxeX5RjB39ckhxPMDCJPpG9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106454'),
  ('303337278297968037', 'The Agatha Christie Hour', 1982, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, 'John Bryden, William Corlett, Freda Kelsall', 'William Gaunt, Nicholas Farrell, Angela Easterling, Christopher Wren, Osmund Bullock, Ciaran Madden', 'NR', 'This ten episode program was based on ten short stories written by Agatha Christie but with wide-ranging themes. Some were romances, some had supernatural themes and a couple were adventures. The common link was that all came from the talented pen of Agatha Christie, all were entertaining and each drama was carefully crafted and well cast with many of Britain''s best known actors of the time represented.', 'This ten episode program was based on ten short stories written by Agatha Christie but with wide-ranging themes. Some were romances, some had supernatural themes and a couple were adventures. The common link was that all came from the talented pen of Agatha Christie, all were entertaining and each drama was carefully crafted and well cast with many of Britain''s best known actors of the time represented.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKL621qo5aKct3Wu0NEEgClydXG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28007'),
  ('112243137832296813', 'The Age of A.I.', 2019, 'Documentary, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Robert Downey Jr.', 'TV-14', 'Explore the impact of A.I. and how it is transforming the way we live and work -- both now and in the future, featuring some of the brightest minds in science, philosophy, technology, engineering, medicine, futurism, entertainment and the arts to tell the dynamic story of A.I.', 'Explore the impact of A.I. and how it is transforming the way we live and work -- both now and in the future, featuring some of the brightest minds in science, philosophy, technology, engineering, medicine, futurism, entertainment and the arts to tell the dynamic story of A.I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccOtYMsGr7xUGgDFS7Tsx32fItv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95696'),
  ('515555598939106988', 'The Age of Anger', 2022, 'Drama', 'J. M. Ruiz Córdoba', 'Juan María Ruiz Córdoba', 'Amaia Aberasturi, Carlos Alcaide, Daniel Ibáñez, Manu Ríos, Dani Sabiti, Oriol Franco, Fernando Sola, Joan Pedrola', null, 'A man is found brutally murdered, presumably by his son Marcos, a teenager with no apparent problems. The tragedy hits the school, with students and teachers wondering what went wrong.', 'A man is found brutally murdered, presumably by his son Marcos, a teenager with no apparent problems. The tragedy hits the school, with students and teachers wondering what went wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1ea0WQV1iT6oziHgSVaMmKIEEJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128022'),
  ('333299165430951021', 'The Agency', 2001, 'Drama', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Gail Katz, Michael Frost Beckner', null, 'Jason O''Mara, David Clennon, Will Patton, Paige Turco, Rocky Carroll, Beau Bridges, Richard Speight Jr., Daniel Benzali', null, 'The Agency is a CBS television drama that followed the inner-workings of the CIA. The series was created by Michael Frost Beckner and was executive produced by Michael Frost Beckner, Shaun Cassidy Productions and Radiant Productions in association with Universal Network Television and CBS Productions. It aired from September 27, 2001 until May 17, 2003, lasting two seasons. It featured unprecedented filming from the actual CIA headquarters. The show was controversial regarding its exploration of current international affairs and its treatment of the ethical conflicts inherent in intelligence work. Beckner''s pilot script, written in March 2001, posited a re-invented CIA tasked with a "War on Terror" after Osama Bin Laden''s Al Qaeda terrorist organization plots a lethal attack on the west. The pilot was to premiere at CIA Headquarters on September 18, 2001 and set to air on CBS September 21, 2001, however, the actual 9/11 attacks convinced the network to hold the pilot and instead air a later episode. That first episode was aired later as the third episode of the first season. The September 11, 2001 terrorist events changed the way Americans viewed topical entertainment and "The Agency", at the time, was one of the most topical offering on network television. The producers of the series quickly responded to this new American perspective on world affairs, but CBS chose to cancel the show shortly after the second season''s final episode.', 'The Agency is a CBS television drama that followed the inner-workings of the CIA. The series was created by Michael Frost Beckner and was executive produced by Michael Frost Beckner, Shaun Cassidy Productions and Radiant Productions in association with Universal Network Television and CBS Productions. It aired from September 27, 2001 until May 17, 2003, lasting two seasons. It featured unprecedented filming from the actual CIA headquarters. The show was controversial regarding its exploration of current international affairs and its treatment of the ethical conflicts inherent in intelligence work. Beckner''s pilot script, written in March 2001, posited a re-invented CIA tasked with a "War on Terror" after Osama Bin Laden''s Al Qaeda terrorist organization plots a lethal attack on the west. The pilot was to premiere at CIA Headquarters on September 18, 2001 and set to air on CBS September 21, 2001, however, the actual 9/11 attacks convinced the network to hold the pilot and instead air a later episode. That first episode was aired later as the third episode of the first season. The September 11, 2001 terrorist events changed the way Americans viewed topical entertainment and "The Agency", at the time, was one of the most topical offering on network television. The producers of the series quickly responded to this new American perspective on world affairs, but CBS chose to cancel the show shortly after the second season''s final episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJXFbRv0WYRcT8cDOLMaKfVYwye.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1537'),
  ('17676688145047759', 'The Agency', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy, Documentary', 'Ekin Atalar', 'Ekin Atalar', 'Barış Falay, Canan Ergüder, Fatih Artman, Ahsen Eroğlu, Deniz Can Aktaş, Ayşenil Şamlıoğlu, Gamze Karaduman, Semi Sırtıkkızıl', 'NR', 'Dicle finds herself in an agency when she comes to Istanbul dreaming of becoming a filmmaker. There’s only place for stars, ego wars, greed, fame, money, hope and disappointment here. As Dicle struggles to exist in this glamorous world without losing her way... Her broken family ties start to bleed again. Her father who abandoned them before she was born is now one of the sharks of the industry and they are working in the same agency. And the magical lights of cinema start to shed light on Dicle’s first love.', 'Dicle finds herself in an agency when she comes to Istanbul dreaming of becoming a filmmaker. There’s only place for stars, ego wars, greed, fame, money, hope and disappointment here. As Dicle struggles to exist in this glamorous world without losing her way... Her broken family ties start to bleed again. Her father who abandoned them before she was born is now one of the sharks of the industry and they are working in the same agency. And the magical lights of cinema start to shed light on Dicle’s first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xeoPEPCpLfdj2LpUgmWFQIMpJT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108179'),
  ('255124623376721008', 'The Agency: Central Intelligence', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jez Butterworth, John-Henry Butterworth', null, 'Michael Fassbender, Jeffrey Wright, Jodie Turner-Smith, Richard Gere, Katherine Waterston, Harriet Sansom Harris, John Magaro, Saura Lightfoot Leon', 'TV-MA', 'Covert CIA agent Martian is ordered to abandon his undercover life and return to London Station. When the love he left behind unexpectedly reappears, their romance reignites, pitting his career, his real identity and his mission against his heart while hurling them both into a deadly game of international intrigue and espionage.', 'Covert CIA agent Martian is ordered to abandon his undercover life and return to London Station. When the love he left behind unexpectedly reappears, their romance reignites, pitting his career, his real identity and his mission against his heart while hurling them both into a deadly game of international intrigue and espionage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDZgOeTiplrl0skvK6IIyejHLQF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219971'),
  ('110150041777176899', 'The Alcàsser Murders', 2019, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Fernando García, Juan Ignacio Blanco, Elías León Siminiani, Ramón Campos, Luis Frontela, Pepe Navarro, Nieves Herrero, Manuel Campo Vidal', 'TV-MA', 'New interviews and an up-to-date analysis of evidence shed light on the 1992 murders of three girls in Spain and their profound impact on the nation.', 'New interviews and an up-to-date analysis of evidence shed light on the 1992 murders of three girls in Spain and their profound impact on the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cH3HIvjW3TrsMeH4fXBoRdVtoZG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90274'),
  ('424742496525809295', 'The Alfred Hitchcock Hour', 1962, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Alfred Hitchcock', null, 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'TV-PG', 'A continuation of the anthology series “Alfred Hitchcock Presents”, hosted by the master of suspense and featuring thrillers and mysteries.', 'A continuation of the anthology series “Alfred Hitchcock Presents”, hosted by the master of suspense and featuring thrillers and mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bnJU1YmobWBNokjLruUsZ6cykC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:21728'),
  ('134375936864901063', 'The Alienist', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Cary Joji Fukunaga', null, 'Daniel Brühl, Luke Evans, Dakota Fanning, Matthew Shear, Douglas Smith, Robert Wisdom, Rosy McEwen, Melanie Field', 'TV-MA', 'New York, 1896. Police commissioner Theodore Roosevelt brings together criminal psychologist Dr. Laszlo Kreizler, newspaper illustrator John Moore and secretary Sara Howard to investigate several murders of male prostitutes.', 'New York, 1896. Police commissioner Theodore Roosevelt brings together criminal psychologist Dr. Laszlo Kreizler, newspaper illustrator John Moore and secretary Sara Howard to investigate several murders of male prostitutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUd4RPbfHuB1zIG2iNI5bdZcQo3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71769'),
  ('282364609854698012', 'The Aliens', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Fintan Ryan', 'Fintan Ryan', 'Michael Socha, Michaela Coel, Jim Howick', 'TV-MA', 'Nearly 40 years ago aliens crash-landed in the UK. They look like us, but are forced to live in a ghetto. Border control officer Lewis falls in love with one.', 'Nearly 40 years ago aliens crash-landed in the UK. They look like us, but are forced to live in a ghetto. Border control officer Lewis falls in love with one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIFfFTzKgU6m7BMzAPsvPxtiYTk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65836'),
  ('51506085848124698', 'The All New Pink Panther Show', 1978, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Tately, Bob Camp', null, null, 'TV-Y', 'Crazylegs Crane inserts himself between 2 Pink Panther adventures.', 'Crazylegs Crane inserts himself between 2 Pink Panther adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuzz9yDTHl2Ox1f0YZsNwflaBGt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114772'),
  ('293172432237976588', 'The All-Devouring Whale: Homecoming', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Mo', null, 'Shujun Lv, Ge Zirui, Zhang Pei, 王小豫, Zhimao, Chong Chong, 苏翼', 'TV-14', 'Fan Lingxiao, a spiritual pet master with exceptional talents, was plotted against during the Level-A sect promotion competition and was devoured by Kun, his own spiritual pet. When he opened his eyes again, he found himself reincarnated into a young man named “Liu Fengmang” and was imprisoned in the White Mansion’s dungeon. Meanwhile, his own sect, Lingxiao Pavilion, was in a perilous state. To uncover the truth of being devoured by Kun and revitalize his sect, Fan Lingxiao, accompanied by his existing spiritual pets, embarked on a brand-new adventure journey with Gu Ling, Cheng Xi, and Yue Tong.', 'Fan Lingxiao, a spiritual pet master with exceptional talents, was plotted against during the Level-A sect promotion competition and was devoured by Kun, his own spiritual pet. When he opened his eyes again, he found himself reincarnated into a young man named “Liu Fengmang” and was imprisoned in the White Mansion’s dungeon. Meanwhile, his own sect, Lingxiao Pavilion, was in a perilous state. To uncover the truth of being devoured by Kun and revitalize his sect, Fan Lingxiao, accompanied by his existing spiritual pets, embarked on a brand-new adventure journey with Gu Ling, Cheng Xi, and Yue Tong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/om6VqS0T8zqbOMMYHKyQxmEmtNJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280078'),
  ('401024109750735549', 'The All-New Popeye Hour', 1978, 'Animation', 'E. C. Segar', null, null, null, 'The All-New Popeye Hour is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions and King Features Syndicate. Starring the popular comic strip character Popeye, the series aired from 1978 to 1983 on CBS.', 'The All-New Popeye Hour is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions and King Features Syndicate. Starring the popular comic strip character Popeye, the series aired from 1978 to 1983 on CBS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePyGlz6tGN5M0VkmofgkYwWg8xd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15520'),
  ('965276448479743547', 'The All-New Super Friends Hour', 1977, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Casey Kasem, Michael Bell, Ross Martin, Olan Soule, Norman Alden, Regis Cordic, Ted Knight, Ted Cassidy', null, 'The All-New Super Friends Hour is an American animated television series about a team of superheroes which ran from September 10, 1977, to September 2, 1978, on ABC. It was produced by Hanna-Barbera and is based on the Justice League and associated comic book characters published by DC Comics.', 'The All-New Super Friends Hour is an American animated television series about a team of superheroes which ran from September 10, 1977, to September 2, 1978, on ABC. It was produced by Hanna-Barbera and is based on the Justice League and associated comic book characters published by DC Comics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1RUrHRmx1QjdLIxOJqCte6HGD4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10159'),
  ('633007095104671743', 'The Allegation', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jan Ehlert, Oliver Berben, Ferdinand von Schirach', 'Ferdinand von Schirach', 'Peter Kurth, Narges Rashidi, Sebastian Urzendowsky, Désirée Nosbusch, Michael Pink, Katharina M. Schubert, Julika Jenkins, Hans-Heinrich Hardt', null, '25 defendants, 300 trial days and a legal scandal that has gone down in the history of jurisprudence: In this thrilling legal drama, bestselling author Ferdinand von Schirach transports the so-called "Worms Trials", a German legal scandal from the nineties into the present. The result is a gripping, current legal drama about hysteria in social media, collective anger and how the hunger for revenge can overlook the victims.', '25 defendants, 300 trial days and a legal scandal that has gone down in the history of jurisprudence: In this thrilling legal drama, bestselling author Ferdinand von Schirach transports the so-called "Worms Trials", a German legal scandal from the nineties into the present. The result is a gripping, current legal drama about hysteria in social media, collective anger and how the hunger for revenge can overlook the victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQ9GHo3TN5LMdCOesDKspm2t1VX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136155'),
  ('887927635457445680', 'The Alliance', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jan Versteegh, Bastiaan Ragas', null, 'Sixteen participants live together. They are divided into teams and have to compete & win their assignments. But in the end, it''s every man for himself, because at the end of every month, only one person wins a hundred thousand euros.', 'Sixteen participants live together. They are divided into teams and have to compete & win their assignments. But in the end, it''s every man for himself, because at the end of every month, only one person wins a hundred thousand euros.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsipinibYxrZhpkQ6MKxIMgL0hv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:235493'),
  ('180261311256215079', 'The Almighty Johnsons', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rachel Lang, James Griffin', null, 'Timothy Balme, Dean O''Gorman, Shane Cortese, Emmett Skilton, Ben Barrington, Jared Turner, Fern Sutherland', null, 'The four Johnson brothers have inherited the powers of the Norse gods. Because the gods lived eons ago, however, time has diluted the powers. The unique ability that each brother possesses isn''t very strong, and they still have the same desires and faults that mortals do. Their lives include sibling rivalry, trying to get girls, and hanging out; but they also want to be stronger, and so they embark on a quest to fulfill an ancient prophecy in hope of gaining the full strength of their abilities.', 'The four Johnson brothers have inherited the powers of the Norse gods. Because the gods lived eons ago, however, time has diluted the powers. The unique ability that each brother possesses isn''t very strong, and they still have the same desires and faults that mortals do. Their lives include sibling rivalry, trying to get girls, and hanging out; but they also want to be stronger, and so they embark on a quest to fulfill an ancient prophecy in hope of gaining the full strength of their abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqIzRbkuyLC3SGKbWkdSpQGexoY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:37779'),
  ('782347527484653779', 'The Althea Tapes', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Maggie Grace', 'TV-MA', 'In this digital companion series, Al interviews survivors and reveals why her interviews are so important.', 'In this digital companion series, Al interviews survivors and reveals why her interviews are so important.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zk5Z3UpnrW0wkXI30dvSz0vmdoD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208071'),
  ('943839629306410630', 'The Amanda Show', 1999, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Dan Schneider', null, 'Amanda Bynes, Nancy Sullivan, Drake Bell, Raquel Lee, John Kassir, Josh Peck, Camryn Walling', 'TV-Y7', 'The Amanda Show is an American live action sketch comedy and variety show that aired on Nickelodeon from October 16, 1999 to September 21, 2002. It starred Amanda Bynes, Drake Bell, and Nancy Sullivan, along with several performing artists who came and left at different points, such as John Kassir, Raquel Lee, and Josh Peck. The show was a spin-off from All That, in which Bynes had co-starred for several years. The show was unexpectedly cancelled at the end of 2002, according to creator Dan Schneider''s blog. Writers for the show included John Hoberg, Steven Molaro, Andrew Hill Newman, and Dan Schneider. Two years after the end of The Amanda Show, Dan Schneider created a new series, called Drake & Josh, featuring Drake Bell, Josh Peck and Nancy Sullivan.', 'The Amanda Show is an American live action sketch comedy and variety show that aired on Nickelodeon from October 16, 1999 to September 21, 2002. It starred Amanda Bynes, Drake Bell, and Nancy Sullivan, along with several performing artists who came and left at different points, such as John Kassir, Raquel Lee, and Josh Peck. The show was a spin-off from All That, in which Bynes had co-starred for several years. The show was unexpectedly cancelled at the end of 2002, according to creator Dan Schneider''s blog. Writers for the show included John Hoberg, Steven Molaro, Andrew Hill Newman, and Dan Schneider. Two years after the end of The Amanda Show, Dan Schneider created a new series, called Drake & Josh, featuring Drake Bell, Josh Peck and Nancy Sullivan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzoU9ACuhNZQ8IMhWPKAGXskGtr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:376'),
  ('217809067679912222', 'The Amazing Digital Circus', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Gooseworx', null, 'Lizzie Freeman, Alex Rochon, Michael Kovach, Amanda Hufford, Marissa Lenti, Sean Chiplock, Ashley Nichols, Gooseworx', 'TV-PG', 'A woman is caught in a bizarre virtual reality where she and other trapped humans become bound to the whims of an unhinged AI ringmaster.', 'A woman is caught in a bizarre virtual reality where she and other trapped humans become bound to the whims of an unhinged AI ringmaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpfrgfomX8uNFxv4VaEzvJGs9TK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261145'),
  ('19932734424528164', 'The Amazing Race', 2001, 'Reality', 'Bertram van Munster, Elise Doganieri', null, 'Phil Keoghan', 'TV-PG', 'This reality competition sees teams embark on a trek around the world to amazing destinations where they must compete in a series of challenges, some mental and some physical. Only when the tasks are completed will they learn of their next location. Teams who are the farthest behind will gradually be eliminated as the contest progresses, with the first team to arrive at the final destination winning the race and the $1 million prize.', 'This reality competition sees teams embark on a trek around the world to amazing destinations where they must compete in a series of challenges, some mental and some physical. Only when the tasks are completed will they learn of their next location. Teams who are the farthest behind will gradually be eliminated as the contest progresses, with the first team to arrive at the final destination winning the race and the $1 million prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1jq0atcQg6UkaZpco0kFL6QHuM.jpg', 38, 'tmdb:tv:30957'),
  ('1149074284345838390', 'The Amazing Race Australia', 2011, 'Reality', 'Bertram van Munster, Elise Doganieri', null, 'Beau Ryan', null, 'Australian version of the American reality competition where teams embark on a trek around the world to amazing destinations competing in a series of challenges, some mental and some physical.', 'Australian version of the American reality competition where teams embark on a trek around the world to amazing destinations competing in a series of challenges, some mental and some physical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MY5XtXBDKVsr8yCR631OHIS17a.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:45665'),
  ('1071260757951820815', 'The Amazing Race Canada', 2013, 'Reality', 'Elise Doganieri, Bertram van Munster', null, 'Jon Montgomery', null, 'A uniquely Canadian take on the original series, with ten teams of two racing around the world to amazing locations for the $1,000,000 prize.', 'A uniquely Canadian take on the original series, with ten teams of two racing around the world to amazing locations for the $1,000,000 prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mz3yidQz3S97EmXmPSEGnepp8ot.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:59138'),
