  ('591169152293023985', 'The Amazing Race Israel', 2009, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'The Race to the Million is a reality game show set in Israel and is based on the American series The Amazing Race. It features eleven teams of two with pre-existing relationships, who will vie for the substantial cash prize in a race around the world.', 'The Race to the Million is a reality game show set in Israel and is based on the American series The Amazing Race. It features eleven teams of two with pre-existing relationships, who will vie for the substantial cash prize in a race around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqyzqp6nvP8z7hi5F3NBlaH9Lqr.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:49443'),
