  ('960710618962846700', 'The Batman', 2004, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Duane Capizzi', null, 'Rino Romano, Evan Sabara, Danielle Judovits, Alastair Duncan', 'TV-Y7', 'A young billionaire Bruce Wayne fights crime and evil as the mysterious vigilante, The Batman.', 'A young billionaire Bruce Wayne fights crime and evil as the mysterious vigilante, The Batman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3w7koeOR2x71XYMJDGpygxYtScI.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2022'),
  ('280530372295064005', 'The Battle Among the Clans', 1985, null, null, null, 'Chow Yun-Fat, Kenneth Tsang, Mimi Kung, Eddie Kwan Lai-Kit, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Andy Tai Chi-Wai, Lui Fong', null, 'The story begins with the Japanese occupation of Hong Kong coming to an end in 1945 and the remaining Japanese dying or leaving the territory. The British colonial government have yet to fully resume its duties. Citizens themselves are flushing out the remaining traitors one by one. Soon, multiple societies of different legions were formed within the HK underground. Each one tries to control the city in a time of very weak and corrupt governance.', 'The story begins with the Japanese occupation of Hong Kong coming to an end in 1945 and the remaining Japanese dying or leaving the territory. The British colonial government have yet to fully resume its duties. Citizens themselves are flushing out the remaining traitors one by one. Soon, multiple societies of different legions were formed within the HK underground. Each one tries to control the city in a time of very weak and corrupt governance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whZBC81jAVerSLGsbZwl9Bk6ele.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107916'),
  ('811529002405748010', 'The Bay', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Daragh Carville, Richard Clark', null, 'Marsha Thomason, Daniel Ryan, Erin Shanagher, Barry Sloane, Georgina Scholes, David Carpenter, Andrew Dowbiggin, Olwen May', 'TV-14', 'Family Liaison Officer Lisa Armstrong becomes a little too emotionally involved with a case (to the point where she might compromise it) concerning a pair of missing Morecambe twins to whose distraught parents she is assigned.', 'Family Liaison Officer Lisa Armstrong becomes a little too emotionally involved with a case (to the point where she might compromise it) concerning a pair of missing Morecambe twins to whose distraught parents she is assigned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZbCq6t1aKssAhFOjvslUpt9W2x.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:87773'),
  ('873716130297097431', 'The Bay of Spies', 2023, 'War & Politics, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Bartosz Gelner, Karol Pocheć, Anna Radwan, Przemysław Kozłowski, Mateusz Grabowski', null, 'Based on true events, "The Bay of Spies" follows Franz Neumann, a young Nazi Abwehr officer, who discovers that his real father was Polish. Using this information to his advantage Franz becomes a spy for the Allies with the code name Got’ His task is to obtain information about the activities of the German Navy, the Kriegsmarine and report back to the allies. Using his charm and charisma, Franz manipulates the men he gets close to, makes women fall in love with him, and snakes his way into the German elite.', 'Based on true events, "The Bay of Spies" follows Franz Neumann, a young Nazi Abwehr officer, who discovers that his real father was Polish. Using this information to his advantage Franz becomes a spy for the Allies with the code name Got’ His task is to obtain information about the activities of the German Navy, the Kriegsmarine and report back to the allies. Using his charm and charisma, Franz manipulates the men he gets close to, makes women fall in love with him, and snakes his way into the German elite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEadu5CEKQQ73BhlA5zH6vBEH7F.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:239318'),
  ('846077048112747044', 'The Bear', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christopher Storer', null, 'Jeremy Allen White, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Ayo Edebiri, Lionel Boyce, Abby Elliott, Matty Matheson, Liza Colón-Zayas, Edwin Lee Gibson', 'TV-MA', 'Carmy, a young fine-dining chef, comes home to Chicago to run his family sandwich shop. As he fights to transform the shop and himself, he works alongside a rough-around-the-edges crew that ultimately reveal themselves as his chosen family.', 'Carmy, a young fine-dining chef, comes home to Chicago to run his family sandwich shop. As he fights to transform the shop and himself, he works alongside a rough-around-the-edges crew that ultimately reveal themselves as his chosen family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKfVzzEazSIjJMrw9ADa2x8ksLz.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:136315'),
  ('225224960597381234', 'The Beast', 1996, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'William Petersen, Karen Sillas, Charles Martin Smith, Ronald Guttman, Missy Crider, Sterling Macer Jr., A.J. Johnson, Larry Drake', 'TV-PG', 'Mysterious deaths and unexplained disappearances begin to occur in the small seaport village of Graves Point. When a large, strange claw is discovered on an empty raft washing up on the shore, marine biologist Dr. Herbert Talley identifies it as belonging to a rare giant squid.', 'Mysterious deaths and unexplained disappearances begin to occur in the small seaport village of Graves Point. When a large, strange claw is discovered on an empty raft washing up on the shore, marine biologist Dr. Herbert Talley identifies it as belonging to a rare giant squid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQ1czivDHyi00ICKMiIW8XkLnUf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49365'),
  ('29015988580426755', 'The Beast', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Vincent Angell, William L. Rotko', null, 'Patrick Swayze, Travis Fimmel, Kevin J. O''Connor, Lindsay Pulsipher, Lawrence Gilliard Jr., Dion Strowhorn Sr., Dale Caba, Laura Otto', null, 'Unorthodox but effective FBI veteran agent Charles Barker takes on a rookie partner, Ellis Dove. Barker trains Dove in a hard-edged, psychologically driven approach towards undercover work, where a moment''s hesitation can lead to death. As the job takes its toll on Dove, an Internal Affairs team tries to enlist the rookie as a double-agent in the bureau''s investigation of his partner.', 'Unorthodox but effective FBI veteran agent Charles Barker takes on a rookie partner, Ellis Dove. Barker trains Dove in a hard-edged, psychologically driven approach towards undercover work, where a moment''s hesitation can lead to death. As the job takes its toll on Dove, an Internal Affairs team tries to enlist the rookie as a double-agent in the bureau''s investigation of his partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPSg8OjovXypwpmTXLuvKe3sI3X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16386'),
  ('1094359866530996031', 'The Beast in Me', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Gabe Rotter', null, 'Claire Danes, Matthew Rhys, Brittany Snow, Natalie Morales', 'TV-MA', 'A famous author is pulled into a twisted mind game with her rich, powerful new neighbor — who might be a murderer.', 'A famous author is pulled into a twisted mind game with her rich, powerful new neighbor — who might be a murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxf7JCfIMvGONWTNUIJ068sFixK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250504'),
  ('102833038041810573', 'The Beast Must Die', 2021, 'Crime', 'Gaby Chiappe', null, 'Cush Jumbo, Jared Harris, Billy Howle, Nathaniel Parker, Mia Tomlinson', null, 'Following the death of her son in a hit and run, all Frances Cairnes wants is to hunt down and kill the man she believes is responsible. When she finally tracks him down, she tricks her way into his house and plots his murder from within.', 'Following the death of her son in a hit and run, all Frances Cairnes wants is to hunt down and kill the man she believes is responsible. When she finally tracks him down, she tricks her way into his house and plots his murder from within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYLgrsOxDwjdKskaurBiHDHlGGr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106348'),
  ('313178076832706531', 'The Beat', 2000, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tom Fontana', null, 'Derek Cecil, Mark Ruffalo, Heather Burns, Poppy Montgomery', null, 'The Beat delves into the personal and professional lives of two young police recruits who patrol New York''s streets. The city''s daily machinations are seen through the often bloodshot eyes of Officers Mike Dorigan and Zane Marinelli, two youthful, irreverent partners who are truly products of their generation and unique urban environment. Issues of race, excessive police force – and the unpredictable quirkiness of New York''s outspoken locals – compel both men to rely on their sense of humor just to make it to the end of their shift.', 'The Beat delves into the personal and professional lives of two young police recruits who patrol New York''s streets. The city''s daily machinations are seen through the often bloodshot eyes of Officers Mike Dorigan and Zane Marinelli, two youthful, irreverent partners who are truly products of their generation and unique urban environment. Issues of race, excessive police force – and the unpredictable quirkiness of New York''s outspoken locals – compel both men to rely on their sense of humor just to make it to the end of their shift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pS49rEj0XIKxKLDEHelW0YH63vZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2319'),
  ('371524767585802584', 'The Beatles', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Al Brodax', 'Bruce Howard, Al Brodax, Dennis Marks', 'Paul Frees, Lance Percival, Julie Bennett, Carol Corbett, John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison, Ringo Starr', null, 'The Beatles is an American animated television series featuring the fanciful and musical misadventures of the popular English rock band of the same name. It ran from 1965 to 1969 on ABC in the US. The series debuted on September 25, 1965 and ended on September 7, 1969. A total of 39 episodes were produced. The series was shown on Saturday mornings at 10:30 AM EST until the 1967 third season when it was moved to 12:00 PM EST. For the fourth season, which consisted of reruns, the series was shown at 9:30 AM EST on Sunday mornings. Each episode has a name of a Beatles song, so the story is based on its lyrics and it is also played at some time in the episode. The original series was rebroadcast in syndication by MTV in 1986 and 1987 and on the Disney Channel. The series was a historical milestone as the first weekly television series to feature animated versions of real, living people.', 'The Beatles is an American animated television series featuring the fanciful and musical misadventures of the popular English rock band of the same name. It ran from 1965 to 1969 on ABC in the US. The series debuted on September 25, 1965 and ended on September 7, 1969. A total of 39 episodes were produced. The series was shown on Saturday mornings at 10:30 AM EST until the 1967 third season when it was moved to 12:00 PM EST. For the fourth season, which consisted of reruns, the series was shown at 9:30 AM EST on Sunday mornings. Each episode has a name of a Beatles song, so the story is based on its lyrics and it is also played at some time in the episode. The original series was rebroadcast in syndication by MTV in 1986 and 1987 and on the Disney Channel. The series was a historical milestone as the first weekly television series to feature animated versions of real, living people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvkbpEK7WbF0uGyuhCaRnwuYyyX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13531'),
  ('438309280656119388', 'The Beatles Anthology', 1995, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Paul McCartney, George Harrison, Ringo Starr, John Lennon, George Martin', 'TV-MA', 'A documentary series on the career of The Beatles.', 'A documentary series on the career of The Beatles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97zhDkOLlrkaIiIvROPsAMSqnzQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16906'),
  ('746576632343960581', 'The Beatles: Get Back', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Peter Jackson', null, 'John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison, Ringo Starr', 'TV-MA', 'The three-part documentary series, compiled from over 60 hours of unseen footage, captures the warmth, camaraderie, and creative genius that defined the legacy of music''s most iconic foursome. The series also includes – for the first time in its entirety – The Beatles'' final performance at London''s Savile Row.', 'The three-part documentary series, compiled from over 60 hours of unseen footage, captures the warmth, camaraderie, and creative genius that defined the legacy of music''s most iconic foursome. The series also includes – for the first time in its entirety – The Beatles'' final performance at London''s Savile Row.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxy9fg1rT853P7zP7ZQGqRimiCS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128876'),
  ('843735802719866543', 'The Beautiful Lie', 2015, 'Drama', 'Imogen Banks, Alice Bell, John Edwards', 'Alice Bell, Jonathan Gavin', 'Sarah Snook, Rodger Corser, Benedict Samuel, Sophie Lowe, Celia Pacquola, Alexander England, Daniel Henshall, Gina Riley', null, 'Anna is happily married. She has the perfect family. But one man will change it all. A grand, complex love story of love, lust and betrayal across three families and generations.', 'Anna is happily married. She has the perfect family. But one man will change it all. A grand, complex love story of love, lust and betrayal across three families and generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1L2PhMT5MOWFO6IumICmiNAebx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64247'),
  ('813788214725729611', 'The Beautiful Neighbor', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Yukie Nakama, Rei Dan, Atsuro Watabe, Mina Fujii, Kazuya Aoyama, Ippei Souda, Mitsuko Kusabue, Rieko Miura', null, 'A sudden encounter between a gracefully attractive but mysterious woman, Saki, and an ordinary housewife, Eriko, who has a happy family, causes Eriko''s serene daily life to fall apart. Eriko''s husband, Shinji becomes the target of Saki''s advances and finds himself caught between her and his wife.', 'A sudden encounter between a gracefully attractive but mysterious woman, Saki, and an ordinary housewife, Eriko, who has a happy family, causes Eriko''s serene daily life to fall apart. Eriko''s husband, Shinji becomes the target of Saki''s advances and finds himself caught between her and his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsh5isY4F711BPPYuFgOytYQ2gN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61089'),
  ('973205279511528836', 'The Beauty', 2026, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Matthew Hodgson, Ryan Murphy', null, 'Evan Peters, Anthony Ramos, Jeremy Pope, Ashton Kutcher', 'TV-MA', 'The world of high fashion turns dark when international supermodels begin dying in gruesome and mysterious ways. FBI Agents Cooper Madsen and Jordan Bennett are sent to Paris to uncover the truth. As they delve deeper into the case, they uncover a sexually transmitted virus that transforms ordinary people into visions of physical perfection, but with terrifying consequences.', 'The world of high fashion turns dark when international supermodels begin dying in gruesome and mysterious ways. FBI Agents Cooper Madsen and Jordan Bennett are sent to Paris to uncover the truth. As they delve deeper into the case, they uncover a sexually transmitted virus that transforms ordinary people into visions of physical perfection, but with terrifying consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6mtso50nTSvhYc3tc7xB7cYHmg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273160'),
  ('781043376690540039', 'The Beauty Inside', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Drake Doremus', null, 'Topher Grace, Mary Elizabeth Winstead', null, 'Alex wakes up every day as a different person. He is always the same person on the inside, but on the outside he is somebody else. When he meets Leah and falls in love everything changes for him. He knows he will see her again, but she will never see him.', 'Alex wakes up every day as a different person. He is always the same person on the inside, but on the outside he is somebody else. When he meets Leah and falls in love everything changes for him. He knows he will see her again, but she will never see him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKtPdpEBOiMVHZt3LxF9W2QvBdJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76496'),
  ('218349576776862054', 'The Beauty Inside', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Im Mea-ri', 'Im Mea-ri', 'Seo Hyun-jin, Lee Min-ki, Lee Da-hee, Ahn Jae-hyun, Lee Tae-ri, Moon Ji-in, Na Young-hee, Lee Moon-su', null, 'The love story between a top actress and an airline director who each suffers an unusual phenomenon. He suffers from prosopagnosia, while every month she transforms into someone else for a week.', 'The love story between a top actress and an airline director who each suffers an unusual phenomenon. He suffers from prosopagnosia, while every month she transforms into someone else for a week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3UGsVYD0nxsucvN7NHLzXP0FHu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82237'),
  ('402030422766277824', 'The Beauty Inside', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Ayşe Üner Kutlu', 'Cemre Baysel, Burak Çelik, Ebru Cündübeyoğlu, Berat Yenilmez, Sevinç Erbulak, Cem Kurtoğlu, Cihan Ercan, Tuğçe Kumral', null, 'Efsun, who works as a dermatologist, lives peacefully on the farm with her father in a village in Gaziantep. Her mother left her and her father at a young age and moved to Istanbul and became one of Turkey''s most important plastic surgeons. Efsun suddenly receives news from her mother, whom she has not seen since she was 12 years old. Her mother is on her deathbed and wants to see her one last time. She invites Efsun to Istanbul by sending her driver. Efsun, who goes to Istanbul to see her mother, is in for a big surprise. Her mother, the owner of the largest aesthetic clinic in Istanbul, asks Efsun to work in the clinic and forces her to do so. As if all this is not enough, Emir, who she thinks is a driver, is actually the son of her mother''s partner Kaya Bey. Emir, a handsome and charismatic surgeon, thinks that Efsun has come to take the clinic away from him, and starts a fight with Efsun. Moreover, these young people are neighbors.', 'Efsun, who works as a dermatologist, lives peacefully on the farm with her father in a village in Gaziantep. Her mother left her and her father at a young age and moved to Istanbul and became one of Turkey''s most important plastic surgeons. Efsun suddenly receives news from her mother, whom she has not seen since she was 12 years old. Her mother is on her deathbed and wants to see her one last time. She invites Efsun to Istanbul by sending her driver. Efsun, who goes to Istanbul to see her mother, is in for a big surprise. Her mother, the owner of the largest aesthetic clinic in Istanbul, asks Efsun to work in the clinic and forces her to do so. As if all this is not enough, Emir, who she thinks is a driver, is actually the son of her mother''s partner Kaya Bey. Emir, a handsome and charismatic surgeon, thinks that Efsun has come to take the clinic away from him, and starts a fight with Efsun. Moreover, these young people are neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ljuDEUnjFsaP090hFIZhh51w9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203572'),
  ('213016328049666027', 'The Beauty Queen of Jerusalem', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ester Namdar, Oded Davidoff, Shlomo Moshiah', null, 'Swell Ariel Or', null, 'The loves, heartbreak, jealousy and pain of the three Armoza sisters – Luna, Rachelika, and Becky - their parents, grandparents and children, set during the early-mid 20th century in Jerusalem.', 'The loves, heartbreak, jealousy and pain of the three Armoza sisters – Luna, Rachelika, and Becky - their parents, grandparents and children, set during the early-mid 20th century in Jerusalem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7m25ev4OztfqOOtn74ZXcAMhmKT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:107387'),
  ('1047597348944415974', 'The Bedfellow', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Murmel Clausen, Mike Viebrock', null, 'Markus Stoll, Lisa Bitter, Helmfried von Lüttichau, Daniel Christensen, Lilly Forgách, Florian Jahr, Gilbert von Sohlern', null, 'Menzinger, an easy-going mechanic, is appointed as a juror by the Munich District Court. With no way to avoid the assignment and no possibility of negotiation with recently transferred judge, Dr. Julia Kellermann, Charlie reluctantly resigns himself to his fate. Instead of continuing in his life as a mechanic, lying under old Italian sports cars of his friend Xaver, Charlie quickly realises that his new position offers certain advantages. His time as a lay judge, however, may change him more than he could imagine.', 'Menzinger, an easy-going mechanic, is appointed as a juror by the Munich District Court. With no way to avoid the assignment and no possibility of negotiation with recently transferred judge, Dr. Julia Kellermann, Charlie reluctantly resigns himself to his fate. Instead of continuing in his life as a mechanic, lying under old Italian sports cars of his friend Xaver, Charlie quickly realises that his new position offers certain advantages. His time as a lay judge, however, may change him more than he could imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhHrVi2CtrV2t8vhntTQEGgpigI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:102704'),
  ('767244615341007896', 'The Beginning After the End', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Natsumi Fujiwara, Makoto Furukawa', 'TV-14', 'After a mysterious death, King Grey is reborn as Arthur Leywin on the magical continent of Dicathen. Although he enters his second life as a baby, his previous wisdom remains. He begins to master magic and forge his own path as the years go by, seeking to correct the mistakes of his past life.', 'After a mysterious death, King Grey is reborn as Arthur Leywin on the magical continent of Dicathen. Although he enters his second life as a baby, his previous wisdom remains. He begins to master magic and forge his own path as the years go by, seeking to correct the mistakes of his past life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0QWnKUhxcxecQSclMBNnO5MXh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:274671'),
  ('684791111149499433', 'The Beginning of the Sea', 2024, 'Family, Drama', 'Miku Ubukata', null, 'Ren Meguro, Izutani Rana, Kasumi Arimura, Shinobu Otake, Kotone Furukawa, Sosuke Ikematsu, Taisei Kido, Go Riju', null, 'A love story depicting the connection between parents and their children in various forms.', 'A love story depicting the connection between parents and their children in various forms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8YbsCAv6p3ruag2SJWqp77pcTL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256299'),
  ('1038812367104374011', 'The Believers', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Teeradon Supapunpinyo, Achiraya Nitibhon, Pachara Chirathivat, Patchai Pakdeesusuk, Paopetch Charoensook, Manatsanun Panlertwongskul, Sarun Naraprasertkul', null, 'When their startup goes deep into debt, three entrepreneurs stage a risky scam using a Buddhist temple to pay back a massive loan before time runs out.', 'When their startup goes deep into debt, three entrepreneurs stage a risky scam using a Buddhist temple to pay back a massive loan before time runs out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1vLAHKRBk5KVJYCvezpEJHT2Nu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:244571'),
  ('315352814221925992', 'The Ben Stiller Show', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Judd Apatow, Ben Stiller', 'Sultan Pepper, Ben Stiller', 'Ben Stiller, Janeane Garofalo, Bob Odenkirk, Andy Dick, John F. O''Donohue', null, 'This sketch show specialises in parodies of movies, shows and commercials. Special guest stars join them in the comedy sketches with crazy results.', 'This sketch show specialises in parodies of movies, shows and commercials. Special guest stars join them in the comedy sketches with crazy results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AIbFuUbETdBomWpWanrU8vMJEc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:737'),
  ('326707518317675515', 'The Benny Hill Show', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Benny Hill', null, 'Benny Hill, Henry McGee, Bob Todd, Nicholas Parsons, Jackie Wright, Helen Horton, Bella Emberg, Patricia Hayes', 'TV-14', 'The Benny Hill Show is a British comedy television show that starred Benny Hill and aired in various incarnations between 15 January 1955 and 30 May 1991 in over 140 countries. The show focused on sketches that were full of slapstick, mime, parody, and double-entendre. Thames Television cancelled production of the show in 1989 due to declining ratings and large production costs at £450,000 per show.', 'The Benny Hill Show is a British comedy television show that starred Benny Hill and aired in various incarnations between 15 January 1955 and 30 May 1991 in over 140 countries. The show focused on sketches that were full of slapstick, mime, parody, and double-entendre. Thames Television cancelled production of the show in 1989 due to declining ratings and large production costs at £450,000 per show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3mGj6YAy7CRWMq06gjsXf3rIJ1.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:3002'),
  ('590858799253200909', 'The Bequeathed', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Kim Hyun-joo, Park Hee-soon, Park Byung-eun, Ryu Kyung-soo, Joo Suk-In', 'TV-MA', 'After the death of an unknown uncle, a woman inherits a burial ground and finds herself in the center of a string of murders and dark secrets.', 'After the death of an unknown uncle, a woman inherits a burial ground and finds herself in the center of a string of murders and dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iExLDuclzOp06ro9929UTDQRDm1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212553'),
  ('244649028540634895', 'The Berenstain Bears', 1985, 'Animation, Kids', 'Jan Berenstain, Stan Berenstain', null, 'David Mendenhall, Brian Cummings, Christina Lange, Billy Rosemberg, Jake Scott', null, 'An animated television series based on Stan and Jan Berenstain''s Berenstain Bears children''s book series.', 'An animated television series based on Stan and Jan Berenstain''s Berenstain Bears children''s book series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpy7oL7fOlxcKRO74NZFfULGnx7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10318'),
  ('11673262853551933', 'The Berenstain Bears', 2003, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Kids', 'Stan Berenstain, Jan Berenstain', null, 'Camilla Scott, Ben Campbell, Michael Cera, Tajja Isen, Corinne Conley, Leslie Carlson, Amanda Soha, Marc McMulkin', 'TV-Y', 'We follow a family of bears, known as the Berenstain Bears, as they figure out life together. With friendly neighbors and close friends, the journey is never boring. Inspired by the book series written by Stan and Jan Berenstain.', 'We follow a family of bears, known as the Berenstain Bears, as they figure out life together. With friendly neighbors and close friends, the journey is never boring. Inspired by the book series written by Stan and Jan Berenstain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRA1KVomv7d9avL7UpdPBJmASrv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4665'),
  ('457803223429474486', 'The Bermuda Triangle: Into Cursed Waters', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'An elite team is investigating the Bermuda Triangle with the aid of a secret weapon—a map, decades in the making, marking the location of unidentified undersea wrecks and anomalies. Each week they will attempt to identify one mystery wreck, along the way evaluating the evidence behind legends and scientific theories like rogue waves, giant methane bubbles, ship-sucking whirlpools, and dead zones that bewilder equipment and planes. In the Bermuda Triangle, one never knows what one will find. On the ocean floor, the team makes historic and important discoveries that go beyond myth and conjecture.', 'An elite team is investigating the Bermuda Triangle with the aid of a secret weapon—a map, decades in the making, marking the location of unidentified undersea wrecks and anomalies. Each week they will attempt to identify one mystery wreck, along the way evaluating the evidence behind legends and scientific theories like rogue waves, giant methane bubbles, ship-sucking whirlpools, and dead zones that bewilder equipment and planes. In the Bermuda Triangle, one never knows what one will find. On the ocean floor, the team makes historic and important discoveries that go beyond myth and conjecture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmOdG2bOdD9H1cgA4CCBhT4u2J6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:214290'),
  ('489672979033103935', 'The Bernie Mac Show', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Larry Wilmore', null, 'Bernie Mac, Jeremy Suarez, Camille Winbush, Dee Dee Davis, Kellita Smith', 'TV-PG', 'The Bernie Mac Show is an American sitcom that aired on Fox for five seasons from November 14, 2001 to April 14, 2006. The series featured comic actor Bernie Mac and his wife Wanda raising his sister''s three kids: Jordan, Bryana, and Vanessa.', 'The Bernie Mac Show is an American sitcom that aired on Fox for five seasons from November 14, 2001 to April 14, 2006. The series featured comic actor Bernie Mac and his wife Wanda raising his sister''s three kids: Jordan, Bryana, and Vanessa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auTnAsA5USO1901qti1mxbUIVoE.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1693'),
  ('1129660702394404097', 'The Best Ending', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Choi Hee-jin, Jung Gun-joo, Kim Min-jong, Park Se-hyun', null, 'A year from their breakup, Woong, who successfully got a job, met Min Chae again. They didn’t save much, but here starts their sweet challenge to marriage.', 'A year from their breakup, Woong, who successfully got a job, met Min Chae again. They didn’t save much, but here starts their sweet challenge to marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPo5XxXrWo0AMrV4irE7M9tbg9U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105470'),
  ('423389696450801591', 'The Best Future', 2014, 'Drama', 'Kim Won-jin', null, 'Seo Kang-joon, Bang Min-ah, Hong Kyung-min, Lee Sun-jin, Choi Sung-kook, Ko Se-won', 'TV-PG', 'Choi Go is a young aspiring idol working a part-time job, who can be a bit of a coward. Mi Rae, recently hired by a company in the talent development field. The two struggle attempting to start different careers, meet by chance and start to share the same house, but because of their different schedules (one works during day, the other during night), they communicate leaving messages on a board.', 'Choi Go is a young aspiring idol working a part-time job, who can be a bit of a coward. Mi Rae, recently hired by a company in the talent development field. The two struggle attempting to start different careers, meet by chance and start to share the same house, but because of their different schedules (one works during day, the other during night), they communicate leaving messages on a board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFSzSaY3QCcTaBjrV6vYbhls0Q2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64232'),
  ('589988596272135630', 'The Best Heart Attack of My Life', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pablo E. Bossi', null, 'Alan Sabbagh, Eleonora Wexler, Rita Cortese, Imanol Arias, Rafael Spregelburd, Daniel Holguín, Paulina Michaels, Olivia Molina', 'TV-MA', 'Ariel, a ghostwriter with a scandalous life, falls into crisis when his wife leaves him. A compulsive smoker, overweight, and with a sense of humor as dark as his underwear, he suffers a heart attack while staying in a rented house in another country, alongside a girl he has just met. This emotional event begins to bring new meaning to his life and the lives of many people around him.', 'Ariel, a ghostwriter with a scandalous life, falls into crisis when his wife leaves him. A compulsive smoker, overweight, and with a sense of humor as dark as his underwear, he suffers a heart attack while staying in a rented house in another country, alongside a girl he has just met. This emotional event begins to bring new meaning to his life and the lives of many people around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQujgWLwsOCmgubjEQfnyMLifwm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280409'),
  ('640730626452181996', 'The Best Hit', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yoon Shi-yoon, Kim Min-jae, Lee Se-young, Cha Tae-hyun, Yoon Son-ha, Dong Hyun-bae, Hong Kyung-min, Cha Eun-woo', null, 'Yoo Hyun-Jae is a member of a popular idol group. He has a lot of fans and he is a scandal maker. Meanwhile, Lee Ji-Hoon is an aspiring singer. He pretends to be studying for his civil servant exam, but he is actually struggling to become an idol.', 'Yoo Hyun-Jae is a member of a popular idol group. He has a lot of fans and he is a scandal maker. Meanwhile, Lee Ji-Hoon is an aspiring singer. He pretends to be studying for his civil servant exam, but he is actually struggling to become an idol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KzbxhGvSt5A3Kc9aD6fUdRh3It.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71871'),
  ('462108338889705903', 'The Best Man: The Final Chapters', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Malcolm D. Lee, Dayna Lynne North', null, 'Morris Chestnut, Taye Diggs, Harold Perrineau, Terrence Howard, Nia Long, Sanaa Lathan, Regina Hall, Melissa De Sousa', 'TV-MA', 'Catch up with Harper, Robyn, Jordan, Lance, Quentin, Shelby, Candace, and Murch as their relationships evolve and past grievances resurface in the unpredictable stages of midlife crisis meets midlife renaissance.', 'Catch up with Harper, Robyn, Jordan, Lance, Quentin, Shelby, Candace, and Murch as their relationships evolve and past grievances resurface in the unpredictable stages of midlife crisis meets midlife renaissance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpInnZep9PfG491qJtZAIbAEF7F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213463'),
  ('697690711509299536', 'The Best of Youth', 2003, 'Drama', 'Marco Tullio Giordana, Sandro Petraglia, Stefano Rulli', 'Stefano Rulli, Sandro Petraglia', 'Luigi Lo Cascio, Alessio Boni, Jasmine Trinca, Adriana Asti, Sonia Bergamasco, Fabrizio Gifuni, Maya Sansa, Valentina Carnelutti', null, 'A family saga set in Italy which chronicles the life of a middle-class family. It explores the relationship between two brothers Nicola and Matteo as their life paths separate during youth, encompassing major political and social events in post–World War II Italian history.', 'A family saga set in Italy which chronicles the life of a middle-class family. It explores the relationship between two brothers Nicola and Matteo as their life paths separate during youth, encompassing major political and social events in post–World War II Italian history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSgmjqjm9LskEfQ3Z3rLduJk5tc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86311'),
  ('392422246893777768', 'The Best Partner', 2019, 'Drama', 'Chen Tong', null, 'Jin Dong, Lyric Lan, Sun Chun, Tian Yu, Liu Mintao, Rong Zixi, Qiao Zhenyu, Zhu Zhu', null, 'Luo Bing is a senior partner at Panorama Law Firm. He is a lawyer who cares only about winning cases. Dai Xi goes to his law firm to argue with him about her best friend''s lawsuit and by chance becomes his assistant. At first, they don''t get along, but soon they begin to understand each other and Dai Xi''s respect for Luo Bing grows. Luo Bing also inherits some of Dai Xi''s empathy for others and learns that practicing law is more than just winning. They both grow and become reliable partners in law.', 'Luo Bing is a senior partner at Panorama Law Firm. He is a lawyer who cares only about winning cases. Dai Xi goes to his law firm to argue with him about her best friend''s lawsuit and by chance becomes his assistant. At first, they don''t get along, but soon they begin to understand each other and Dai Xi''s respect for Luo Bing grows. Luo Bing also inherits some of Dai Xi''s empathy for others and learns that practicing law is more than just winning. They both grow and become reliable partners in law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ict5Nx350jJLCrs7kftA1pA8cFh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96761'),
  ('643503981082804501', 'The Best Sex Ever', 2002, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Angela Nicholas', null, 'Veronica hosts a midnight radio show called "The Best Sex Ever". Each night "after all the good girls and boys have gone to bed", she invites listeners to call in and share their own personal erotic tale about "the best sex you ever had". In each episode Veronica suggests a theme for that night''s show, and one caller''s story is presented, with Veronica occasionally interjecting comments or questions.', 'Veronica hosts a midnight radio show called "The Best Sex Ever". Each night "after all the good girls and boys have gone to bed", she invites listeners to call in and share their own personal erotic tale about "the best sex you ever had". In each episode Veronica suggests a theme for that night''s show, and one caller''s story is presented, with Veronica occasionally interjecting comments or questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1t2ZuJeZnyowW1OKX3G9NSNZmR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7463'),
  ('183838239950952509', 'The Best Thing', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Linghe, Xu Ruohan, Wang Youjun, Tang Jiuzhou, Huang Cancan, Zhou Yiru, Chen Yian, Xie Xinhao', null, 'Suffering from insomnia and migraines, Shen Xifan consults a traditional Chinese medicine doctor, He Suye. As their lives intersect, an unexpected romance blossoms.', 'Suffering from insomnia and migraines, Shen Xifan consults a traditional Chinese medicine doctor, He Suye. As their lives intersect, an unexpected romance blossoms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okQHEWYmmVDLfxAsT8UBJeTMPIi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256128'),
  ('433544568767747727', 'The Betrayal Knows My Name', 2010, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Soichiro Hoshi, Takahiro Sakurai, Akira Ishida, Daisuke Ono, Hiroshi Kamiya, Houko Kuwashima, Jun Fukuyama, Marina Inoue', 'TV-14', 'Gifted with a strange ability to see into the troubles of others, kind-hearted Yuki Sakurai finds his life turned upside down the day a handsome stranger named Luka appears. Suddenly, evil beings known as "Duras" begin hunting for him and a world of magic, terror, and a dark truth about his past surround him.', 'Gifted with a strange ability to see into the troubles of others, kind-hearted Yuki Sakurai finds his life turned upside down the day a handsome stranger named Luka appears. Suddenly, evil beings known as "Duras" begin hunting for him and a world of magic, terror, and a dark truth about his past surround him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5bqFocBric73YPjBlcbGDKsdNm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42411'),
  ('234086107849476349', 'The betrothed', 1990, null, null, null, 'Tullio Solenghi, Anna Marchesini, Massimo Lopez, Giuliano Gemma, Pippo Baudo, Wanna Marchi, Piero Badaloni, Daniele Piombi', null, 'A comic retelling of the classic Italian epic novel of thwarted love and treachery in the first half of the 19th century.', 'A comic retelling of the classic Italian epic novel of thwarted love and treachery in the first half of the 19th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIBlTgSbAGnZJrlqxzq1O1gRxkO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67262'),
  ('194869774580614024', 'The Better Sister', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Olivia Milch', null, 'Jessica Biel, Elizabeth Banks, Corey Stoll, Kim Dickens, Maxwell Acee Donovan, Bobby Naderi, Gabriel Sloyer, Gloria Reuben', 'TV-14', 'Chloe moves in New York''s most elite circles with her lawyer husband Adam and teenage son Ethan by her side while her estranged sister Nicky tries to make ends meet and stay clean. When Adam is brutally murdered, the investigation sends shockwaves through the family and exposes long-buried secrets.', 'Chloe moves in New York''s most elite circles with her lawyer husband Adam and teenage son Ethan by her side while her estranged sister Nicky tries to make ends meet and stay clean. When Adam is brutally murdered, the investigation sends shockwaves through the family and exposes long-buried secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vd1vEp1cKOkimarpuykswWR63Eg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253321'),
  ('984178533418519247', 'The Beverly Hillbillies', 1962, 'Comedy, Family', 'Paul Henning', null, 'Buddy Ebsen, Irene Ryan, Donna Douglas, Max Baer Jr., Raymond Bailey, Nancy Kulp', 'TV-G', 'Jed Clampett''s swamp is loaded with oil. When a wildcatter discovers the huge pool, Jed sells his land to the O.K. Oil Company and at the urging of cousin Pearl, moves his family to a 35-room mansion in Beverly Hills, California.', 'Jed Clampett''s swamp is loaded with oil. When a wildcatter discovers the huge pool, Jed sells his land to the O.K. Oil Company and at the urging of cousin Pearl, moves his family to a 35-room mansion in Beverly Hills, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEZs4szkwBXIK3DOm37MnQN9fIe.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:1930'),
