  ('1143854408933487867', 'The Bold Type', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sarah Watson', null, 'Katie Stevens, Aisha Dee, Meghann Fahy, Melora Hardin, Stephen Conrad Moore', 'TV-14', 'A glimpse into the outrageous lives of Jane, Kat and Sutton, who are working at the nation''s top women''s magazine, Scarlet, while navigating their careers, identities and individual voices.', 'A glimpse into the outrageous lives of Jane, Kat and Sutton, who are working at the nation''s top women''s magazine, Scarlet, while navigating their careers, identities and individual voices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKloQpl6zE7kdFf8SUeYU2qPT9H.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:69630'),
  ('1018164060675578393', 'The Bombing of Pan Am 103', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jonathan Lee', null, 'Connor Swindells, Patrick J. Adams, Tony Curran, Eddie Marsan, Phyllis Logan, Lauren Lyle, Merritt Wever', null, 'Follow the investigation into the crash of Pan Am 103 from both sides of the Atlantic and discover the devastating effect it had on the small town and the families who lost loved ones.', 'Follow the investigation into the crash of Pan Am 103 from both sides of the Atlantic and discover the devastating effect it had on the small town and the families who lost loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RR6jkc35HOJcZG3modHZwh3J3J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248226'),
  ('9325368057124937', 'The Bond', 2021, 'Drama, Family', 'Zhang Kaizhou', 'WeiXi', 'Bai Yu, Song Zuer, Mao Xiaotong, Zhang Wanyi, Liu Jun, Zhou Yiran, Zhou Fang, Qu Zheming', null, 'When their mother dies and their father withdraws, the Qiao siblings must rely on each other to survive. Led by their eldest brother, they grow up facing life’s struggles together, forming an unbreakable family bond through perseverance and love.', 'When their mother dies and their father withdraws, the Qiao siblings must rely on each other to survive. Led by their eldest brother, they grow up facing life’s struggles together, forming an unbreakable family bond through perseverance and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wb5wi5oDkpsKaEo08LkePpgdxVR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129203'),
  ('152627171619986592', 'The Bondsman', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Grainger David', null, 'Kevin Bacon, Jennifer Nettles, Beth Grant, Damon Herriman, Maxwell Jenkins, Jolene Purdy', 'TV-MA', 'Backwoods bounty hunter Hub Halloran comes back from the dead with an unexpected second chance at life, love, and a nearly-forgotten musical career — only to find that his old job now has a demonic new twist.', 'Backwoods bounty hunter Hub Halloran comes back from the dead with an unexpected second chance at life, love, and a nearly-forgotten musical career — only to find that his old job now has a demonic new twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwd2HpY2ymvmASUP3zMYF59IIr7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229711'),
  ('283054335725249692', 'The Bonfire of Destiny', 2019, 'Drama', 'Karine Spreuzkouski, Catherine Ramberg', 'Catherine Ramberg, Karine Spreuzkouski', 'Audrey Fleurot, Camille Lou, Josiane Balasko, Julie de Bona, Gilbert Melki, Antoine Duléry, François-David Cardonnel, Stéphane Guillon', 'TV-MA', 'After a devastating fire in 1897 Paris, three women find their lives upended by betrayals, deceptions and romantic turmoil. Inspired by real events.', 'After a devastating fire in 1897 Paris, three women find their lives upended by betrayals, deceptions and romantic turmoil. Inspired by real events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAJ8MDAdmxMntcLYpvvfR4UkgDp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93742'),
  ('857543493415506993', 'The Book Group', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Annie Griffin', null, 'Anne Dudek, Michelle Gomez, Saskia Mulder, Karen Kilgariff, Rory McCann, Derek Riddell, Bonnie Engstrom, James Lance', 'TV-14', 'Clare, a neurotic American, moves to Glasgow and starts a book group to meet new, interesting people. But Kenny, Dirka, Rab, Fist and Janice are more interesting than she bargained for...', 'Clare, a neurotic American, moves to Glasgow and starts a book group to meet new, interesting people. But Kenny, Dirka, Rab, Fist and Janice are more interesting than she bargained for...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7XCGdK4W1s0yeQspUAqZa3wGdU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3842'),
  ('138705470615027043', 'The Book of Bantorra', 2009, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Haruka Tomatsu, Romi Park, Toru Okawa, Miyuki Sawashiro, Yuichi Nakamura', null, 'In a world where dead people turn into books and are stored in the Bantorra Library where anyone who reads a book can learn their past. Bantorra Library is maintained by Armed Librarians who wield psychic powers and their enemy is a religious society known as Sindeki Kyōdan.', 'In a world where dead people turn into books and are stored in the Bantorra Library where anyone who reads a book can learn their past. Bantorra Library is maintained by Armed Librarians who wield psychic powers and their enemy is a religious society known as Sindeki Kyōdan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXPYJTREQSYr59vKu1LjFWxW2Ef.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46036'),
  ('404482660615471432', 'The Book of Boba Fett', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jon Favreau', 'Noah Kloor', 'Temuera Morrison, Ming-Na Wen', 'TV-14', 'Legendary bounty hunter Boba Fett and mercenary Fennec Shand must navigate the galaxy’s underworld when they return to the sands of Tatooine to stake their claim on the territory once ruled by Jabba the Hutt and his crime syndicate.', 'Legendary bounty hunter Boba Fett and mercenary Fennec Shand must navigate the galaxy’s underworld when they return to the sands of Tatooine to stake their claim on the territory once ruled by Jabba the Hutt and his crime syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNbdjDi1HamTCrfvM9JeA94bNi2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115036'),
  ('916324643812613988', 'The Book of Daniel', 2006, 'Drama', 'Jack Kenny', null, 'Aidan Quinn, Susanna Thompson, Christian Campbell, Ivan Shaw, Alison Pill, Garret Dillahunt, Dylan Baker, Ellen Burstyn', 'TV-14', 'Rev. Daniel Webster is an unconventional Episcopalian priest who not only believes in Jesus, but actually sees him and discusses life with him. He is challenged on many levels as he struggles to be a good husband, father and minister, while navigating an often rocky relationship with the church hierarchy.', 'Rev. Daniel Webster is an unconventional Episcopalian priest who not only believes in Jesus, but actually sees him and discusses life with him. He is challenged on many levels as he struggles to be a good husband, father and minister, while navigating an often rocky relationship with the church hierarchy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PxnIIu9UkVAFUkFBeuwDW4DdVH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2856'),
  ('842818945824901011', 'The Book of Negroes', 2015, 'Drama', 'Clement Virgo, Lawrence Hill', 'Lawrence Hill, Clement Virgo', 'Shailyn Pierre-Dixon, Sandra Caldwell, Dwain Murphy, Siya Xaba, Armand Aucamp, Louis Gossett Jr., Allan Hawco, Cuba Gooding Jr.', 'TV-MA', 'Kidnapped in Africa and subsequently enslaved in South Carolina, Aminata must navigate a revolution in New York, isolation in Nova Scotia and treacherous jungles of Sierra Leone, in an attempt to secure her freedom in the 19th century.', 'Kidnapped in Africa and subsequently enslaved in South Carolina, Aminata must navigate a revolution in New York, isolation in Nova Scotia and treacherous jungles of Sierra Leone, in an attempt to secure her freedom in the 19th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDb8HvQyS3zSigUR1Spmt02IeQd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62982'),
  ('561782050191659647', 'The Book of Pooh', 2001, 'Kids, Animation, Family', 'A.A. Milne', null, 'Jim Cummings, John Fiedler, Kath Soucie, Peter Cullen, Nikita Hopkins, Stephanie D''Abruzzo, Andrew Sabiston, Andre Stojka', null, 'The Book of Pooh is an American television series that aired on the Disney Channel. It is the third television series to feature the characters from the Disney franchise based on A. A. Milne''s works; the other two were the live-action Welcome to Pooh Corner and the animated The New Adventures of Winnie the Pooh which ran from 1988-1991. It premiered on February 9, 2001, and completed its run on July 8, 2003. The show is produced by Shadow Projects, and Playhouse Disney. This is the first Pooh show where Jim Cummings voices Tigger filling in for the late Paul Winchell. It was shown in U.K on a Channel 5 Block known as ''Milkshake!'' as well as Playhouse Disney. It''s run on Milkshake! ended around 2006 to 2007.', 'The Book of Pooh is an American television series that aired on the Disney Channel. It is the third television series to feature the characters from the Disney franchise based on A. A. Milne''s works; the other two were the live-action Welcome to Pooh Corner and the animated The New Adventures of Winnie the Pooh which ran from 1988-1991. It premiered on February 9, 2001, and completed its run on July 8, 2003. The show is produced by Shadow Projects, and Playhouse Disney. This is the first Pooh show where Jim Cummings voices Tigger filling in for the late Paul Winchell. It was shown in U.K on a Channel 5 Block known as ''Milkshake!'' as well as Playhouse Disney. It''s run on Milkshake! ended around 2006 to 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnXwJlVXCqyRE0qQn4Af102k183.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:973'),
  ('817785562375980483', 'The Boondocks', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Animation', 'Aaron McGruder', null, 'Regina King, John Witherspoon, Cedric Yarbrough, Jill Talley, Gary Anthony Williams, Gabby Soleil', 'TV-MA', 'When Robert “Granddad” Freeman becomes legal guardian to his two grandsons, he moves from the tough south side of Chicago to the upscale neighborhood of Woodcrest (a.k.a. "The Boondocks") so he can enjoy his golden years in safety and comfort. But with Huey, a 10-year-old leftist revolutionary, and his eight-year-old misfit brother, Riley, suburbia is about to be shaken up.', 'When Robert “Granddad” Freeman becomes legal guardian to his two grandsons, he moves from the tough south side of Chicago to the upscale neighborhood of Woodcrest (a.k.a. "The Boondocks") so he can enjoy his golden years in safety and comfort. But with Huey, a 10-year-old leftist revolutionary, and his eight-year-old misfit brother, Riley, suburbia is about to be shaken up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAvT2RXjOpgH0COriRm9riPqA0m.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2604'),
  ('439246924052735585', 'The Booth at the End', 2011, 'Drama', 'Christopher Kubasik', null, 'Michelle Dunker, Brendan Chadd Thomas, Jenni Blong, Jennifer Del Rosario, Noel Fisher, Abby Miller, Dayton Callie, Danny Nucci', null, 'A mysterious man sits in the booth at the end who people make a deal with to get what they want. They do the task or they don''t - that is up to them, but there are no rule changes.', 'A mysterious man sits in the booth at the end who people make a deal with to get what they want. They do the task or they don''t - that is up to them, but there are no rule changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dG15J9859DiWjiv4Luov4C4SULe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:44220'),
  ('258064757793676505', 'The Border', 2008, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Peter Raymont', null, 'James McGowan, Graham Abbey, Jonas Chernick, Mark Wilson, Jim Codrington, Catherine Disher, Grace Park', 'TV-14', 'The Border is a Canadian drama that aired on CBC Television and 20 other TV networks worldwide. It was created by Peter Raymont, Lindalee Tracey, Janet MacLean and Jeremy Hole of White Pine Pictures. The Executive in Charge of Production is Janice Dawe. Episodes in the first season were directed by John Fawcett, Michael DeCarlo, Ken Girotti, Kelly Makin, Brett Sullivan and Philip Earnshaw. The first season had a total budget of 20 million dollars, with about 1.5 million dollars per episode. The series is set in Toronto and follows agents of the fictitious Immigration and Customs Security agency. ICS was created by the Government of Canada to deal with trans-border matters concerning Canadian national security including terrorism and smuggling. The cancellation of The Border was announced by the CBC after three seasons were aired.', 'The Border is a Canadian drama that aired on CBC Television and 20 other TV networks worldwide. It was created by Peter Raymont, Lindalee Tracey, Janet MacLean and Jeremy Hole of White Pine Pictures. The Executive in Charge of Production is Janice Dawe. Episodes in the first season were directed by John Fawcett, Michael DeCarlo, Ken Girotti, Kelly Makin, Brett Sullivan and Philip Earnshaw. The first season had a total budget of 20 million dollars, with about 1.5 million dollars per episode. The series is set in Toronto and follows agents of the fictitious Immigration and Customs Security agency. ICS was created by the Government of Canada to deal with trans-border matters concerning Canadian national security including terrorism and smuggling. The cancellation of The Border was announced by the CBC after three seasons were aired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anCuYMK080KhUg3hEGw9MCNYn1R.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:14958'),
  ('51181177764996944', 'The Border', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', null, 'Kamil Chomiuk, Krzysztof Maćkowski', 'Leszek Lichota, Aleksandra Popławska, Bartłomiej Topa, Magdalena Popławska, Andrzej Zieliński, Dagmara Bąk, Karol Bernacki, Maciej Mikołajczyk', null, 'After a bombing attack at the Poland–Ukraine border which killed his friends from the Border Guard, Captain Wiktor Rebrow tries to unravel the mystery and figure out what happened and who is behind it all.', 'After a bombing attack at the Poland–Ukraine border which killed his friends from the Border Guard, Captain Wiktor Rebrow tries to unravel the mystery and figure out what happened and who is behind it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdb44zgYqSzNgeUOT0Km7as3X0b.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61598'),
  ('912835732169882456', 'The Borgias', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', 'Neil Jordan', null, 'Jeremy Irons, François Arnaud, Holliday Grainger, Sean Harris, Thure Lindhardt, Sebastian de Souza', 'TV-MA', 'Set in 15th century Italy at the height of the Renaissance, The Borgias chronicles the corrupt rise of patriarch Rodrigo Borgia to the papacy, where he proceeds to commit every sin in the book to amass and retain power, influence and enormous wealth for himself and his family.', 'Set in 15th century Italy at the height of the Renaissance, The Borgias chronicles the corrupt rise of patriarch Rodrigo Borgia to the papacy, where he proceeds to commit every sin in the book to amass and retain power, influence and enormous wealth for himself and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6CHDkNDhswuaqwQEC0wgC7MMox.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:33025'),
  ('199253279476686671', 'The Borrowers', 1992, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Richard Carpenter', 'Rebecca Callard, Penelope Wilton, Ian Holm, Paul Cross, Siân Phillips', null, 'The Borrowers are small, 15cm high humans who live in the English hinterland. They live out their lives in mouse-hole sized nooks in human homes, and survive by ''borrowing'' all they need from the house and its inhabitants. This series follows young girl Arriety, and her parents Pod and Homily, as they are displaced from their home and try to find a new home, with the help of a human boy, George.', 'The Borrowers are small, 15cm high humans who live in the English hinterland. They live out their lives in mouse-hole sized nooks in human homes, and survive by ''borrowing'' all they need from the house and its inhabitants. This series follows young girl Arriety, and her parents Pod and Homily, as they are displaced from their home and try to find a new home, with the help of a human boy, George.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZaefhd3UeSeEso2rCcIPAewjDu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:40306'),
  ('1112359569389679070', 'The Boss', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat', null, 'Guillermo Francella, Gabriel Goity, Darío Barassi, Gastón Cocchiarale', 'TV-MA', 'Eliseo is the superintendent of an upscale building. On the surface, is cordial and docile in his role, but underneath Eliseo believes himself the omnipotent figure of the community — meddling in the affairs of residents and pulling strings as he sees fit. Eliseo''s only concern is protecting his job, which comes under threat by a proposed pool project.', 'Eliseo is the superintendent of an upscale building. On the surface, is cordial and docile in his role, but underneath Eliseo believes himself the omnipotent figure of the community — meddling in the affairs of residents and pulling strings as he sees fit. Eliseo''s only concern is protecting his job, which comes under threat by a proposed pool project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uez7jwNd3oO87ceRr6nX8yCQvsL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:128306'),
  ('1100913724144693161', 'The Boss Baby: Back in Business', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Brandon Sawyer', null, 'JP Karliak, Alex Cazares, Kevin Michael Richardson, Carlos Ponce, Pierce Gagnon, Hope Levy, David W. Collins, Eric Bell Jr.', 'TV-G', 'With a little help from his brother and accomplice, Tim, Boss Baby tries to balance family life with his job at Baby Corp headquarters.', 'With a little help from his brother and accomplice, Tim, Boss Baby tries to balance family life with his job at Baby Corp headquarters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUVZHkJPKDYgDy1dbDdi0Esj9eB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:77606'),
  ('78308716934791118', 'The Boss Baby: Back in the Crib', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', null, null, 'JP Karliak, Mary Faber, Alex Cazares', 'TV-Y7', 'Framed for a corporate crime, an adult Ted Templeton turns back into the Boss Baby to live undercover with his brother, Tim, posing as one of his kids.', 'Framed for a corporate crime, an adult Ted Templeton turns back into the Boss Baby to live undercover with his brother, Tim, posing as one of his kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18f8ASmigtrQTm8MARHD8Af47db.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:197429'),
  ('161191270547105387', 'The Boulet Brothers'' Dragula', 2016, 'Reality', 'Swanthula Boulet, Dracmorda Boulet', 'Dracmorda Boulet, Swanthula Boulet', 'Dracmorda Boulet, Swanthula Boulet, Israel Zamora', 'TV-MA', 'Hosted by The Boulet Brothers, this reality competition show features monster drag artists from around the world competing for a chance to win $100,000 and the title of "Dragula, The World''s Next Drag Supermonster". Each week, the competitors are tasked with horror-based makeup, design, and performance challenges meant to test their skills and prove they have what it takes to remain in the competition. For the monsters that fail, grueling mental and physical "Extermination Challenges" await with horrifying and deadly consequences, until only the strongest finalists remain.', 'Hosted by The Boulet Brothers, this reality competition show features monster drag artists from around the world competing for a chance to win $100,000 and the title of "Dragula, The World''s Next Drag Supermonster". Each week, the competitors are tasked with horror-based makeup, design, and performance challenges meant to test their skills and prove they have what it takes to remain in the competition. For the monsters that fail, grueling mental and physical "Extermination Challenges" await with horrifying and deadly consequences, until only the strongest finalists remain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6py2tZQgj6HA9gmM2mSsWUFmogr.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:70940'),
  ('989956797108184179', 'The Bourne Identity', 1988, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Robert Ludlum', 'Carol Sobieski', 'Richard Chamberlain, Jaclyn Smith, Anthony Quayle, Donald Moffat, Yorgo Voyagis, Peter Vaughan, Denholm Elliott', null, 'Wounded to the brink of death and suffering from amnesia, Jason Bourne is rescued at sea by a fisherman. With nothing to go on but a Swiss bank account number, he starts to reconstruct his life, but finds that many people he encounters want him dead. However, Bourne realizes that he has the combat and mental skills of a world-class spy—but who does he work for?', 'Wounded to the brink of death and suffering from amnesia, Jason Bourne is rescued at sea by a fisherman. With nothing to go on but a Swiss bank account number, he starts to reconstruct his life, but finds that many people he encounters want him dead. However, Bourne realizes that he has the combat and mental skills of a world-class spy—but who does he work for?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NLM7JqueGMHw3LgnPzvoAFYyeD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25397'),
  ('746371851562458669', 'The Box', 2021, 'Drama', 'Adi Hasak', 'Josh Azouz, Clare Siobhan Byrne, Paula Killen', 'Anna Friel, Alexander Karim, Peter Stormare, Olivia Grant, Nina Yndis, Helen Behan, Shaq B. Grant, Letitia Hector', null, 'Sharon Pici, a Kansas City Police Detective, is locked in a room that she cannot escape.', 'Sharon Pici, a Kansas City Police Detective, is locked in a room that she cannot escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPyHyyqGVCYzOiSHqAu71R5tVrq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128653'),
  ('961024591211563575', 'The Box', 2026, 'Reality', 'Aleksander Herresthal', null, 'Beau van Erven Dorens', null, 'Yellow boxes suddenly appear everywhere in the Netherlands. Inside: well-known Dutch people, closed off from everything that is familiar. Where are they? What is going to happen? As soon as the boxes open, the adventure begins. Without explanation, without rules. Under the leadership of Beau van Erven Dorens, the participants are taken to special locations, where they have to rely on their instincts again and again.', 'Yellow boxes suddenly appear everywhere in the Netherlands. Inside: well-known Dutch people, closed off from everything that is familiar. Where are they? What is going to happen? As soon as the boxes open, the adventure begins. Without explanation, without rules. Under the leadership of Beau van Erven Dorens, the participants are taken to special locations, where they have to rely on their instincts again and again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zw0DsKbiK2PLxsUu8kDLMHqR0I7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282318'),
  ('465124757067478156', 'The Box of Delights', 1984, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Kids', 'Alan Seymour', 'Alan Seymour', 'Devin Stanfield, Robert Stephens, Joanna Dukes, Jonathan Stephens, Geoffrey Larder, Heidi Burton, Flora Page', null, 'Patrick Troughton stars in this children''s fantasy tale with dark undertones. When a young schoolboy is given a box for safekeeping by a mysterious magician, little does he know the wondrous things he’ll soon discover.', 'Patrick Troughton stars in this children''s fantasy tale with dark undertones. When a young schoolboy is given a box for safekeeping by a mysterious magician, little does he know the wondrous things he’ll soon discover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orqIDAEIYfL34POU4kcMMe0hm1u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21353'),
  ('968367141179170911', 'The Boy Next Door', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Choi Jae-yoon', null, 'Choi Woo-shik, Jang Ki-yong', null, 'Neighbors Kyu-tae and Gi-jae can''t seem to escape one another - they discover they have a mutual acquaintance in Min-ah, and they even end up living together.', 'Neighbors Kyu-tae and Gi-jae can''t seem to escape one another - they discover they have a mutual acquaintance in Min-ah, and they even end up living together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmdb1lPi0N6DTjlY6dF7TURG9IJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74500'),
  ('949226870502780401', 'The Boy Next World', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'MAME', 'MAME', 'Chaikamon Sermsongwittaya, Nuttarat Tangwai, Suppawit Thongyuen, Kashane Pichetsopon, Sinsophak Wijitwerot, Chaloemdet Thammawut, Kanoklak Sinngam, Ploypapas Isarapongporn', null, 'A stranger claims to be Phu’s lover from another universe. It sounds crazy—until Phu’s heart starts to believe him.', 'A stranger claims to be Phu’s lover from another universe. It sounds crazy—until Phu’s heart starts to believe him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QvZozNBhCESIcyB5NJzJlxuU1p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236457'),
  ('699113257239239615', 'The Boy That Never Was', 2024, 'Drama', 'Karen Perry', null, 'Colin Morgan, Toni O''Rourke, Kerr Logan', null, 'When Dillon’s father Harry races back to their tiny apartment to rescue his child, the apartment is in rubble and there is no sign of his son. Three years later, thousands of miles away in Dublin, Harry spots a six-year-old boy in a crowd and is convinced he is Dillon. Desperate to find his son, Harry’s obsession tears apart his marriage to Robin, exposing shameful secrets that lead to the truth of what happened to their son on the night he went missing.', 'When Dillon’s father Harry races back to their tiny apartment to rescue his child, the apartment is in rubble and there is no sign of his son. Three years later, thousands of miles away in Dublin, Harry spots a six-year-old boy in a crowd and is convinced he is Dillon. Desperate to find his son, Harry’s obsession tears apart his marriage to Robin, exposing shameful secrets that lead to the truth of what happened to their son on the night he went missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rl4Mop410gjpeShCfswERo7Fhx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263351'),
  ('837105463704788801', 'The Boy''s Word: Blood on the Asphalt', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Zhora Kryzhovnikov', null, 'Ivan Yankovsky, Ruzil Minekaev, Leon Kemstach, Anastasiya Krasovskaya, Anna Peresild, Nikita Kologrivyy, Elizaveta Bazykina, Yuliya Aleksandrova', 'TV-PG', 'In the late 1980s, when “perestroika” was taking place in the USSR and the era of the Soviet Union was about to collapse, life became unstable and very different. The 1980s brought not only freedom, but also waves of crime on the city streets. While some young people began to ‘grow up’ on the streets, others found it difficult to find their place in this unpredictable reality. Andrey, lives with his mother and five-year-old sister. He studies at a music school and often encounters street teenagers who harass him. To protect himself, Andrey makes friends with one of these teenagers, Marat, who introduces him to gang life. Youth groups fight for every piece of territory; they defend their right to live the life, even breaking laws and promises. The only thing that matters to them is the vows they make to their gang members-brothers, with whom they confront the violence and fears of the adult world.', 'In the late 1980s, when “perestroika” was taking place in the USSR and the era of the Soviet Union was about to collapse, life became unstable and very different. The 1980s brought not only freedom, but also waves of crime on the city streets. While some young people began to ‘grow up’ on the streets, others found it difficult to find their place in this unpredictable reality. Andrey, lives with his mother and five-year-old sister. He studies at a music school and often encounters street teenagers who harass him. To protect himself, Andrey makes friends with one of these teenagers, Marat, who introduces him to gang life. Youth groups fight for every piece of territory; they defend their right to live the life, even breaking laws and promises. The only thing that matters to them is the vows they make to their gang members-brothers, with whom they confront the violence and fears of the adult world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmJ2vVzaSAPvCqB79H70uMHSNr4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234763'),
  ('380742428771599488', 'The Boyfriend', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'MEGUMI, Chiaki Horan, Thelma Aoyama, Durian Lollobrigida, Yoshimi Tokui', 'TV-14', 'Over the course of a month, a group of men live under one roof and run a coffee truck together to connect and hopefully meet their one true boyfriend.', 'Over the course of a month, a group of men live under one roof and run a coffee truck together to connect and hopefully meet their one true boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LQWb3RXtOjTo0sd7tmdPY5qpB5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:256220'),
  ('1052877248107937884', 'The Boys', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Eric Kripke', null, 'Karl Urban, Jack Quaid, Antony Starr, Erin Moriarty, Jessie T. Usher, Laz Alonso, Chace Crawford, Tomer Capone', 'TV-MA', 'A group of vigilantes known informally as “The Boys” set out to take down corrupt superheroes with no more than blue-collar grit and a willingness to fight dirty.', 'A group of vigilantes known informally as “The Boys” set out to take down corrupt superheroes with no more than blue-collar grit and a willingness to fight dirty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/in1R2dDc421JxsoRWaIIAqVI2KE.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:76479'),
  ('374093883265829859', 'The Boys from Brazil: Rise of the Bolsonaros', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Steve Bannon, Jair Bolsonaro, Glenn Greenwald, Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva, David Miranda, Michelle Bolsonaro, Flávio Bolsonaro, Carla Zambelli', null, 'The remarkable rise of one of the world’s most controversial leaders, Jair Bolsonaro, from obscurity to the presidency of Brazil.', 'The remarkable rise of one of the world’s most controversial leaders, Jair Bolsonaro, from obscurity to the presidency of Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZXernSnVWGhlrAhDUDtdg3fuZn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210318'),
  ('596158787168828332', 'The boys of 3rd C', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', null, 'Sharon Gusberti, Renato Cestiè, Fabrizio Bracconeri, Fabio Ferrari, Giacomo Rosselli, Francesca Ventura, Stefania Dadda, Claudia Vegliante', null, 'Rome, late 1980s, Leopardi Classical High School. This is where the various protagonists of the series meet and experience the epic, hilarious exploits of their classmates in 3C, the most outgoing high school students of the entire school year. Bruno Sacchi, a shy, rather plump boy, often awkward but with a big heart. Chicco Lazzaretti, the classic, tireless repeater, obsessed with school and his classmates, always ready to answer teachers in funny ways to distract his classmates. Of course, Daniele and Rossella, typical sweethearts who have grown up together since childhood, are also present, along with the beautiful, blonde Sharon Zampetti, desired by everyone.', 'Rome, late 1980s, Leopardi Classical High School. This is where the various protagonists of the series meet and experience the epic, hilarious exploits of their classmates in 3C, the most outgoing high school students of the entire school year. Bruno Sacchi, a shy, rather plump boy, often awkward but with a big heart. Chicco Lazzaretti, the classic, tireless repeater, obsessed with school and his classmates, always ready to answer teachers in funny ways to distract his classmates. Of course, Daniele and Rossella, typical sweethearts who have grown up together since childhood, are also present, along with the beautiful, blonde Sharon Zampetti, desired by everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUegH7JHkg4oghRoXGfPom94aM7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:41583'),
  ('293671006708994824', 'The Boys Presents: Diabolical', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'From some of the most unhinged and maniacal minds in Hollywood today comes this animated anthology series, a collection of irreverent and emotionally shocking animated short films. Each episode plunges elbow-deep into unseen crevices of The Boys Universe.', 'From some of the most unhinged and maniacal minds in Hollywood today comes this animated anthology series, a collection of irreverent and emotionally shocking animated short films. Each episode plunges elbow-deep into unseen crevices of The Boys Universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZKfZWwFOAicgoKS2IO7oM1GuHZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152483'),
  ('399280746739216995', 'The Brady Bunch', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Sherwood Schwartz', null, 'Robert Reed, Florence Henderson, Ann B. Davis, Maureen McCormick, Eve Plumb, Susan Olsen, Barry Williams, Christopher Knight', 'TV-G', 'When widower Mike Brady marries a lovely lady widow Carol Ann, their two families become one. These are the misadventures of this new couple, their six children, a dog named Tiger, and quirky housekeeper Alice.', 'When widower Mike Brady marries a lovely lady widow Carol Ann, their two families become one. These are the misadventures of this new couple, their six children, a dog named Tiger, and quirky housekeeper Alice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63MN0GwbAW4Oq2VxbpZODYomMsi.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2126'),
  ('847793335829413457', 'The Brainiacs', 2015, 'Talk', 'Park Hyun-joo', null, null, null, 'Traditionally, the cast is given clues to guess the identity of the episode''s guests, and once the guests appear and are introduced, they and the cast are given a set of puzzles to solve.', 'Traditionally, the cast is given clues to guess the identity of the episode''s guests, and once the guests appear and are introduced, they and the cast are given a set of puzzles to solve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKR1knS6AqjdLzA0usesdGepg0d.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:82833'),
  ('45244361753261981', 'The Brak Show', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Andy Merrill, C. Martin Croker, George Lowe, Joanna Daniels, Carey Means, MC Chris', 'TV-PG', 'In this spin-off of "Space Ghost: Coast to Coast," sidekick Brak goes through a series of bizarre circumstances in his daily suburban life with his alien mom and Cuban dad.', 'In this spin-off of "Space Ghost: Coast to Coast," sidekick Brak goes through a series of bizarre circumstances in his daily suburban life with his alien mom and Cuban dad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkCCKPKQGOjsrGHkn09FQ6AYc2I.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:481'),
  ('628871684272214131', 'The Brave', 2017, 'Drama', 'Dean Georgaris', null, 'Mike Vogel, Natacha Karam, Noah Mills, Hadi Tabbal, Anne Heche, Demetrius Grosse, Sofia Pernas, Tate Ellington', 'TV-14', 'The complex world of our bravest military heroes who make personal sacrifices while executing the most challenging and dangerous missions behind enemy lines.', 'The complex world of our bravest military heroes who make personal sacrifices while executing the most challenging and dangerous missions behind enemy lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkc4PkMhxsQUTs9NnM8hmYNP4M1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71714'),
  ('42952081173729940', 'The Brave ''Yoshihiko''', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Yuichi Fukuda', null, 'Takayuki Yamada, Tsuyoshi Muro, Haruka Kinami, Shin Takuma, Ryusei Nakao, Jiro Sato, Azusa Okamoto', null, 'The story is set in an ancient time, when the whole country was covered in thick forests. A mysterious plague breaks out, resulting in countless deaths. A pure young man named Yoshihiko becomes chosen as a hero, and he sets out on a journey in order to save a village. He has two goals – to bring back the legendary plant that can cure the plague, and to rescue his father Teruhiko who left to find the plant but never returned.', 'The story is set in an ancient time, when the whole country was covered in thick forests. A mysterious plague breaks out, resulting in countless deaths. A pure young man named Yoshihiko becomes chosen as a hero, and he sets out on a journey in order to save a village. He has two goals – to bring back the legendary plant that can cure the plague, and to rescue his father Teruhiko who left to find the plant but never returned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhsJzNmXlktaOVsdTAQDQhGt5ob.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45890'),
  ('129942254459454695', 'The Brave of Legend Da-Garn', 1992, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rica Matsumoto, Show Hayami, Shunsuke Takamiya, Bin Shimada', null, 'Seiji Takasugi obtained a jewel called "Aurin" which is the earth''s alter ego and it has elected him to be the commander of eight brave robots. The Brave robots are sleeping in many parts of the world as "Brave Stones". However, they become super robots by fusing with modern people and machines once Seiji awakens them and they soon follow his instructions. Their enemy is Lord OhBoss who is an invader who aims at stealing the planet''s energy with the aid of his subordinates that Da-Garn and the other brave robots must stop in order to save the world.', 'Seiji Takasugi obtained a jewel called "Aurin" which is the earth''s alter ego and it has elected him to be the commander of eight brave robots. The Brave robots are sleeping in many parts of the world as "Brave Stones". However, they become super robots by fusing with modern people and machines once Seiji awakens them and they soon follow his instructions. Their enemy is Lord OhBoss who is an invader who aims at stealing the planet''s energy with the aid of his subordinates that Da-Garn and the other brave robots must stop in order to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7lb8O67wDt1WInNaxWu9AJiQPN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89506'),
  ('477326355690019498', 'The Brave of the Sun Fighbird', 1991, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Action & Adventure', 'Katsuyoshi Yatabe', null, 'Yasunori Matsumoto', null, 'Draias, the self-declared ruler of the universe decided to make Earth his base. Together with his ever-loyal subjects Zol and Shura, he carries out his misdeeds through the evil scientist Jango. To stop them, Fighbird and his team follow him to Earth. Fighbird disguises himself as Prof. Amano''s assistant, Yuutaro Katori, and in doing so, is in for a culture shock as he learns how to live with his human hosts. It''s the good, old, cliched battle of good-versus-evil on a mainly human scale as Prof. Amano settles a lifelong grudge match against his former colleague Dr. Jango, while Fighbird squares off with Draias and his men.', 'Draias, the self-declared ruler of the universe decided to make Earth his base. Together with his ever-loyal subjects Zol and Shura, he carries out his misdeeds through the evil scientist Jango. To stop them, Fighbird and his team follow him to Earth. Fighbird disguises himself as Prof. Amano''s assistant, Yuutaro Katori, and in doing so, is in for a culture shock as he learns how to live with his human hosts. It''s the good, old, cliched battle of good-versus-evil on a mainly human scale as Prof. Amano settles a lifelong grudge match against his former colleague Dr. Jango, while Fighbird squares off with Draias and his men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fI8b4B6su8ddBYFvtYMFfg6HXkS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114936'),
  ('352941415119092200', 'The Brave Ones', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Akin Omotoso, Robbie Thorpe, Portia Gumede', null, 'Sthandile Nkosi, Nomalanga Nkosi, Bonko Khoza, Tony Kgoroge, Zamani Mbatha, Keke Mphuthi, S''Thandiwe Kgoroge, Pheello Kotelo', 'TV-14', 'An all-mighty goddess reincarnated as a young woman must harness her divine powers to avenge her sister''s death and protect her family from destruction.', 'An all-mighty goddess reincarnated as a young woman must harness her divine powers to avenge her sister''s death and protect her family from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtJVqPfax61940ak6k94F3D6Klh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209390'),
  ('167696776692021604', 'The Bravest Knight', 2019, 'Animation, Kids', 'Daniel Errico', 'Daniel Errico', 'Bobby Moynihan, T. R. Knight, Chance Hurstfield, Millie Davis', 'TV-Y7', 'The Bravest Knight is the story of a young pumpkin farmer named Cedric as he attempts to become the greatest knight who ever lived. Now grown and married to the prince of his dreams, Sir Cedric recounts his fairytale adventures to his adopted daughter Nia, showing her the paths and pitfalls that await her on the way to knighthood.', 'The Bravest Knight is the story of a young pumpkin farmer named Cedric as he attempts to become the greatest knight who ever lived. Now grown and married to the prince of his dreams, Sir Cedric recounts his fairytale adventures to his adopted daughter Nia, showing her the paths and pitfalls that await her on the way to knighthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shQOswlI6DQPmy0hmSBHh91jlhQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90617'),
  ('151108088834566340', 'The Break', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Matthieu Donck', null, 'Jasmina Douieb, Aurélien Caeyman, Lara Hubinont, Yoann Blanc, Sophie Breyer, Julien Drion, Karim Barras, Tom Audenaert', 'TV-MA', 'The story is set in a small village in the Ardennes, where a young African footballer is found dead. If all clues lead first to suicide, a police officer just arrived from Brussels does not take long to discover that this is a murder.', 'The story is set in a small village in the Ardennes, where a young African footballer is found dead. If all clues lead first to suicide, a police officer just arrived from Brussels does not take long to discover that this is a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQDiPRmyTdUwzbzUr8yprg1tEX0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65672'),
  ('24354858559291524', 'The Break with Michelle Wolf', 2018, 'Comedy', null, 'Joanna Bradley', 'Michelle Wolf', 'TV-MA', 'Nobody''s safe as Michelle Wolf unapologetically takes aim in this weekly topical show that blends sketches with live comedy and in-studio guests.', 'Nobody''s safe as Michelle Wolf unapologetically takes aim in this weekly topical show that blends sketches with live comedy and in-studio guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UFPnQPTxGErBXvuUrP47n83x7J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79168'),
  ('587813712918919336', 'The Breakthrough', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Oskar Söderlund', 'Peter Eggers, Mattias Nordkvist, Jessica Liedberg, Karin de Frumerie, Julia Sporre, Julius Fleischanderl, Annika Hallin, Bahador Foladi', 'TV-14', 'When a shocking double homicide goes unsolved for 16 years, a detective teams up with a genealogist to catch the killer before it becomes a cold case.', 'When a shocking double homicide goes unsolved for 16 years, a detective teams up with a genealogist to catch the killer before it becomes a cold case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gYhNl5XAPOw36qjxg3mOXxeKoq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279283'),
  ('1123417709122649705', 'The Breslau Murders', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Tomasz Schuchardt, Adam Bobik, Sandra Drzymalska, Ireneusz Czop, Agata Kulesza, Karolina Gruszka, Przemysław Bluszcz, Piotr Janusz', null, 'Commissioner Franz Podolsky investigates a brutal murder and, because of the upcoming Olympic Games, the pressure is on to catch the murderer.', 'Commissioner Franz Podolsky investigates a brutal murder and, because of the upcoming Olympic Games, the pressure is on to catch the murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6i3mGilu3N85kJgjRh41oXQ3YH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254356'),
  ('936681723749911644', 'The Bride', 2024, 'Drama', 'Taner Tunc', null, 'Talya Çelebi, Cenay Türksever, Sidal Damar, Betigül Ceylan, Kutay Şahin, Can Tarakçı, Ceren Yüksekkaya, Çisel Kuşkan', null, 'The continuation of the lineage of a deep-rooted family depends on Cihan Develioğlu''s unborn son, but Cihan cannot have a child due to his wife. Mukadder plays a cruel game for her son Cihan to have a son. Mukadder goes to Cihan''s wife, Beyza, with a dangerous proposal and asks her to divorce her son. Named after her sharp looks, Hançer faces an offer that will turn her life upside down. Mukadder, who takes advantage of the fact that Hançer is poor and has a family that will not cause trouble, offers her the opportunity to marry her son and give birth to a male child. Hançer, who dreams of finding the love of her life and having a happy marriage, first rejects this offer. However, she is forced to accept the offer when she learns that her brother has a deadly illness. Cihan and Hançer, who have entered an irreversible path, will no longer be the same. Will these two young people, drawn into a big game and lost in a dark maze, fall under the spell of love contrary to the planned games?', 'The continuation of the lineage of a deep-rooted family depends on Cihan Develioğlu''s unborn son, but Cihan cannot have a child due to his wife. Mukadder plays a cruel game for her son Cihan to have a son. Mukadder goes to Cihan''s wife, Beyza, with a dangerous proposal and asks her to divorce her son. Named after her sharp looks, Hançer faces an offer that will turn her life upside down. Mukadder, who takes advantage of the fact that Hançer is poor and has a family that will not cause trouble, offers her the opportunity to marry her son and give birth to a male child. Hançer, who dreams of finding the love of her life and having a happy marriage, first rejects this offer. However, she is forced to accept the offer when she learns that her brother has a deadly illness. Cihan and Hançer, who have entered an irreversible path, will no longer be the same. Will these two young people, drawn into a big game and lost in a dark maze, fall under the spell of love contrary to the planned games?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXRnWrAooZyGzHQFmelixDTGOet.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:245841'),
  ('1027929258436326757', 'The Bride of Habaek', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yoon Mi-Kyung', 'Jung Yoon-jung', 'Nam Joo-hyuk, Shin Sae-kyeong, Lim Ju-hwan, Krystal Jung, Gong Myoung, Choi Woo-ri, Bae Noo-ri, Song Won-geun', 'TV-14', 'Yoon So Ah is a pragmatic neuropsychiatrist who carries a tremendous financial burden to run her own practice. Her family has been tasked with serving Ha Baek, a reincarnated water god, for many generations, and So Ah is forced to do the same. Ha Baek starts to develop feelings for So Ah, but he has competition for her heart from Hoo Ye, the CEO of a resort company, who clashes with So Ah over a piece of land but then falls in love with her. Can a relationship between a mortal female and a god have a future?', 'Yoon So Ah is a pragmatic neuropsychiatrist who carries a tremendous financial burden to run her own practice. Her family has been tasked with serving Ha Baek, a reincarnated water god, for many generations, and So Ah is forced to do the same. Ha Baek starts to develop feelings for So Ah, but he has competition for her heart from Hoo Ye, the CEO of a resort company, who clashes with So Ah over a piece of land but then falls in love with her. Can a relationship between a mortal female and a god have a future?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SOabkBsDeUzdinuHJ9TciPM6Ls.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70452'),
  ('89865728701170651', 'The Bridge', 2010, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Robert Wertheimer, Alan DiFiore', null, 'Aaron Douglas, Ona Grauer, Paul Popowich, Michael Murphy, Frank Cassini, Inga Cadranel, Miranda Edwards', 'TV-14', 'The Bridge was a Canadian police drama commissioned by CTV and CBS starring Aaron Douglas. The name of the series is derived from the bridge which connects the wealthy Rosedale neighborhood of Toronto with one of its poorest, St. James Town. The initial order is for 11 episodes, produced by Entertainment One. After CTV ordered the pilot to series in November 2008, CTV later shared the pilot with CBS. This series premiered on CTV on March 5, 2010 and premiered on July 10, 2010 on CBS. It has been canceled in the US after three episodes due to low ratings. CTV announced on June 3, 2010 that the series will return for a second season during the 2010–2011 season. However, on January 13, 2011, star Aaron Douglas tweeted that the series has been officially canceled after only one season.', 'The Bridge was a Canadian police drama commissioned by CTV and CBS starring Aaron Douglas. The name of the series is derived from the bridge which connects the wealthy Rosedale neighborhood of Toronto with one of its poorest, St. James Town. The initial order is for 11 episodes, produced by Entertainment One. After CTV ordered the pilot to series in November 2008, CTV later shared the pilot with CBS. This series premiered on CTV on March 5, 2010 and premiered on July 10, 2010 on CBS. It has been canceled in the US after three episodes due to low ratings. CTV announced on June 3, 2010 that the series will return for a second season during the 2010–2011 season. However, on January 13, 2011, star Aaron Douglas tweeted that the series has been officially canceled after only one season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaPPhbqwz6Ln6bzQCUurvJiozkG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18359'),
  ('431187446246446980', 'The Bridge', 2011, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Hans Rosenfeldt', 'Erik Ahrnbom, Måns Mårlind, Björn Stein', 'Sofia Helin, Thure Lindhardt, Mikael Birkkjær, Sarah Boberg, Rafael Pettersson, Julie Carlsen, Maria Kulle, Anders Mossling', 'TV-MA', 'When a body is found on the bridge between Denmark and Sweden, right on the border, Danish inspector Martin Rohde and Swedish Saga Norén have to share jurisdiction and work together to find the killer.', 'When a body is found on the bridge between Denmark and Sweden, right on the border, Danish inspector Martin Rohde and Swedish Saga Norén have to share jurisdiction and work together to find the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8V9hLWArWhoIdmZ1ujmWrJZL6J.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:45016'),
  ('965527881017017114', 'The Bridge', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Meredith Stiehm, Elwood Reid', null, 'Diane Kruger, Demián Bichir, Annabeth Gish, Emily Rios, Thomas M. Wright, Matthew Lillard, Ted Levine', 'TV-MA', 'A murdered body on a bridge between El Paso and Juarez bring together El Paso detective Sonya Cross and Chihuahua State Police detective Marco Ruiz.', 'A murdered body on a bridge between El Paso and Juarez bring together El Paso detective Sonya Cross and Chihuahua State Police detective Marco Ruiz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUbzlmMmPxU1aQViVBvTwtZjSM1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:47141'),
  ('373547277194855800', 'The Brigade', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Jérémie Guez, Erwan Augoyard', null, null, null, 'Saïd leads a team of young elite cops and will have to find his place within his group while preventing a gang war from breaking out between Eric''s family and that of the El Hassani brothers.', 'Saïd leads a team of young elite cops and will have to find his place within his group while preventing a gang war from breaking out between Eric''s family and that of the El Hassani brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xjMAeMDvWVoPszbKyluQ05L8Z8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203276'),
  ('552570680636356300', 'The Brightest Star in the Sky', 2019, 'Comedy', null, 'Wang Yan Da, Liu Ran, Zuo Wei Jia', 'Huang Zitao, Janice Wu, Niu Junfeng, Cao Xiyue, Xiao Liujia, David Chen, Zhao Yihuan, Lang Feng', null, 'An aspiring music lover, Yang Zhenzhen, becomes the assistant to arrogant idol Zheng Boxu and helps transform him into a true artist, all while she grows into a skilled manager and he faces fierce competition from rising star Yu Zirui.', 'An aspiring music lover, Yang Zhenzhen, becomes the assistant to arrogant idol Zheng Boxu and helps transform him into a true artist, all while she grows into a skilled manager and he faces fierce competition from rising star Yu Zirui.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yP9Nez0l85drBerALxuSvk0AfDQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88067'),
  ('364921288233947382', 'The Brilliant Healer''s New Life in the Shadows', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shogo Sakata, Miharu Hanai, Yoko Hikasa, Mashiro Hitaka, Anna Nagase, Masaaki Mizunaka, Sayaka Kikuchi, Taku Yashiro', 'TV-MA', 'Banished as "useless," Zenos, a self-taught healer from the slums, turns despair into defiance and opens a secret clinic in the city''s shadows. With unlicensed, unmatched magic, he cures, comforts, and rights wrongs, quietly becoming a legend. But as his power grows, even the royal palace takes notice. Can he buck the odds and heal a world that cast him aside?', 'Banished as "useless," Zenos, a self-taught healer from the slums, turns despair into defiance and opens a secret clinic in the city''s shadows. With unlicensed, unmatched magic, he cures, comforts, and rights wrongs, quietly becoming a legend. But as his power grows, even the royal palace takes notice. Can he buck the odds and heal a world that cast him aside?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RqQ6WNHaIyHJByEiRYTpbGCsms.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276253'),
  ('106850622971936630', 'The Brink', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Kim Benabib, Roberto Benabib', null, 'Jack Black, Tim Robbins, Pablo Schreiber, Aasif Mandvi, Eric Ladin, Esai Morales, Maribeth Monroe, Megan Suri', 'TV-MA', 'Three top U.S. government and military officials scramble to prevent World War 3 from happening amidst the chaos of a geopolitical crisis.', 'Three top U.S. government and military officials scramble to prevent World War 3 from happening amidst the chaos of a geopolitical crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lEy8PfwzIYc8J582rECuJ2BEsV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15907'),
  ('1113531717756239081', 'The Brittas Empire', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Andrew Norriss', null, 'Chris Barrie, Michael Burns, Julia St. John, Pippa Haywood, Tim Marriott, Harriet Thorpe, Russell Porter', null, 'The Brittas Empire is a British sitcom created and originally written by Andrew Norriss and Richard Fegen. Chris Barrie plays Gordon Brittas, the well-meaning but incompetent manager of Whitbury New Town Leisure Centre. The show ran for seven series and 53 episodes — including two Christmas specials — from 1991 to 1997 on BBC1. Norriss and Fegen wrote the first five series, after which they left the show. The Brittas Empire enjoyed a long and successful run throughout the 1990s, and gained itself large mainstream audiences. In 2004 the show came 47th on the BBC''s Britain''s Best Sitcom poll, and all series have been released on DVD. The creators Andrew Norriss and Richard Fegen often combine farce with either surreal or dramatic elements in episodes. For example in the first series, the leisure centre prepares for a royal visit, only for the doors to seal, the boiler room to flood and a visitor to become electrocuted. Unlike the traditional sitcom, deaths were quite common in The Brittas Empire.', 'The Brittas Empire is a British sitcom created and originally written by Andrew Norriss and Richard Fegen. Chris Barrie plays Gordon Brittas, the well-meaning but incompetent manager of Whitbury New Town Leisure Centre. The show ran for seven series and 53 episodes — including two Christmas specials — from 1991 to 1997 on BBC1. Norriss and Fegen wrote the first five series, after which they left the show. The Brittas Empire enjoyed a long and successful run throughout the 1990s, and gained itself large mainstream audiences. In 2004 the show came 47th on the BBC''s Britain''s Best Sitcom poll, and all series have been released on DVD. The creators Andrew Norriss and Richard Fegen often combine farce with either surreal or dramatic elements in episodes. For example in the first series, the leisure centre prepares for a royal visit, only for the doors to seal, the boiler room to flood and a visitor to become electrocuted. Unlike the traditional sitcom, deaths were quite common in The Brittas Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPtzc6MbPxeFdIO55Kd6QiiEIdH.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:245'),
  ('577041155296205142', 'The Broken Marriage Vow', 2022, 'Drama', 'Andoy Ranay, Connie Macatuno', null, 'Jodi Sta. Maria, Zanjoe Marudo, Sue Ramirez, Zaijian Jaranilla, Jane Oineza, Joem Bascon, Art Acuña', null, 'A seemingly perfect home gets shattered by broken trust and infidelity, bringing forth catastrophic effects into the lives of the couple, their son, and everyone else involved. This is a story about a woman scorned.', 'A seemingly perfect home gets shattered by broken trust and infidelity, bringing forth catastrophic effects into the lives of the couple, their son, and everyone else involved. This is a story about a woman scorned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfWdh5oAUYBa6G0WeRouPkdGkUl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:125030'),
