  ('964942033677439398', 'The Brothers Sun', 2024, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime, Comedy', 'Brad Falchuk, Byron Wu', 'Justin Calen-Chenn', 'Michelle Yeoh, Justin Chien, Sam Li, Joon Lee, Highdee Kuan', 'TV-MA', 'When a mysterious enemy targets his family, a Taipei triad member heads to Los Angeles to protect his strong-willed mother and oblivious younger brother.', 'When a mysterious enemy targets his family, a Taipei triad member heads to Los Angeles to protect his strong-willed mother and oblivious younger brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTPMj3Bqb0WfHsIv8zUOROSjb7S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227004'),
  ('687070121333961996', 'The Buccaneers', 1956, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Kids, Family, Crime', null, null, 'Robert Shaw', 'TV-G', 'The adventures of privateer Captain Dan Tempest and his crew of former pirates as they make their way across the seven seas in The Sultana.', 'The adventures of privateer Captain Dan Tempest and his crew of former pirates as they make their way across the seven seas in The Sultana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z085lWTy2t9t1P1LKdRd6SKlYdF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12033'),
  ('909516078669352316', 'The Buccaneers', 1995, 'Drama', null, null, 'Carla Gugino, Mira Sorvino, Alison Elliott, Rya Kihlstedt, Dinsdale Landen, Cherie Lunghi, Greg Wise, James Frain', null, 'Because of their "new money" background, four American girls have difficulty breaking into the upper-crust society of New York. Laura Testvalley, the governess of one of the girls, suggests a London season and thus the young women set sail for England and the unsuspecting English aristocracy. In England, all the girls soon find eligible husbands and the youngest girl, Nan, seems to land the best husband of them all: the handsome and very wealthy Julius, Duke of Trevennick. The girls soon discover that English upper-class men are not at all what they expected and hoped for.', 'Because of their "new money" background, four American girls have difficulty breaking into the upper-crust society of New York. Laura Testvalley, the governess of one of the girls, suggests a London season and thus the young women set sail for England and the unsuspecting English aristocracy. In England, all the girls soon find eligible husbands and the youngest girl, Nan, seems to land the best husband of them all: the handsome and very wealthy Julius, Duke of Trevennick. The girls soon discover that English upper-class men are not at all what they expected and hoped for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbdJg42cyKWqfVm8B3fwdilabtK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23023'),
  ('710565500583739865', 'The Buccaneers', 2023, 'Drama', 'Katherine Jakeways', null, 'Kristine Froseth, Alisha Boe, Aubri Ibrag, Imogen Waterhouse, Josie Totah, Matthew Broome, Josh Dylan, Guy Remmers', 'TV-MA', 'A group of fun-loving American girls burst onto the scene in tightly corseted 1870s London, kicking off an Anglo-American culture clash. Sent to secure husbands and status, the buccaneers'' hearts are set on much more than that.', 'A group of fun-loving American girls burst onto the scene in tightly corseted 1870s London, kicking off an Anglo-American culture clash. Sent to secure husbands and status, the buccaneers'' hearts are set on much more than that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbbZRlzz41JQjBOT9OEKHgonhZ3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213338'),
  ('960367805985201434', 'The Buddha of Suburbia', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hanif Kureishi', null, 'Naveen Andrews, Brenda Blethyn, Harish Patel, Jemma Redgrave, Roshan Seth, Steven Mackintosh, Susan Fleetwood, David Bamber', null, 'Karim is 17 years old and lives in a South London suburb with his English mother and Pakistani father, who has become a kind of spiritual guru to his middle-class neighbours. Karim wants to explore his cultural roots, in the hope that he will achieve sexual and racial self-realisation.', 'Karim is 17 years old and lives in a South London suburb with his English mother and Pakistani father, who has become a kind of spiritual guru to his middle-class neighbours. Karim wants to explore his cultural roots, in the hope that he will achieve sexual and racial self-realisation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DnR1THP7DW22o7HxMnX4JxntYr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8894'),
  ('745460108199295879', 'The Bugs Bunny and Tweety Show', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Stan Freberg, Mel Blanc, Jim Backus, June Foray, Jeff Bergman', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cP0RW6xncXL0P5NvgF6cHsRsXXA.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:26927'),
  ('859446761722264031', 'The Bullwinkle Show', 1959, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Family', 'Jay Ward, Bill Scott', null, 'William Conrad, June Foray, Bill Scott, Paul Frees, Dorothy Scott, Edward Everett Horton, Walter Tetley, Daws Butler', 'TV-G', 'A variety show, with the main feature being the serialized adventures of the two title characters, the anthropomorphic moose Bullwinkle and flying squirrel Rocky. The main adversaries in most of their adventures are the Russian-like spies Boris Badenov and Natasha Fatale. Supporting segments include Dudley Do-Right, Peabody''s Improbable History, and Fractured Fairy Tales, among others.', 'A variety show, with the main feature being the serialized adventures of the two title characters, the anthropomorphic moose Bullwinkle and flying squirrel Rocky. The main adversaries in most of their adventures are the Russian-like spies Boris Badenov and Natasha Fatale. Supporting segments include Dudley Do-Right, Peabody''s Improbable History, and Fractured Fairy Tales, among others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAMWBJyYynFWxJNrIvVnHlN2e9P.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1025'),
  ('1011442845288747481', 'The Bureau', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Éric Rochant', null, 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Sara Giraudeau, Stefan Crepon, Zineb Triki, Florence Loiret Caille, Jonathan Zaccaï, Oleksiy Horbunov, Mathieu Amalric', 'TV-MA', 'Within the DGSE (General Directorate for External Security), a department called the Office Of Legends (BDL) forms and remote pilot the most important agents of the French intelligence services: Clandestine. Immersion in hostile country, their mission is to identify individuals who may be recruited as sources of information. Operating "under caption", that is to say in a fabricated identity from scratch, they live for many years in a permanent duplicity. Our hero just returned from a clandestine mission six years in Damascus. But contrary to what is required by safety rules, he does not abandon his legend and the identity under which he lived in Syria, thus putting in danger the whole system.', 'Within the DGSE (General Directorate for External Security), a department called the Office Of Legends (BDL) forms and remote pilot the most important agents of the French intelligence services: Clandestine. Immersion in hostile country, their mission is to identify individuals who may be recruited as sources of information. Operating "under caption", that is to say in a fabricated identity from scratch, they live for many years in a permanent duplicity. Our hero just returned from a clandestine mission six years in Damascus. But contrary to what is required by safety rules, he does not abandon his legend and the identity under which he lived in Syria, thus putting in danger the whole system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWd0ajqIsd92tcQEgYBC7nMpOrk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:62476'),
  ('872680150689819714', 'The Bureau of Magical Things', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Comedy, Family, Action & Adventure', 'Jonathan M. Shiff', null, 'Kimie Tsukakoshi, Mia Milnes, Elizabeth Cullen, Julian Cullen, Rainbow Wedell, Jamie Carter, Christopher Sommers, Nicholas Bell', 'TV-G', 'When ordinary teenager Kyra touches a mysterious book, she is transformed into a Tri-ling-–part-human, part-fairy and part-elf. In addition to acquiring amazing magical powers, Kyra discovers a secret world of magic all around her.', 'When ordinary teenager Kyra touches a mysterious book, she is transformed into a Tri-ling-–part-human, part-fairy and part-elf. In addition to acquiring amazing magical powers, Kyra discovers a secret world of magic all around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sM1E094qxukl7GOt8EC1uVDxkXR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82791'),
  ('1063418940824170503', 'The Burning Girls', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Hans Rosenfeldt', null, 'Samantha Morton, Ruby Stokes, Conrad Khan, David Dawson, Paul Bradley, Janie Dee, Jane Lapotaire, John Macmillan', null, 'Follows Reverend Jack Brooks and her daughter in Chapel Croft, a place for a fresh start that soon reveals its community''s dark history and where ancient superstitions and mistrust of outsiders are quite common.', 'Follows Reverend Jack Brooks and her daughter in Chapel Croft, a place for a fresh start that soon reveals its community''s dark history and where ancient superstitions and mistrust of outsiders are quite common.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjhbQMfQPcMpk9fqcB7AqGvLfHP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234787'),
