  ('203556400175994115', 'The Circus', 2016, 'Documentary', 'John Heilemann, Mark McKinnon', null, 'John Heilemann, Mark McKinnon, Jennifer Palmieri', 'TV-14', 'Come one, come all to The Circus. This real-time documentary series pulls back the curtain on the current political stories, revealing the intense, inspiring and infuriating stories behind the headlines. Key characters and events are presented in real time, as they are happening.', 'Come one, come all to The Circus. This real-time documentary series pulls back the curtain on the current political stories, revealing the intense, inspiring and infuriating stories behind the headlines. Key characters and events are presented in real time, as they are happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnufA6IaOEgmnk28CSTIH9Umk4S.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:65339'),
  ('663261317620179247', 'The City and the City', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', null, null, 'Danny Webb, Lara Pulver, Mandeep Dhillon, David Morrissey, Ron Cook, Maria Schrader, Christian Camargo, Paprika Steen', null, 'When the body of a foreign student is discovered in the streets of the down-at-heel city of Besźel, it’s just another day’s work for Inspector Tyador Borlú of the Extreme Crime Squad. But he uncovers evidence that the murdered girl came from Ul Qoma, a city that shares a dangerous and volatile relationship with Besźel, and this case will challenge everything Borlú holds dear.', 'When the body of a foreign student is discovered in the streets of the down-at-heel city of Besźel, it’s just another day’s work for Inspector Tyador Borlú of the Extreme Crime Squad. But he uncovers evidence that the murdered girl came from Ul Qoma, a city that shares a dangerous and volatile relationship with Besźel, and this case will challenge everything Borlú holds dear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5xoKhFdaOQQXbiYxPGavsZ6R1S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78317'),
  ('921018717110205616', 'The Civil War', 1990, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, 'David McCullough, Sam Waterston, Julie Harris, Jason Robards, Morgan Freeman, Paul Roebling, Garrison Keillor, George Black', 'TV-14', 'A documentary on the American Civil War narrated by Ken Burns, covering the secession of the Confederacy to the assassination of Abraham Lincoln.', 'A documentary on the American Civil War narrated by Ken Burns, covering the secession of the Confederacy to the assassination of Abraham Lincoln.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qs6J3T0mfAlmoOOUt0B2d4zd6je.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9693'),
  ('1125213611010679723', 'The Clan', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Anghel Damian, Cristian Buje', null, 'Denis Hanganu, Marian Olteanu, Șerban Pavlu, Theo Rose, Codin Maticiuc, George Mihăiță, Carmen Tănase, Mădălina Craiu', null, 'The Clan is an adaptation that will center on an engaging story about the classic struggle between the Police and the Mafia. Tensions will rise as love stories spice up the eternal battle between good and evil.', 'The Clan is an adaptation that will center on an engaging story about the classic struggle between the Police and the Mafia. Tensions will rise as love stories spice up the eternal battle between good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yfUQcWRGqVlE3oBQn2kVuK4Nj3.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:209454'),
  ('672881468007930097', 'The Clandestine', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Edoardo Leo, Lavinia Longhi, Hassani Shapi, Fausto Maria Sciarappa, Alice Arcuri, Mattia Mele, Michele Savoia, Isabella Mottinelli', null, 'Inspired by a profound encounter, a troubled former chief investigator becomes a private eye for those who won´t - or can´t - turn to the law.', 'Inspired by a profound encounter, a troubled former chief investigator becomes a private eye for those who won´t - or can´t - turn to the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRea2kGGXnzTYCTXftkXp7PVibJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251564'),
  ('1056964258209761049', 'The Class', 2006, 'Comedy', 'David Crane, Jeffrey Klarik', null, 'Andrea Anders, Jon Bernthal, Lizzy Caplan, Jesse Tyler Ferguson, Heather Goldenhersh, Sean Maguire, Lucy Punch, Jason Ritter', 'TV-PG', 'A group of 20-somethings who are inextricably bound together having shared the same third-grade class. Now face to face at an impromptu reunion to celebrate the 20th anniversary of the day they met, they wonder if they''ll have anything in common besides vague memories of playground kisses and underwear sightings on the monkey bars. Turns out they do. After two decades apart for most of them, some are eager to show off, some want to rekindle old crushes and others just want to satisfy their curiosity.', 'A group of 20-somethings who are inextricably bound together having shared the same third-grade class. Now face to face at an impromptu reunion to celebrate the 20th anniversary of the day they met, they wonder if they''ll have anything in common besides vague memories of playground kisses and underwear sightings on the monkey bars. Turns out they do. After two decades apart for most of them, some are eager to show off, some want to rekindle old crushes and others just want to satisfy their curiosity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OkGxfZ5H20rO6ph1kW2kxt59BD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:417'),
  ('260859563445864729', 'The Classroom of a Black Cat and a Witch', 2026, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Kaede Hondo, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Fuka Izumi, Miho Wataya', null, 'Spica Virgo is an apprentice witch, but can’t use any magic. She needs someone to be her master in order to get into the academy of her dreams, but she has no money and no connections. Suddenly, a mysterious talking black cat that can use magic appears before her!! Spica wants to learn magic, and the black cat wants his curse broken—goals on the same path. Therefore, a secret master-apprentice relationship was born! But the key to breaking the curse is kissing his…?!', 'Spica Virgo is an apprentice witch, but can’t use any magic. She needs someone to be her master in order to get into the academy of her dreams, but she has no money and no connections. Suddenly, a mysterious talking black cat that can use magic appears before her!! Spica wants to learn magic, and the black cat wants his curse broken—goals on the same path. Therefore, a secret master-apprentice relationship was born! But the key to breaking the curse is kissing his…?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7ec9R5MY39TPWDtj0SrqnDecsv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:297557'),
  ('359800467144720821', 'The Claudia Winkleman Show', 2026, 'Talk', null, null, 'Claudia Winkleman', null, 'Good vibes, great guests, glorious fringe. Your weekly dose of Claudia‑powered joy, as she has a chat with Hollywood stars, the best of British and her gorgeous studio audience.', 'Good vibes, great guests, glorious fringe. Your weekly dose of Claudia‑powered joy, as she has a chat with Hollywood stars, the best of British and her gorgeous studio audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GtwuTBjzF5dJlSD8v2QsD6ZakH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315110'),
  ('859598470281994700', 'The Cleaner', 2008, 'Drama', 'Jonathan Prince, Robert Munic', 'Jonathan Prince', 'Benjamin Bratt, Grace Park, Esteban Powell, Amy Price-Francis', 'TV-14', 'After hitting rock-bottom from his own addictions during the birth of his twins, William Banks strikes a tentative deal with God. In exchange for a second chance, he vows to kick his addictions and dedicate his life to helping others. Now, along with his unconventional team, he helps people get clean from their own addictions of sex, drugs, alcohol and gambling by any means necessary.', 'After hitting rock-bottom from his own addictions during the birth of his twins, William Banks strikes a tentative deal with God. In exchange for a second chance, he vows to kick his addictions and dedicate his life to helping others. Now, along with his unconventional team, he helps people get clean from their own addictions of sex, drugs, alcohol and gambling by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huLx1P9ByuzQWah4mtSAqiSnzg8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7547'),
  ('987191590697953411', 'The Cleaner', 2021, 'Comedy', null, 'Greg Davies', 'Greg Davies', 'TV-14', 'After CSI have done their stuff, the cleaner mops up the grisly remains. For Wicky, a bloodbath and the pub is all in a day''s work.', 'After CSI have done their stuff, the cleaner mops up the grisly remains. For Wicky, a bloodbath and the pub is all in a day''s work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEWFux3hrOjisaehbDUBvzeSJ4o.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:132156'),
  ('54013280686339726', 'The Cleaning Lady', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lucas Combina, Irene Gissara, Greta MOLAS', null, 'Antonella Costa, Marcelo Arbach, Martín Rena', null, 'Rosa is a single mother forced to become the “cleaning lady” for the mob. Her skills to spotlessly clean any crime scene keeps the mob safe until the detectives decide to investigate the chemicals.', 'Rosa is a single mother forced to become the “cleaning lady” for the mob. Her skills to spotlessly clean any crime scene keeps the mob safe until the detectives decide to investigate the chemicals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRa4iZAg8qFFA2SeU7Vs9AvfI8b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73043'),
  ('185085546944374832', 'The Cleaning Lady', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Miranda Kwok', null, 'Élodie Yung, Sebastien LaSalle, Valentino LaSalle, Eva De Dominici', 'TV-14', 'A whip-smart doctor comes to the U.S. for a medical treatment to save her ailing son. But when the system fails and pushes her into hiding, she refuses to be beaten down and marginalized. Instead, she becomes a cleaning lady for the mob and starts playing the game by her own rules.', 'A whip-smart doctor comes to the U.S. for a medical treatment to save her ailing son. But when the system fails and pushes her into hiding, she refuses to be beaten down and marginalized. Instead, she becomes a cleaning lady for the mob and starts playing the game by her own rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoTQhDKiuKpn599yNxp03wr2ZHu.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:125282'),
  ('865262495066985452', 'The Clear Horizon', 1960, 'Soap', 'Manya Starr', null, 'Bern Bennett, Denise Alexander, John Mitchum, Michael Fox, Earl Hammond, Ed Kemmer, Charles Herbert, Lee Meriwether', null, 'The Clear Horizon is an American soap opera which ran on CBS Daytime from July 11, 1960 to March 10, 1961 and February 26 to June 11, 1962. The show was created and head written by Manya Starr.', 'The Clear Horizon is an American soap opera which ran on CBS Daytime from July 11, 1960 to March 10, 1961 and February 26 to June 11, 1962. The show was created and head written by Manya Starr.', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:11768'),
