  ('894359852803313008', 'The Countryside', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Caballero, Julián Sastre, Nando Abad', null, 'Carlos Areces, Silvia Casanova, Ruth Díaz, Empar Ferrer, Vicente Gil, María Hervás, Ángel Jodrá, Javier Losán', 'TV-14', 'A group of urbanites flee the city for different reasons: existential, economic crisis, need for fresh air, search for peace, inspiration to compose ... The intention of these strangers is to settle in an abandoned town and start their lives from scratch, but when they arrive they discover that there are still some neighbors: rural people with a very different way of seeing life.', 'A group of urbanites flee the city for different reasons: existential, economic crisis, need for fresh air, search for peace, inspiration to compose ... The intention of these strangers is to settle in an abandoned town and start their lives from scratch, but when they arrive they discover that there are still some neighbors: rural people with a very different way of seeing life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3pJC3leDFQnXsDzHWTqvY7SyMp.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:89427'),
  ('211837476940401711', 'The Couple Next Door', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Hugh Dennis, Annabel Scholey, Sam Palladio, Aggy K. Adams, Sendhil Ramamurthy, Adam James, Shane Zaza, Maimie McCoy', 'TV-MA', 'Evie and Pete move into an upscale neighborhood and find themselves in a world of curtain twitching and status anxiety. They find friendship in the shape of the couple next door, alpha traffic cop Danny and his wife, glamorous yoga instructor Becka, but after Danny and Evie share a passionate night together there is trouble ahead.', 'Evie and Pete move into an upscale neighborhood and find themselves in a world of curtain twitching and status anxiety. They find friendship in the shape of the couple next door, alpha traffic cop Danny and his wife, glamorous yoga instructor Becka, but after Danny and Evie share a passionate night together there is trouble ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifQ5ffAI6KfywBcSGoGU1YWO3yC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:223438'),
  ('492448314466199987', 'The Courtship of Eddie''s Father', 1969, 'Comedy, Family, Kids', 'James Komack', null, 'Bill Bixby, Brandon Cruz, Miyoshi Umeki, James Komack, Kristina Holland', null, 'The Courtship of Eddie''s Father is an American television sitcom based on the 1963 movie of the same name, which was based on the book written by Mark Toby. It tells the story of a widower, Tom Corbett, who is a magazine publisher, and his son, Eddie, who believes his father should marry, and manipulates situations surrounding the women his father is interested in. ABC had acquired the rights to the story; the series debuted on September 17, 1969, and was last broadcast on March 1, 1972. Bixby received an Emmy nomination for the show.', 'The Courtship of Eddie''s Father is an American television sitcom based on the 1963 movie of the same name, which was based on the book written by Mark Toby. It tells the story of a widower, Tom Corbett, who is a magazine publisher, and his son, Eddie, who believes his father should marry, and manipulates situations surrounding the women his father is interested in. ABC had acquired the rights to the story; the series debuted on September 17, 1969, and was last broadcast on March 1, 1972. Bixby received an Emmy nomination for the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMMgHbBnR1DXtHCfWvWqQnmaJVI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:6137'),
  ('943261521496825634', 'The Coyotes', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jaques Molitor, Gary Seghers', null, 'Kassim Meesters, Léo Hainaut, Isabelle Defossé, Anas El Marcouchi, Tessa Balzano, Louka Minnella, Sarah Ber, Victoria Bluck', 'NR', 'A troop of scouts arrives at Warnaffe for their big summer camp. Among them, the newest member of the Coyotes patrol, Kevin, a rebellious and lonely boy. From the first evening, he leaves to find something to smoke in the neighbouring village. There he meets Marie with whom it''s love at first sight. They spend the night by a lake in a quarry. The next day, still under the influence of drugs, Kevin dives into the lake, discovers a cave, diamonds and a corpse of a young man. This is where problems started.', 'A troop of scouts arrives at Warnaffe for their big summer camp. Among them, the newest member of the Coyotes patrol, Kevin, a rebellious and lonely boy. From the first evening, he leaves to find something to smoke in the neighbouring village. There he meets Marie with whom it''s love at first sight. They spend the night by a lake in a quarry. The next day, still under the influence of drugs, Kevin dives into the lake, discovers a cave, diamonds and a corpse of a young man. This is where problems started.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpwfI3LRoWIQuoY9BlzT8DPWrT4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125676'),
  ('93150154537053278', 'The Cramp Twins', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Brian Wood', null, 'Tom Kenny, Kath Soucie, Nicole Oliver, Ian James Corlett, Terry Klassen, Jayne Paterson, Tabitha St. Germain, Cathy Weseluck', 'TV-Y7', 'The story of a pair of non-identical twin brothers, Lucien and Wayne, who live with their hygiene-crazed mother and their western/country-crazed father in a small town called Soap City. Lucien is a delicate, nature-loving boy, while Wayne is a rough antisocial bully, whose only interest in life is junk. Naturally, some conflicts will ensue.', 'The story of a pair of non-identical twin brothers, Lucien and Wayne, who live with their hygiene-crazed mother and their western/country-crazed father in a small town called Soap City. Lucien is a delicate, nature-loving boy, while Wayne is a rough antisocial bully, whose only interest in life is junk. Naturally, some conflicts will ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDbVBSQJx4xz7FAaOoJG9IFhAsB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3003'),
  ('308373237007400622', 'The Crash', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Michael Leendertse', 'Michael Leendertse', 'Yorick van Wageningen, Thomas Höppener, Joy Delima, Bart Slegers, Guy Clemens, Katrien van Beurden, Chris Peters, Kenneth Herdigein', null, 'Following the catastrophic crash of a large El Al cargo aircraft into Amsterdam''s ''Bijlmer'' high-rise district in October 1992, a local young veterinarian and two journalists find themselves drawn into a years-long investigation into the many puzzling questions, about the disaster and its aftermath, the powers that be seem determined to keep unanswered.', 'Following the catastrophic crash of a large El Al cargo aircraft into Amsterdam''s ''Bijlmer'' high-rise district in October 1992, a local young veterinarian and two journalists find themselves drawn into a years-long investigation into the many puzzling questions, about the disaster and its aftermath, the powers that be seem determined to keep unanswered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9OORSoTiUny2W8K44OAk1awVdx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208831'),
  ('879144034219713112', 'The Crazy Ones', 2013, 'Comedy', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'Robin Williams, Sarah Michelle Gellar, James Wolk, Hamish Linklater, Amanda Setton', 'TV-14', 'Simon Roberts is eccentric, passionate, unpredictable and brilliant. He''s also the first "Roberts" in the Lewis, Roberts + Roberts advertising agency. The second is his pragmatic daughter Sydney. As Sydney struggles to rein in her dad, the agency fights to stay at the top of the ad game, charming everyone from McDonald''s bigwigs to Victoria''s Secret models in the process!', 'Simon Roberts is eccentric, passionate, unpredictable and brilliant. He''s also the first "Roberts" in the Lewis, Roberts + Roberts advertising agency. The second is his pragmatic daughter Sydney. As Sydney struggles to rein in her dad, the agency fights to stay at the top of the ad game, charming everyone from McDonald''s bigwigs to Victoria''s Secret models in the process!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2e7hTrdmNUaJDf0yDP5b4AHvrD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58932'),
  ('975409823038314655', 'The Creature Cases', 2022, 'Kids, Animation', 'Gabe Pulliam', null, 'Nneka Okoye, Shash Hira', 'TV-Y7', 'Special agents Sam and Kit hop the globe with their sleuthing skills, science facts and cool gadgets to solve the animal kingdom''s many mysteries.', 'Special agents Sam and Kit hop the globe with their sleuthing skills, science facts and cool gadgets to solve the animal kingdom''s many mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFi3nx53Dfwa5YOd4J2VnIXpqBk.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:195407'),
  ('353853565907913002', 'The Creep Tapes', 2024, 'Mystery', 'Mark Duplass, Patrick Brice', 'Mark Duplass, Patrick Brice', 'Mark Duplass', 'TV-MA', 'A secluded serial killer lures videographers into his world with the promise of a paid job documenting his life. Unfortunately, as the tape rolls, the killer''s questionable intentions surface with his increasingly odd behavior and the victims will learn they may have made a deadly mistake.', 'A secluded serial killer lures videographers into his world with the promise of a paid job documenting his life. Unfortunately, as the tape rolls, the killer''s questionable intentions surface with his increasingly odd behavior and the victims will learn they may have made a deadly mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nh4vd3KIVt2PTavs5Nj1gurnMjs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:256201'),
  ('1079930261477474714', 'The Crew', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Jeff Lowell', null, 'Kevin James, Jillian Mueller, Freddie Stroma, Gary Anthony Williams, Dan Ahdoot, Sarah Stiles', null, 'When the owner of the fictional NASCAR Bobby Spencer Racing team steps down and passes the team off to his daughter Catherine, the crew chief has to protect himself and his crew from her attempts to modernize.', 'When the owner of the fictional NASCAR Bobby Spencer Racing team steps down and passes the team off to his daughter Catherine, the crew chief has to protect himself and his crew from her attempts to modernize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dF4l0wVGuqxbKvGkrWQaoCuuGC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116736'),
  ('47733011248552753', 'The Crime of the Century', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime, Drama', 'Alex Gibney', null, 'Edward Byrne, Patrick Radden Keefe, Lenny Bernstein, Roy Bosley, Alec Burlakoff, Scott Higham', 'TV-MA', 'A searing indictment of Big Pharma and the political operatives and government regulations that enable over-production, reckless distribution and abuse of synthetic opiates.', 'A searing indictment of Big Pharma and the political operatives and government regulations that enable over-production, reckless distribution and abuse of synthetic opiates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jtWsNSW2ID23u9OeDRRQBCa5Mm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119142'),
  ('556464486827343616', 'The Criminal Investigator', 1995, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Sunny Chan Kam-Hung, Gigi Lai Chi, Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Kwan Ching, Felton Law Gwan-Joh, Wilson Ai Wai, Leung Wing-Lam', null, 'The Criminal Investigator is a 1995 Hong Kong police procedural television drama. Produced by Jonathan Chik and edited by Chow Yuk-ming, the drama is a TVB production. The story follows a team of investigators from the Organized Crime and Triad Bureau unit of the Royal Hong Kong Police Force.', 'The Criminal Investigator is a 1995 Hong Kong police procedural television drama. Produced by Jonathan Chik and edited by Chow Yuk-ming, the drama is a TVB production. The story follows a team of investigators from the Organized Crime and Triad Bureau unit of the Royal Hong Kong Police Force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5yorH6DWv1HdxRPTTxoSHKXFGE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:33944'),
  ('475364292660699845', 'The Criminal Investigator II', 1996, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Sunny Chan Kam-Hung, Gigi Lai Chi, Bonnie Chiu Hok-Yee, Marianne Chan, Joe Ma Tak-Chung, Karen Tong Bo-Yue', 'NR', 'The Criminal Investigator II is a 1996 Hong Kong police procedural television drama. Produced by Jonathan Chik and edited by Chow Yuk-ming and Chiu Ching-yung, the drama is a TVB production and the direct sequel to 1995''s The Criminal Investigator. The story follows a team of investigators from the Organized Crime and Triad Bureau unit of the Royal Hong Kong Police Force.', 'The Criminal Investigator II is a 1996 Hong Kong police procedural television drama. Produced by Jonathan Chik and edited by Chow Yuk-ming and Chiu Ching-yung, the drama is a TVB production and the direct sequel to 1995''s The Criminal Investigator. The story follows a team of investigators from the Organized Crime and Triad Bureau unit of the Royal Hong Kong Police Force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sT8S7CfJWh3fXMLZyyWXrcpuDz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33890'),
  ('815178496196664319', 'The Crimson Field', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Sarah Phelps', null, 'Hermione Norris, Oona Chaplin, Richard Rankin, Marianne Oldham, Alice St. Clair, Suranne Jones, Kevin Doyle, Alex Wyndham', 'TV-PG', 'In a tented field hospital on the coast of France, a team of doctors, nurses and women volunteers work together to heal the bodies and souls of men wounded in the trenches.', 'In a tented field hospital on the coast of France, a team of doctors, nurses and women volunteers work together to heal the bodies and souls of men wounded in the trenches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFHTFvCaR9cdMYXLCaGzB3LkHtW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61241'),
