  ('1009060448844091800', 'The Critic', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Mike Reiss, Al Jean', null, 'Jon Lovitz, Christine Cavanaugh, Park Overall, Russi Taylor, Charles Napier, Judith Ivey, Gerrit Graham, Nancy Cartwright', 'TV-PG', 'Jay Sherman is a TV movie critic who is forced to review the most pathetic films which he always rates as "It stinks." In addition to the film parodies, the show also deals with his personal life: working for a tyrannical media mogul boss, his lovelife and his family.', 'Jay Sherman is a TV movie critic who is forced to review the most pathetic films which he always rates as "It stinks." In addition to the film parodies, the show also deals with his personal life: working for a tyrannical media mogul boss, his lovelife and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVP8YDNWEV3JUVGJRySbgVJLVZU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1839'),
  ('766749702874536823', 'The Crocodile Hunter', 1997, 'Documentary, Action & Adventure, Family', 'John Stainton, Steve Irwin', null, 'Terri Irwin, Steve Irwin, Bindi Irwin', 'TV-G', 'Australian host Steve Irwin and his wife Terri run a wildlife refuge. Their shared passion is educating the world about wildlife, including the much feared crocodile and numerous venomous snakes. Steve''s specialty is the capture and relocation of crocodiles. No animal appears too threatening to Steve, his true respect for animals is the foundation for everything he does.', 'Australian host Steve Irwin and his wife Terri run a wildlife refuge. Their shared passion is educating the world about wildlife, including the much feared crocodile and numerous venomous snakes. Steve''s specialty is the capture and relocation of crocodiles. No animal appears too threatening to Steve, his true respect for animals is the foundation for everything he does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/youExJaJ4EW8jjDllu0emOJAIKi.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1904'),
  ('803913528028681744', 'The Croods: Family Tree', 2021, 'Animation, Family, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', 'Chris Sanders, Kirk DeMicco, John Cleese', null, 'Kiff VandenHeuvel, Ally Dixon, Darin Brooks, Amy Landecker, Artemis Pebdani, A.J. LoCascio, Amy Rosoff, Matthew Waterson', 'TV-Y7', 'Two very different families join forces to create a new community, an us-against-the-world, cave person co-op on the most amazing farm in the history of prehistory!', 'Two very different families join forces to create a new community, an us-against-the-world, cave person co-op on the most amazing farm in the history of prehistory!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0x8dGn1eurgf2TxvLHsPBrJKks.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:132559'),
  ('901224857923460413', 'The Crossing', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Jay Beattie, Dan Dworkin', null, 'Steve Zahn, Natalie Martinez, Sandrine Holt, Georgina Haig, Tommy Bastow, Rob Campbell, Rick Gomez, Marcuis Harris', 'TV-PG', 'Refugees from a war-torn country start showing up to seek asylum in an American town. Only the country these people are from is America and the war they are fleeing is 250 years in the future. The local sheriff with a past, a federal agent and a mother in search of her missing refugee daughter drive this allegory with a surprising conspiracy at the center.', 'Refugees from a war-torn country start showing up to seek asylum in an American town. Only the country these people are from is America and the war they are fleeing is 250 years in the future. The local sheriff with a past, a federal agent and a mother in search of her missing refugee daughter drive this allegory with a surprising conspiracy at the center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvoSPs6We2u88mXz2vSqjbd4kQ0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71383'),
  ('411214586418705722', 'The Crossover', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kwame Alexander', null, 'Derek Luke, Jalyn Hall, Amir O''Neil, Sabrina Revelle, Deja Monique Cruz, Trevor Raine Bush, Daveed Diggs, Skyla I''Lece', 'TV-PG', 'The coming-of-age story of basketball prodigy twins Filthy (aka Josh) and JB who learn that even though they have so much that binds them together growing up is all about discovering what makes us unique.', 'The coming-of-age story of basketball prodigy twins Filthy (aka Josh) and JB who learn that even though they have so much that binds them together growing up is all about discovering what makes us unique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahL7MXhqvTul41uRrKaxycJhbUQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121183'),
  ('283944614707909600', 'The Crow Girl', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Milly Thomas', null, 'Eve Myles, Katherine Kelly, Clara Rugaard, Elliot Edusah, Dougray Scott, Victoria Hamilton, Raphael Sowole, Chloe Sweetlove', null, 'DCI Jeanette Kilburn and eminent psychotherapist Dr. Sophia Craven join forces to hunt the killer of young men. The investigation takes Jeanette and Sophia into a dangerous world of historic abuse and murder.', 'DCI Jeanette Kilburn and eminent psychotherapist Dr. Sophia Craven join forces to hunt the killer of young men. The investigation takes Jeanette and Sophia into a dangerous world of historic abuse and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vCFSNwql5Be5W1LrS7hGVZYnbm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248698'),
  ('326577796840899868', 'The Crow Road', 1996, 'Drama', null, 'Bryan Elsley', 'Joseph McFadden, Bill Paterson, Peter Capaldi, Dougray Scott, Claire Nielson, Valerie Edmond, Stella Gonet, David Robb', null, 'History student Prentice returns home to attend his grandmother’s funeral. As the McHoan family gathers together to mark the solemn occasion, old disagreements continue to fester and old acquaintances are renewed. Following the unexpected death of another close relative, Prentice begins to question the past: why did his Uncle Rory suddenly disappear and where did he go? Reading his Uncle Rory’s unpublished novel may provide the answers he is seeking but it also unearths some dark family secrets he didn’t bargain for.', 'History student Prentice returns home to attend his grandmother’s funeral. As the McHoan family gathers together to mark the solemn occasion, old disagreements continue to fester and old acquaintances are renewed. Following the unexpected death of another close relative, Prentice begins to question the past: why did his Uncle Rory suddenly disappear and where did he go? Reading his Uncle Rory’s unpublished novel may provide the answers he is seeking but it also unearths some dark family secrets he didn’t bargain for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9EZvEFtLdrMd7zs3iEZnke7Duc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13856'),
  ('415508309202655325', 'The Crow: Stairway to Heaven', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Crime', 'Bryce Zabel', null, 'Mark Dacascos, Katie Stuart, Sabine Karsenti, Marc Gomes, Johnny Cuthbert, Lynda Boyd, Julie Dreyfus, John Pyper-Ferguson', null, 'The Crow: Stairway to Heaven was a 1998 Canadian television series created by Bryce Zabel spun off from the The Crow film series starring Mark Dacascos in the lead role as Eric Draven, reprising the role originally played by Brandon Lee in the 1994 film The Crow.', 'The Crow: Stairway to Heaven was a 1998 Canadian television series created by Bryce Zabel spun off from the The Crow film series starring Mark Dacascos in the lead role as Eric Draven, reprising the role originally played by Brandon Lee in the 1994 film The Crow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tUsu4z4GzTf1iXFuU3OsdawaMO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13821'),
  ('134299705307121478', 'The Crowded Room', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Akiva Goldsman', null, 'Tom Holland, Amanda Seyfried, Sasha Lane, Will Chase, Lior Raz, Emmy Rossum, Thomas Sadoski', 'TV-MA', 'In 1979 Manhattan, a young man is arrested for a shocking crime — and an unlikely investigator must solve the mystery behind it.', 'In 1979 Manhattan, a young man is arrested for a shocking crime — and an unlikely investigator must solve the mystery behind it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRmopCFp0j1eJGbILLsYsYzxmL8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123192'),
  ('326979464323169063', 'The Crown', 2016, 'Drama', 'Peter Morgan', null, 'Imelda Staunton, Jonathan Pryce, Lesley Manville, Dominic West, Claudia Harrison, Marcia Warren', 'TV-MA', 'The gripping, decades-spanning inside story of Her Majesty Queen Elizabeth II and the Prime Ministers who shaped Britain''s post-war destiny. The Crown tells the inside story of two of the most famous addresses in the world – Buckingham Palace and 10 Downing Street – and the intrigues, love lives and machinations behind the great events that shaped the second half of the 20th century. Two houses, two courts, one Crown.', 'The gripping, decades-spanning inside story of Her Majesty Queen Elizabeth II and the Prime Ministers who shaped Britain''s post-war destiny. The Crown tells the inside story of two of the most famous addresses in the world – Buckingham Palace and 10 Downing Street – and the intrigues, love lives and machinations behind the great events that shaped the second half of the 20th century. Two houses, two courts, one Crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1M876KPjulVwppEpldhdc8V4o68.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:65494'),
  ('358761689774721236', 'The Crown of the Kings', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Vasyl Vasylyk, Antoni Sałaj, Grażyna Szapołowska, Zbigniew Suszyński, Katarzyna Czapla, Kamil Siegmund, Małgorzata Buczkowska, Dorota Naruszewicz', null, 'Piasts'' reign is coming to end on Casimir the Great, who have no sons. Polish throne comes to Anjous. Thanks to the marriage of Saint Jadwiga of Poland with Lithuanian Grand Duke Jogaila, an alliance is made and a new dynasty - Jagiellons, who rule Poland for next two hundred years', 'Piasts'' reign is coming to end on Casimir the Great, who have no sons. Polish throne comes to Anjous. Thanks to the marriage of Saint Jadwiga of Poland with Lithuanian Grand Duke Jogaila, an alliance is made and a new dynasty - Jagiellons, who rule Poland for next two hundred years', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPx4pZVi2SwWbq0apgpJwfAZqW6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:77652'),
  ('1050160320413984548', 'The Crown Princess', 2018, 'Drama, Soap', null, 'Nuttiya Sirakornwilai', 'Nadech Kugimiya, Urassaya Sperbund, Sara Legge, Cindy Sirinya Bishop, Sakuntala Teinpairoj, JeeJa Yanin, Parisaya Jaronetisat, Nithichai Yotamornsunthorn', null, 'The main heroine - a princess of a small country, comes into danger after her coronation. To protect her they send her to Thailand, where the main hero - a navy man- becomes her bodyguard.', 'The main heroine - a princess of a small country, comes into danger after her coronation. To protect her they send her to Thailand, where the main hero - a navy man- becomes her bodyguard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiD97qpHPljSdeNAUuN1aYJtQb8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79504'),
  ('1028514267484726811', 'The Crowned Clown', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Kim Hee-won', null, 'Yeo Jin-goo, Lee Se-young, Kim Sang-kyung, Jeong Hye-young, Jang Kwang, Kwon Hae-hyo, Jang Young-nam, Yoon Kyung-ho', null, 'The story takes place at a time in Joseon history, when upheaval and power struggles surrounding the throne had reached extreme levels. In order to escape those who plan to assassinate him, the king puts a clown, who looks exactly like him, on the throne.', 'The story takes place at a time in Joseon history, when upheaval and power struggles surrounding the throne had reached extreme levels. In order to escape those who plan to assassinate him, the king puts a clown, who looks exactly like him, on the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UxIBzQV4AYtNLdO4Z9ewhrm6ra.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85405'),
  ('17926469235463003', 'The Cry', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Jenna Coleman, Ewen Leslie, Asher Keddie, Markella Kavenagh, Stella Gonet, Sophie Kennedy Clark, Shareena Clanton, Alex Dimitriades', 'TV-14', 'The disappearance of a baby from a small coastal town in Australia is the catalyst for a journey into the disintegrating psychology of a young couple as they deal with an unthinkable tragedy under both the white light of public scrutiny and behind closed doors.', 'The disappearance of a baby from a small coastal town in Australia is the catalyst for a journey into the disintegrating psychology of a young couple as they deal with an unthinkable tragedy under both the white light of public scrutiny and behind closed doors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7Qdjk9jBSkZM3Zobfj2ua2pw7r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82681'),
  ('843329531650805149', 'The Cry of the Butterflies', 2023, 'Drama', 'Juan Pablo Buscarini', 'Juan Pablo Buscarini, Azucena Rodríguez, Ricardo Rodríguez', 'Sandy Hernández, Luis Alberto García, Susana Abaitua, Belén Rueda, Guillermo Toledo, Mercedes Sampietro, Héctor Noas, Maridalia Hernández', null, 'This series examines the events leading up the brutal murder of Dominican activist Minerva Mirabal and her two activist sisters, on the orders of dictator Rafael Leónidas Trujillo. The heinous crime would set in motion not only the end of a vicious regime, but also come to mark the global fight against gender-based violence.', 'This series examines the events leading up the brutal murder of Dominican activist Minerva Mirabal and her two activist sisters, on the orders of dictator Rafael Leónidas Trujillo. The heinous crime would set in motion not only the end of a vicious regime, but also come to mark the global fight against gender-based violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRA53hPBcgE679HzzUdpcjDUUJR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128300'),
  ('150906784439137229', 'The Crystal Cuckoo', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Javier Castillo, Jesús Mesas Silva, Javier Andrés Roig', null, 'Catalina Sopelana, Itziar Ituño, Álex García, Ivan Massagué, Tomás del Estal, Alfons Nieto', 'TV-MA', 'Hoping to learn more about her heart donor, a young doctor arrives in a mountain town where decades of mysterious tragedies plague the small community.', 'Hoping to learn more about her heart donor, a young doctor arrives in a mountain town where decades of mysterious tragedies plague the small community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsY3Kl793m2sXTMkQTajz0EOqCl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274979'),
  ('1097016763392672433', 'The Crystal Maze', 1990, 'Reality', 'Jacques Antoine', null, 'Edward Tudor-Pole', null, 'The Crystal Maze was a British game show, produced by Chatsworth Television and shown on Channel 4 in the United Kingdom between 15 February 1990 and 10 August 1995. The series is set in "The Crystal Maze", which features four different "zones" set in various periods of time and space. A team of six contestants take part in a series of challenges in order to win "time crystals". Each crystal gives the team five seconds of time inside "The Crystal Dome", the centrepiece of the maze where the contestants take part in their final challenge.', 'The Crystal Maze was a British game show, produced by Chatsworth Television and shown on Channel 4 in the United Kingdom between 15 February 1990 and 10 August 1995. The series is set in "The Crystal Maze", which features four different "zones" set in various periods of time and space. A team of six contestants take part in a series of challenges in order to win "time crystals". Each crystal gives the team five seconds of time inside "The Crystal Dome", the centrepiece of the maze where the contestants take part in their final challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLRwVzGLErkNcsQkzOkfiwQCbaW.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2818'),
  ('720981303106762748', 'The Cuba Libre Story', 2015, 'Documentary', null, 'Emmanuel Amara, Kai Christiansen, Florian Dedio', 'Ken Eaken', 'TV-14', 'Recounts the tumultuous history of Cuba, a nation of foreign conquest, freedom fighters and Cold War political machinations.', 'Recounts the tumultuous history of Cuba, a nation of foreign conquest, freedom fighters and Cold War political machinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZNQiTu0YQaYotPmGztgm8p7cqC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65867'),
  ('222286496395618967', 'The Culture of Sex', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Rodrigo Jarpa', null, 'Nathalie Nicloux, Rodrigo Jarpa', 'TV-MA', 'The odyssey of Rodrigo Jarpa, a remarkable and charismatic sexologist who, together with Nathalie Nicloux, a comedian and actress, travels around the world discovering new ways to live and practice sexuality. Each episode is an X-ray of some city and goes deep into a predetermined topic, seen from the local culture, customs and local perspective.', 'The odyssey of Rodrigo Jarpa, a remarkable and charismatic sexologist who, together with Nathalie Nicloux, a comedian and actress, travels around the world discovering new ways to live and practice sexuality. Each episode is an X-ray of some city and goes deep into a predetermined topic, seen from the local culture, customs and local perspective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3MF6CvDNGGUV7Pjy7FRzDYY8TQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106660'),
  ('924784071558104469', 'The Cuphead Show!', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Dave Wasson', null, 'Tru Valentino, Frank Todaro', 'TV-Y7', 'Follow the misadventures of the impulsive Cuphead and his cautious but persuadable brother Mugman in this animated series based on the hit video game.', 'Follow the misadventures of the impulsive Cuphead and his cautious but persuadable brother Mugman in this animated series based on the hit video game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6nGUyxKCi7ODvyfc8qQShliVEd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:103786'),
  ('54328549072193549', 'The Curious Case of Natalia Grace', 2023, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Nicole DePaul, Mackenzie DePaul', 'TV-14', 'This stranger-than-fiction series explores the question of whether Natalia Barnett is an exploited Ukrainian child with dwarfism or a dangerous adult masquerading as a child. Featuring exclusive bombshell interviews with members of Natalia''s adoptive family, relatives, friends, legal experts, and neighbors, this docuseries offers a never-before-seen glimpse into the Barnett family, Natalia''s identity, Michael Barnett''s October 2022 trial, as well as key insights into new theories and evidence.', 'This stranger-than-fiction series explores the question of whether Natalia Barnett is an exploited Ukrainian child with dwarfism or a dangerous adult masquerading as a child. Featuring exclusive bombshell interviews with members of Natalia''s adoptive family, relatives, friends, legal experts, and neighbors, this docuseries offers a never-before-seen glimpse into the Barnett family, Natalia''s identity, Michael Barnett''s October 2022 trial, as well as key insights into new theories and evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nob2INC40ytwbMnHC2bneDz9k5D.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:226706'),
  ('883129012440562103', 'The Curious Creations of Christine McConnell', 2018, 'Comedy, Talk, Reality', null, null, 'Christine McConnell, Colleen Smith, Adam Mayfield', 'TV-PG', 'Wickedly talented baker and artist Christine McConnell fills her home with haunting confections, creepy crafts -- and wildly inappropriate creatures.', 'Wickedly talented baker and artist Christine McConnell fills her home with haunting confections, creepy crafts -- and wildly inappropriate creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81BS0vEbWOfsAVo9ln9OAnXLUtd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81284'),
  ('768857596949656879', 'The Curse', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'James de Frond, Tom Davis, Hugo Chegwin', null, 'Steve Stamp, Emer Kenny, Abraham Popoola, Thérèse Bradley, Michael Smiley', null, 'In 1980s East London, a gang of hopeless crooks become embroiled in a major gold heist.', 'In 1980s East London, a gang of hopeless crooks become embroiled in a major gold heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGr8ulZ31zzidZUHxihjgNCxbjR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:156861'),
