  ('876810851332558880', 'The Curse of Oak Island', 2014, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Reality, Documentary', 'Kevin Burns', null, 'Rick Lagina, Marty Lagina, Robert Clotworthy, Gary Drayton', 'TV-PG', 'Follow brothers Marty and Rick Lagina through their effort to find the speculated - and as of yet undiscovered - buried treasure believed to have been concealed through extraordinary means on Oak Island.', 'Follow brothers Marty and Rick Lagina through their effort to find the speculated - and as of yet undiscovered - buried treasure believed to have been concealed through extraordinary means on Oak Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtkxUUmHDF31iDUOlxQqUXmiU71.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:60603'),
  ('866149328682309880', 'The Cursed', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yeon Sang-ho', 'Yeon Sang-ho', 'Uhm Ji-won, Sung Dong-il, Cho Min-soo, Jung Zi-so, Jung Moon-sung, Kim Min-jae, Kim In-kwon, Ko Kyu-pil', 'TV-MA', 'Im Jin Hee is a gung ho reporter, out to do the ring thing. She covers a violent case involving Forest, the biggest IT company in South Korea. The chairman of Forest is Jin Jong Hyun. He relies heavily on shamanism. During her investigation, Im Jin Hee learns of a spiritual consulting company that is affiliated with Forest. The head of that affiliate company is Jin Kyung. While trying to reveal the secret behind Forest, Im Jin Hee meets So Jin. She is possessed by a spirit and she has a special ability.', 'Im Jin Hee is a gung ho reporter, out to do the ring thing. She covers a violent case involving Forest, the biggest IT company in South Korea. The chairman of Forest is Jin Jong Hyun. He relies heavily on shamanism. During her investigation, Im Jin Hee learns of a spiritual consulting company that is affiliated with Forest. The head of that affiliate company is Jin Kyung. While trying to reveal the secret behind Forest, Im Jin Hee meets So Jin. She is possessed by a spirit and she has a special ability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZkWOHIdSDskDhlVthEuX60vWK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97488'),
  ('599796319751205622', 'The Cyanide & Happiness Show', 2014, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Rob DenBleyker, Matt Melvin, Kris Wilson', null, 'Mike Salcedo, Dave McElfatrick, Rob DenBleyker, Kris Wilson', null, 'Following the success of its webcomic and occasional animated shorts, Cyanide & Happiness has debuted its animated show. After a very successful Kickstarter campaign, the creators of the popular comic (Kris Wilson, Rob DenBleyker, Matt Melvin, Dave McElfatrick) have released a much longer show that’s essentially a collection of animated sketches with some recurring themes throughout.', 'Following the success of its webcomic and occasional animated shorts, Cyanide & Happiness has debuted its animated show. After a very successful Kickstarter campaign, the creators of the popular comic (Kris Wilson, Rob DenBleyker, Matt Melvin, Dave McElfatrick) have released a much longer show that’s essentially a collection of animated sketches with some recurring themes throughout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IaXQ40ri9fz4IoE1E7MnorL5Xw.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61858'),
  ('653901306847671558', 'The Cyberfarm', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Sergei Vasiliev', null, 'Sergey Chikhachyov, Grigoriy Skryapkin, Olga Zhevakina, Margarita Silaeva, Vlada Lukina, Artyom Semakin, Elena Makhova, Igor Bogomyagkov', 'TV-PG', 'Farmer Nikolay has long ago settled on Mars with his family. He leads a peaceful life and tends to his robot-aided farmstead until the Head of a large corporation comes to Mars to get rid of the village and launch a new production line.', 'Farmer Nikolay has long ago settled on Mars with his family. He leads a peaceful life and tends to his robot-aided farmstead until the Head of a large corporation comes to Mars to get rid of the village and launch a new production line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVonRPPVUtOnQEGc1m8ouPpHMU1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:232377'),
  ('469602309882421288', 'The D''Amelio Show', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Charli D''Amelio, Dixie D''Amelio, Heidi D''Amelio, Marc D''Amelio', 'TV-14', 'From relative obscurity and a seemingly normal life, to overnight success and thrust into the Hollywood limelight overnight, the D’Amelios are faced with new challenges and opportunities they could not have imagined.', 'From relative obscurity and a seemingly normal life, to overnight success and thrust into the Hollywood limelight overnight, the D’Amelios are faced with new challenges and opportunities they could not have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TMOWefVY5854oxEI0I6yLLMwlR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:130392'),
  ('453771829634241044', 'The Daily Life of a Middle-Aged Online Shopper in Another World', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Junichi Suwabe, Misaki Kuno, Miyu Tomita, Yu Kobayashi, Kaede Hondo', 'TV-14', 'Kenichi Hamada is just a regular, middle-aged man working as an illustrator in Japan. One day, he is transported to another world and wakes to find himself in the middle of a dangerous forest filled with ravenous monsters. He quickly discovers a massive online shopping site that can deliver him exactly what he needs. Join Kenichi on his search for relaxation in a new world!', 'Kenichi Hamada is just a regular, middle-aged man working as an illustrator in Japan. One day, he is transported to another world and wakes to find himself in the middle of a dangerous forest filled with ravenous monsters. He quickly discovers a massive online shopping site that can deliver him exactly what he needs. Join Kenichi on his search for relaxation in a new world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rr079GvB0pgzkGnKFTSk7519dDR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261745'),
  ('1081067154739863234', 'The Daily Life of the Immortal King', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Xuan Ku', null, 'Sun Lulu, Qian Chen, Yin Long, Gu Jiangshan, Titus Jin, Guo Haoran, Shuai Guan', 'TV-14', 'As a cultivation genius who has achieved a new realm every two years since he was a year old, Wang Ling is a near-invincible existence with prowess far beyond his control. But now that he’s sixteen, he faces his greatest battle yet – Senior High School. With one challenge after another popping up, his plans for a low-key high school life seem further and further away…', 'As a cultivation genius who has achieved a new realm every two years since he was a year old, Wang Ling is a near-invincible existence with prowess far beyond his control. But now that he’s sixteen, he faces his greatest battle yet – Senior High School. With one challenge after another popping up, his plans for a low-key high school life seem further and further away…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7By0jV3kf9MVvv3X3K8u4mhRUwp.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:98123'),
  ('928203394335638960', 'The Daily Show', 1996, 'News, Comedy', 'Lizz Winstead, Madeleine Smithberg', null, null, 'TV-14', 'The World''s Fakest News Team tackle the biggest stories in news, politics and pop culture.', 'The World''s Fakest News Team tackle the biggest stories in news, politics and pop culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixcfyK7it6FjRM36Te4OdblAq4X.jpg', 31, 'tmdb:tv:2224'),
  ('828256891141384107', 'The Daltons', 2010, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Jean-François Henry, Olivier Jean-Marie', null, 'Christophe Lemoine, Bruno Flender, Julien Cafaro, Bernard Alane, François Morel, Stéphane Ronchewski', 'TV-Y', 'Unshackle your laughing gas, put your ball and chain away, take a prison break and get ready to escape with the Daltons! The fab four are back! The Daltons will try every trick in the books to get out and then some: a maze of tunnels, explosives, hot air balloons and rain dances, and a whole cast of zany characters to help them get free ... or not! The only thing they don’t try using are their brains! But what they lack in intelligence, they sure make up for in willpower and imagination! The far west has never been crazier!', 'Unshackle your laughing gas, put your ball and chain away, take a prison break and get ready to escape with the Daltons! The fab four are back! The Daltons will try every trick in the books to get out and then some: a maze of tunnels, explosives, hot air balloons and rain dances, and a whole cast of zany characters to help them get free ... or not! The only thing they don’t try using are their brains! But what they lack in intelligence, they sure make up for in willpower and imagination! The far west has never been crazier!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKSD0Qg8EejWzhiqBoXBodPwYnL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66219'),
  ('459557128429169475', 'The Damage Report with John Iadarola', 2018, 'News', null, null, 'John Iadarola, Francesca Fiorentini, Jayar Jackson, Brett Erlich', null, 'Welcome to The Damage Report with John Iadarola, your daily breakdown of the true threats and challenges facing our country and our world. John Iadarola hosts an unflinching, no-holds-barred look at the damage the Trump administration is causing.', 'Welcome to The Damage Report with John Iadarola, your daily breakdown of the true threats and challenges facing our country and our world. John Iadarola hosts an unflinching, no-holds-barred look at the damage the Trump administration is causing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckJWPg2f9F0oJSvjInHi4Mk6Lrz.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:115992'),
