  ('141131167538343497', 'The Dance of Passion', 2006, 'Drama', null, null, 'Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Gigi Lai Chi, Moses Chan Ho, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Maggie Shiu, Rebecca Chan, Tsui Wing', null, 'With almost the same cast and crew as War And Beauty, And the extensive location filming in Yinchuan, The Dance Of Passion is going to be another great legend in TV history! Across the Loess Plateau… Is a story of family feuds and furtive passions! On the Loess Plateau of Shanbei live two clans, the YIMs and the SUNGs. The SUNGs have been relying on the YIMs and a lasting peace has been going on for three generations. But this situation cannot continue when YIM MAN-HEI (LAM, BOWIE) becomes the Superintendent. His rise to power has drawn the clans into serious conflict. SUNG TUNG-SING (CHAN HO, MOSES) who falls in love with a widow has suffered the cruelest punishment, the Penalty of Torching, for his affair, as ordered by HEI. SING’s lover is burnt to death while SING is expelled from YIM’s clan...', 'With almost the same cast and crew as War And Beauty, And the extensive location filming in Yinchuan, The Dance Of Passion is going to be another great legend in TV history! Across the Loess Plateau… Is a story of family feuds and furtive passions! On the Loess Plateau of Shanbei live two clans, the YIMs and the SUNGs. The SUNGs have been relying on the YIMs and a lasting peace has been going on for three generations. But this situation cannot continue when YIM MAN-HEI (LAM, BOWIE) becomes the Superintendent. His rise to power has drawn the clans into serious conflict. SUNG TUNG-SING (CHAN HO, MOSES) who falls in love with a widow has suffered the cruelest punishment, the Penalty of Torching, for his affair, as ordered by HEI. SING’s lover is burnt to death while SING is expelled from YIM’s clan...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzBihgshMN5XFXUQpV3X6k6ecjP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98346'),
  ('103579388290521773', 'The Dandy', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mauricio Cruz, Chava Cartas', 'Rodrigo Ordoñez, Larissa Andrade', 'Itahisa Machado, Dagoberto Gama, Damián Alcázar, Alfonso Herrera, Luis de Alba, Aleyda Gallardo, Claudio Roca', null, 'Inspired by the 1997 American drama Donnie Brasco, El Dandy tells the story of a law professor who has been hired by the Attorney General, to participate in a program of special operations, where you must infiltrate one of the most notorious drug cartels of Mexico City. Under the false name Daniel "El Dandy" Bracho, begins the task of identifying all the members of this clandestine network. However, he quickly finds that his acute ability to police work is only comparable with the exciting sense of danger that experiences living life to the fullest. Along the way, it avails itself of the help of a criminal''s petty, loyal, even corrupt, called El Chueco, who quickly befriends Bracho and comes dangerously close to discover his true identity. Much deeper Bracho is involved in the mafia, more work tells him to get out, and the professor once incorruptible has to choose between returning to a normal life as a respectable citizen or fully embrace his criminal life.', 'Inspired by the 1997 American drama Donnie Brasco, El Dandy tells the story of a law professor who has been hired by the Attorney General, to participate in a program of special operations, where you must infiltrate one of the most notorious drug cartels of Mexico City. Under the false name Daniel "El Dandy" Bracho, begins the task of identifying all the members of this clandestine network. However, he quickly finds that his acute ability to police work is only comparable with the exciting sense of danger that experiences living life to the fullest. Along the way, it avails itself of the help of a criminal''s petty, loyal, even corrupt, called El Chueco, who quickly befriends Bracho and comes dangerously close to discover his true identity. Much deeper Bracho is involved in the mafia, more work tells him to get out, and the professor once incorruptible has to choose between returning to a normal life as a respectable citizen or fully embrace his criminal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an8NFIDiL0L4HgZ5gpBrqalRKOE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64566'),
  ('1036365878272205501', 'The Dangerous Book for Boys', 2018, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Greg Mottola, Bryan Cranston', null, 'Chris Diamantopoulos, Gabriel Bateman, Drew Powell, Kyan Zielinski, Erinn Hayes, Swoosie Kurtz', 'TV-Y7', 'The story of a middle-class family coping with the sudden passing of their beloved patriarch Patrick, a whimsical inventor who touched the lives of all who knew him. Devastated, his family finds hope in a guide book he created for his sons.', 'The story of a middle-class family coping with the sudden passing of their beloved patriarch Patrick, a whimsical inventor who touched the lives of all who knew him. Devastated, his family finds hope in a guide book he created for his sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sU4tfnvxpqDwr4n4usyNYrjdtQ8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77345'),
  ('140444491049120319', 'The Dangers in My Heart', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Shun Horie, Hina Youmiya', 'TV-14', 'Kyotaro Ichikawa, a boy barely clinging to the bottom rung of his school''s social ladder, secretly believes he’s the tortured lead in some psychological thriller. He spends his days dreaming up ways to disrupt his classmates'' peaceful lives and pining after Anna Yamada, the class idol. But Kyotaro''s not nearly the troubled teen he pretends to be…and it turns out Anna''s a bit odd herself!', 'Kyotaro Ichikawa, a boy barely clinging to the bottom rung of his school''s social ladder, secretly believes he’s the tortured lead in some psychological thriller. He spends his days dreaming up ways to disrupt his classmates'' peaceful lives and pining after Anna Yamada, the class idol. But Kyotaro''s not nearly the troubled teen he pretends to be…and it turns out Anna''s a bit odd herself!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKhMmREBOKXtp3tlv9rnLRxZec5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207250'),
  ('956020798285932130', 'The Danish Woman', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Benedikt Erlingsson, Ólafur Egill Egilsson', 'Benedikt Erlingsson, Ólafur Egill Egilsson', 'Trine Dyrholm, Hilmar Guðjónsson, Halldóra Geirharðsdóttir, Besir Zeciri, Jens Albinus, Kristín Þóra Haraldsdóttir, Hjálmar Hjálmarsson, Björn Thors', null, 'Having just retired from the Danish Secret Service, Ditte Jensen has settled into a small apartment building in Reykjavík. Possessing a strong sense of justice, she doesn''t hesitate to get involved in her neighbours'' problems and help them.', 'Having just retired from the Danish Secret Service, Ditte Jensen has settled into a small apartment building in Reykjavík. Possessing a strong sense of justice, she doesn''t hesitate to get involved in her neighbours'' problems and help them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5x87ouELGhodhvN5KjboZwWpDj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287740'),
  ('570143356288334095', 'The Danny Thomas Show', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Melville Shavelson', null, 'Danny Thomas, Marjorie Lord, Rusty Hamer, Angela Cartwright', 'TV-G', 'Danny Thomas, an entertainer, tries to balance his home life with the needs of his career, with hilarious results.', 'Danny Thomas, an entertainer, tries to balance his home life with the needs of his career, with hilarious results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2ovIZjDq2PelProVtBXmK2SkkY.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:981'),
  ('300152349930531725', 'The Dark Charisma of Adolf Hitler', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Laurence Rees', 'Laurence Rees', 'Herbert Forthuber, Stefan Gilly, Peter Kollmann', null, 'Adolf Hitler is infamous today as a war criminal - arguably one of the worst war criminals in history. Yet during the 1930s he was loved by millions of Germans. How was this possible? In this fascinating series, award-winning historian and documentary maker Laurence Rees examines the background to Hitler''s ''charismatic'' rule.', 'Adolf Hitler is infamous today as a war criminal - arguably one of the worst war criminals in history. Yet during the 1930s he was loved by millions of Germans. How was this possible? In this fascinating series, award-winning historian and documentary maker Laurence Rees examines the background to Hitler''s ''charismatic'' rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSi9nD7DydjEBzHYQigBounbIXl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55585'),
  ('357968401535021174', 'The Dark Crystal: Age of Resistance', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Family', 'Jeffrey Addiss, Will Matthews', null, 'Taron Egerton, Anya Taylor-Joy, Nathalie Emmanuel, Donna Kimball, Jason Isaacs, Dave Chapman, Olly Taylor, Helena Smee', 'TV-PG', 'Return to the world of Thra, where three Gelfling discover the horrifying secret behind the Skeksis'' power and set out to ignite the fires of rebellion and save their world.', 'Return to the world of Thra, where three Gelfling discover the horrifying secret behind the Skeksis'' power and set out to ignite the fires of rebellion and save their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnMJ7mBC8Jx4emaj7TE4TU0Qm92.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71809'),
  ('105752949688448520', 'The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshino Aoyama, Mao Ichimichi, Shohei Komatsu, Makoto Furukawa, Shunichi Toki, Arthur Lounsbery, Atsushi Tamaru, Tomoaki Maeno', 'TV-14', 'Konoha Satou’s dark fictional past becomes her reality when she’s reincarnated as Iana Magnolia, the villainess of her own adolescent fantasy. Now as a role she meticulously designed to be despicable, remembering every last detail is now a matter of life and death. Will she be able to rewrite her character’s fate into something peaceful?', 'Konoha Satou’s dark fictional past becomes her reality when she’s reincarnated as Iana Magnolia, the villainess of her own adolescent fantasy. Now as a role she meticulously designed to be despicable, remembering every last detail is now a matter of life and death. Will she be able to rewrite her character’s fate into something peaceful?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrAx1DmfnZjTs2NKsljqd60Kg9X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286404'),
  ('637130257086919889', 'The Dark Romance', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Xue Xiaolu', 'Sun Li, Wu Kang-ren, Wang Ge, Chen Xixu, Tao Hui, Chen Tianyu, Wu Nien-hsuan, Liao Yinyue', null, 'While investigating her best friend’s suicide, single mother Yan Ling is drawn into a dangerous web of emotional manipulation. As love and betrayal become entangled, she begins to recognize the truth, break free from control, and reclaim her life.', 'While investigating her best friend’s suicide, single mother Yan Ling is drawn into a dangerous web of emotional manipulation. As love and betrayal become entangled, she begins to recognize the truth, break free from control, and reclaim her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b20DhmJR1CPQJXIEwU22BJHF94u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273151'),
  ('898624562784225375', 'The Dark Side of Porn', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Sarfraz Manzoor, Jan Wellmann', null, 'Bernard Rose, John Simm', null, 'This documentary series examines the adult entertainment industry.', 'This documentary series examines the adult entertainment industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PXRyFZ0THuG2KdYnwCBM3I7vrj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1268'),
  ('595744968148302660', 'The Dark Wizard', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Peter Mortimer, Nick Rosen', null, 'Dean Potter', null, 'An unflinching portrait of Dean Potter, the world''s most influential and controversial climber, base jumper and highline walker, who achieves jaw-dropping feats while battling his inner demons.', 'An unflinching portrait of Dean Potter, the world''s most influential and controversial climber, base jumper and highline walker, who achieves jaw-dropping feats while battling his inner demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGbsQ6fhZPBhx9kgN0utAIyGRry.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316527'),
  ('503396101881277796', 'The Darkest Hour', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Alexander Shcherbakov', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Andrey Burkovskiy, Artur Smolyaninov, Maksim Belborodov, Artur Vakha, Vladimir Zaytsev, Mariya Lisovaya, Agniya Ditkovskite', null, 'A post WWII criminal drama, masterfully filmed and produced. Fantastic performance, great historical details and ambience immerse the viewers into the atmosphere of post-war USSR. At the same time, the show has a modern edge thanks to the detailed characters’ psychology and backstory. The war is over but the life is far from being back to normal. It is now the war on crime and Lieutenant Denis Zhuravlev must unholster his gun and protect the safety of civilians. He has to go undercover and become a member of a brutal local gang. He is in and he’s risking his life to stop the murders and heists, but then the plot takes a very dangerous, unpredictable turn. The project is a true gem for audiences worldwide.', 'A post WWII criminal drama, masterfully filmed and produced. Fantastic performance, great historical details and ambience immerse the viewers into the atmosphere of post-war USSR. At the same time, the show has a modern edge thanks to the detailed characters’ psychology and backstory. The war is over but the life is far from being back to normal. It is now the war on crime and Lieutenant Denis Zhuravlev must unholster his gun and protect the safety of civilians. He has to go undercover and become a member of a brutal local gang. He is in and he’s risking his life to stop the murders and heists, but then the plot takes a very dangerous, unpredictable turn. The project is a true gem for audiences worldwide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtkzVYMsGCLYUjbEXCjmfAaZ8oV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126998'),
  ('997958432687220764', 'The Darkness', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Lasse Hallström', null, 'Lena Olin, Árni Þór Lárusson, Þorsteinn Bachmann, Sólveig Guðmundsdóttir, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Álfrún Laufeyjardóttir, Thorvaldur Kristjansson, Douglas Henshall', null, 'Special investigator DI Hulda Hermannsdóttir tackles one last cold case before forced into early retirement. This one relates the mysterious and shocking murder of a young Russian asylum seeker a year prior.', 'Special investigator DI Hulda Hermannsdóttir tackles one last cold case before forced into early retirement. This one relates the mysterious and shocking murder of a young Russian asylum seeker a year prior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaPrG1yhXz1SE1cHUu4lmWAlZDR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275694'),
  ('142855222775831455', 'The Darling Buds of May', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'David Jason, Pam Ferris, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Philip Franks, Stephanie Ralph, Rachel Bell, Abigail Rokison', null, 'An idyllic picture of 1950''s rural England as seen through the lives of the Larkins, a farm family living in Kent. The show revolves around Pa Larkin, a man of a kind and mischievous nature with a penchant for getting into scrapes and talking his way out of them with equal equanimity; and his daughters, as they deal with growing up and discovering the joys and sorrows of young love.', 'An idyllic picture of 1950''s rural England as seen through the lives of the Larkins, a farm family living in Kent. The show revolves around Pa Larkin, a man of a kind and mischievous nature with a penchant for getting into scrapes and talking his way out of them with equal equanimity; and his daughters, as they deal with growing up and discovering the joys and sorrows of young love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88JSDfXpyLhs4gk1248HusyIFKo.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2062'),
  ('539793435636572573', 'The Darwin Incident', 2026, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Atsumi Tanezaki, Mitsuho Kambe, Akio Otsuka, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Rina Sato, Yoji Ueda, Kaito Ishikawa, Hiroya Egashira', null, 'Charlie is one of a kind. As a half-human, half-chimpanzee Humanzee, his intellect and physical prowess is off the charts. Which is why The Animal Liberation Alliance, a terrorist group, wants him. And they will take extreme measures to get him. However, Charlie is determined to fight back for the sake of his loved ones.', 'Charlie is one of a kind. As a half-human, half-chimpanzee Humanzee, his intellect and physical prowess is off the charts. Which is why The Animal Liberation Alliance, a terrorist group, wants him. And they will take extreme measures to get him. However, Charlie is determined to fight back for the sake of his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hLo3uSeGx6vDtnOPQcq7sVBzsL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255064'),
  ('408701861451949040', 'The Daughter of God: Dalma Maradona', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Dalma Maradona, Diego Maradona', null, 'Dalma Maradona travels to the places she shared with her father and tries to understand how she came to be called "the daughter of God."', 'Dalma Maradona travels to the places she shared with her father and tries to understand how she came to be called "the daughter of God."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYGAvlLCaSIW5DwLSbYzR3bAwH6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237727'),
  ('912214036311463821', 'The Dawn of the Witch', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shuichiro Umeda, Miho Okasaki, Sayumi Suzushiro, Taku Yashiro, Yumiri Hanamori, Masaaki Yano, Masaaki Mizunaka, You Taichi', 'TV-14', 'Saybil can''t remember his life before he joined the magic academy. He has the lowest grades, because his amnesia leaves him unmotivated. One day, the school headmaster, Albus, orders him to participate in a dangerous special training. "I want you to spread the use of magic in an area where they hold witch hunts." This story is a spin-off of ''Grimoire of Zero.''', 'Saybil can''t remember his life before he joined the magic academy. He has the lowest grades, because his amnesia leaves him unmotivated. One day, the school headmaster, Albus, orders him to participate in a dangerous special training. "I want you to spread the use of magic in an area where they hold witch hunts." This story is a spin-off of ''Grimoire of Zero.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfBTEhNt6NBChu0rryz6WojsDMw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124363'),
  ('602118953479215516', 'The Day', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Julie Mahieu, Jonas Geirnaert', 'Jonas Geirnaert, Julie Mahieu', 'Sofie Decleir, Maaike Neuville, Titus De Voogdt, Jeroen Perceval, Zouzou Ben Chikha, Johan van Assche, Dominique Van Malder, Katelijne Verbeke', null, 'The nerve-racking events of a cold winter''s day, seen from two different perspectives. The odd episodes tell the story of a team of police negotiators and special forces who respond to a hostage crisis in a small bank branch. The even episodes tell exactly the same events, only through the eyes of the criminals inside and their victims.', 'The nerve-racking events of a cold winter''s day, seen from two different perspectives. The odd episodes tell the story of a team of police negotiators and special forces who respond to a hostage crisis in a small bank branch. The even episodes tell exactly the same events, only through the eyes of the criminals inside and their victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoF9hWG40ZtNoQsgEoE47YWJrNs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81791'),
  ('268989402976752808', 'The Day After', 2013, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sergey Godin, Evgeniya Rozanova, Tatyana Kazuchits, Dmitry Endaltsev, Ivan Makarevich, Arina Postnikova, Andrey Trushin, Anastasia Chepeliuk', 'NR', 'A drug company, attempting to create a perfect human race, releases a virus which proves to be deadly. People are dying by the thousands, but eleven strangers, who wake up in a bunker with no memory of how they got there, find themselves responsible for determining the future of all mankind.', 'A drug company, attempting to create a perfect human race, releases a virus which proves to be deadly. People are dying by the thousands, but eleven strangers, who wake up in a bunker with no memory of how they got there, find themselves responsible for determining the future of all mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udZdOVpvqEBX7RppeX0ZtyBqigW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65673'),
  ('833237384035538713', 'The Day I Became a God', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Jun Maeda', 'Natsuki Hanae, Ayane Sakura, Yuuki Kuwahara, Yui Ishikawa, Ryohei Kimura, Chiharu Shigematsu, Kikuko Inoue, Ryoka Yuzuki', 'TV-14', 'At the end of the last summer vacation of high school, Youta Narukami spends his days preparing for the university entrance exams, when a young girl named Hina suddenly appears, proclaiming herself as the "god of omniscience." Youta is confused and does not believe Hina when she tells him "The world will end in 30 days." After witnessing Hina’s God-like predictive ability, Youta begins to believe her powers are real. Hina, who is innocent and childlike despite her supernatural powers, decides for some reason to stay at Youta’s home. Thus begins the start of their lively summer before the end of the world.', 'At the end of the last summer vacation of high school, Youta Narukami spends his days preparing for the university entrance exams, when a young girl named Hina suddenly appears, proclaiming herself as the "god of omniscience." Youta is confused and does not believe Hina when she tells him "The world will end in 30 days." After witnessing Hina’s God-like predictive ability, Youta begins to believe her powers are real. Hina, who is innocent and childlike despite her supernatural powers, decides for some reason to stay at Youta’s home. Thus begins the start of their lively summer before the end of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWSF0C4X8rdLdJgaiuUdWemSm23.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103319'),
  ('826856595928258918', 'The Day I Met El Chapo: The Kate del Castillo Story', 2017, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Kate del Castillo, Eric del Castillo, Jillian Warry Barberie, Sabina Berman, Epigmenio Ibarra, Roxanna Castellanos, Don Francisco, Fabiola Campomanes', 'TV-MA', 'Mexican superstar actress Kate del Castillo reveals the untold story of her encounter with El Chapo Guzmán, the world’s most-wanted drug lord.', 'Mexican superstar actress Kate del Castillo reveals the untold story of her encounter with El Chapo Guzmán, the world’s most-wanted drug lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHJ08CcTSCBkBfcVDQRRiOFKoM2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74579'),
  ('1126245464113046847', 'The Day of Becoming You', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Wang Xiongcheng', 'Zhang Xincheng, Liang Jie, Zhao Zhiwei, Shen Wei, Zhou Shiyuan, Su Xunlun, Chen Xiaohan, An Ge', null, 'After a freak accident swaps their bodies, boyband leader Jiang Yi and entertainment reporter Yu Sheng Sheng must navigate each other’s worlds, facing chaotic challenges that ultimately bring them closer—and spark an unexpected romance.', 'After a freak accident swaps their bodies, boyband leader Jiang Yi and entertainment reporter Yu Sheng Sheng must navigate each other’s worlds, facing chaotic challenges that ultimately bring them closer—and spark an unexpected romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eojTmcSvMZaVIcRWEQthrGItgHq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127668'),
  ('699030624583797863', 'The Day of the Jackal', 2024, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Ronan Bennett', null, 'Eddie Redmayne, Lashana Lynch, Eleanor Matsuura, Chukwudi Iwuji, Úrsula Corberó, Adoney Díaz Barajas, David Gojković', 'TV-MA', 'An unrivalled and highly elusive lone assassin, the Jackal, makes his living carrying out hits for the highest fee. But following his latest kill, he meets his match in a tenacious British intelligence officer who starts to track down the Jackal in a thrilling cat-and-mouse chase across Europe, leaving destruction in its wake.', 'An unrivalled and highly elusive lone assassin, the Jackal, makes his living carrying out hits for the highest fee. But following his latest kill, he meets his match in a tenacious British intelligence officer who starts to track down the Jackal in a thrilling cat-and-mouse chase across Europe, leaving destruction in its wake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYLecM3WSEjlkKhkGiH5G68Dprm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222766'),
  ('1088762543555028087', 'The Day of the Triffids', 1981, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Douglas Livingstone', null, 'John Duttine, Emma Relph, Maurice Colbourne', null, 'After an unusual meteor shower leaves most of the human population blind, a merchant navy officer must find a way to conquer tall, aggressive plants which are feeding on people and animals.', 'After an unusual meteor shower leaves most of the human population blind, a merchant navy officer must find a way to conquer tall, aggressive plants which are feeding on people and animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDGJW9qlHQwnhNhlj9gQReM4NVi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2609'),
