  ('530827370338169202', 'The Deal', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lee Jung-gon', null, 'Yoo Seung-ho, Kim Dong-hwi, Yoo Su-bin, Lee Joo-young, Baek Ji-won, Kim Do-yoon, Lee Sung-wook, Jung Yong-ju', null, 'Two young men happen to kidnap their friend and demand ten billion won as ransom.', 'Two young men happen to kidnap their friend and demand ten billion won as ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tmUwuWYLtaBXHdUo6UpBbtt31W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213320'),
  ('305332535719439004', 'The Deal', 2025, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Jean-Stéphane Bron, Alice Winocour', 'Jean-Stéphane Bron, Alice Winocour, Eugène Riousse', 'Veerle Baetens, Arash Marandi, Juliet Stevenson, Anthony Azizi, Alexander Behrang Keshtkar, Sam Crane, Fenella Woolgar, Marie Jung', null, 'Geneva, April 2015. In the hushed corridors of a luxury hotel, high-tension international negotiations get underway between the United States and Iran, suspected of secretly developing the atomic weapon. Alexandra Weiss, head of the Swiss diplomatic mission, is trying to maintain a fragile balance between the parties operating behind the scenes. The unexpected arrival of her former love, Payam Sanjabi, an Iranian engineer whose life is under threat, will complicate her task dangerously...', 'Geneva, April 2015. In the hushed corridors of a luxury hotel, high-tension international negotiations get underway between the United States and Iran, suspected of secretly developing the atomic weapon. Alexandra Weiss, head of the Swiss diplomatic mission, is trying to maintain a fragile balance between the parties operating behind the scenes. The unexpected arrival of her former love, Payam Sanjabi, an Iranian engineer whose life is under threat, will complicate her task dangerously...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4XKzWhQaJ5SAUsbrf3mTqDC0r1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286648'),
  ('679971710408552137', 'The Dean Martin Celebrity Roasts', 1973, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Dean Martin', null, 'The Dean Martin Celebrity Roasts is a NBC television special show hosted by entertainer Dean Martin from 1974 to 1984. For a series of 54 specials and shows, Martin would periodically "roast" a celebrity. These roasts were patterned after the roasts held at the New York Friars'' Club in New York City. The format would have the celebrity guest seated at a banquet table, and one by one the guest of honor was affectionately chided or insulted about his career by his fellow celebrity friends. In 1973, The Dean Martin Show was declining in popularity. The final season of his variety show would be retooled into one of celebrity roasts, requiring less of Martin''s involvement. For the 1973–1974 season, a new feature called “Man of the Week Celebrity Roast" was added to try to pick up the ratings. The roasts seemed to be popular among television audiences and are often marketed in post-issues as part of the official Dean Martin Celebrity Roasts and not The Dean Martin Show. After The Dean Martin Show was cancelled in 1974, NBC drew up a contract with Martin to do several specials and do more roast specials. Starting with Bob Hope in 1974, the roast was taped in California and turned out to be a hit, leading to many other roasts to follow.', 'The Dean Martin Celebrity Roasts is a NBC television special show hosted by entertainer Dean Martin from 1974 to 1984. For a series of 54 specials and shows, Martin would periodically "roast" a celebrity. These roasts were patterned after the roasts held at the New York Friars'' Club in New York City. The format would have the celebrity guest seated at a banquet table, and one by one the guest of honor was affectionately chided or insulted about his career by his fellow celebrity friends. In 1973, The Dean Martin Show was declining in popularity. The final season of his variety show would be retooled into one of celebrity roasts, requiring less of Martin''s involvement. For the 1973–1974 season, a new feature called “Man of the Week Celebrity Roast" was added to try to pick up the ratings. The roasts seemed to be popular among television audiences and are often marketed in post-issues as part of the official Dean Martin Celebrity Roasts and not The Dean Martin Show. After The Dean Martin Show was cancelled in 1974, NBC drew up a contract with Martin to do several specials and do more roast specials. Starting with Bob Hope in 1974, the roast was taped in California and turned out to be a hit, leading to many other roasts to follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wR5dGJxYPlPoElcXCxsxchRO8b9.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:39571'),
  ('121894961594372055', 'The Dean Martin Show', 1965, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Dean Martin', null, 'The Dean Martin Show, also known as The Dean Martin Variety Show, is a TV variety-comedy series that ran from 1965 to 1974 for 264 episodes. It was broadcast by NBC and hosted by entertainer Dean Martin. The theme song to the series was his 1964 hit "Everybody Loves Somebody."', 'The Dean Martin Show, also known as The Dean Martin Variety Show, is a TV variety-comedy series that ran from 1965 to 1974 for 264 episodes. It was broadcast by NBC and hosted by entertainer Dean Martin. The theme song to the series was his 1964 hit "Everybody Loves Somebody."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOxZ92eL4Eyn61297yw8cLSMnWH.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:12875'),
  ('742132835865090100', 'The Death of Bunny Munro', 2025, 'Drama', 'Nick Cave', null, 'Matt Smith, Rafael Mathé, Sarah Greene, Johann Myers, Robert Glenister, Alice May Feetham, David Threlfall, Lindsay Duncan', null, 'Travelling salesman Bunny Munro takes his son around Sussex following the death of his wife Libby. And while Bunny’s grief and his addictions threaten to derail their road trip entirely, a serial killer dressed as the Devil makes his own way down to Brighton.', 'Travelling salesman Bunny Munro takes his son around Sussex following the death of his wife Libby. And while Bunny’s grief and his addictions threaten to derail their road trip entirely, a serial killer dressed as the Devil makes his own way down to Brighton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ucY5MO4lSpcHzry93aFzSoJ2S6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279116'),
  ('117443606610857129', 'The Death of Yugoslavia', 1995, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Norma Percy', 'Allan Little', 'Robin Ellis, Slobodan Milošević, Franjo Tuđman, Borisav Jović, Momir Bulatović, Stipe Mesić, Radovan Karadžić, Alija Izetbegović', null, 'The Death of Yugoslavia is a BAFTA-award winning BBC documentary series first broadcast in 1995. It covers the collapse of the former Yugoslavia. It is notable in its combination of never-before-seen archive footage interspersed with interviews of most of the main players in the conflict, including Slobodan Milošević, the then President of Serbia. Norma Percy won the 1996 BAFTA TV Award for ''Best Factual Series'' for the documentary. However, it has been argued that it presents a potentially slightly biased point-of-view; for instance during the trial of Milošević before the ICTY in The Hague, Judge Bonomy called the nature of much of the commentary "tendentious" (partisan).', 'The Death of Yugoslavia is a BAFTA-award winning BBC documentary series first broadcast in 1995. It covers the collapse of the former Yugoslavia. It is notable in its combination of never-before-seen archive footage interspersed with interviews of most of the main players in the conflict, including Slobodan Milošević, the then President of Serbia. Norma Percy won the 1996 BAFTA TV Award for ''Best Factual Series'' for the documentary. However, it has been argued that it presents a potentially slightly biased point-of-view; for instance during the trial of Milošević before the ICTY in The Hague, Judge Bonomy called the nature of much of the commentary "tendentious" (partisan).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPnXvse3vL1dvCOiksZbnGFD3aR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8943'),
  ('944859553089970658', 'The Decagon House Murders', 2024, 'Mystery', null, null, 'Tomoya Oku, Munetaka Aoki, Akihiro Kakuta, Toru Nakamura, Ayumu Mochizuki, Neru Nagahama, Yuki Imai, Kosuke Suzuki', null, 'The drama tells the story of a group of seven university students who travel to a deserted island where a strange decagonal mansion stands. It was the scene of a grisly mass murder six months earlier, and events soon turn ominous.', 'The drama tells the story of a group of seven university students who travel to a deserted island where a strange decagonal mansion stands. It was the scene of a grisly mass murder six months earlier, and events soon turn ominous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VX6z9qyanyKIqB2UU9C7v72QEZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242331'),
  ('585515340510441136', 'The Decameron', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kathleen Jordan', 'Sarah Stoecker', 'Tanya Reynolds, Jessica Kate Plummer, Lou Gala, Karan Gill, Zosia Mamet, Saoirse-Monica Jackson, Douggie McMeekin, Tony Hale', 'TV-MA', 'As the bubonic plague spreads through Italy, a group of nobles and servants retreats to a villa, where their lavish getaway quickly spirals into chaos.', 'As the bubonic plague spreads through Italy, a group of nobles and servants retreats to a villa, where their lavish getaway quickly spirals into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jxX4EQLeGMQb8SA4YgiaUowz8n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250162'),
  ('399232176530124812', 'The Deceived', 2020, 'Drama', 'Lisa McGee, Tobias Beer', 'Lisa McGee, Tobias Beer', 'Emily Reid, Emmett J. Scanlan, Paul Mescal, Catherine Walker, Eleanor Methven, Shelley Conn, Dempsey Bovell, Lloyd Everitt', 'TV-MA', 'English student Ophelia falls in love with her married lecturer, seeing in him all the answers to her needs. When their affair is interrupted by a shocking and tragic death, Ophelia finds herself trapped in a world where she can no longer trust her own mind.', 'English student Ophelia falls in love with her married lecturer, seeing in him all the answers to her needs. When their affair is interrupted by a shocking and tragic death, Ophelia finds herself trapped in a world where she can no longer trust her own mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQzfgnvDQiBMdh1o7sPvZB6148R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106755'),
  ('1024298399321106891', 'The Deep', 2010, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Simon Donald', 'Paul Rutman, Simon Donald', 'Minnie Driver, Goran Višnjić, James Nesbitt, Antonia Thomas, Orla Brady, Richard Brake, Sacha Dhawan, Sinéad Cusack', 'TV-14', 'As the world''s energy supplies dwindle, the Orpheus, a research submarine, delves into the deep of the Arctic Ocean searching for rare micro-organisms, but the crew soon find themselves in peril.', 'As the world''s energy supplies dwindle, the Orpheus, a research submarine, delves into the deep of the Arctic Ocean searching for rare micro-organisms, but the crew soon find themselves in peril.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xFhx63ec8WPvL5BaXu15IOinoE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32763'),
  ('816903610357123343', 'The Deep', 2015, 'Kids, Family, Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Tom Taylor, James Brouwer', 'Daniel Hall, Justine Juel Gillmer, Tom Taylor', 'Vincent Tong, Ashleigh Ball, Michael Dobson, Kathleen Barr, Lee Tockar', 'TV-Y', 'The adventures of the Nekton family, a family of daring underwater explorers who live aboard a state-of-the-art submarine, The Aronnax, and explore uncharted areas of the earth''s oceans to unravel the mysteries of the deep.', 'The adventures of the Nekton family, a family of daring underwater explorers who live aboard a state-of-the-art submarine, The Aronnax, and explore uncharted areas of the earth''s oceans to unravel the mysteries of the deep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aoRvpHjuRmn76P2AVXZIBDoCdg.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67106'),
  ('489800349213870737', 'The Deep End', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Teal Swan, Molly Monahan', 'TV-14', 'An arresting and provocative exploration inside the world of one of today''s most controversial spiritual teachers and her dedicated followers. Filmed over three years with unprecedented access, it is an unflinching portrayal of the incredible lengths people will go to in their search for connection.', 'An arresting and provocative exploration inside the world of one of today''s most controversial spiritual teachers and her dedicated followers. Filmed over three years with unprecedented access, it is an unflinching portrayal of the incredible lengths people will go to in their search for connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyhQFabQSC3e7pQSRxNXEzzqNB0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196965'),
  ('1047482962685103606', 'The Defects', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Oh Ki-hwan', null, 'Yum Jung-ah, Won Jin-ah, Choi Young-jun, Dex, Ahn Ji-ho, Lee Na-eun, Oh Seung-jun, Kang Ji-yong', null, 'An action thriller depicting the revenge of children who barely survived the brink of death after being abandoned by their adoptive parents.', 'An action thriller depicting the revenge of children who barely survived the brink of death after being abandoned by their adoptive parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKxKRYXZqarVzfSdDFlVINoqONT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238673'),
  ('814505088178345735', 'The Defence', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Magdalena Cielecka, Filip Pławiak, Piotr Żurawski, Jakub Gierszał', 'TV-MA', 'Three-year-old Nikola Szlezyngier disappears in unexplained circumstances and her parents Angelika and Dawid are the main suspects. Angelika contacts an old friend Joanna Chylka, a brilliant, cynical and successful lawyer to help. With her new apprentice Kordian, Joanna will try to bring the case to a happy close.', 'Three-year-old Nikola Szlezyngier disappears in unexplained circumstances and her parents Angelika and Dawid are the main suspects. Angelika contacts an old friend Joanna Chylka, a brilliant, cynical and successful lawyer to help. With her new apprentice Kordian, Joanna will try to bring the case to a happy close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sohkhCEkIboAuJf8SH4H3HRmsU.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:85233'),
  ('609298634160365568', 'The Defenders', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Niels Mueller, Kevin Kennedy', null, 'Jim Belushi, Jerry O''Connell, Jurnee Smollett, Tanya Fischer', 'TV-PG', 'The Defenders is a drama about two colorful Las Vegas defense attorneys who go all-in when it comes to representing their clients. Nick and Pete are the local go-to guys with an eclectic client list who are still looking to hit their own jackpot.', 'The Defenders is a drama about two colorful Las Vegas defense attorneys who go all-in when it comes to representing their clients. Nick and Pete are the local go-to guys with an eclectic client list who are still looking to hit their own jackpot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAW5aSnv6ALlJvXQG1zTSpfCll5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32736'),
  ('44871540761662649', 'The Defiant Ones', 2017, 'Documentary', null, 'Allen Hughes, Doug Pray, Lasse Järvi', 'Dr. Dre, Jimmy Iovine', 'TV-MA', 'A four-part documentary series that tells the stories of Jimmy Iovine and Dr. Dre -- one the son of a Brooklyn longshoreman, the other straight out of Compton - -- and their improbable partnership and surprising leading roles in a series of transformative events in contemporary culture.', 'A four-part documentary series that tells the stories of Jimmy Iovine and Dr. Dre -- one the son of a Brooklyn longshoreman, the other straight out of Compton - -- and their improbable partnership and surprising leading roles in a series of transformative events in contemporary culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38JFkjD3SZvbDKvgDEXPUXbK5d0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72141'),
  ('902074039735547188', 'The Degenerates', 2018, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Six stand-ups explore the coarse and salacious side of comedy in this series of half-hour specials. For mature audiences.', 'Six stand-ups explore the coarse and salacious side of comedy in this series of half-hour specials. For mature audiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HZYXXaylpVLnFAc5fzHciM5b2c.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83591'),
  ('249405146699639980', 'The Deleted', 2016, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Bret Easton Ellis', 'Kurt Lustgarten', 'Nash Grier, Spencer Neville, Madeline Brewer, Amanda Cerny, Ian Nelson, Daniel Zovatto, Todd Maurer, Will Peltz', 'TV-MA', 'When escapees from a mysterious cult start disappearing, the survivors are driven to find each other for protection. Damaged by their dark pasts and hunted by the cult leaders who followed them to Los Angeles, they''ll do anything to be free.', 'When escapees from a mysterious cult start disappearing, the survivors are driven to find each other for protection. Damaged by their dark pasts and hunted by the cult leaders who followed them to Los Angeles, they''ll do anything to be free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQkls6iQW5fRttuYiyE88aCRZ55.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68985'),
  ('379324344123097354', 'The Delicious Guys', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Four comedians who are famous for their love of food visit restaurants all over Korea to try the popular menus.', 'Four comedians who are famous for their love of food visit restaurants all over Korea to try the popular menus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2a1brhbBrYkAu9JPSXAHG8h7rj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63942'),
  ('672787983917119819', 'The Delivery Man', 2015, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Darren Boyd, Fay Ripley, Aisling Bea, Llewella Gideon, Jennie Jacques, Shaz Lancaster', 'TV-14', 'Matthew decides to leave his job and train to become a male midwife on a busy maternity ward. He is soon joined by best friend and former policeman friend Ian who joins as the hospital security guard.', 'Matthew decides to leave his job and train to become a male midwife on a busy maternity ward. He is soon joined by best friend and former policeman friend Ian who joins as the hospital security guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adStMB39dGlP8U2pnpnLeFwksUl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62414'),
  ('730819020082986646', 'The Demi-Gods and Semi-Devils', 1997, 'Drama', 'Lee Tim-Sing', null, 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Benny Chan Ho-Man, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, Cheung Kwok-Keung, Bonnie Chiu Hok-Yee, He Meitian, Rain Lau Yuk-Chui', null, 'The story deals with several separate yet intertwining story lines, revolving around the protagonists Kiu Fung, Duen Yu and Hui Juk.', 'The story deals with several separate yet intertwining story lines, revolving around the protagonists Kiu Fung, Duen Yu and Hui Juk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rChf8CTlmg2jXjS3kXBxl3ujlaB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72819'),
  ('72658414178943860', 'The Demon Girl Next Door', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Konomi Kohara, Akari Kito, Minami Takahashi, Tomoyo Takayanagi, Sayaka Senbongi, Ayaka Suwa, Hitomi Ohwada, Sayaka Ohara', 'TV-14', 'Awakening her dormant abilities as a devil one day, Yuuko Yoshida aka Shadow Mistress Yuuko, is entrusted with the mission to defeat the Light clan''s shrine maiden, a magical girl, by her ancestor Lilith. Yuuko meets magical girl Momo Chiyoda through her classmate Anri Sada, and challenges her to a duel, but loses quickly due to her lack of strength. Since then, Yuuko has struggled with her role as a devil and her duel with Momo, and borrowed help from her regularly. However, by a strange coincidence, Yuuko also weakens Momo by taking away her power to cooperate in protecting the peace of Tama city.', 'Awakening her dormant abilities as a devil one day, Yuuko Yoshida aka Shadow Mistress Yuuko, is entrusted with the mission to defeat the Light clan''s shrine maiden, a magical girl, by her ancestor Lilith. Yuuko meets magical girl Momo Chiyoda through her classmate Anri Sada, and challenges her to a duel, but loses quickly due to her lack of strength. Since then, Yuuko has struggled with her role as a devil and her duel with Momo, and borrowed help from her regularly. However, by a strange coincidence, Yuuko also weakens Momo by taking away her power to cooperate in protecting the peace of Tama city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTzpBCrmWfqOdF3XoanFfpwKYZU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88806'),
  ('476013880048383084', 'The Demon Hunter', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Wo Chi Xihongshi', '焦柄乾', 'Sanshi, Duan Yixuan, Liangwei Hu, Ma Zhengyang, Ma Haifeng, Xia Michen, Qianhan Liu, Zhengjian Hu', null, 'Meng Chuan witnessed his mother killed before his eyes, so he trained very hard hoping to one day avenge her death. But his peaceful days were broken as his wedding engagement being called off, an invasion by foreign forces, the sanctuary fallen into enemy hands… In order to protect the people of Ning City, he picked up his sword and vowed to be the strongest. This is a heavy responsibility and a long journey…', 'Meng Chuan witnessed his mother killed before his eyes, so he trained very hard hoping to one day avenge her death. But his peaceful days were broken as his wedding engagement being called off, an invasion by foreign forces, the sanctuary fallen into enemy hands… In order to protect the people of Ning City, he picked up his sword and vowed to be the strongest. This is a heavy responsibility and a long journey…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryAX7owZUxkpaBU3VbsQdtI2zLz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229192'),
  ('1017716253687746147', 'The Demon Hunter''s Romance', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Miu Wenjing', null, 'Ren Jialun, Song Zuer, Xuan Yan, Fan Shuaiqi, Liu Ruogu, Kiki Liu, Yao Yiqi', null, 'In the bustling city of Guangping, where humans and demons coexist, the wealthy young lady Ban Xia possesses unusual eyes that see shadows invisible to others. Despite her propriety and considerate nature, she is labeled a "madwoman" by others. When Ban Xia uncovers her sister-in-law''s secret, she meets the demon hunter Xuan Ye, who reveals the world where humans and demons coexist. Together, they investigate various mysterious phenomena in Guangping.', 'In the bustling city of Guangping, where humans and demons coexist, the wealthy young lady Ban Xia possesses unusual eyes that see shadows invisible to others. Despite her propriety and considerate nature, she is labeled a "madwoman" by others. When Ban Xia uncovers her sister-in-law''s secret, she meets the demon hunter Xuan Ye, who reveals the world where humans and demons coexist. Together, they investigate various mysterious phenomena in Guangping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBmOko0HAs7cVS60cZo6IxLf5e6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138291'),
  ('1140397853003748041', 'The Demon King''s Daughter Is Too Kind!!', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Misaki Kuno, Ayaka Ohashi, Akio Otsuka, Shigeru Chiba, Ayasa Ito, Kaori Ishihara, Yuko Sanpei', null, 'Once feared as the ruler of all demons, Demon King Ahriman seeks to conquer the world…until he’s stopped by an unexpected force: his daughter, Dou! Too kind for chaos and too gentle for war, Dou melts the hearts of demons, humans, and even angels. Desperate to restore demon pride, Ahriman’s aide Jahi vows to train Dou to become a proper demon. But is Jahi any match for Dou’s compassion?!', 'Once feared as the ruler of all demons, Demon King Ahriman seeks to conquer the world…until he’s stopped by an unexpected force: his daughter, Dou! Too kind for chaos and too gentle for war, Dou melts the hearts of demons, humans, and even angels. Desperate to restore demon pride, Ahriman’s aide Jahi vows to train Dou to become a proper demon. But is Jahi any match for Dou’s compassion?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oit4HWGxF8xncV7DniAfbGUOMVP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294280'),
  ('154447159771880473', 'The Demon Prince of Momochi House', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsumi Kawaida, Takeo Otsuka, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Yuki Ono, Taku Yashiro, Wataru Hatano', 'TV-14', 'Himari’s 16th birthday will be one she never forgets. Unexpectedly, she receives a will detailing her inheritance of a mysterious estate: the Momochi House. She arrives only to discover that the home was built on the cusp between the human world and the spiritual realm. There, she encounters Yukari, Ise, and a peculiar boy named Aoi, who seems to be concealing a shadowy secret.', 'Himari’s 16th birthday will be one she never forgets. Unexpectedly, she receives a will detailing her inheritance of a mysterious estate: the Momochi House. She arrives only to discover that the home was built on the cusp between the human world and the spiritual realm. There, she encounters Yukari, Ise, and a peculiar boy named Aoi, who seems to be concealing a shadowy secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/963GYlakUDBxnfMx2WINXcFKJgC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230823'),
  ('607618563362282036', 'The Demon Sword Master of Excalibur Academy', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Marina Inoue, Yui Ishikawa, Aya Suzaki, Hiromi Igarashi, Honoka Kuroki, Arisa Nakada, Tomofumi Ikezoe, Ai Kakuma', 'TV-14', 'Awakening from magical stasis after a thousand years, the Dark Lord Leonis suddenly finds himself in the body of a ten-year-old boy! He quickly meets Riselia, a girl confronting the Voids, creatures that have nearly exterminated humanity. Determined to uncover the mysteries of this strange new era, Leonis enrolls in Excalibur Academy, a school that trains students to fight back against these enigmatic monsters. Could the Voids hold some connection to Leonis''s past?', 'Awakening from magical stasis after a thousand years, the Dark Lord Leonis suddenly finds himself in the body of a ten-year-old boy! He quickly meets Riselia, a girl confronting the Voids, creatures that have nearly exterminated humanity. Determined to uncover the mysteries of this strange new era, Leonis enrolls in Excalibur Academy, a school that trains students to fight back against these enigmatic monsters. Could the Voids hold some connection to Leonis''s past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvUIWcUg23JwWDVF7oTqLFmUe9g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136840'),
  ('953346854331662516', 'The Deputy', 1959, 'Western', 'Norman Lear, Roland Kibbee', null, 'Henry Fonda, Read Morgan, Wallace Ford', 'TV-PG', 'The Deputy is an American western series that aired on NBC from September 1959, to July 1961. The series stars Henry Fonda as Chief Marshal Simon Fry of the Arizona Territory and Allen Case as Deputy Clay McCord, a storekeeper who tried to avoid using a gun.', 'The Deputy is an American western series that aired on NBC from September 1959, to July 1961. The series stars Henry Fonda as Chief Marshal Simon Fry of the Arizona Territory and Allen Case as Deputy Clay McCord, a storekeeper who tried to avoid using a gun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFwqrcfHZ1gtO9M7LpAZxoTKqp2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13778'),
  ('290620525352357607', 'The Destiny of White Snake', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Liu Ya, Li Zhenru', 'Yang Zi, Ren Jialun, Mao Zijun, Li Man, Liu Xueyi, He Dujuan, Fu Fangjun, Zhu Xiaoyu', null, 'A retelling of the popular Chinese folktale Legend of the White Snake that depicts the romance between a white snake spirit and a mortal physician.', 'A retelling of the popular Chinese folktale Legend of the White Snake that depicts the romance between a white snake spirit and a mortal physician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TdytshFau9Cjjas7M6thrMjb3s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80846'),
  ('1102002707398571479', 'The Detail', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ley Lukins', null, 'Angela Griffin, Shenae Grimes-Beech, Wendy Crewson, David Cubitt, Al Mukadam, Matt Gordon', 'TV-14', 'Three fiercely talented female homicide investigators work tirelessly to solve crimes while navigating the complicated demands of their personal lives.', 'Three fiercely talented female homicide investigators work tirelessly to solve crimes while navigating the complicated demands of their personal lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ec8QfalJdDDWoAGTTjMH1V3PTD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72735'),
  ('100786583374901832', 'The Detective Is Already Dead', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Arata Nagai, Saki Miyashita, Ayana Taketatsu, Kanon Takao, Saho Shirasu, Maria Naganawa, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Mai Fuchigami', 'TV-14', 'Kimizuka Kimihiko is a crisis-magnet. So it is no surprise when his rather mundane flight suddenly enters a state of emergency with a dire need of a detective onboard. Unfortunately, his attempt at avoiding trouble is foiled by a beautiful girl with silver hair who goes by the codename Siesta. Declaring herself a detective, she unceremoniously drags Kimizuka into the case as her assistant. That incident spelled the beginning of an adventure around the globe that went beyond his wildest imagination. Putting their lives on the line, the two took down criminal organizations, prevented disasters, and saved thousands. But the curtain closed to their epic journey with Siesta''s untimely death three years later. Resolving to live an ordinary high school life this time, Kimizuka spends a year maintaining a low profile. However, as fate would have it, a girl with an uncanny resemblance to Siesta comes crashing into his life, threatening to throw his peaceful days into disarray.', 'Kimizuka Kimihiko is a crisis-magnet. So it is no surprise when his rather mundane flight suddenly enters a state of emergency with a dire need of a detective onboard. Unfortunately, his attempt at avoiding trouble is foiled by a beautiful girl with silver hair who goes by the codename Siesta. Declaring herself a detective, she unceremoniously drags Kimizuka into the case as her assistant. That incident spelled the beginning of an adventure around the globe that went beyond his wildest imagination. Putting their lives on the line, the two took down criminal organizations, prevented disasters, and saved thousands. But the curtain closed to their epic journey with Siesta''s untimely death three years later. Resolving to live an ordinary high school life this time, Kimizuka spends a year maintaining a low profile. However, as fate would have it, a girl with an uncanny resemblance to Siesta comes crashing into his life, threatening to throw his peaceful days into disarray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gCOlj0bXa2cQnXSl4wRX5tVIA0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:117061'),
  ('125224652977648186', 'The Detectives', 1959, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Jules V. Levy', null, 'Robert Taylor, Ursula Thiess, Mark Goddard, Tige Andrews, Adam West', null, 'The Detectives is an American crime drama series which ran on ABC during its first two seasons, and on NBC during its third and final season. The series, starring motion picture star Robert Taylor, was produced by Four Star Television. Captain Matt Holbrook (Robert Taylor) is head of the detective division of a large metropolitan police force—a man whose devotion to duty, professional brilliance, and quick judgment are reflected in his 20-year career on the force. His aides, Lt. Johnny Russo (Tige Andrews), Lt. Otto Lindstrom (Russ Thorson), and Sgt. Chris Ballard (Mark Goddard) form a team that is both proficient and warmly human. The stories stress the interrelationships between the men as well as the solutions to crimes and the apprehension of criminals, adding a dimension of human drama to the excitement, action, and suspense inherent in each story of the detectives'' difficult, sometimes thankless, and frequently dangerous assignments.', 'The Detectives is an American crime drama series which ran on ABC during its first two seasons, and on NBC during its third and final season. The series, starring motion picture star Robert Taylor, was produced by Four Star Television. Captain Matt Holbrook (Robert Taylor) is head of the detective division of a large metropolitan police force—a man whose devotion to duty, professional brilliance, and quick judgment are reflected in his 20-year career on the force. His aides, Lt. Johnny Russo (Tige Andrews), Lt. Otto Lindstrom (Russ Thorson), and Sgt. Chris Ballard (Mark Goddard) form a team that is both proficient and warmly human. The stories stress the interrelationships between the men as well as the solutions to crimes and the apprehension of criminals, adding a dimension of human drama to the excitement, action, and suspense inherent in each story of the detectives'' difficult, sometimes thankless, and frequently dangerous assignments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfTnudiCwpKitJ6XZcCj16FeIup.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:14781'),
  ('667498468535604070', 'The Detectives', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Jasper Carrott', 'Steve Knight, Mike Whitehill', 'Robert Powell, George Sewell, Jasper Carrott', 'NR', 'The absurd adventures of two defective detectives, who - despite unbelievable incompetence - somehow manage to solve their cases (or be nearby when the cases are solved) and retain their jobs.', 'The absurd adventures of two defective detectives, who - despite unbelievable incompetence - somehow manage to solve their cases (or be nearby when the cases are solved) and retain their jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JWALQsJZs23Tx36K8FGa1mnMfa.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4130'),
  ('377586669679246306', 'The Detectives'' Adventures', 2021, 'Reality', 'Tong Wu, Shi Hui', null, 'Na Ying, Huang Zitao, Gao Ye, Ryan Cheng, Meng Ziyi, Tian Jiarui, Xu Zhisheng, Francis Ng Chun-Yu', null, 'The first reality show on detective stories adapted from classic IP. Every episode is based on a classic IP drama. MCs are able to adapt and act out the classic stories in the real scenes. The detective group includes seven MCs, who are encouraged to obtain clues from the unreasonable scripts and amusing games.', 'The first reality show on detective stories adapted from classic IP. Every episode is based on a classic IP drama. MCs are able to adapt and act out the classic stories in the real scenes. The detective group includes seven MCs, who are encouraged to obtain clues from the unreasonable scripts and amusing games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epoCnqVnMqohtKnf8QiT1eGaV9A.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:126544'),
  ('862769843049822616', 'The Detour', 2016, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Samantha Bee, Jason Jones', null, 'Jason Jones, Natalie Zea, Liam Carroll, Ashley Gerasimovich', 'TV-MA', 'A what-in-the-living-hell-is-wrong-with-this-family comedy created by comic super-couple Jason Jones &amp; Samantha Bee and inspired by their own experiences with family trips. Unfiltered dad Nate hits the road with wife Robin and kids Delilah and Jared. Every leg of their trip is fraught with disaster as they encounter one hellish turn after another. If there''s trouble on the road, this family will find it and plow into it.', 'A what-in-the-living-hell-is-wrong-with-this-family comedy created by comic super-couple Jason Jones &amp; Samantha Bee and inspired by their own experiences with family trips. Unfiltered dad Nate hits the road with wife Robin and kids Delilah and Jared. Every leg of their trip is fraught with disaster as they encounter one hellish turn after another. If there''s trouble on the road, this family will find it and plow into it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXR3Vxu8BVtMF9YxRrbCV6fcEWr.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:66186'),
  ('337846904711788542', 'The Deuce', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'David Simon, George Pelecanos', null, 'James Franco, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Chris Bauer, Chris Coy, Lawrence Gilliard Jr., Luke Kirby, Margarita Levieva, Emily Meade', 'TV-MA', 'The story of the legalization and subsequent rise of the porn industry in New York’s Times Square from the early ’70s through the mid ’80s, exploring the rough-and-tumble world that existed there until the rise of HIV, the violence of the cocaine epidemic and the renewed real estate market ended the bawdy turbulence of the area.', 'The story of the legalization and subsequent rise of the porn industry in New York’s Times Square from the early ’70s through the mid ’80s, exploring the rough-and-tumble world that existed there until the rise of HIV, the violence of the cocaine epidemic and the renewed real estate market ended the bawdy turbulence of the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKFUwmue5g45rthZOyYWd7l931y.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65817'),
  ('933787662192848460', 'The Devil Between Us', 2026, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Lei Mi', 'Nie Chengshuai', 'Ren Suxi, Wang Xiao, Cai Wenjing, Li Zefeng, Wang Youjun, Dong Qing, Lan Xiya', null, 'In a quiet coastal town, a missing bag of drugs ignites a chain of chaos, pulling together a detective, a desperate father, an ambitious young woman, and two siblings caught in addiction. As their lives collide, a risky rescue mission begins—one that no one will walk away from unchanged.', 'In a quiet coastal town, a missing bag of drugs ignites a chain of chaos, pulling together a detective, a desperate father, an ambitious young woman, and two siblings caught in addiction. As their lives collide, a risky rescue mission begins—one that no one will walk away from unchanged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sK3RhSaWD1E8iOtfV5y1bPIYsjo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281495'),
  ('488359961799148691', 'The Devil Is a Part-Timer!', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Yoko Hikasa, Nao Toyama, Yuki Ono, Hiro Shimono, Kanae Itou, Hina Kino', 'TV-14', 'Foiled by a hero when he’s inches away from conquering the world, the devil finds himself in modern-day Tokyo. With no real-world skills to speak of, the devil is forced to make ends meet flipping burgers at a fast food joint! To stall any further plans of world domination, the hero tracks the devil’s trail and takes on the lowly tasks of a telemarketer.', 'Foiled by a hero when he’s inches away from conquering the world, the devil finds himself in modern-day Tokyo. With no real-world skills to speak of, the devil is forced to make ends meet flipping burgers at a fast food joint! To stall any further plans of world domination, the hero tracks the devil’s trail and takes on the lowly tasks of a telemarketer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55jYHFT8iJuASF8Mzg0V8Dh3N3M.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45997'),
  ('32120227847451379', 'The Devil Judge', 2021, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Moon Yoo-seok', null, 'Ji Sung, Kim Min-joung, Jinyoung, Park Gyu-young, Jang Young-nam, Kim Jae-kyung, Ahn Nae-sang, Chun Young-min', 'TV-MA', 'The court system is corrupted and old-fashioned. People desire a new system that can satisfy the crowds. However, are the crowds always correct? The drama shows how judges discover the truth about people in court. It centers around a chief judge who doesn’t believe in justice, but only makes judgements that the crowds will be satisfied with. An assistant judge starts to question his motives and tries to find the truth.', 'The court system is corrupted and old-fashioned. People desire a new system that can satisfy the crowds. However, are the crowds always correct? The drama shows how judges discover the truth about people in court. It centers around a chief judge who doesn’t believe in justice, but only makes judgements that the crowds will be satisfied with. An assistant judge starts to question his motives and tries to find the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41wc4n7juC0A4XNROYTDvlndi0E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119772'),
  ('51521537192196351', 'The Devil Next Door', 2019, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'John Demjanjuk', 'TV-MA', 'A Cleveland grandfather is brought to trial in Israel, accused of being the infamous Nazi death camp guard known as Ivan the Terrible.', 'A Cleveland grandfather is brought to trial in Israel, accused of being the infamous Nazi death camp guard known as Ivan the Terrible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLv7OzCqqCoMG2l464BNXhwni3q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94813'),
  ('216630650144372214', 'The Devil Punisher', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mike He, Yin Chao-te, Dewi Chien, Amanda Chou, Chen Bo-zheng, Ivy Shao, Guang Chen, Johnny Yang', null, 'A baker by day and demon fighter by night, Zhong Kui, a reincarnated deity must jog his amnesiac lover''s memory of their millennium-long romance.', 'A baker by day and demon fighter by night, Zhong Kui, a reincarnated deity must jog his amnesiac lover''s memory of their millennium-long romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgfYU0zWySnyapKIv6bTq2QHgH1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112152'),
  ('584652366717250018', 'The Devil You Know', 2019, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'A journalist races to learn the truth when human remains are found in the home of self-proclaimed Satanist "Pazuzu".', 'A journalist races to learn the truth when human remains are found in the home of self-proclaimed Satanist "Pazuzu".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMkpuqhRzwnmaBOpnwqCOSLAYRk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92968'),
