  ('1121084725283458559', 'The Dinah Shore Chevy Show', 1956, 'Reality', null, null, 'Dinah Shore', null, 'The Dinah Shore Chevy Show is an American variety series hosted by Dinah Shore, and broadcast on NBC from October 1956 to June 1963. The series was sponsored by the Chevrolet Motor Division of General Motors and its theme song, sung by Shore, was "See the U.S.A. in Your Chevrolet", which continued to be used in Chevrolet advertising for several more years after the cancellation of the show.', 'The Dinah Shore Chevy Show is an American variety series hosted by Dinah Shore, and broadcast on NBC from October 1956 to June 1963. The series was sponsored by the Chevrolet Motor Division of General Motors and its theme song, sung by Shore, was "See the U.S.A. in Your Chevrolet", which continued to be used in Chevrolet advertising for several more years after the cancellation of the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7diL0sAqbIlPVVa4UtVxiXKpHLy.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:13765'),
  ('887943360381963669', 'The Dinner Table Detective', 2025, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Yuki Kaji, Mamoru Miyano', null, 'Rich heiress Reiko Hosho lives a double life as a novice detective, fighting crime under Inspector Kazamatsuri—also from a wealthy family. After work, Reiko sheds her pantsuit to don a lovely dress for dinner each day. Difficult cases force her to confide in her butler Kageyama, who proceeds to savagely ridicule her inability to solve mysteries, all while brilliantly unraveling each case himself.', 'Rich heiress Reiko Hosho lives a double life as a novice detective, fighting crime under Inspector Kazamatsuri—also from a wealthy family. After work, Reiko sheds her pantsuit to don a lovely dress for dinner each day. Difficult cases force her to confide in her butler Kageyama, who proceeds to savagely ridicule her inability to solve mysteries, all while brilliantly unraveling each case himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojbA3PYa2P5FIs2l4N737FtVpSn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279216'),
  ('105496530801051099', 'The Dinosaurs', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Morgan Freeman', 'TV-PG', 'From the first dinosaurs to the last, this epic documentary series examines their 165 million years on Earth and the forces that shaped their evolution.', 'From the first dinosaurs to the last, this epic documentary series examines their 165 million years on Earth and the forces that shaped their evolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x37IK9WWhuzi7tgyMT4ff3kiT5X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313298'),
  ('493664855145917277', 'The Diplomat', 2023, 'Drama', 'Ben Richards', 'Ben Richards, Lauren Klee', 'Sophie Rundle, Steven Cree, Philipp Boos, Serena Manteghi, Dylan Brady, Isak Férriz, Laia Costa, Danny Sapani', null, 'The six-part series follows Laura Simmonds and her Barcelona Consul colleague and friend Alba Ortiz as they fight to protect British nationals who find themselves in trouble in the Catalan city.', 'The six-part series follows Laura Simmonds and her Barcelona Consul colleague and friend Alba Ortiz as they fight to protect British nationals who find themselves in trouble in the Catalan city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePknauaRbj3fSzyVRt9CIs6So7y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203762'),
  ('6941480901657714', 'The Director Who Buys Me Dinner', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Toesa', 'Park Young-woon, Park Jeong-woo, Jang You-sung, Kim Ji-eun, Choi Funny', null, 'Min Youtan remembers every past life. Dongbaek doesn’t. To break a curse, Youtan must make him fall in love—again.', 'Min Youtan remembers every past life. Dongbaek doesn’t. To break a curse, Youtan must make him fall in love—again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9b7NuTsNptt24noCnibYBUjPLdS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216304'),
  ('428240951340695059', 'The Disappearance', 2015, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Charlotte Brändström, Catherine Touzet, Marie Deshaires', null, 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Alix Poisson, François-Xavier Demaison, Alice Pol, Camille Razat, Laurent Bateau, Muriel Combeau, Léo Legrand', 'NR', 'A family falling apart over a missing girl. This intimate drama traces the increasing trauma of the Morel family when their 17 year old daughter, Léa, fails to return home from a night out. The Disappearance explores every parent''s worst nightmare: their child going missing, their fate unknown.', 'A family falling apart over a missing girl. This intimate drama traces the increasing trauma of the Morel family when their 17 year old daughter, Léa, fails to return home from a night out. The Disappearance explores every parent''s worst nightmare: their child going missing, their fate unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddHMDQ52wGCbd2ZooBuHpxg2io8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62547'),
  ('210614706471581702', 'The Disappearance', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Geneviève Simard, Normand Daneau', null, 'Aden Young, Peter Coyote, Camille Sullivan, Joanne Kelly, Micheline Lanctôt', null, 'When Anthony Sullivan disappears on his tenth birthday, his family is devastated. However, as more and more time passes without the police being able to locate him, long-buried family secrets are dragged to the surface, turning the Sullivan family against one another.', 'When Anthony Sullivan disappears on his tenth birthday, his family is devastated. However, as more and more time passes without the police being able to locate him, long-buried family secrets are dragged to the surface, turning the Sullivan family against one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDw0ItLofAmLoMUYxVyhdK4lI0p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72744'),
  ('996244989814100017', 'The Disappearance of Kimmy Diore', 2024, 'Drama', 'Victor Rodenbach, Judith Havas', 'Judith Havas, Benjamin Adam, Victor Rodenbach', 'Géraldine Nakache, Doria Tillier, India Hair, Oussama Kheddam, Panayotis Pascot, Sébastien Pouderoux, Suliane Brahim, Véronique Ruggia Saura', null, 'When Kimmy Diore is kidnapped in broad daylight, shockwaves go beyond her family circle. Kimmy is no ordinary six-old-year girl, but a YouTube star whose videos are followed by millions of viewers. To save her, Sara Roussel must dive into an unfamiliar world, both fascinating and terrifying. She enters the Diore family''s inner circle, gradually uncovering secrets that resonate with her own.', 'When Kimmy Diore is kidnapped in broad daylight, shockwaves go beyond her family circle. Kimmy is no ordinary six-old-year girl, but a YouTube star whose videos are followed by millions of viewers. To save her, Sara Roussel must dive into an unfamiliar world, both fascinating and terrifying. She enters the Diore family''s inner circle, gradually uncovering secrets that resonate with her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JnA647tAHiiMeB7DuE4gbGdkll.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222807'),
  ('1073226005686431367', 'The Disappearance of Madeleine McCann', 2019, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Chris Smith', null, 'Kate McCann, Gerry McCann, Anthony Summers, Jim Gamble, Kelvin MacKenzie, Alexander David, Fernando Lupach, Marisa Matos', null, 'The documentary takes a detailed look at the disappearance of 3-year-old Madeleine McCann, who vanished while on holiday with her family.', 'The documentary takes a detailed look at the disappearance of 3-year-old Madeleine McCann, who vanished while on holiday with her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKdXmOme5HtZXKNItMncQgZqkAN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87600'),
  ('273280082523764797', 'The Disappearance of Nagato Yuki-chan', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Minori Chihara, Tomokazu Sugita, Natsuko Kuwatani, Yuko Goto, Yuki Matsuoka, Aya Hirano, Daisuke Ono, Minoru Shiraishi', null, 'In an alternate universe, shy, awkward Yuki Nagato attempts to court her crush, Kyon, with the help of her best friend and neighbor, the perky and indomitable Ryoko Asakura. Together, the trio defends their high school literature club from extermination…and from the pestering of their over-the-top classmate Tsuruya and her friend and minion Mikuru.', 'In an alternate universe, shy, awkward Yuki Nagato attempts to court her crush, Kyon, with the help of her best friend and neighbor, the perky and indomitable Ryoko Asakura. Together, the trio defends their high school literature club from extermination…and from the pestering of their over-the-top classmate Tsuruya and her friend and minion Mikuru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1usg5ElzRxorATTr5ImYBj6fj3D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68574'),
  ('1082595868506755601', 'The Disastrous Life of Saiki K.', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Ai Kayano, Maaya Uchida, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Yuki Kaji, Masaya Matsukaze, Daisuke Ono', 'TV-14', 'High school sophomore Kusuo Saiki swore as a child that he would keep his psychic talents hidden, but his abilities still make his life difficult.', 'High school sophomore Kusuo Saiki swore as a child that he would keep his psychic talents hidden, but his abilities still make his life difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpym31HVeQgenaubvCxkMF3kFHy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67676'),
  ('991429631271316352', 'The Disastrous Life of Saiki K.: Reawakened', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Ai Kayano, Daisuke Ono, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Satoshi Hino, Natsuki Hanae, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Rikako Aikawa', 'TV-14', 'Kusuo and his gaggle of self-proclaimed friends are back for more psychic mishaps. If he didn''t have enough problems before, he''s got even more now.', 'Kusuo and his gaggle of self-proclaimed friends are back for more psychic mishaps. If he didn''t have enough problems before, he''s got even more now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dTgw94cx05DwUH2fZXM2gkY7MU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97009'),
  ('306847582169305012', 'The Discounters', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Christian Ulmen', 'Emil Belton, Oskar Belton', 'Marc Hosemann, Bruno Alexander, Ludger Bökelmann, Klara Lange, Merlin Sandmeyer, Marie Bloching, David Ali Rashed, Nura Habib Omer', null, 'A group of young supermarket employees face the everyday challenges of the branch. Under the direction of branch manager Thorsten, the employees try to cope with all catastrophes and dramas, such as stealing employees, a mouse plague or dissatisfied customers, from store opening to closing time. It is not uncommon for employees to reach their limits.', 'A group of young supermarket employees face the everyday challenges of the branch. Under the direction of branch manager Thorsten, the employees try to cope with all catastrophes and dramas, such as stealing employees, a mouse plague or dissatisfied customers, from store opening to closing time. It is not uncommon for employees to reach their limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIn8U6sMTmP4qjYYeDoBLHDjQ7P.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:153642'),
  ('36851944340466199', 'The Discovery of India', 1988, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Shyam Benegal, Jawaharlal Nehru', 'Vasant Dev, Ashok Mishra, Sandeep Pendse', 'Roshan Seth', null, 'Bharat Ek Khoj is a 53-episode Indian historical drama based on the book The Discovery of India by Jawaharlal Nehru, that dramatically unfolds the 5000 year history of India from its beginnings to the coming of independence in 1947. The drama was directed, written and produced by Shyam Benegal with cinematographer V. K. Murthy in 1988 for state-owned Doordarshan. Benegal''s regular script collaborator Shama Zaidi also co-wrote the script.', 'Bharat Ek Khoj is a 53-episode Indian historical drama based on the book The Discovery of India by Jawaharlal Nehru, that dramatically unfolds the 5000 year history of India from its beginnings to the coming of independence in 1947. The drama was directed, written and produced by Shyam Benegal with cinematographer V. K. Murthy in 1988 for state-owned Doordarshan. Benegal''s regular script collaborator Shama Zaidi also co-wrote the script.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eE327cvRMzngQTwMvbTSj6yoo74.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18301'),
  ('94703739219543286', 'The Disguiser', 2015, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Hu Ge, Jin Dong, Wang Kai, Wang Ou, Liu Yijun, Song Yi, Liu Mintao, Wang Lejun', null, 'Set in the Japanese occupation era, the rich yet naive young master Ming Tai is trained to become an agent, and is later sent to become an underground spy for the Communists. Together with his brother and double agent Ming Lou, they try and bring down Wang Wei''s Kuomintang Secret Service Headquarters.', 'Set in the Japanese occupation era, the rich yet naive young master Ming Tai is trained to become an agent, and is later sent to become an underground spy for the Communists. Together with his brother and double agent Ming Lou, they try and bring down Wang Wei''s Kuomintang Secret Service Headquarters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCWLUg5Jd3W96mtMgKUvtak6xS7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65176'),
  ('663086188036020608', 'The District', 2000, 'Drama', 'Terry George, Jack Maple', 'Anthony Sparks, Terry George, Jack Maple', 'Craig T. Nelson, Jonathan LaPaglia, Roger Aaron Brown, Sean Patrick Thomas, Elizabeth Marvel', 'TV-14', 'The District is a television police drama which aired on CBS from October 7, 2000 to May 1, 2004. The show followed the work and personal life of the chief of Washington, D.C.''s Police Department.', 'The District is a television police drama which aired on CBS from October 7, 2000 to May 1, 2004. The show followed the work and personal life of the chief of Washington, D.C.''s Police Department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnd8bGqWZhtEdCwDf5YXdIDaJei.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:396'),
  ('526759980425088149', 'The Divide', 2014, 'Drama', 'Tony Goldwyn, Richard LaGravenese', null, 'Damon Gupton, Marin Ireland, Joe Anderson, Nia Long, Clarke Peters, Paul Schneider', null, 'The Divide is a 2014 legal drama that aired on WE tv. The first season consisted of eight hour-long episodes. It premiered on July 16, 2014. On October 30, 2014, the series was canceled by WE-tv.', 'The Divide is a 2014 legal drama that aired on WE tv. The first season consisted of eight hour-long episodes. It premiered on July 16, 2014. On October 30, 2014, the series was canceled by WE-tv.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVlzsIJfX0pabYsW1MQEq0Ofjxj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57277'),
  ('125772611450858858', 'The Division', 2001, 'Drama', 'Deborah Joy LeVine', null, 'Bonnie Bedelia, Nancy McKeon, Lisa Vidal, Jon Hamm, Taraji P. Henson, Amy Jo Johnson', null, 'The Division is an American crime drama television series created by Deborah Joy LeVine and starring Bonnie Bedelia. The series focused on a team of women police officers in the San Francisco Police Department. The series premiered on Lifetime on January 7, 2001 and ended on June 28, 2004 after 88 episodes.', 'The Division is an American crime drama television series created by Deborah Joy LeVine and starring Bonnie Bedelia. The series focused on a team of women police officers in the San Francisco Police Department. The series premiered on Lifetime on January 7, 2001 and ended on June 28, 2004 after 88 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FE02HHz3Uv9T0yThBq1SahJ4yV.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2222'),
  ('687236470830735586', 'The Divorce Insurance', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Won-suk', '이태윤', 'Lee Dong-wook, Lee Kwang-soo, Lee Ju-bin, Lee Da-hee, Exy, You Hyun-soo, Kim Won-hae, Jo Jae-yun', null, 'No Ki-jun, an employee at an insurance company, decides to develop a divorce insurance policy after personally experiencing three divorces that impacted his life and finances. Despite potential biases, he believes divorce is an unforeseen disaster and establishes a team for divorce insurance.', 'No Ki-jun, an employee at an insurance company, decides to develop a divorce insurance policy after personally experiencing three divorces that impacted his life and finances. Despite potential biases, he believes divorce is an unforeseen disaster and establishes a team for divorce insurance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HAbRWYkX3bouEeHA4bjsUxznKC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258764'),
  ('387696612534345905', 'The Do-Over Damsel Conquers the Dragon Emperor', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shu Uchida, Kikunosuke Toya, Shiori Izawa, Mari Hino, Tatsumaru Tachibana, Shunichi Toki, Ayumi Mano, Yuka Nukui', 'TV-14', 'Jill Savelle—fiancée of the crown prince Gerald de Kleitos and known as the "Lady Goddess of War"—is being hunted down by the same country she swore to protect. Betrayed by her betrothed, she is framed as a traitor and imprisoned. In her last moments, Jill is filled with regret, but just as death approaches, she awakens six years in the past. This time, she will not be a mere pawn. Now as a 10-year-old girl, Jill resolves to escape her imminent engagement to the prince. To this end, she jokingly professes her love to the 19-year-old dragon emperor Hades Theos Rave, who will one day stain the land in blood due to madness. But against all expectations, he accepts! In contrast to the tyrant from Jill''s memories, the Hades of this time is a kind albeit unfortunate emperor. Can Jill prevent Hades from descending down the same dark, villainous road, or is he bound to an inevitable future?', 'Jill Savelle—fiancée of the crown prince Gerald de Kleitos and known as the "Lady Goddess of War"—is being hunted down by the same country she swore to protect. Betrayed by her betrothed, she is framed as a traitor and imprisoned. In her last moments, Jill is filled with regret, but just as death approaches, she awakens six years in the past. This time, she will not be a mere pawn. Now as a 10-year-old girl, Jill resolves to escape her imminent engagement to the prince. To this end, she jokingly professes her love to the 19-year-old dragon emperor Hades Theos Rave, who will one day stain the land in blood due to madness. But against all expectations, he accepts! In contrast to the tyrant from Jill''s memories, the Hades of this time is a kind albeit unfortunate emperor. Can Jill prevent Hades from descending down the same dark, villainous road, or is he bound to an inevitable future?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvpBGiUxOI7QwILqYisu0D4TmLI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244624'),
  ('230152682712844419', 'The Doctor Blake Mysteries', 2013, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Tony Wright, George Adams', null, 'Craig McLachlan, Nadine Garner, Joel Tobeck, Belinda McClory, Timothy Quabba, Anna McGahan, Charlie Cousins', null, 'Dr Lucien Blake left Ballarat as a young man. But now he finds himself returning to take over not only his dead father''s medical practice, but also his on-call role as the town''s police surgeon, only to find change is afoot, nothing is sacred, and no one is safe.', 'Dr Lucien Blake left Ballarat as a young man. But now he finds himself returning to take over not only his dead father''s medical practice, but also his on-call role as the town''s police surgeon, only to find change is afoot, nothing is sacred, and no one is safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQ9uCfDu12jLxMU3ea618LMvMyX.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:59134'),
  ('918720369452458056', 'The Dog House', 2019, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Set inside Wood Green, The Animals Charity, where staff are committed to matching their homeless dogs with hopeful dog owners.', 'Set inside Wood Green, The Animals Charity, where staff are committed to matching their homeless dogs with hopeful dog owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSTudnLuTojZH6tD27CW9bf0VVp.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:104007'),
  ('602467162984888694', 'The Dogs of Karma', 2024, null, null, null, null, null, 'Kubozuka Yosuke and Kamenashi Kazuya play the roles of an avenger duo tied to their dark past. They are not champions of justice, moral teachers, or preachers. Instead, they are professional avengers. Behind the facade of running a small and ordinary old bookstore, Kamo and Tora seek revenge for victims and their families against villains who have escaped legal justice. But why? What drove them to become avengers? The duo targets ruthless murder cases by a rapist, a child abuser, and a family manipulator.', 'Kubozuka Yosuke and Kamenashi Kazuya play the roles of an avenger duo tied to their dark past. They are not champions of justice, moral teachers, or preachers. Instead, they are professional avengers. Behind the facade of running a small and ordinary old bookstore, Kamo and Tora seek revenge for victims and their families against villains who have escaped legal justice. But why? What drove them to become avengers? The duo targets ruthless murder cases by a rapist, a child abuser, and a family manipulator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1Xl7nbCQzTbwdFJEHhHfDPTpvy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:278887'),
  ('406384117415201536', 'The Doll', 1978, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jerzy Kamas, Małgorzata Braunek, Bronisław Pawlik, Emil Karewicz, Marta Lipińska, Alina Janowska, Stefan Friedmann, Wojciech Pokora', null, 'The story of Stanisław Wokulski, a wealthy merchant who falls in love with a haughty aristocrat, Izabela Łęcka. Causing a misalliance in the late nineteenth century Warsaw. Young Wokulski is forced to work as a waiter, while dreaming of a life in science. After taking part in the failed uprising, he is sentenced to exile in Siberia. Upon return to Warsaw, he becomes a salesman. Marrying the late shop owner''s widow, he becomes rich, He uses his money set up a partnership with a Russian merchant, met in the exile. The two makes a fortune supplying the Russian army. Wokulski falls in love with Izabela, daughter of the bankrupt aristocrat. In his quest to win her, he ventures theatres and aristocratic salons. To help her financially distressed father, he founds a company with the aristocrats as shareholders. Wokulski ability to make money is respected, but his lack of social rank is often brought. Izabela eventually accepts his affection, but without true devotion or love.', 'The story of Stanisław Wokulski, a wealthy merchant who falls in love with a haughty aristocrat, Izabela Łęcka. Causing a misalliance in the late nineteenth century Warsaw. Young Wokulski is forced to work as a waiter, while dreaming of a life in science. After taking part in the failed uprising, he is sentenced to exile in Siberia. Upon return to Warsaw, he becomes a salesman. Marrying the late shop owner''s widow, he becomes rich, He uses his money set up a partnership with a Russian merchant, met in the exile. The two makes a fortune supplying the Russian army. Wokulski falls in love with Izabela, daughter of the bankrupt aristocrat. In his quest to win her, he ventures theatres and aristocratic salons. To help her financially distressed father, he founds a company with the aristocrats as shareholders. Wokulski ability to make money is respected, but his lack of social rank is often brought. Izabela eventually accepts his affection, but without true devotion or love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jvhNwu0oGiQazgs0Iu3f1cfVVu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47878'),
  ('1091492430932796071', 'The Doll Factory', 2023, 'Drama', 'Charley Miles', null, 'Esmé Creed-Miles, Éanna Hardwicke, Mirren Mack, George Webster, Freddy Carter, Pippa Haywood, Sharlene Whyte, Reece Kenwyne-Mpudzi', 'TV-MA', 'Iris dreams of being an artist. Silas is a taxidermist who longs to be revered. Louis is a painter searching for his next muse. As their lives collide a love triangle appears to bloom. But this will morph into a story of dark obsession.', 'Iris dreams of being an artist. Silas is a taxidermist who longs to be revered. Louis is a painter searching for his next muse. As their lives collide a love triangle appears to bloom. But this will morph into a story of dark obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQAEVcAWRvcn2qyA1G9TkUNM95P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214191'),
  ('245589335149431015', 'The Dolls', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Dmitry Abezyaev, Viktoriya Ostrovskaya, Mariya Trubnikova', 'Miloš Biković, Paulina Andreeva, Oksana Akinshina, Anna Slyu, Aleksei Kravchenko, Viktoriya Tolstoganova, Lyubov Aksyonova, Izabel Eydlen', null, 'The roaring twenties of the new century. The era of messengers, electronic cigarettes and universal digitalization. The main character is Andrey Mirkin, a promising head of a PR agency. He owes his success and beautiful life to women. Mirkin can seduce almost anyone, he is charismatic, courteous and cynically uses it. He goes head over heels, not thinking about how many lives he has ruined along the way. He just doesn''t care. The cherry on the cake in the hero''s career promises to be a multimillion-dollar tender. Mirkin''s victory in it is guaranteed in advance. But no one knows how much dirt is behind this well-being. And in the coming days, it will overwhelm Mirkin.', 'The roaring twenties of the new century. The era of messengers, electronic cigarettes and universal digitalization. The main character is Andrey Mirkin, a promising head of a PR agency. He owes his success and beautiful life to women. Mirkin can seduce almost anyone, he is charismatic, courteous and cynically uses it. He goes head over heels, not thinking about how many lives he has ruined along the way. He just doesn''t care. The cherry on the cake in the hero''s career promises to be a multimillion-dollar tender. Mirkin''s victory in it is guaranteed in advance. But no one knows how much dirt is behind this well-being. And in the coming days, it will overwhelm Mirkin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJnwXZE2FcumKwPdeRNA5PrIbXH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158226'),
  ('983876181128335454', 'The Donna Reed Show', 1958, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Donna Reed, Carl Betz, Paul Petersen, Patty Petersen', 'TV-PG', 'Revolves around typical family problems, such as firing a clumsy housekeeper, throwing a retirement bash for a colleague, and finding quality time away from the children.', 'Revolves around typical family problems, such as firing a clumsy housekeeper, throwing a retirement bash for a colleague, and finding quality time away from the children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emKpcFHWRosNoQQGyOU0lSn8yAM.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:10649'),
  ('1050428558769332950', 'The Doris Day Show', 1968, 'Comedy, Western', 'James Fritzell', null, 'Doris Day, John Dehner, Jackie Joseph', null, 'The Doris Day Show is an American sitcom that was originally broadcast on the CBS network from September 1968 until March 1973, remaining on the air for five seasons and 128 episodes. In addition to showcasing Doris Day, the show is remembered for its many abrupt format changes over the course of its five-year run. It is also remembered for Day''s statement, in her autobiography Doris Day: Her Own Story, that her husband Martin Melcher had signed her to do the TV series without her knowledge, a fact she only discovered when Melcher died of heart disease on April 20, 1968. The TV show premiered on Tuesday, September 24, 1968.', 'The Doris Day Show is an American sitcom that was originally broadcast on the CBS network from September 1968 until March 1973, remaining on the air for five seasons and 128 episodes. In addition to showcasing Doris Day, the show is remembered for its many abrupt format changes over the course of its five-year run. It is also remembered for Day''s statement, in her autobiography Doris Day: Her Own Story, that her husband Martin Melcher had signed her to do the TV series without her knowledge, a fact she only discovered when Melcher died of heart disease on April 20, 1968. The TV show premiered on Tuesday, September 24, 1968.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hicgxVSdGn0L3EKuVAPgfG3LA8a.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:10099'),
  ('838410219456988268', 'The Double', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Qian Shan Cha Ke', 'Ma ShiGe', 'Wu Jinyan, Wang Xingyue, Chen Xinhai, Liang Yongqi, Joe Chen, Liu Xiening, Li Meng, Yang Chaoyue', null, 'Xue Fangfei, the daughter of a well-off county magistrate lost everything after a major upheaval. Saved by Jiang Li, the daughter of the Secretariat Director, she took on the identity of Jiang Li and returned to the capital. With the help of Duke Xiao Heng and others, she overcame numerous hardships, tirelessly fought against injustice, rescued her father who had been wrongly imprisoned, assisted Xiao Heng in upholding justice, protecting the common people, and ultimately regained a beautiful life.', 'Xue Fangfei, the daughter of a well-off county magistrate lost everything after a major upheaval. Saved by Jiang Li, the daughter of the Secretariat Director, she took on the identity of Jiang Li and returned to the capital. With the help of Duke Xiao Heng and others, she overcame numerous hardships, tirelessly fought against injustice, rescued her father who had been wrongly imprisoned, assisted Xiao Heng in upholding justice, protecting the common people, and ultimately regained a beautiful life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4zFeoSUlqp18yPbzppi5oZRlgH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236033'),
  ('786378659137088846', 'The Dovekeepers', 2015, 'Drama', null, 'Ann Peacock', 'Cote De Pablo, Rachel Brosnahan, Kathryn Prescott, Diego Boneta, André Agius, Jonas Armstrong, Sam Hazeldine, Manuel Cauchi', 'TV-14', 'Set in ancient Israel, The Dovekeepers is based on the true events at Masada in 70 C.E. After being forced out of their home in Jerusalem by the Romans, 900 Jews were ensconced in a fortress at Masada, a mountain in the Judean desert. Besieged at Masada, the Jews held out for months against the vast Roman armies. The events are recounted from the perspective of a few extraordinary women who arrive at Masada with unique backstories, but a common bond for survival. Additionally, these women, who work together daily as dovekeepers, are all concealing substantial secrets. This four-hour limited event series is based on Alice Hoffman''s bestselling, critically acclaimed historical novel.', 'Set in ancient Israel, The Dovekeepers is based on the true events at Masada in 70 C.E. After being forced out of their home in Jerusalem by the Romans, 900 Jews were ensconced in a fortress at Masada, a mountain in the Judean desert. Besieged at Masada, the Jews held out for months against the vast Roman armies. The events are recounted from the perspective of a few extraordinary women who arrive at Masada with unique backstories, but a common bond for survival. Additionally, these women, who work together daily as dovekeepers, are all concealing substantial secrets. This four-hour limited event series is based on Alice Hoffman''s bestselling, critically acclaimed historical novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s55x7Q0Yp8jSMWfNlO7XpLK6d0k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61917'),
  ('728163189364385695', 'The Dr. Oz Show', 2009, 'Talk', 'Oprah Winfrey', null, 'Mehmet Oz', null, 'The Dr. Oz Show is an American syndicated television talk show, hosted by Mehmet Oz, a cardiothoracic surgeon and teaching professor at Columbia University who became famous for his appearances on The Oprah Winfrey Show. The fifth season premiered on September 9, 2013.', 'The Dr. Oz Show is an American syndicated television talk show, hosted by Mehmet Oz, a cardiothoracic surgeon and teaching professor at Columbia University who became famous for his appearances on The Oprah Winfrey Show. The fifth season premiered on September 9, 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvZussCQDXKsmZNF4LCyZC8uuW3.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:21768'),
  ('1007088814730224840', 'The Dragnet', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Wu Gang, Ke Lan, Ning Li, Simon Yam, Yu Feihong, Shi Liang, Kenneth Tsang, Lam Suet', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zB4faOhCO4Jr2BATtkkLrYH6J21.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117471'),
  ('173055624038188574', 'The Dragon Dentist', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Otaro Maijo', null, 'Yoshiko Sengen, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Koichi Yamadera, Megumi Hayashibara, Kaori Nazuka, Yukitoshi Tokumoto, Wataru Takagi, Suzuki Matsuo', null, 'The story takes place in Dragon Country. Nonoko is a newly appointed dentist and her mission is to protect the dragon, the guardian of the country, from tooth-cavity bacteria. One day, amid increasingly fierce battles with the neighboring country, Nonoko finds on the dragon''s tooth an unconscious boy soldier from the enemy country. His name is Bell, and he has been resurrected from inside the tooth by the dragon—a supernatural phenomenon that legend says occurs before a major disaster. As Nonoko and Bell go through a series of fierce battles, they eventually learn to accept their fate.', 'The story takes place in Dragon Country. Nonoko is a newly appointed dentist and her mission is to protect the dragon, the guardian of the country, from tooth-cavity bacteria. One day, amid increasingly fierce battles with the neighboring country, Nonoko finds on the dragon''s tooth an unconscious boy soldier from the enemy country. His name is Bell, and he has been resurrected from inside the tooth by the dragon—a supernatural phenomenon that legend says occurs before a major disaster. As Nonoko and Bell go through a series of fierce battles, they eventually learn to accept their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnN2C6kud4T54AaF2bqAqW5IoWd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70468'),
  ('659220233740438181', 'The Dragon Prince', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Justin Richmond, Aaron Ehasz', null, 'Jack De Sena, Paula Burrows, Sasha Rojen, Racquel Belmonte, Jesse Inocalla, Jonathan Holmes, Omari Newton, Erik Dellums', 'TV-PG', 'An extraordinary discovery inspires two human princes and an elven assassin to team up on an epic quest to bring peace to their warring lands.', 'An extraordinary discovery inspires two human princes and an elven assassin to team up on an epic quest to bring peace to their warring lands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7PIRa6ez7ZEl9D4JUrnSsmcnVD.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:81046'),
  ('682229459962447175', 'The Dream Life of Mr. Kim', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jo Hyun-tak', 'Kim Hong-ki', 'Ryu Seung-ryong, Myung Se-bin, Cha Kang-yoon, Yoo Seung-mok, Lee Shin-ki, Shin Dong-won, Jung Soon-won, Ha Seo-yoon', null, 'Kim Nak-su is a middle-aged man who loses everything he once considered valuable in an instant. After a long journey, he finally discovers his true self, beyond his role as a department manager at a large corporation.', 'Kim Nak-su is a middle-aged man who loses everything he once considered valuable in an instant. After a long journey, he finally discovers his true self, beyond his role as a department manager at a large corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcaYFdxzsCnaNlVtHNhwiBubYXf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275592'),
  ('733222632094340353', 'The Dream of Red Mansions', 2010, 'Drama', null, 'Qing Mei', 'Yang Yang, Jiang Mengjie, Li Qin, Tsai Chin, Yang Mi, Gua Ah-leh, Yao Di, Michelle Bai', null, 'Jai Baoyu is a male heir who grew up in a wealthy feudal clan dominated by women. His love affairs with his cousins Lin Daiyu and Xue Baochai happened in the midst of his family''s struggle to remain influential.', 'Jai Baoyu is a male heir who grew up in a wealthy feudal clan dominated by women. His love affairs with his cousins Lin Daiyu and Xue Baochai happened in the midst of his family''s struggle to remain influential.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tJKf5Qd1CFsfRYxGBm462roPf0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86232'),
  ('127363258856080466', 'The Dreaming Boy Is a Realist', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Naoya Miyase, Akiho Suzumoto, Yumiri Hanamori, Mikako Komatsu, Kaori Ishihara, Iori Saeki, Minami Kurisaka', 'TV-14', 'Did Wataru''s intentions slip by Aika because she was getting impatient?! This is the start of a romcom revolving around two people who just can''t get their feelings across and both think their love is unrequited!', 'Did Wataru''s intentions slip by Aika because she was getting impatient?! This is the start of a romcom revolving around two people who just can''t get their feelings across and both think their love is unrequited!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85EoiGOOG58oP9HlvxiWjvgkMNR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214651'),
  ('678188692995722875', 'The Dreamstone', 1990, 'Family, Animation', 'Michael Jupp', null, 'Stuart Lock, Nancy Hendry, John Franklyn-Robbins, Gary Martin, Melvyn Hayes, Anthony Jackson, Peter Craze, Colin Marsh', null, 'The Dreamstone is a British animated television series that ran for 4 series of 13 episodes each between 1990 and 1995. The original concept and artwork were created by Michael Jupp who would later create another cartoon show Bimble''s Bucket. The series was produced by FilmFair as a Central production for ITV. In 1996 Filmfair was bought from the Caspian Group by the Canadian company Cinar, then it became Cookie Jar Entertainment, but then it became part of DHX Media. This resulted in DHX''s ownership of the first two series, while a company called Dreamstone Productions Ltd. retain the ownership of the third and fourth series. The Dreamstone is set in an alternative world called the ''Sleeping World,'' and concerns itself principally with the struggle between good, and evil.', 'The Dreamstone is a British animated television series that ran for 4 series of 13 episodes each between 1990 and 1995. The original concept and artwork were created by Michael Jupp who would later create another cartoon show Bimble''s Bucket. The series was produced by FilmFair as a Central production for ITV. In 1996 Filmfair was bought from the Caspian Group by the Canadian company Cinar, then it became Cookie Jar Entertainment, but then it became part of DHX Media. This resulted in DHX''s ownership of the first two series, while a company called Dreamstone Productions Ltd. retain the ownership of the third and fourth series. The Dreamstone is set in an alternative world called the ''Sleeping World,'' and concerns itself principally with the struggle between good, and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8gVkpMqOarvG6Z2urbtQnanZRU.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:117'),
  ('552921120966074321', 'The Dresden Files', 2007, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Jim Butcher', null, 'Paul Blackthorne, Valerie Cruz, Terrence Mann, Raoul Bhaneja, Conrad Coates', 'TV-PG', 'A Chicago-based wizard works as a private investigator.', 'A Chicago-based wizard works as a private investigator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rujRcP9fZAk7Sq0U8iDITOXouCW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4955'),
  ('537862115261272906', 'The Drew Barrymore Show', 2020, 'Talk', 'Drew Barrymore', null, 'Drew Barrymore', 'TV-G', 'Drew Barrymore presents human-interest stories, celebrity guests, lifestyle segments and field pieces, all driven by her infectious brand of humor and optimism.', 'Drew Barrymore presents human-interest stories, celebrity guests, lifestyle segments and field pieces, all driven by her infectious brand of humor and optimism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7X3BkHmyPUp2pbYeN1qITgKfrOz.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:108178'),
  ('346150590354575753', 'The Drew Carey Show', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Bruce Helford, Drew Carey', null, 'Drew Carey, Ryan Stiles, Diedrich Bader, Cynthia Watros, Kathy Kinney', 'TV-PG', 'Drew is an assistant director of personnel in a Cleveland department store and he has been stuck there for ten years. Other than fighting with co-worker Mimi, his hobbies include drinking beer and not being able to get dates. To make a few extra bucks he has a micro-brewery going in his garage with his buddies.', 'Drew is an assistant director of personnel in a Cleveland department store and he has been stuck there for ten years. Other than fighting with co-worker Mimi, his hobbies include drinking beer and not being able to get dates. To make a few extra bucks he has a micro-brewery going in his garage with his buddies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWboJ8Cfi5NgHoENAB0gYtgZHkR.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:97'),
  ('47513902341606198', 'The Driver', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jim Poyser, Daniel Brocklehurst', 'Daniel Brocklehurst', 'David Morrissey, Claudie Blakley, Ian Hart, Harish Patel, Sacha Parkinson, Lee Ross, Lewis Rainer, Colm Meaney', null, 'The Driver is a three-part British crime drama serial aired on BBC One between 23 September and 7 October 2014. Written by Danny Brocklehurst and directed by Jamie Payne, it stars David Morrissey as despondent cab driver Vince McKee, whose life is turned upside down when he agrees to be the driver for a criminal gang.', 'The Driver is a three-part British crime drama serial aired on BBC One between 23 September and 7 October 2014. Written by Danny Brocklehurst and directed by Jamie Payne, it stars David Morrissey as despondent cab driver Vince McKee, whose life is turned upside down when he agrees to be the driver for a criminal gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeveGKPiqqUbWptQLmsGpbDZk4c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61393'),
  ('809909367064771946', 'The Dropout', 2022, 'Drama', 'Elizabeth Meriwether', null, 'Amanda Seyfried, Naveen Andrews', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Elizabeth Holmes, the enigmatic Stanford dropout who founded medical testing start-up Theranos. Lauded as a Steve Jobs for the next tech generation and once worth billions of dollars, the myth crumbled when it was revealed that none of the tech actually worked, putting thousands of people''s health in grave danger.', 'The story of Elizabeth Holmes, the enigmatic Stanford dropout who founded medical testing start-up Theranos. Lauded as a Steve Jobs for the next tech generation and once worth billions of dollars, the myth crumbled when it was revealed that none of the tech actually worked, putting thousands of people''s health in grave danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SkOJF92FE0H1UXeOgLz7lAnoMb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122066'),
  ('950354087406607492', 'The Drops of God', 2026, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Takuya Sato, Kazuya Kamenashi, Maaya Uchida, Banjo Ginga, Yuhko Kaida, Shinshu Fuji, Misa Watanabe, Yuuya Uchida', null, 'Shizuku Kanzaki, estranged son of a famous wine critic, has never had a glass of wine. When his father unexpectedly dies, he learns he must compete for his father''s inheritance against Issei Tomine, a man adopted as the late Kanzaki''s protege. With the help of a strange and passionate wine stewardess-in-training, he comes to realize a love for the complexities of wine, and begins to develop an understanding of his distant father.', 'Shizuku Kanzaki, estranged son of a famous wine critic, has never had a glass of wine. When his father unexpectedly dies, he learns he must compete for his father''s inheritance against Issei Tomine, a man adopted as the late Kanzaki''s protege. With the help of a strange and passionate wine stewardess-in-training, he comes to realize a love for the complexities of wine, and begins to develop an understanding of his distant father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13BJOVrahDs0nF7mxxhvbuJSz94.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306121'),
  ('214022035882542359', 'The Drowning', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jill Halfpenny, Jonas Armstrong, Cody Molko, Deborah Findlay, Jade Anouka, Dara Devaney, Deirdre Mullins, Babs Olusanmokun', 'TV-14', 'Since losing her son eight years ago, Jodie has been rebuilding her life but when she catches sight of Daniel, she is convinced she has found her missing son.', 'Since losing her son eight years ago, Jodie has been rebuilding her life but when she catches sight of Daniel, she is convinced she has found her missing son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jdOyS9OXbtobEYDl8Z4V4iWaH3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117946'),
  ('472402643049815971', 'The Drug Hunter', 2018, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', null, 'Jin Aju', 'Yu Hewei, Hou Meng Sha, Zhang Danfeng, Fu Chengpeng, Wu Xiubo, Xu Zheng, Zhang Lu, Liu Xiaofeng', null, 'An educated chemical engineer becomes an undercover officer against drug dealers.', 'An educated chemical engineer becomes an undercover officer against drug dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdBr3qKWYbUoRfc8QKHQgm334an.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80686'),
  ('178087559662954516', 'The Dry', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nancy Harris', null, 'Roisin Gallagher', 'NR', 'In the series, when Shiv Sheridan returns to Dublin after years of partying in London, she is sober and full of good intentions – but being back with her family makes staying on ‘the dry'' much harder than she expected. As Shiv tries to navigate this new phase of her life, so must her family and they all have issues they don''t want to face.', 'In the series, when Shiv Sheridan returns to Dublin after years of partying in London, she is sober and full of good intentions – but being back with her family makes staying on ‘the dry'' much harder than she expected. As Shiv tries to navigate this new phase of her life, so must her family and they all have issues they don''t want to face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwe65Wfk0dvdCy0aAyXdEjevIu0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:201209'),
  ('1060747986353194430', 'The Duchess', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Katherine Ryan', 'Katherine Ryan', 'Katherine Ryan, Rory Keenan, Katy Byrne, Michelle de Swarte, Max Fincham, Steen Raskopoulos', 'TV-MA', 'Katherine''s a single mom juggling her career, her tween daughter, her relationship with her boyfriend — and pondering getting pregnant with her ex.', 'Katherine''s a single mom juggling her career, her tween daughter, her relationship with her boyfriend — and pondering getting pregnant with her ex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jQJrEn6gKsEzQr9eJPHKGpdFTJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107363'),
  ('1089665448470368653', 'The Duchess of Duke Street', 1976, 'Drama', 'John Hawkesworth', null, 'Gemma Jones', null, 'The Duchess of Duke Street is a British television period drama created and written by John Hawkesworth, loosely based on the real-life career of Rosa Lewis, and produced by the BBC and Time-Life Television Productions for BBC One. The programme ran for two series from 1976 to 1977. In Victorian London, Louisa Leyton works her way up from servant to renowned cook to proprietress of the upper-class Bentinck Hotel in Duke Street, St James''s.', 'The Duchess of Duke Street is a British television period drama created and written by John Hawkesworth, loosely based on the real-life career of Rosa Lewis, and produced by the BBC and Time-Life Television Productions for BBC One. The programme ran for two series from 1976 to 1977. In Victorian London, Louisa Leyton works her way up from servant to renowned cook to proprietress of the upper-class Bentinck Hotel in Duke Street, St James''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d65klq9CnesUlWn3RCKuiNj7qM9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13753'),
  ('1108078281429117693', 'The Dude Perfect Show', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Cory Cotton, Coby Cotton, Garrett Hilbert, Cody Jones, Tyler Toney', 'TV-PG', 'In this show, you''ll meet the five guys behind the viral YouTube magic: Tyler, the bearded guy; Cody; the tall one; Garrett; the purple hoser; and Coby and Cory, the twins. Operating from their Dude Perfect headquarters in Frisco, Texas, Dude Perfect has the job every kid dreams of. Whether it’s working with celebrity guest stars like Luke Bryan, Dale Earnhardt Jr and Aaron Rodgers, or prepping for their next battle video, Giant Basketball Arcade, Lawnmower Race or Epic Snow Battle, these guys have made a career out of having fun.', 'In this show, you''ll meet the five guys behind the viral YouTube magic: Tyler, the bearded guy; Cody; the tall one; Garrett; the purple hoser; and Coby and Cory, the twins. Operating from their Dude Perfect headquarters in Frisco, Texas, Dude Perfect has the job every kid dreams of. Whether it’s working with celebrity guest stars like Luke Bryan, Dale Earnhardt Jr and Aaron Rodgers, or prepping for their next battle video, Giant Basketball Arcade, Lawnmower Race or Epic Snow Battle, these guys have made a career out of having fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1mQgypsZTkbp09A2d3vtNaNLjk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66548'),
  ('32414478885001552', 'The Dudesons', 2006, 'Documentary, Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Jarno Laasala, Hannu-Pekka Parviainen, Jarppi Leppälä, Jukka Hildén', 'TV-14', 'The Dudesons is a reality series following four Finnish friends as they dare each other to perform stupid stunts and crazy antics.', 'The Dudesons is a reality series following four Finnish friends as they dare each other to perform stupid stunts and crazy antics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCNLfAfW1TBYRIMcR3eJIWnGO5n.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:27747'),
  ('1003765768667352998', 'The Duel Club', 2022, 'Drama', 'Sergey Taramaev, Lyubov Lvova', 'Sergey Taramaev, Lyubov Lvova', 'Gleb Kalyuzhny, Artem Koshman, Valentin Antsiferov, Nikita Kologrivyy, Anastasiya Krasovskaya, Olga Tsirsen, Oleg Chugunov, Sergey Gilev', null, 'Egor lives in a small seaside town and is graduating from high school this spring. He cannot stand the routine of his life much longer, and with his loyal friends Kisa and Hank, they start to look for excitement in their small town.', 'Egor lives in a small seaside town and is graduating from high school this spring. He cannot stand the routine of his life much longer, and with his loyal friends Kisa and Hank, they start to look for excitement in their small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iXhTZAawc7wrqOpklxmsz8cfos.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157535'),
  ('1133541470982476531', 'The Duke of Death and His Maid', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Ayumi Mano, Hochu Otsuka, Inori Minase, Wakana Kuramochi, Hiroshi Kamiya, Yuma Uchida, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-14', 'Due to a childhood curse, anything that the Duke touches will die - which makes his flirty maid’s behavior all the more shocking! Can the Duke and his companions break the curse, or is he doomed to a life where love is forever out of his reach?', 'Due to a childhood curse, anything that the Duke touches will die - which makes his flirty maid’s behavior all the more shocking! Can the Duke and his companions break the curse, or is he doomed to a life where love is forever out of his reach?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNf26LXRCO1zX0R7RLgzN3x1DDL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117992'),
  ('192581408584070433', 'The Duke of Mount Deer', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Tim-Sing', null, 'Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Steven Ma Chun-Wai, Hilary Tsui Ho-Ying, Rain Lau Yuk-Chui, Cherie Chan Siu-Ha, Ku Feng, Lau Kong, Ken Lok Tat-Wah', null, 'Wai Siu Bo is the son of a prostitute who works in a brothel in Yangzhou. After joining the Heaven and Earth society, he heads to the Capital and gets enrolled into the service of the Grand Eunuchs. There he becomes friends with the young emperor Hong Hei (Wai mistakes the emperor as another young eunuch) and falls in love with the emperor''s younger sister, Princess Kin Ning. His adventures in the Forbidden City leads him into discovering the empress dowager as an impostor; finding several volumes of the prized 42 Chapters which contains the location of a treasure cave; helps the emperor kill the baddie courtier, Lord Obai; and see his position rise from humble eunuch to a grand courtier and confidante of the emperor.', 'Wai Siu Bo is the son of a prostitute who works in a brothel in Yangzhou. After joining the Heaven and Earth society, he heads to the Capital and gets enrolled into the service of the Grand Eunuchs. There he becomes friends with the young emperor Hong Hei (Wai mistakes the emperor as another young eunuch) and falls in love with the emperor''s younger sister, Princess Kin Ning. His adventures in the Forbidden City leads him into discovering the empress dowager as an impostor; finding several volumes of the prized 42 Chapters which contains the location of a treasure cave; helps the emperor kill the baddie courtier, Lord Obai; and see his position rise from humble eunuch to a grand courtier and confidante of the emperor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZLbJlF5ee21LNqJ8L7Rs3pWH81.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65568'),
  ('453141779528896096', 'The Dukes of Hazzard', 1979, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Rod Amateau, Gy Waldron', null, 'Tom Wopat, John Schneider, Catherine Bach, Denver Pyle, Ben Jones, Sorrell Booke, James Best, Sonny Shroyer', 'TV-PG', 'Cousins Bo and Luke Duke and their car "General Lee", assisted by Cousin Daisy and Uncle Jesse, have a running battle with the authorities of Hazzard County (Boss Hogg and Sheriff Coltrane), plus a string of ne''er-do-wells often backed by the scheming Hogg.', 'Cousins Bo and Luke Duke and their car "General Lee", assisted by Cousin Daisy and Uncle Jesse, have a running battle with the authorities of Hazzard County (Boss Hogg and Sheriff Coltrane), plus a string of ne''er-do-wells often backed by the scheming Hogg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9eXJUxP6zgrpCMEOJzaEXzXLsp.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:397'),
  ('234770296964763755', 'The Dumping Ground', 2013, 'Family, Kids', null, null, 'Kia Pegg, Sarah Rayson, Stacy Liu, Connor Byrne, Miles Butler-Hughton, Hannah Moncur, Lewis G Hamilton, Mia McKenna-Bruce', null, 'Following the exploits and antics of children living in a care home. Growing up in a care home brings all sorts of tough challenges, but the kids know that if they stick together, they can get through anything life throws at them.', 'Following the exploits and antics of children living in a care home. Growing up in a care home brings all sorts of tough challenges, but the kids know that if they stick together, they can get through anything life throws at them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/embpxgcIHxpqneNsjaxnPRktmi4.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:44810'),
  ('142166092777297858', 'The Dungeon of Black Company', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Misaki Kuno, Hiro Shimono, Satomi Sato, Wataru Takagi, Megumi Toda, Mao Ichimichi, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'TV-14', 'Kinji, who lacks any kind of work ethic, is a layabout in his modern life. One day, he finds himself transported to another world–but not in a grand fantasy of a hero welcomed with open arms. He''s immediately shoved into a terrible job! Now enslaved by an evil mining company in a fantasy world, Kinji''s about to really learn the meaning of hard work!', 'Kinji, who lacks any kind of work ethic, is a layabout in his modern life. One day, he finds himself transported to another world–but not in a grand fantasy of a hero welcomed with open arms. He''s immediately shoved into a terrible job! Now enslaved by an evil mining company in a fantasy world, Kinji''s about to really learn the meaning of hard work!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVHfZoFzl7MbKBgNaAnhIdwseXY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105476'),
  ('140711163115907302', 'The DuPont Show with June Allyson', 1959, 'Drama', null, null, 'June Allyson', null, 'The DuPont Show with June Allyson is an American anthology drama series which aired on CBS from September 21, 1959 to April 3, 1961 with rebroadcasts continuing until June 12, 1961. The series was hosted by actress June Allyson.', 'The DuPont Show with June Allyson is an American anthology drama series which aired on CBS from September 21, 1959 to April 3, 1961 with rebroadcasts continuing until June 12, 1961. The series was hosted by actress June Allyson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ucAnc3yFX0zu4EKX4JMcq1Egzs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:18021'),
  ('158803137344127549', 'The Durrells', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Simon Nye', null, 'Keeley Hawes, Josh O''Connor, Milo Parker, Daisy Waterstone, Callum Woodhouse, Alexis Georgoulis, Yorgos Karamihos', 'TV-PG', 'In 1935, financially strapped widow Louisa Durrell, whose life has fallen apart, decides to move from England, with her four children (three sons, one daughter), to the island of Corfu, Greece. Once there, the family moves into a dilapidated old house that has no electricity and that is crumbling apart. But life on Corfu is cheap, it''s an earthly paradise, and the Durrells proceed to forge their new existence, with all its challenges, adventures, and forming relationships.', 'In 1935, financially strapped widow Louisa Durrell, whose life has fallen apart, decides to move from England, with her four children (three sons, one daughter), to the island of Corfu, Greece. Once there, the family moves into a dilapidated old house that has no electricity and that is crumbling apart. But life on Corfu is cheap, it''s an earthly paradise, and the Durrells proceed to forge their new existence, with all its challenges, adventures, and forming relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgZiuQ9PMeyHU7xMaIctwRu4SLa.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:66134'),
  ('43613474118252973', 'The Dust Bowl', 2012, 'Documentary', null, 'Dayton Duncan', 'Patricia Clarkson, Peter Coyote, Carolyn McCormick', null, 'Chronicles the worst man-made ecological disaster in American history, in which the frenzied wheat boom of the Great Plow-Up, followed by a decade-long drought during the 1930s nearly swept away the breadbasket of the nation.', 'Chronicles the worst man-made ecological disaster in American history, in which the frenzied wheat boom of the Great Plow-Up, followed by a decade-long drought during the 1930s nearly swept away the breadbasket of the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fa7F0yq1mwvXE8MooF5ah8dua33.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56629'),
  ('935728892538218957', 'The Dying Detective', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Sara Heldt', 'Rolf Lassgård, Angelika Prick, Helena af Sandeberg, Alexej Manvelov, Lena B. Eriksson, Henrik Norlén, Per Svensson, Amanda Ooms', null, 'A doctor orders lifestyle change to prevent heart attack. Retired detective investigates 1985 rape and murder case, following a killer in Sweden, uncertain of next steps.', 'A doctor orders lifestyle change to prevent heart attack. Retired detective investigates 1985 rape and murder case, following a killer in Sweden, uncertain of next steps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92VEErr07l9sxrQV2Gu3CkRCh1s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76098'),
  ('517830914262209737', 'The Dynasty: New England Patriots', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Brady, Bill Belichick, Robert Kraft', 'TV-MA', 'Go inside the franchise''s 20-year journey, from the unique chemistry that fueled six Super Bowl wins to the internal strife that sparked a turf war. Tom Brady, Bill Belichick, Robert Kraft, and key players reveal the road to—and cost of—greatness.', 'Go inside the franchise''s 20-year journey, from the unique chemistry that fueled six Super Bowl wins to the internal strife that sparked a turf war. Tom Brady, Bill Belichick, Robert Kraft, and key players reveal the road to—and cost of—greatness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68d28XHYGsU5m9pRkRUUdDKXfbP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239748'),
  ('590620542930462641', 'The Eagle: A Crime Odyssey', 2004, 'Crime, Drama', 'Peter Thorsboe, Mai Brostrøm', 'Peter Thorsboe, Mai Brostrøm', 'Jens Albinus, Ghita Nørby, Marina Bouras, Steen Stig Lommer, Janus Nabil Bakrawi, Susan A. Olsen, David Owe', null, 'The Eagle: A Crime Odyssey is a Danish police procedural television series produced by Danmarks Radio, created and written by Peter Thorsboe and Mai Brostrøm. The series debuted on 10 October 2004 in Denmark. It won an International Emmy Award from the International Academy of Television Arts &amp; Sciences for best non-American television drama series in 2005. There were three seasons; the second season premiered in Denmark on 9 October 2005 and the third on 8 October 2006. The last episode originally aired in Denmark on 26 November 2006. The series was filmed on location in various parts of northern Europe, from Berlin and Copenhagen to Oslo and other locations including Iceland. The series has enjoyed particular success in Australia, where it airs on SBS and is available on DVD with English subtitles.', 'The Eagle: A Crime Odyssey is a Danish police procedural television series produced by Danmarks Radio, created and written by Peter Thorsboe and Mai Brostrøm. The series debuted on 10 October 2004 in Denmark. It won an International Emmy Award from the International Academy of Television Arts &amp; Sciences for best non-American television drama series in 2005. There were three seasons; the second season premiered in Denmark on 9 October 2005 and the third on 8 October 2006. The last episode originally aired in Denmark on 26 November 2006. The series was filmed on location in various parts of northern Europe, from Berlin and Copenhagen to Oslo and other locations including Iceland. The series has enjoyed particular success in Australia, where it airs on SBS and is available on DVD with English subtitles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTuHsoyVPlzDnUQ4noA0tgmyWN1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2873'),
  ('76358920718129351', 'The Early Show', 1999, 'News', null, null, 'Chris Wragge, Jeff Glor, Erica Hill', null, 'The Early Show is an American morning television show which was broadcast by CBS from New York City from 1999 to 2012. The program aired live from 7 to 9 a.m. Eastern Time Monday through Friday in the Eastern time zone; most affiliates in the Central, Mountain, and Pacific time zones aired the show on tape-delay from 7 to 9 a.m. local time. The Saturday edition aired live from 7 to 9 a.m. Eastern Time as well, but a number of affiliates did not carry it or aired it later on tape-delay. It premiered on November 1, 1999, and was the newest of the major networks'' morning shows, although CBS has made several attempts to program in the morning slot since 1954. The show aired as a division of CBS News. The Early Show, like many of its predecessors, traditionally ran last in the ratings to its rivals, NBC''s Today and ABC''s Good Morning America. Much like NBC''s The Today Show and The Tonight Show, the title The Early Show was analogous to that of CBS''s late-night talk show, The Late Show.', 'The Early Show is an American morning television show which was broadcast by CBS from New York City from 1999 to 2012. The program aired live from 7 to 9 a.m. Eastern Time Monday through Friday in the Eastern time zone; most affiliates in the Central, Mountain, and Pacific time zones aired the show on tape-delay from 7 to 9 a.m. local time. The Saturday edition aired live from 7 to 9 a.m. Eastern Time as well, but a number of affiliates did not carry it or aired it later on tape-delay. It premiered on November 1, 1999, and was the newest of the major networks'' morning shows, although CBS has made several attempts to program in the morning slot since 1954. The show aired as a division of CBS News. The Early Show, like many of its predecessors, traditionally ran last in the ratings to its rivals, NBC''s Today and ABC''s Good Morning America. Much like NBC''s The Today Show and The Tonight Show, the title The Early Show was analogous to that of CBS''s late-night talk show, The Late Show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJvwr7kL0Q7BtrYC38KQ5baPw7g.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:3167'),
  ('214062172173158084', 'The Earth', 2026, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Lapisara Intarasut, Panthita Jencharoentham, Sarocha Chankimha, Engfa Waraha, Milin Watinthanakit, Nutthasid Panyangarm, Pathsitar Phengkong, Natsinee Charoensitthisap', null, 'Rose Thippapha, heir to the Chomjan acreage, returns to Chiang Rai from America when her stepfather falls into a coma following a suspicious accident. There, she finds herself in danger from Wasu, a vineyard owner who seeks to force her into marriage and snatch up her land for his illegal business operations. Fortunately, Rose''s childhood friend and owner of an organic vegetable farm Din Kasama Wathinwanit comes to protect her. To secure her safety, she and Din will have to marry. Even if it''s only a sham marriage, their reestablished closeness gradually brings about real feelings.', 'Rose Thippapha, heir to the Chomjan acreage, returns to Chiang Rai from America when her stepfather falls into a coma following a suspicious accident. There, she finds herself in danger from Wasu, a vineyard owner who seeks to force her into marriage and snatch up her land for his illegal business operations. Fortunately, Rose''s childhood friend and owner of an organic vegetable farm Din Kasama Wathinwanit comes to protect her. To secure her safety, she and Din will have to marry. Even if it''s only a sham marriage, their reestablished closeness gradually brings about real feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j51J5g8jupMuvlSCDFAyP9wH9vm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287115'),
  ('1074462051058366804', 'The Eastern Gate', 2025, 'War & Politics, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, null, 'Lena Góra, Andrzej Konopka, Bartłomiej Topa, Ewelina Starejki, Karol Pocheć, Alona Szostak', 'TV-MA', 'Ewa Oginiec wants to leave the secret service and start over after a personal tragedy but things take a turn when her partner, also an agent, is exposed by Russian intelligence and mysteriously disappears.', 'Ewa Oginiec wants to leave the secret service and start over after a personal tragedy but things take a turn when her partner, also an agent, is exposed by Russian intelligence and mysteriously disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ameJi7taGoBfBYWZKTqLT6yCCOD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253370'),
  ('253369467539663926', 'The Eccentric Family', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Junichi Suwabe, Mai Nakahara, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Kikuko Inoue, Ayane Sakura, Mamiko Noto, Hideyuki Umezu', 'TV-14', 'In Kyoto, humans and supernatural creatures live side-by-side. Soichiro Shimogamo used to be the head of tanuki society, but without warning one day he was made into tanuki stew, and no one knows how it happened. He left four sons behind who all live happily with their mother. What does fate have in store for this strongly bonded family?!', 'In Kyoto, humans and supernatural creatures live side-by-side. Soichiro Shimogamo used to be the head of tanuki society, but without warning one day he was made into tanuki stew, and no one knows how it happened. He left four sons behind who all live happily with their mother. What does fate have in store for this strongly bonded family?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDq0Q9OoeFOqJGCaV9sdn1cmJNy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61338'),
  ('79418071883587034', 'The Echoes of Survivors: Inside Korea''s Tragedies', 2025, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, null, null, 'Discover the harrowing tales of those who survived Korea''s gloomiest chapters, shedding a light on long-hidden truths.', 'Discover the harrowing tales of those who survived Korea''s gloomiest chapters, shedding a light on long-hidden truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhT5oPlsiPV8j5YAwLo12UIU6QS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290682'),
  ('150760058946993797', 'The Eclipse', 2022, 'Drama', 'Chairat Pipitpattanaprap', 'Minta Bhanaparin, Apirak Chaipanha, Chot-anan Kasamwonghong', 'Kanaphan Puitrakul, Thanawat Ratanakitpaisan, Trai Nimtawat, Thanawin Teeraphosukarn, Chayapol Jutamas, Thanik Kamontharanon, Patchatorn Thanawat, Varayu Pusomjitsakul', null, 'School is the second home that will shape them to continue to grow in society, but if school rules become a problem, do these students have no right to fight for what they''ve stolen? In schools, when there are rulers, there are also those who wish to break the rules, and that clash may drive love between two people.', 'School is the second home that will shape them to continue to grow in society, but if school rules become a problem, do these students have no right to fight for what they''ve stolen? In schools, when there are rulers, there are also those who wish to break the rules, and that clash may drive love between two people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upelDW5lk3wu0F4Cz9vVwXNvluE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207024'),
  ('870052813218933441', 'The Ed Sullivan Show', 1948, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Ed Sullivan', 'NR', 'The Ed Sullivan Show is an American TV variety show that originally ran on CBS from Sunday June 20, 1948 to Sunday June 6, 1971, and was hosted by New York entertainment columnist Ed Sullivan. It was replaced in September 1971 by the CBS Sunday Night Movie, which ran only one season and was eventually replaced by other shows. In 2002, The Ed Sullivan Show was ranked #15 on TV Guide''s 50 Greatest TV Shows of All Time.', 'The Ed Sullivan Show is an American TV variety show that originally ran on CBS from Sunday June 20, 1948 to Sunday June 6, 1971, and was hosted by New York entertainment columnist Ed Sullivan. It was replaced in September 1971 by the CBS Sunday Night Movie, which ran only one season and was eventually replaced by other shows. In 2002, The Ed Sullivan Show was ranked #15 on TV Guide''s 50 Greatest TV Shows of All Time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUEfDXUxwhgXBX7LSk57vJKXCTp.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:5307'),
  ('855893889104743602', 'The Eddy', 2020, 'Drama', 'Jack Thorne', null, 'André Holland, Joanna Kulig, Leïla Bekhti, Adil Dehbi, Randy Kerber, Ludovic Louis, Damian Nueva Cortes, Lada Obradovic', 'TV-MA', 'The owner of a Paris jazz club gets tangled up with dangerous criminals as he fights to protect his business, his band and his teenage daughter.', 'The owner of a Paris jazz club gets tangled up with dangerous criminals as he fights to protect his business, his band and his teenage daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfpB5bU70zPtwhKDT6s9N3iNXbU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86784'),
  ('168340884435427588', 'The Edge and Christian Show That Totally Reeks of Awesomeness', 2016, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Adam Copeland, Jason Reso, Matthew Hardy, Amy Dumas, Jeff Hardy', 'TV-PG', 'WWE presents a half-hour variety show starring the talented duo Edge and Christian, in a series that will take a look back at all the highs and lows of sports-entertainment, while offering a unique and humor filled perspective to the WWE Universe.', 'WWE presents a half-hour variety show starring the talented duo Edge and Christian, in a series that will take a look back at all the highs and lows of sports-entertainment, while offering a unique and humor filled perspective to the WWE Universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9L7a0YwTCk0urHBLHR8o2VY0Xez.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65899'),
  ('502761926157566479', 'The Edge of Righteousness', 1993, 'Crime, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ga-Ho Lau', null, 'Alex Man Chi-Leung, Dicky Cheung Wai-Kin, Athena Chu Yan, Monica Chan Fat-Yung, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Jessica Hsuan, Wilson Ai Wai, Kwan Hoi-San', null, 'LUI MAN FUNG (MAN TSE LEUNG) is a top neurological surgeon, a very earnest and resolute type who will try to achieve his goals by hook or by crook. Because of his character defects, he has been on bad terms with his family. Even his girlfriend YIP MAN (HSUAN JESSICA HESTER) is worried about his raging temper. The relationship between the pair therefore involves frequent quarrels and arguments. Eight-year-old NG SIU TUNG (CHENG PAK LAM) has been suffering from brain cancer. Wishing for a medical cure, he follows his uncle LUK AH CHOI (CHEUNG WAI KIN) to the United States to seek consultation treatment.....', 'LUI MAN FUNG (MAN TSE LEUNG) is a top neurological surgeon, a very earnest and resolute type who will try to achieve his goals by hook or by crook. Because of his character defects, he has been on bad terms with his family. Even his girlfriend YIP MAN (HSUAN JESSICA HESTER) is worried about his raging temper. The relationship between the pair therefore involves frequent quarrels and arguments. Eight-year-old NG SIU TUNG (CHENG PAK LAM) has been suffering from brain cancer. Wishing for a medical cure, he follows his uncle LUK AH CHOI (CHEUNG WAI KIN) to the United States to seek consultation treatment.....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2Qs7mkeTQjBZD9UvBcQW81iupJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69992'),
  ('19386335608249034', 'The Edge of Sleep', 2024, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Willie Block, Jake Emanuel', 'Willie Block, Jake Emanuel', 'Mark Fischbach, Lio Tipton, Eve Harlow, Franz Drameh', 'TV-14', 'When a night watchman finishes his shift at work, he is terrified to discover that everyone in the world who went to sleep the previous night has died. Now he and a band of survivors must stay awake and uncover the secret of this global epidemic, before they fall asleep.', 'When a night watchman finishes his shift at work, he is terrified to discover that everyone in the world who went to sleep the previous night has died. Now he and a band of survivors must stay awake and uncover the secret of this global epidemic, before they fall asleep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haqI8mBNJSWXsLfGMheK7WQm7x0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221585'),
  ('638959544257069861', 'The Eighth Family', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ali Atay', 'Ali Atay, Cihan Talay', 'Haluk Bilginer, Hazal Kaya, Mehmet Özgür, Ali Atay, Erdem Şenocak, Melisa Döngel, Serkan Keskin, Çağlar Çorumlu', null, 'With their invention of bulletproof thermal underwear, the Basmacıgil Family earns the title of the Eighth Family, one of the ruling forces of the world. Yet, as six very different siblings attempt to run the family business, their well-meaning but ineffective efforts leave their father Erol convinced that “no outside enemy is necessary."', 'With their invention of bulletproof thermal underwear, the Basmacıgil Family earns the title of the Eighth Family, one of the ruling forces of the world. Yet, as six very different siblings attempt to run the family business, their well-meaning but ineffective efforts leave their father Erol convinced that “no outside enemy is necessary."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8NmGRfD3GuhhR8bTj7rXWkOMqk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:304774'),
  ('179671900533580147', 'The Eighth Sense', 2023, 'Drama', 'Inu Baek', null, 'Lim Ji-sub, Oh Jun-taek, Lee Mi-ra, Park Hae-in, Chae Soo-ah, Jang Young-joon, Seo Ji-an, Bang Jin Won', null, 'A rural freshman and a returning vet face a new kind of challenge: finding meaning in a crowded, fast-moving world.', 'A rural freshman and a returning vet face a new kind of challenge: finding meaning in a crowded, fast-moving world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoHehNNiO8lWpmaKmlx8icDESbm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223440'),
  ('298506601929416412', 'The Eighties', 2016, 'Documentary', null, null, 'H.W. Brands', 'TV-14', 'The third installment from executive producers Tom Hanks, Gary Goetzman and Mark Herzog, following in the footsteps of critically-acclaimed series THE SIXTIES and THE SEVENTIES, tackles 10 years shaped by exceptionalism and excess. Like its predecessors, THE EIGHTIES intersperses rare archival newsreel footage, interviews, and comments by historians, journalists, politicians, celebrities and others, painting a perspective-rich picture of a vibrant decade. Episodes examine the age of Reagan, the AIDS crisis, the end of the Cold War, Wall Street corruption, the evolving TV and music scene, and everything in between.', 'The third installment from executive producers Tom Hanks, Gary Goetzman and Mark Herzog, following in the footsteps of critically-acclaimed series THE SIXTIES and THE SEVENTIES, tackles 10 years shaped by exceptionalism and excess. Like its predecessors, THE EIGHTIES intersperses rare archival newsreel footage, interviews, and comments by historians, journalists, politicians, celebrities and others, painting a perspective-rich picture of a vibrant decade. Episodes examine the age of Reagan, the AIDS crisis, the end of the Cold War, Wall Street corruption, the evolving TV and music scene, and everything in between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydvEA8OuFK1v1SUV4RDDampCYSd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66482'),
  ('959126072318265503', 'The Electric Company', 1971, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Morgan Freeman, Rita Moreno, Mel Brooks, Hattie Winston, Gene Wilder, Joan Rivers, Zero Mostel, Todd Graff', null, 'The Electric Company is an educational American children''s television series that was produced by the Children''s Television Workshop for PBS in the United States. PBS broadcast 780 episodes over the course of its six seasons from October 25, 1971 to April 15, 1977. After it ceased production that year, the program continued in reruns from 1977 to 1985, the result of a decision made in 1975 to produce two final seasons for perpetual use. CTW produced the show at Teletape Studios Second Stage in Manhattan, the first home of Sesame Street. The Electric Company employed sketch comedy and other devices to provide an entertaining program to help elementary school children develop their grammar and reading skills. It was intended for children who had graduated from CTW''s flagship program, Sesame Street. Appropriately, the humor was more mature than what was seen there.', 'The Electric Company is an educational American children''s television series that was produced by the Children''s Television Workshop for PBS in the United States. PBS broadcast 780 episodes over the course of its six seasons from October 25, 1971 to April 15, 1977. After it ceased production that year, the program continued in reruns from 1977 to 1985, the result of a decision made in 1975 to produce two final seasons for perpetual use. CTW produced the show at Teletape Studios Second Stage in Manhattan, the first home of Sesame Street. The Electric Company employed sketch comedy and other devices to provide an entertaining program to help elementary school children develop their grammar and reading skills. It was intended for children who had graduated from CTW''s flagship program, Sesame Street. Appropriately, the humor was more mature than what was seen there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqSyefnBcymXCfQ51Kukd4xq4w8.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4366'),
  ('1018909960404684385', 'The Elegant Universe', 2003, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Brian Greene, Steven Weinberg, Nima Arkani-Hamed', null, 'One of the most ambitious and exciting theories ever proposed—one that may be the long-sought "theory of everything," which eluded even Einstein—gets a masterful, lavishly computer-animated explanation from bestselling author-physicist Brian Greene, when NOVA presents the nuts, bolts, and sometimes outright nuttiness of string theory.', 'One of the most ambitious and exciting theories ever proposed—one that may be the long-sought "theory of everything," which eluded even Einstein—gets a masterful, lavishly computer-animated explanation from bestselling author-physicist Brian Greene, when NOVA presents the nuts, bolts, and sometimes outright nuttiness of string theory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3E5akUCSxZM86NCnEfeft49ag2n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21444'),
  ('272119513695545876', 'The Elephant Princess', 2008, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Jonathan M. Shiff', null, 'Emily Robins, Sebastian Gregory, Liam Hemsworth, Emelia Burns, Eka Darville, Damien Bodie', null, 'Alex Wilson thinks she is an average suburban girl living in Melbourne, until her 16th birthday when exotic visitor, Kuru, shows up in her backyard with a magical elephant, Anala. He informs her she is the heir to the throne of the magical kingdom of Manjipoor. With his help, the reluctant princess will master her magic powers and defend her royal inheritance against her devious cousin, Vashan, whilst balancing the pull of both worlds to find her true destiny.', 'Alex Wilson thinks she is an average suburban girl living in Melbourne, until her 16th birthday when exotic visitor, Kuru, shows up in her backyard with a magical elephant, Anala. He informs her she is the heir to the throne of the magical kingdom of Manjipoor. With his help, the reluctant princess will master her magic powers and defend her royal inheritance against her devious cousin, Vashan, whilst balancing the pull of both worlds to find her true destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7cmIHA84UkkH1JTaqygPW9IsBb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:8203'),
  ('694161619818834729', 'The Ellen DeGeneres Show', 2003, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Ellen DeGeneres', null, 'Ellen DeGeneres', 'TV-PG', 'The Ellen DeGeneres Show, often shortened to just Ellen, is an American television talk show hosted by comedian/actress Ellen DeGeneres.', 'The Ellen DeGeneres Show, often shortened to just Ellen, is an American television talk show hosted by comedian/actress Ellen DeGeneres.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PhUYIGUUk1RzWq2Aw3TqH65McE.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:562'),
  ('1022685868005134446', 'The Ellen Show', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Mitchell Hurwitz, Carol Leifer, Ellen DeGeneres', null, 'Ellen DeGeneres, Jim Gaffigan, Emily Rutherfurd, Martin Mull, Cloris Leachman, Kerri Kenney', 'TV-PG', 'When her high-profile start-up Internet company goes belly up, Ellen gives up her high-powered career and heads back to her small hometown to put her life together. She gets a counselor at her old high school and moves in with her eccentric mother and unlucky-in-love sister.', 'When her high-profile start-up Internet company goes belly up, Ellen gives up her high-powered career and heads back to her small hometown to put her life together. She gets a counselor at her old high school and moves in with her eccentric mother and unlucky-in-love sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGzaGZYzSaEWGdkaan5N4MxYzy3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3237'),
  ('633882127901772233', 'The Elon Musk Show', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Jeremy Llewellyn-Jones, Marian Mohamed', null, 'Elon Musk', null, 'From South Africa to Silicon Valley - the enigmatic, compelling and controversial inside story of the world''s richest man, as told by family, friends and enemies.', 'From South Africa to Silicon Valley - the enigmatic, compelling and controversial inside story of the world''s richest man, as told by family, friends and enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBzqWWvsLsN9JexM7XyEcvXCg7O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212190'),
  ('921481580176571865', 'The Elusive Samurai', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Asaki Yuikawa, Yuichi Nakamura, Hinaki Yano, Mari Hino, Sayumi Suzushiro, Aoi Yuuki, Kikunosuke Toya', 'TV-14', 'Set between the Kamakura and Muromachi periods, during the Kenmu Restoration, the story follows the tale of Hojo Tokiyuki, a boy on the run after his family is overthrown by Ashikaga Takauji. With his only allies being a shady priest and his followers, the young lord must seek revenge and regain his glory, with his only weapon: a superhuman ability to flee and hide.', 'Set between the Kamakura and Muromachi periods, during the Kenmu Restoration, the story follows the tale of Hojo Tokiyuki, a boy on the run after his family is overthrown by Ashikaga Takauji. With his only allies being a shady priest and his followers, the young lord must seek revenge and regain his glory, with his only weapon: a superhuman ability to flee and hide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9ZgHhSwJKkoaVAuYz4uJaHsqii.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:222623'),
  ('1129457578447797126', 'The Embassy', 2016, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Ramón Campos, Gema R. Neira', null, 'Abel Folk, Belén Rueda, Úrsula Corberó, Raúl Arévalo, Chino Darín, Amaia Salamanca, Maxi Iglesias, Megan Montaner', null, 'Luis Salinas, the new ambassador to Thailand, who knows he''s going to get his hands dirty in the next four years – if he makes it that long. He''s accompanied by his wife, Claudia, and their daughter Ester. Aware that the familiar constellation of life in the embassy is about to change radically, the staff gear up in nervous anticipation. Life does change, but in a way that Luis would never have imagined it. He must not only cope with the chaos and corruption he was expecting, but also with the implosion of his family life, as Claudia and Ester become involved in affairs that might seriously damage relations between Spain and Thailand. Will the glamorous, globe-trotting diplomatic life swallow up Luis or will he continue to fight for integrity and morals?', 'Luis Salinas, the new ambassador to Thailand, who knows he''s going to get his hands dirty in the next four years – if he makes it that long. He''s accompanied by his wife, Claudia, and their daughter Ester. Aware that the familiar constellation of life in the embassy is about to change radically, the staff gear up in nervous anticipation. Life does change, but in a way that Luis would never have imagined it. He must not only cope with the chaos and corruption he was expecting, but also with the implosion of his family life, as Claudia and Ester become involved in affairs that might seriously damage relations between Spain and Thailand. Will the glamorous, globe-trotting diplomatic life swallow up Luis or will he continue to fight for integrity and morals?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVKzUchsNdBMrpzyW8cF5Kngmlz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65536'),
  ('839212028947331632', 'The Eminence in Shadow', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Seiichiro Yamashita, Asami Seto, Inori Minase, Suzuko Mimori, Fairouz Ai, Hisako Kanemoto, Reina Kondo, Rina Hidaka', 'TV-14', 'Shadowbrokers are those who go unnoticed, posing as unremarkable people, when in truth, they control everything from behind the scenes. Sid wants to be someone just like that more than anything, and something as insignificant as boring reality isn’t going to get in his way! He trains in secret every single night, preparing for his eventual rise to power—only to be denied his destiny by a run-of-the-mill (yet deadly) traffic accident. But when he wakes up in a another world and suddenly finds himself at the head of an actual secret organization doing battle with evil in the shadows, he’ll finally get a chance to act out all of his delusional fantasies!', 'Shadowbrokers are those who go unnoticed, posing as unremarkable people, when in truth, they control everything from behind the scenes. Sid wants to be someone just like that more than anything, and something as insignificant as boring reality isn’t going to get in his way! He trains in secret every single night, preparing for his eventual rise to power—only to be denied his destiny by a run-of-the-mill (yet deadly) traffic accident. But when he wakes up in a another world and suddenly finds himself at the head of an actual secret organization doing battle with evil in the shadows, he’ll finally get a chance to act out all of his delusional fantasies!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JKYmtLydAwo9ZsEmAknZiO4U8g.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:119495'),
  ('137077693966160341', 'The Emperor and I', 1994, null, null, null, 'Marco Ngai Chun-Git, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Maggie Chan Mei-Kei, Joanna Chan Pui-San, Joe Ma Tak-Chung, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Bessie Chan Ming-Kwan', null, '“The Emperor and I” tells the story of Emperor Lung (Eddie Cheung) and Yuk (Marco Ngai). The two men were of very different backgrounds and yet by chance, they became friends. At first, they were so close that they were willing to sacrifice for each other. However, their difference in belief and status quo inevitably led to their contradiction and they eventually were against each other.', '“The Emperor and I” tells the story of Emperor Lung (Eddie Cheung) and Yuk (Marco Ngai). The two men were of very different backgrounds and yet by chance, they became friends. At first, they were so close that they were willing to sacrifice for each other. However, their difference in belief and status quo inevitably led to their contradiction and they eventually were against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72qEj00N3S5TR5M8ZQ2oOpBLUA7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109438'),
  ('959509536770539662', 'The Emperor in Han Dynasty', 2005, 'Drama', null, null, 'Chen Baoguo, Du Chun, Jiao Huang, Gua Ah-leh, Song Xiaoying, Yang Tongshu, Yang Tongshu, Tao Hong', null, 'The Emperor in Han Dynasty,[1] also released under the title The Emperor Han Wu in some countries, is a 2005 Chinese historical television series based on the life of Emperor Wu of the Han dynasty. It uses the historical texts Records of the Grand Historian and Book of Han as its source material. The series covers the life of Emperor Wu from his early childhood to his death and some events in the reign of Emperor Jing (Emperor Wu''s father and predecessor), such as the Rebellion of the Seven States. It follows the conflicts that defined the pivotal war between the Han Empire and the Xiongnu, and depicts the major victories that the Han scored over the Xiongnu during Emperor Wu''s reign. Prominent historical figures such as the generals Li Guang, Wei Qing and Huo Qubing, as well as the diplomats Su Wu and Zhang Qian, also make appearances as supporting characters in the series.', 'The Emperor in Han Dynasty,[1] also released under the title The Emperor Han Wu in some countries, is a 2005 Chinese historical television series based on the life of Emperor Wu of the Han dynasty. It uses the historical texts Records of the Grand Historian and Book of Han as its source material. The series covers the life of Emperor Wu from his early childhood to his death and some events in the reign of Emperor Jing (Emperor Wu''s father and predecessor), such as the Rebellion of the Seven States. It follows the conflicts that defined the pivotal war between the Han Empire and the Xiongnu, and depicts the major victories that the Han scored over the Xiongnu during Emperor Wu''s reign. Prominent historical figures such as the generals Li Guang, Wei Qing and Huo Qubing, as well as the diplomats Su Wu and Zhang Qian, also make appearances as supporting characters in the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vVKTMM69CJkbxQUX6Iyyn9p1qL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87875'),
  ('951009282119244890', 'The Emperor: Owner of the Mask', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Jung Hae-ri, Park Hye-jin', 'Yoo Seung-ho, Kim So-hyun, L, Yoon So-hee, Huh Joon-ho, Shin Hyun-soo, Park Cheol-min, Kim Byong-chul', null, 'In the 1700''s, Crown Prince Lee Sun fights against Pyunsoo hwe. Pyunsoo hwe is an organization that has accumulated power and wealth through privatizing water all over Joseon. Crown Prince Lee Sun becomes a hope for the people who suffers. Ga-Eun is the woman Crown Prince Lee Sun loves and she helps him grow as a ruler.', 'In the 1700''s, Crown Prince Lee Sun fights against Pyunsoo hwe. Pyunsoo hwe is an organization that has accumulated power and wealth through privatizing water all over Joseon. Crown Prince Lee Sun becomes a hope for the people who suffers. Ga-Eun is the woman Crown Prince Lee Sun loves and she helps him grow as a ruler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Qrf6HrFGnmnSDPdQZ3v55hUlac.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69975'),
  ('743276789077548289', 'The Emperor''s Cook', 2015, 'Drama', 'Hisahide Sugimori', null, 'Takeru Satoh, Haru Kuroki, Ryohei Suzuki, Kaoru Kobayashi, Tetta Sugimoto, Jun Miho, Tetsuya Takeda', null, 'The drama series depicts the life of Tokuzo Akiyama, head chef of the Imperial Household Ministry’s Imperial Cuisine Division during the Taisho (1912-1926) and early Showa (1926-1989) eras. Based on a true story and book by Hisahide Sugimori, ''The Emperor’s Cook'' follows the life of country boy, Akiyama, who arrives in Tokyo in pursuit of the culinary arts. Driven by a deep love for his wife and family, a great reverence for his teachers, strong reliance on friends and an abiding love for cooking, Akiyama eventually rises to become ''the Emperor’s cook''.', 'The drama series depicts the life of Tokuzo Akiyama, head chef of the Imperial Household Ministry’s Imperial Cuisine Division during the Taisho (1912-1926) and early Showa (1926-1989) eras. Based on a true story and book by Hisahide Sugimori, ''The Emperor’s Cook'' follows the life of country boy, Akiyama, who arrives in Tokyo in pursuit of the culinary arts. Driven by a deep love for his wife and family, a great reverence for his teachers, strong reliance on friends and an abiding love for cooking, Akiyama eventually rises to become ''the Emperor’s cook''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkG5V0CivnXohzMfmdWdHtn1zxD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70187'),
  ('448585316388396286', 'The Emperor''s New School', 2006, 'Comedy, Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mark Dindal', null, 'Eartha Kitt, Curtis Armstrong, Justin Cowden, Rip Taylor, Shane Baumel, Bob Bergen, J.P. Manoux, John Goodman', 'TV-G', 'It''s about Kuzco, a self-centered and spoiled teen who must survive the trials of Incan public school and pass all of his classes so that he can officially become Emperor. His friend Malina keeps his attitude in check, while the evil Yzma (cleverly disguised as Principal Amzy) and her dim-witted sidekick Kronk are out to make sure Kuzco fails.', 'It''s about Kuzco, a self-centered and spoiled teen who must survive the trials of Incan public school and pass all of his classes so that he can officially become Emperor. His friend Malina keeps his attitude in check, while the evil Yzma (cleverly disguised as Principal Amzy) and her dim-witted sidekick Kronk are out to make sure Kuzco fails.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1TlTdWPcofNIklBdInaJFp7NkF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4623'),
  ('180394027244183221', 'The Empire', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Nikkhil Advani', null, 'Dino Morea, Shabana Azmi, Kunal Kapoor, Aditya Seal, Drashti Dhami, Sahher Bambba, Rahul Dev, Rishabh Sawhney', null, 'The story of a king battling against enemies, fate, family, death and even himself, in search of his kingdom.', 'The story of a king battling against enemies, fate, family, death and even himself, in search of his kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3tQIWFvTSe6GoYjmxlMeRdfaVJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130692'),
  ('718983873536045932', 'The Empire Of Law', 2022, 'Drama', 'Yoo Hyeon-gi', 'Oh Ga-gyu', 'Kim Seon-a, Ahn Jae-wook, Lee Mi-sook, Song Young-chang, Shin Gu, Oh Hyun-kyung, Lim Se-mi, Lee Ka-eun', null, 'Depicts the vulgar scandals of Korea’s nobles of the robe (whose rank came from holding judicial or administrative posts) who dream of hereditary succession. Han Hye Ryul is the chief of the special division of the Seoul Central District Prosecutors’ Office. Han Hye Ryul is from a family of judicial workers who has had wealth and power for three generations. She is an ambitious figure who is not satisfied with her current position and aims to become a prosecutor general or someone higher up the ladder.', 'Depicts the vulgar scandals of Korea’s nobles of the robe (whose rank came from holding judicial or administrative posts) who dream of hereditary succession. Han Hye Ryul is the chief of the special division of the Seoul Central District Prosecutors’ Office. Han Hye Ryul is from a family of judicial workers who has had wealth and power for three generations. She is an ambitious figure who is not satisfied with her current position and aims to become a prosecutor general or someone higher up the ladder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ubnY4VgSKIjwXxo9xrPzVevfMA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133772'),
  ('1098464045271471867', 'The Empress', 2022, 'Drama', 'Katharina Eyssen', null, 'Devrim Lingnau, Philip Froissant, Melika Foroutan, Johannes Nussbaum, Elisa Schlott, Jördis Triebel, Almila Bağrıaçık, Wiebke Puls', 'TV-MA', 'When rebellious Elisabeth falls for Emperor Franz and becomes his unlikely bride, she enters a world of tension and intrigue at the Viennese court.', 'When rebellious Elisabeth falls for Emperor Franz and becomes his unlikely bride, she enters a world of tension and intrigue at the Viennese court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AWkNkZHwNLuM6H5u6dToioHMAI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:131488'),
  ('919377146095025660', 'The Empress of China', 2014, 'Drama', 'Yik Chun Go', null, 'Fan Bingbing, Zhang Fengyi, Aarif Rahman, Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Jerry Lee, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Zhang Ting, Ma Sichun', null, 'Based on events in 7th and 8th-century Tang dynasty and starring producer Fan Bingbing as the titular character Wu Zetian, The Empress of China is the story of the only woman in Chinese history to rule as an emperor.', 'Based on events in 7th and 8th-century Tang dynasty and starring producer Fan Bingbing as the titular character Wu Zetian, The Empress of China is the story of the only woman in Chinese history to rule as an emperor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzl7vFwEqhe5Ipvi6wP22ZvSBs4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61988'),
  ('951234964817853446', 'The End', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Amro Samir Atef', 'Youssef El Sherif, Nahed El Sebai, Ahmad Wafiq, Nihal Nour, Amr Abdel Gelil, Sahar Al Sayegh, Sawsan Badr, Mohammad Lotfi', null, 'In 2120 Jerusalem, an engineer tries to find a solution to the energy problem in light of the restrictions that the regime imposes on the population. However, everything changes when he comes across his robotic doppelganger.', 'In 2120 Jerusalem, an engineer tries to find a solution to the energy problem in light of the restrictions that the regime imposes on the population. However, everything changes when he comes across his robotic doppelganger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgU8k57U5IEZ7PFkVCFyG2wd8p1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102049'),
  ('347860691032617207', 'The End Is Nye', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Seth MacFarlane, Brannon Braga, Bill Nye', null, 'Bill Nye', 'TV-PG', 'Explore the myths and realities of both natural and unnatural threats, from viruses to volcanoes, asteroids to authoritarianism, and climate change to chemical warfare.', 'Explore the myths and realities of both natural and unnatural threats, from viruses to volcanoes, asteroids to authoritarianism, and climate change to chemical warfare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5tVRFsUpQawA73pybqfHspxBAX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206763'),
  ('66847720029929902', 'The End of an Era', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Taylor Swift, Kameron Saunders, Andrea Swift, Amanda Balen, Whyley Yoshimura, Kamilah Marshall, Travis Kelce, Austin Swift', 'TV-MA', 'A behind-the-scenes docuseries event chronicling the development, impact, and inner workings that created the phenomenon that was Taylor Swift | The Eras Tour, as well as providing an intimate look at Taylor''s life as her tour made headlines and thrilled fans around the world. The series also spotlights performers, family members, and friends — including Gracie Abrams, Sabrina Carpenter, Ed Sheeran, and Florence Welch — offering never-before-seen insight into what it took to create a phenomenon.', 'A behind-the-scenes docuseries event chronicling the development, impact, and inner workings that created the phenomenon that was Taylor Swift | The Eras Tour, as well as providing an intimate look at Taylor''s life as her tour made headlines and thrilled fans around the world. The series also spotlights performers, family members, and friends — including Gracie Abrams, Sabrina Carpenter, Ed Sheeran, and Florence Welch — offering never-before-seen insight into what it took to create a phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qEyRXQMC3L77fjY924qcoxaaVs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:302919'),
