  ('531656453884669174', 'The Endless Night', 2023, 'Drama', 'Gustavo Lipsztein', 'Gustavo Lipsztein, Daniela Arbex', 'Thelmo Fernandes, Paulo Gorgulho, Bianca Byington, Leonardo Medeiros, Débora Lamm, Bel Kowarick, Raquel Karro, Paola Antonini', 'TV-MA', 'When a fire kills 242 people in a nightclub, all that the victims'' parents can do is mourn... and fight for justice.', 'When a fire kills 242 people in a nightclub, all that the victims'' parents can do is mourn... and fight for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbCt8M0wDQxhhCa85yLgBvd5wMw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139396'),
