  ('1001780839492443022', 'The Expanse: One Ship', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'An anthology of short webisodes of The Expanse, all relating to the Doctrine of One Ship - that there is only one ship, and it has countless parts as a single body has countless cells.', 'An anthology of short webisodes of The Expanse, all relating to the Doctrine of One Ship - that there is only one ship, and it has countless parts as a single body has countless cells.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OHsrQnGy2o0cRqp0pD3ax9NAqm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155655'),
  ('259040711407795983', 'The Expecting', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Ben Ketai', 'Ben Ketai', 'AnnaSophia Robb, Rory Culkin, Mira Sorvino, Hannah Murray, Daniel K. Isaac, Michael Gaston, Daniel Washington, Ethan Herschenfeld', null, 'Follow the dark journey of a young woman down on her luck and pregnant under mysterious circumstances. She must deal with the increasingly disturbing effects of her pregnancy and the potential conspiracy surrounding it.', 'Follow the dark journey of a young woman down on her luck and pregnant under mysterious circumstances. She must deal with the increasingly disturbing effects of her pregnancy and the potential conspiracy surrounding it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHfAk3vs2ZRBNFFzQyMKKKxD7js.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111372'),
  ('696643879464669066', 'The F Word', 2005, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Janet Street-Porter, Gordon Ramsay', 'TV-14', 'The F Word is a British food magazine and cookery programme featuring chef Gordon Ramsay. The programme covers a wide range of topics, from recipes to food preparation and celebrity food fads. The programme is made by Optomen Television and aired weekly on Channel 4. The theme tune for the series is "The F-Word" from the Babybird album Bugged.', 'The F Word is a British food magazine and cookery programme featuring chef Gordon Ramsay. The programme covers a wide range of topics, from recipes to food preparation and celebrity food fads. The programme is made by Optomen Television and aired weekly on Channel 4. The theme tune for the series is "The F-Word" from the Babybird album Bugged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63tzS2P1B7FQD8MJFoKmvUYK9hz.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1478'),
  ('323756984478685790', 'The F Word', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Gordon Ramsay', 'TV-14', 'Good food and good cooking are combined with Ramsay’s passion, energy and humor into a one-of-a-kind LIVE series. Foodies from across the U.S. will battle it out in a high-stakes cook-off, as Ramsay chats with surprise guests and appears in unique field segments.', 'Good food and good cooking are combined with Ramsay’s passion, energy and humor into a one-of-a-kind LIVE series. Foodies from across the U.S. will battle it out in a high-stakes cook-off, as Ramsay chats with surprise guests and appears in unique field segments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skWtbfPT79vzmZiCp399HgLqG24.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71989'),
  ('942575291926533049', 'The F.B.I.', 1965, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Efrem Zimbalist Jr., Philip Abbott, Marvin Miller, William Reynolds, Shelly Novack, Stephen Brooks', 'TV-14', 'The F.B.I. is an American television series that was broadcast on ABC from 1965 to 1974. It was sponsored by the Ford Motor Company, and the characters almost always drove Ford vehicles in the series. Alcoa was co-sponsor of Season One only.', 'The F.B.I. is an American television series that was broadcast on ABC from 1965 to 1974. It was sponsored by the Ford Motor Company, and the characters almost always drove Ford vehicles in the series. Alcoa was co-sponsor of Season One only.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUlL68lFmnonSg180QJ59ipnd7c.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2223'),
  ('803648995564661895', 'The Fable', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, null, 'Kazuyuki Okitsu, Miyuki Sawashiro, Kana Hanazawa, Akio Otsuka', 'TV-MA', 'A legendary hitman trained to become the world''s best assassin is asked to lay low for a year by the head of his crime family.', 'A legendary hitman trained to become the world''s best assassin is asked to lay low for a year by the head of his crime family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQeVABaQ7gZedtmtDRwhrgOQwgq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:238843'),
  ('791193078354584016', 'The Fabric of the Cosmos', 2011, 'Documentary, Mystery', null, null, 'Brian Greene', null, 'Brian Greene is going to let you in on a secret: We''ve all been deceived. Our perceptions of time and space have led us astray. Much of what we thought we knew about our universe-that the past has already happened and the future is yet to be, that space is just an empty void, that our universe is the only universe that exists-just might be wrong.', 'Brian Greene is going to let you in on a secret: We''ve all been deceived. Our perceptions of time and space have led us astray. Much of what we thought we knew about our universe-that the past has already happened and the future is yet to be, that space is just an empty void, that our universe is the only universe that exists-just might be wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SIrl72zvkluMA3xi4KHOk3BKZJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68672'),
  ('561546450940432542', 'The Fabulous', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Jeong-hyeon, Kim Ji-hee, Im Jin-soon', null, 'Chae Soo-bin, Minho, Lee Sang-un, Park Hee-jeong, Kim Min-kyu, Shin Dong-mi, Lee Mi-do, Choi Hee-jin', 'TV-14', 'Four best friends chase their dreams in the competitive world of fashion while juggling demanding jobs, romantic dilemmas and wild nights on the town.', 'Four best friends chase their dreams in the competitive world of fashion while juggling demanding jobs, romantic dilemmas and wild nights on the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LnPNXQ8upwUT1dYX2ZopQXjmt8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135155'),
  ('974038795584609243', 'The Face Men Thailand', null, 'Reality', 'Piyarat Kaljareuk', null, 'Jumpol Adulkittiporn, Phakphum Romsaithong, Khemanit Jamikorn, Ananda Everingham', null, 'The Face Men Thailand is an international Thai reality television modeling competition for males. Focusing on finding the next top male model and actor. It is a spin-off of The Face Thailand, featuring teams mentored by industry experts who compete in weekly acting, modeling, and charisma challenges.', 'The Face Men Thailand is an international Thai reality television modeling competition for males. Focusing on finding the next top male model and actor. It is a spin-off of The Face Thailand, featuring teams mentored by industry experts who compete in weekly acting, modeling, and charisma challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJFWCnQTDulZz5KrdDQXqg3AqT5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:316559'),
  ('176840869497780855', 'The Face of Analia', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Humberto ''Kiko'' Olivieri', null, 'Elizabeth Gutiérrez, Martín Karpan, Maritza Rodríguez, Gaby Espino, Gabriel Porras, Karla Monroig, Sarah Mintz, Ximena Duque', null, 'El Rostro de Analía is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the American-based television network Telemundo. It stars Elizabeth Gutiérrez, Martin Karpan, Maritza Rodríguez and Gabriel Porras, with the special appearance of Gaby Espino.', 'El Rostro de Analía is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the American-based television network Telemundo. It stars Elizabeth Gutiérrez, Martin Karpan, Maritza Rodríguez and Gabriel Porras, with the special appearance of Gaby Espino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQJmZpHjKTsqt64PPGucObvU1gy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7859'),
  ('301605722633282503', 'The Factor', null, 'News', 'Bill O''Reilly', null, 'Bill O''Reilly', null, 'The O''Reilly Factor, originally titled The O''Reilly Report from 1996 to 1998 and often called The Factor, is an American talk show on the Fox News Channel hosted by commentator Bill O''Reilly, who often discusses current controversial political issues with guests.', 'The O''Reilly Factor, originally titled The O''Reilly Report from 1996 to 1998 and often called The Factor, is an American talk show on the Fox News Channel hosted by commentator Bill O''Reilly, who often discusses current controversial political issues with guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HJfeFXsQUCxEpMIbvvnoZpixEA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1094'),
  ('115544077041632879', 'The Facts of Life', 1979, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dick Clair, Norman Lear, Jenna McMahon', null, 'Cloris Leachman, Lisa Whelchel, Kim Fields, Mindy Cohn, Nancy McKeon, Mackenzie Astin, Sherrié Austin', 'TV-PG', 'Mrs. Edna Garrett, housemother and dietitian at the Eastland School, teaches a group of girls in her charge how to solve those problems that every teenager has to face.', 'Mrs. Edna Garrett, housemother and dietitian at the Eastland School, teaches a group of girls in her charge how to solve those problems that every teenager has to face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45i9VujUbQITmHl3QE3eNs9ZUv3.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:1803'),
  ('850144685627552351', 'The Fades', 2011, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jack Thorne', null, 'Iain De Caestecker, Daniel Kaluuya, Johnny Harris, Natalie Dormer, Tom Ellis, Lily Loveless, Sophie Wu, Claire Rushbrook', 'TV-14', 'Seventeen-year old Paul can see the spirits of the dead. When one of these restless spirits crosses back into the living world, he is forced into a fight to prevent the apocalypse.', 'Seventeen-year old Paul can see the spirits of the dead. When one of these restless spirits crosses back into the living world, he is forced into a fight to prevent the apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YEXq1g6QQ3k5rEaeocMNk3eGcF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41211'),
  ('99822316548533409', 'The Fading Gold', 2025, 'Drama', null, 'Sai-Leung Mak, Shing Mo Chang', 'Roger Kwok Chun-On, Hera Chan, Lo Chung-Him, Mimi Kung, Helena Law Lan, Matthew Ho, Andrew Chan, Joey Law', null, 'After a car accident, family business tycoon Fong Yeung-tin returns with much younger wife Lam Ching, establishing a trust managed by Ko Shum. Defying sons and grandmother’s legal challenges, he vows to uncover the insider who plotted the crash while reforming his feuding heirs.', 'After a car accident, family business tycoon Fong Yeung-tin returns with much younger wife Lam Ching, establishing a trust managed by Ko Shum. Defying sons and grandmother’s legal challenges, he vows to uncover the insider who plotted the crash while reforming his feuding heirs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heHKYO7ajF1dhQ8O3M7J8cxNmYx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275846'),
  ('117158235653093345', 'The Fairly OddParents', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Family', 'Butch Hartman', null, 'Tara Strong, Susanne Blakeslee, Daran Norris, Carlos Alazraqui, Jim Ward, Gary LeRoi Gray, Grey DeLisle, Kari Wahlgren', 'TV-Y7', 'The zany, fast-paced adventures of a 10-year-old boy and his fairy godparents, who inadvertently create havoc as they grant wishes for their pint-sized charge.', 'The zany, fast-paced adventures of a 10-year-old boy and his fairy godparents, who inadvertently create havoc as they grant wishes for their pint-sized charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ryMj7tIvVtiXyI2tLvHYTjOjq4.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:4630'),
  ('401671967719211809', 'The Fairly OddParents: A New Wish', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Dan Abramovici, Ashleigh Crystal Hairston, Dave Stone', null, 'Ashleigh Crystal Hairston, Susanne Blakeslee, Daran Norris', 'TV-Y7', 'Ten-year-old Hazel Wells has just moved to the big city of Dimmadelphia because of her dad’s new job. On top of being in an unfamiliar environment, it’s the first time she’s been without her brother, Antony, who’s just left for college, leaving her lonely and unsure of herself. All that changes when the pink-and-green-haired neighbors next door reveal that they are no ordinary neighbors…they’re Cosmo and Wanda, fairy godparents! And they’re coming out of retirement to make all of Hazel’s wishes come true.', 'Ten-year-old Hazel Wells has just moved to the big city of Dimmadelphia because of her dad’s new job. On top of being in an unfamiliar environment, it’s the first time she’s been without her brother, Antony, who’s just left for college, leaving her lonely and unsure of herself. All that changes when the pink-and-green-haired neighbors next door reveal that they are no ordinary neighbors…they’re Cosmo and Wanda, fairy godparents! And they’re coming out of retirement to make all of Hazel’s wishes come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePgVXUAo1z8Bs2iLewcZ5ZH2wBR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247246'),
  ('795916853368655611', 'The Fairly OddParents: Fairly Odder', 2022, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Christopher J. Nowak', null, 'Audrey Grace Marshall, Tyler Wladis, Laura Bell Bundy, Ryan-James Hatanaka, Imogen Cohen, Susanne Blakeslee, Daran Norris', 'TV-G', 'When Ty Turner uproots his life to reunite with his high school sweetheart, Rachel Raskin, in the colorful town of Dimmsdale, his cautious 13-year-old daughter Vivian is thrust into a new world, and a new school alongside new step-brother and town star, Roy, a jock with a heart of gold. Lucky for Viv she’s inherited Wanda and Cosmo, two Fairy Godparents she’ll share with Roy, to help them both find their way.', 'When Ty Turner uproots his life to reunite with his high school sweetheart, Rachel Raskin, in the colorful town of Dimmsdale, his cautious 13-year-old daughter Vivian is thrust into a new world, and a new school alongside new step-brother and town star, Roy, a jock with a heart of gold. Lucky for Viv she’s inherited Wanda and Cosmo, two Fairy Godparents she’ll share with Roy, to help them both find their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpENUVs55Y4FuAUDaST1cNXvISK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129565'),
  ('948255443118908518', 'The Falcon and the Winter Soldier', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Malcolm Spellman', 'Derek Kolstad, Dalan Musson, Jasmyne Flournoy', 'Anthony Mackie, Sebastian Stan, Wyatt Russell, Erin Kellyman, Daniel Brühl, Emily VanCamp, Danny Ramirez, Adepero Oduye', 'TV-14', 'Following the events of “Avengers: Endgame”, the Falcon, Sam Wilson and the Winter Soldier, Bucky Barnes team up in a global adventure that tests their abilities, and their patience.', 'Following the events of “Avengers: Endgame”, the Falcon, Sam Wilson and the Winter Soldier, Bucky Barnes team up in a global adventure that tests their abilities, and their patience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kbAMLteGO8yyewYau6bJ683sw7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88396'),
  ('282787458704551883', 'The Fall', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Allan Cubitt', null, 'Gillian Anderson, Jamie Dornan, Niamh McGrady, John Lynch, Colin Morgan, Stuart Graham, Valene Kane, Bronagh Waugh', 'TV-MA', 'When the Police Service of Northern Ireland are unable to close a case after 28 days, Detective Superintendent Stella Gibson of the Metropolitan Police Service is called in to review the case. Under her new leadership, the local detectives must track down and stop a serial killer who is terrorising the city of Belfast.', 'When the Police Service of Northern Ireland are unable to close a case after 28 days, Detective Superintendent Stella Gibson of the Metropolitan Police Service is called in to review the case. Under her new leadership, the local detectives must track down and stop a serial killer who is terrorising the city of Belfast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fm7nN3nUADA7JGgnFNlOWpXn1tf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:49010'),
  ('664503225294394277', 'The Fall and Rise of Reggie Dinkins', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Robert Carlock, Sam Means', null, 'Tracy Morgan, Daniel Radcliffe, Erika Alexander, Bobby Moynihan, Precious Way, Jalyn Hall', 'TV-14', 'A disgraced former football player is on a mission to rehabilitate his image.', 'A disgraced former football player is on a mission to rehabilitate his image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrF8Ve4GoazCalfbrSY52tUIXSN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291334'),
  ('53894674182781054', 'The Fall and Rise of Reginald Perrin', 1976, 'Comedy', 'David Nobbs', null, 'Leonard Rossiter, Pauline Yates, John Barron, Sue Nicholls, Geoffrey Palmer, Leslie Schofield, John Horsley, Tim Preece', null, 'Disillusioned after a long career at Sunshine Desserts, Perrin goes through a mid-life crisis and fakes his own death. Returning in disguise after various attempts at finding a ''new life'', he gets his old job back and finds nothing has changed. He is eventually found out, and in the second series has success with a chain of shops selling useless junk. That becomes so successful that he feels he has created a monster and decides to destroy it. In the third and final series he has a dream of forming a commune which his long suffering colleagues help bring to reality. Unfortunately that also fails and he finds himself back in a job not unlike the one he originally had at Sunshine Desserts.', 'Disillusioned after a long career at Sunshine Desserts, Perrin goes through a mid-life crisis and fakes his own death. Returning in disguise after various attempts at finding a ''new life'', he gets his old job back and finds nothing has changed. He is eventually found out, and in the second series has success with a chain of shops selling useless junk. That becomes so successful that he feels he has created a monster and decides to destroy it. In the third and final series he has a dream of forming a commune which his long suffering colleagues help bring to reality. Unfortunately that also fails and he finds himself back in a job not unlike the one he originally had at Sunshine Desserts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKl1NsOKHc4xDk6szPplV21j94k.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:719'),
  ('562833675340410670', 'The Fall Guy', 1981, 'Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Glen A. Larson', null, 'Lee Majors, Douglas Barr, Heather Thomas, Markie Post, Jo Ann Pflug', 'TV-PG', 'Hollywood stuntman Colt Seavers picks up some extra pocket money by using his rough-and-tumble skills to track and capture bail jumpers.', 'Hollywood stuntman Colt Seavers picks up some extra pocket money by using his rough-and-tumble skills to track and capture bail jumpers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8IS76HrmnjwGAvMwcanxohNja4.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:5031'),
  ('128986716224713330', 'The Fall of Diddy', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Sean Combs', 'TV-14', 'Pull back the curtain on music mogul Sean Combs, and the allegations of violence and abuse kept quiet for years. This chilling chronicle redefines the music mogul and business titan everyone thinks they know.', 'Pull back the curtain on music mogul Sean Combs, and the allegations of violence and abuse kept quiet for years. This chilling chronicle redefines the music mogul and business titan everyone thinks they know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1igPXOqx7MUOBs9xjPHUHS3Ey7h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281999'),
  ('91821837391342962', 'The Fall of the Empire', 2005, 'Drama', null, 'Vladimir Khotinenko, Leonid Yuzefovich', 'Aleksandr Baluev, Sergey Makovetskiy, Mariya Mironova, Chulpan Khamatova, Andrey Krasko', null, 'Russian Empire. The second decade of the twentieth century. As a result of the conflict between the Entente and the bloc of the Central Powers led by Germany, which erupted in August 1914, Russia is drawn into the First World War. A wave of unrest is rolling through the country. Revolutionary moods are increasing every day. Counterintelligence is trying with all its might to suppress the activity of German spies active in the territory of the country ...', 'Russian Empire. The second decade of the twentieth century. As a result of the conflict between the Entente and the bloc of the Central Powers led by Germany, which erupted in August 1914, Russia is drawn into the First World War. A wave of unrest is rolling through the country. Revolutionary moods are increasing every day. Counterintelligence is trying with all its might to suppress the activity of German spies active in the territory of the country ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RRVomjkkK8x0SHI1pl4iZdaxUz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42921'),
  ('1034277762923732290', 'The Fall of the House of Usher', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Mike Flanagan', 'Justina Ireland, Kiele Sanchez', 'Carla Gugino, Bruce Greenwood, Mary McDonnell, Henry Thomas, Kate Siegel, Rahul Kohli, Samantha Sloyan, T''Nia Miller', 'TV-MA', 'Ruthless siblings Roderick and Madeline Usher have built Fortunato Pharmaceuticals into an empire of wealth, privilege and power. But past secrets come to light when the heirs to the Usher dynasty start dying at the hands of a mysterious woman from their youth.', 'Ruthless siblings Roderick and Madeline Usher have built Fortunato Pharmaceuticals into an empire of wealth, privilege and power. But past secrets come to light when the heirs to the Usher dynasty start dying at the hands of a mysterious woman from their youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rl04pRCaGfz91lwfWdDQmOiGJp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157065'),
  ('582644640246453850', 'The Fame Game', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sri Rao', 'Nisha Mehta, Sri Rao', 'Madhuri Dixit, Sanjay Kapoor, Manav Kaul, Suhasini Mulay, Lakshvir Saran, Muskkaan Jaferi, Rajshri Deshpande, Gagan Arora', 'TV-MA', 'When India''s most famous actress goes missing, the search for her chips away at the flawless facade of her life and family, revealing painful truths.', 'When India''s most famous actress goes missing, the search for her chips away at the flawless facade of her life and family, revealing painful truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLqX8PWdSJVmKfBqSEg24bERIEg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156441'),
  ('461054324032395835', 'The Familiar of Zero', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rie Kugimiya, Satoshi Hino, Nanako Inoue, Yuka Inokuchi, Mamiko Noto, Yui Horie, Tetsuo Goto, Takahiro Sakurai', 'TV-14', 'Louise Françoise Le Blanc de La Vallière’s name is so long and her spell-casting skills are so poor that everyone at the Tristain Academy of Magic just calls her “Louise the Zero.” Louise’s humiliation only increases during an important second-year test, she inexplicably summons Saito Hiraga, a totally normal teenager from Tokyo. Now she’s stuck with him and Saito’s stuck with the lousy life of being a familiar.', 'Louise Françoise Le Blanc de La Vallière’s name is so long and her spell-casting skills are so poor that everyone at the Tristain Academy of Magic just calls her “Louise the Zero.” Louise’s humiliation only increases during an important second-year test, she inexplicably summons Saito Hiraga, a totally normal teenager from Tokyo. Now she’s stuck with him and Saito’s stuck with the lousy life of being a familiar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edpG7IAoHtEfQ2XMMjcpBarlOF4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:35753'),
  ('1023977906665016475', 'The Family', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jenna Bans', null, 'Joan Allen, Alison Pill, Rupert Graves, Margot Bingham, Liam James, Andrew McCarthy, Zach Gilford, Floriana Lima', 'TV-14', 'This thriller follows the return of a politician’s young son who was presumed dead after disappearing over a decade earlier. As the mysterious young man is welcomed back into his family, suspicions emerge — is he really who he says he is?', 'This thriller follows the return of a politician’s young son who was presumed dead after disappearing over a decade earlier. As the mysterious young man is welcomed back into his family, suspicions emerge — is he really who he says he is?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AciJALZmd0SOMht1QVyPAjpnfFE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62814'),
  ('478344098345092889', 'The Family', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Jesse Moss', null, 'James Cromwell, Jeff Sharlet', 'TV-14', 'An enigmatic conservative Christian group known as the Family wields enormous influence in Washington, D.C., in pursuit of its global ambitions.', 'An enigmatic conservative Christian group known as the Family wields enormous influence in Washington, D.C., in pursuit of its global ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uxUa1gF15oVTyVwaKPzIBWCamM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91505'),
  ('16232681376507078', 'The Family', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Hakan Bonomo', null, 'Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Serenay Sarıkaya, Nur Sürer, Nejat İşler, Canan Ergüder, Yüsra Geyik, Umutcan Ütebay, Emel Göksu', null, 'Aile is a story of Aslan who is the son of a large family, runs a nightclub. An extremely shrewd man. He is a dark and mysterious character. Psychologist Devin will enter the life of this difficult man and it becomes intense.', 'Aile is a story of Aslan who is the son of a large family, runs a nightclub. An extremely shrewd man. He is a dark and mysterious character. Psychologist Devin will enter the life of this difficult man and it becomes intense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1FRgsUSD0mqrmwZtCDtGmZbCh3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:219446'),
  ('881601271850984305', 'The Family Circumstances of the Irregular Witch', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aoi Koga, Nana Mizuki, Takaya Hashi, Romi Park, Kana Hanazawa, You Taichi, Akira Sekine, Takayuki Kondo', 'TV-14', 'When witch Alyssa found a baby on her doorstep, she didn’t expect her life to take a topsy-turvy turn. Despite her bewilderment, she names the child Viola and decides to raise her. Fast-forward 16 years, and her “daughter” Viola isn’t just taller—she’s towering! Join this bewitching duo in a hilariously chaotic journey of mistaken identities and supernatural shenanigans!', 'When witch Alyssa found a baby on her doorstep, she didn’t expect her life to take a topsy-turvy turn. Despite her bewilderment, she names the child Viola and decides to raise her. Fast-forward 16 years, and her “daughter” Viola isn’t just taller—she’s towering! Join this bewitching duo in a hilariously chaotic journey of mistaken identities and supernatural shenanigans!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGXu03mb6HdNCn41pfi4mTxRSIU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209829'),
  ('665578847362075971', 'The Family Game', 2013, 'Drama, Family, Mystery', 'Honma Yohei', null, 'Sho Sakurai, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Shioli Kutsuna, Seishu Uragami, Rie Kitahara, Itsuji Itao, Honami Suzuki', null, 'Yoshimoto Koya becomes a tutor to a student, Numata Shigeyuki, an underachiever on the verge of dropping out of middle school. Expecting immediate results, Shigeyuki’s father makes a deal with Koya that if he could make Shigeyuki return to school within a week, he would receive a 100,000 yen bonus. Koya accepts the offer, replying that he would only need 5 days to complete the mission but demands that no one should interfere with his methodology in doing so.', 'Yoshimoto Koya becomes a tutor to a student, Numata Shigeyuki, an underachiever on the verge of dropping out of middle school. Expecting immediate results, Shigeyuki’s father makes a deal with Koya that if he could make Shigeyuki return to school within a week, he would receive a 100,000 yen bonus. Koya accepts the offer, replying that he would only need 5 days to complete the mission but demands that no one should interfere with his methodology in doing so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvoA0ux8m3FmAf1st2An7E96heb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72157'),
  ('655457690966610830', 'The Family Man', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Raj Nidimoru, Krishna D.K.', 'Krishna D.K., Suman Kumar, Raj Nidimoru', 'Manoj Bajpayee, Priyamani, Sharib Hashmi, Vedant Sinha, Ashlesha Thakur, Shreya Dhanwanthary, Darshan Kumaar, Vipin Sharma', 'TV-PG', 'The story of a middle-class man who works for a special cell of the National Investigation Agency. While he tries to protect the nation from terrorists, he also has to protect his family from the impact of his secretive, high-pressure, and low paying job.', 'The story of a middle-class man who works for a special cell of the National Investigation Agency. While he tries to protect the nation from terrorists, he also has to protect his family from the impact of his secretive, high-pressure, and low paying job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tE1NUJqw9gV6AVjQ1GTK78LbWJ9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:93352'),
  ('1073405981791473214', 'The Family Stallone', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Sylvester Stallone, Jennifer Flavin Stallone, Sophia Rose Stallone, Sistine Rose Stallone, Scarlet Rose Stallone', null, 'Follow legendary actor Sylvester Stallone with his wife and daughters in a direct access to their daily life.', 'Follow legendary actor Sylvester Stallone with his wife and daughters in a direct access to their daily life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixyT8oYgT7tcuq4FLo4skZGhdpH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:222236'),
  ('1002291043823927099', 'The Famous Adventures of Mr. Magoo', 1964, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Roger Carel, Jim Backus, Robie Lester', null, 'The Famous Adventures of Mr. Magoo is an animated television series, produced by United Productions of America, which aired for one season. The television series was based on the original cartoon of the same name, with Jim Backus reprising the voice over of the role he did on TV: while doing this show, he continued with the prime time show Gilligan''s Island. Unlike the theatrical cartoons, which focused on the extremely nearsighted Quincy Magoo''s bumbling, the show featured the Magoo character as an actor in adaptations of such literary classics as Don Quixote and Gunga Din. Each of these roles was played seriously, with few if any references to Magoo''s nearsightedness; however, introductory segments in each program featured Magoo backstage stumbling into scenery and talking to props, thus connecting the older cartoons to this series. Some stories were contained in a single half-hour episode, but others ran to two and even four episodes. As UPA did not have its own studio facility the production was farmed out to the Grantray-Lawrence and Format Films studios. Among the most ambitious adaptations mounted in this format were the four-part Robin Hood, in which he took the role of Friar Tuck; Treasure Island, in which he played the villainous Long John Silver; and a version of Snow White in which he portrayed all seven dwarves.', 'The Famous Adventures of Mr. Magoo is an animated television series, produced by United Productions of America, which aired for one season. The television series was based on the original cartoon of the same name, with Jim Backus reprising the voice over of the role he did on TV: while doing this show, he continued with the prime time show Gilligan''s Island. Unlike the theatrical cartoons, which focused on the extremely nearsighted Quincy Magoo''s bumbling, the show featured the Magoo character as an actor in adaptations of such literary classics as Don Quixote and Gunga Din. Each of these roles was played seriously, with few if any references to Magoo''s nearsightedness; however, introductory segments in each program featured Magoo backstage stumbling into scenery and talking to props, thus connecting the older cartoons to this series. Some stories were contained in a single half-hour episode, but others ran to two and even four episodes. As UPA did not have its own studio facility the production was farmed out to the Grantray-Lawrence and Format Films studios. Among the most ambitious adaptations mounted in this format were the four-part Robin Hood, in which he took the role of Friar Tuck; Treasure Island, in which he played the villainous Long John Silver; and a version of Snow White in which he portrayed all seven dwarves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TKToh9R6SSsHYumqxDX9SukKgJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13412'),
  ('1076273554164111004', 'The Famous Five', 1978, 'Family, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Crime', 'Enid Blyton', null, 'Gary Russell, Jennifer Thanisch, Marcus Harris, Michele Gallagher, Toddy Woodgate', null, 'The Famous Five is a British television series based on the children''s books of the same name by Enid Blyton. It was broadcast on ITV over two series in 1978 and 1979. It was produced by Southern Television in 26 half-hour episodes.', 'The Famous Five is a British television series based on the children''s books of the same name by Enid Blyton. It was broadcast on ITV over two series in 1978 and 1979. It was produced by Southern Television in 26 half-hour episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lC4oVuewZGTglSbIoDooI7HWinQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31441'),
  ('672956830647854783', 'The Famous Five', 2023, 'Family, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Matthew Read, Nicolas Winding Refn', null, 'Diaana Babnicova, Elliott Rose, Kit Rakusen, Flora Jacoby Richardson', 'TV-PG', 'There''s adventure around every corner with The Famous Five! Join Julian, George, Dick, Anne and Timmy as they uncover mystery and excitement.', 'There''s adventure around every corner with The Famous Five! Join Julian, George, Dick, Anne and Timmy as they uncover mystery and excitement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jg2x00j8MRFhsDaFN2ESeJxeZO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:231348'),
