  ('312510507770144137', 'The Fantastic Four', 1978, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Jack Kirby, Stan Lee', null, 'Mike Road, Ted Cassidy, Ginny Tyler, Frank Welker, Dick Tufeld', 'TV-Y7', 'The second independent animated adaptation of Marvel''s Fantastic Four, consisting of 13 episodes. This series is the premiere for the robot H.E.R.B.I.E., as the Human Torch was unable to be used in the show due to a rights issue.', 'The second independent animated adaptation of Marvel''s Fantastic Four, consisting of 13 episodes. This series is the premiere for the robot H.E.R.B.I.E., as the Human Torch was unable to be used in the show due to a rights issue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEyV8MffIg2Zmmaif5GHeiHYHq4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2373'),
  ('302789048890704266', 'The Fantastic Journey', 1977, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Bruce Lansbury', null, 'Jared Martin, Ike Eisenmann, Carl Franklin, Katie Saylor, Mike Road', null, 'The Fantastic Journey was an American science fiction television series that was originally aired on NBC from February 3 through June 17, 1977.', 'The Fantastic Journey was an American science fiction television series that was originally aired on NBC from February 3 through June 17, 1977.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ExChIiRaAZ9N5SeiAcw8XjJCyk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11243'),
  ('340663649812742261', 'The Far Pavilions', 1984, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Julian Bond', 'Ben Cross, Amy Irving, Omar Sharif, Christopher Lee, Benedict Taylor, Rossano Brazzi, Saeed Jaffrey', null, 'Adapted from M.M. Kaye''s best-selling novel, this dramatic HBO miniseries follows two star-crossed lovers -- the young British officer Ash (Ben Cross) and the betrothed princess Anjuli (Amy Irving) -- as they face daunting odds in their quest to be together. Set in India during the time of the British Raj, this haunting (and BAFTA-nominated) love story features spectacular scenery and an epic saga of battle, treachery and intrigue.', 'Adapted from M.M. Kaye''s best-selling novel, this dramatic HBO miniseries follows two star-crossed lovers -- the young British officer Ash (Ben Cross) and the betrothed princess Anjuli (Amy Irving) -- as they face daunting odds in their quest to be together. Set in India during the time of the British Raj, this haunting (and BAFTA-nominated) love story features spectacular scenery and an epic saga of battle, treachery and intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inkGOAi6xAvh18L0f0VlkLCBpcS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47779'),
  ('1097325971288578573', 'The Faraway Paladin', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Ayumu Murase, Go Shinomiya, Kenji Nomura, Kenichirou Matsuda', 'TV-14', 'In a city of the dead, long since ruined and far from human civilization, lives a single human child. His name is Will, and he''s being raised by three undead: the hearty skeletal warrior, Blood; the graceful mummified priestess, Mary; and the crotchety spectral sorcerer, Gus. The three pour love into the boy, and teach him all they know. But one day, Will starts to wonder: "Who am I?" Will must unravel the mysteries of this faraway dead man''s land, and unearth the secret pasts of the undead. He must learn the love and mercy of the good gods, and the bigotry and madness of the bad. And when he knows it all, the boy will take his first step on the path to becoming a Paladin.', 'In a city of the dead, long since ruined and far from human civilization, lives a single human child. His name is Will, and he''s being raised by three undead: the hearty skeletal warrior, Blood; the graceful mummified priestess, Mary; and the crotchety spectral sorcerer, Gus. The three pour love into the boy, and teach him all they know. But one day, Will starts to wonder: "Who am I?" Will must unravel the mysteries of this faraway dead man''s land, and unearth the secret pasts of the undead. He must learn the love and mercy of the good gods, and the bigotry and madness of the bad. And when he knows it all, the boy will take his first step on the path to becoming a Paladin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzrtmcYoz1A3LtcvZXSI0mTtXzJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:123525'),
  ('499578274616752323', 'The Farm', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Marcelina Zawadzka, Ilona Krawczyńska, Adam Nowak, Anna Małysa', null, 'In which the participants, accustomed to the comforts and charms of big city life, will have to survive in conditions they have not known before. to grow and sleep only when their duties allow it. In addition, duels for survival, as well as tasks that will require them to make difficult decisions, not always in accordance with their nature. In order to survive and win the program, the inhabitants of the Farm will have to cooperate with each other, test your survival instinct and strength of character. I will be alliances, quarrels, intrigues, but also friendships, and maybe even love? Every week one participant will say goodbye to the Farm, and ultimately only one will win the title of Super Farmer and 100,000 zlotys! Marcelina Zawadzka and Ilona Krawczyńska will set off on an adventure full of challenges, who from the very first day will try to help Farmers on their way to victory!', 'In which the participants, accustomed to the comforts and charms of big city life, will have to survive in conditions they have not known before. to grow and sleep only when their duties allow it. In addition, duels for survival, as well as tasks that will require them to make difficult decisions, not always in accordance with their nature. In order to survive and win the program, the inhabitants of the Farm will have to cooperate with each other, test your survival instinct and strength of character. I will be alliances, quarrels, intrigues, but also friendships, and maybe even love? Every week one participant will say goodbye to the Farm, and ultimately only one will win the title of Super Farmer and 100,000 zlotys! Marcelina Zawadzka and Ilona Krawczyńska will set off on an adventure full of challenges, who from the very first day will try to help Farmers on their way to victory!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qToH926WG7e484Yx15KQ2GYQdFh.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:157665'),
  ('569188160485940639', 'The Fast Show', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Paul Whitehouse, Charlie Higson', 'Paul Whitehouse', 'Paul Whitehouse, Charlie Higson, Mark Williams, John Thomson, Caroline Aherne, Arabella Weir, Simon Day, Maria McErlane', null, 'The Fast Show is a multi BAFTA award winning sketch comedy show written and produced by Paul Whitehouse and Charlie Higson.', 'The Fast Show is a multi BAFTA award winning sketch comedy show written and produced by Paul Whitehouse and Charlie Higson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7qGNeI1lEFFTUCPUsxf5WMlist.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2537'),
  ('1141798875953766538', 'The Fated Magical Princess: Who Made Me a Princess', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tao Dian, Zhao Lu, Ma Zhengyang, Zhang Qi, Sun Ye, Xu Hui, Chen Yiwen, Yang Chaoran', null, 'When a woman wakes up as Athanasia, the ill-fated princess from the novel The Lovely Princess, she''s gotta rewrite this tragedy or face execution—by her own father! She may be trapped, but she''s got her wits and the doomed girl''s memories to help her with a plot twist of survival. But when her escape plan fails, she has to charm her way into not being executed again.', 'When a woman wakes up as Athanasia, the ill-fated princess from the novel The Lovely Princess, she''s gotta rewrite this tragedy or face execution—by her own father! She may be trapped, but she''s got her wits and the doomed girl''s memories to help her with a plot twist of survival. But when her escape plan fails, she has to charm her way into not being executed again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOOkVZQTmTGXBJ0VPeP02YZl84m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262453'),
  ('1041250083747564868', 'The FBI Files', 1998, 'Documentary, Crime, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Witness the crime busting techniques and forensic science used by the FBI to break the most baffling cases. From crime scene analysis to the most up-to-date laboratories, FBI agents relentlessly comb through mountains of evidence to narrow their search, ultimately prevailing over the perpetrators and bringing them to justice.', 'Witness the crime busting techniques and forensic science used by the FBI to break the most baffling cases. From crime scene analysis to the most up-to-date laboratories, FBI agents relentlessly comb through mountains of evidence to narrow their search, ultimately prevailing over the perpetrators and bringing them to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xY7A8Gn4L9iyLDMv2ziOo8aXItW.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:660'),
  ('30706238308449408', 'The Fear', 2012, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Richard Cottan', 'Harry Lloyd, Anastasia Hille, Richard E. Grant, Peter Mullan, Paul Nicholls, Dragoș Bucur, Shaban Arifi, Julia Ragnarsson', null, 'Former gang boss turned respected businessman, Richie Beckett pledge money to help rebuild a pier. But Richie''s mind is deteriorating, and the other outfit he runs with his sons is under attack by a vicious rival gang.', 'Former gang boss turned respected businessman, Richie Beckett pledge money to help rebuild a pier. But Richie''s mind is deteriorating, and the other outfit he runs with his sons is under attack by a vicious rival gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usVYbEtg3Qkci5Jui3c4e1nuT1f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47833'),
  ('282610094515590407', 'The Fear Index', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Caroline Bartleet, Paul Andrew Williams, Matthew Billingsly', 'Josh Hartnett, Arsher Ali, Leila Farzad, Grégory Montel, Aïssa Maïga', null, 'Dr. Alex Hoffman, an American ex-pat physicist, creates an AI-driven system that exploits fear in the financial markets and operates at lightning speed to make big returns. But on the day of launch, Alex’s sanity is shaken after he is viciously attacked at his home by a man who knows all of his security codes. After more unexplained occurrences, Alex becomes convinced he’s being framed.', 'Dr. Alex Hoffman, an American ex-pat physicist, creates an AI-driven system that exploits fear in the financial markets and operates at lightning speed to make big returns. But on the day of launch, Alex’s sanity is shaken after he is viciously attacked at his home by a man who knows all of his security codes. After more unexplained occurrences, Alex becomes convinced he’s being framed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBtfIcDeKu6Fe9PEZRAJSWZyetU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156029'),
  ('32330644484420829', 'The Fearless', 2023, 'Drama', 'Zhao Dongling', 'Zhao Dongling', 'Rayzha Alimjan, Wang Yang, Chuai Ni, Shen Yujie, Feng Hui, Zheng Xiaoning, Li Yu, Liang Zhigang', null, 'Luo Yingzi, a self-taught lawyer who, after personal setbacks, teams up with Qiu Hua and Xia Shu to fight for justice, navigating both legal challenges and their own personal struggles', 'Luo Yingzi, a self-taught lawyer who, after personal setbacks, teams up with Qiu Hua and Xia Shu to fight for justice, navigating both legal challenges and their own personal struggles', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTWbWbbmcBwQdN4lwQscGiEOBG7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:238469'),
  ('637642225340522692', 'The Feds', 1993, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Robert Taylor, Angie Milliken, John Bach, Brian Vriends', null, 'The Feds is a series of Australian television films starring Robert Taylor, which were first broadcast on the Nine Network 1993-1996. The Feds revolves around the activities of the Australian Federal Police, who protect the national interests from crime in Australia and overseas. Nine telemovies were produced in the series.', 'The Feds is a series of Australian television films starring Robert Taylor, which were first broadcast on the Nine Network 1993-1996. The Feds revolves around the activities of the Australian Federal Police, who protect the national interests from crime in Australia and overseas. Nine telemovies were produced in the series.', null, 3, 'tmdb:tv:17768'),
  ('899815662827011807', 'The Feed', 2019, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Channing Powell', null, 'David Thewlis, Guy Burnet, Nina Toussaint-White, Michelle Fairley, Jeremy Neumark Jones, Jing Lusi, Clare-Hope Ashitey, Osy Ikhile', 'TV-14', 'In the near future, people’s minds are connected to The Feed, giving them instant connectivity. When something or someone invades it, everyone is at risk.', 'In the near future, people’s minds are connected to The Feed, giving them instant connectivity. When something or someone invades it, everyone is at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLC4AyssOIIF4oacH3WC78hBZv7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93833'),
  ('812191973644567581', 'The Ferragnez', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Chiara Ferragni, Fedez, Leone Lucia Ferragni', null, 'Tells the extraordinary life of Chiara Ferragni and Fedez. An authentic tale that unveils the behind the scenes of one of the most followed couples ever and the most intimate moments of a young family that passionately fights for their dreams to come true.', 'Tells the extraordinary life of Chiara Ferragni and Fedez. An authentic tale that unveils the behind the scenes of one of the most followed couples ever and the most intimate moments of a young family that passionately fights for their dreams to come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LAH1mdTqJoWIku2yaxoa63pt70.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:153195'),
  ('145633124633347225', 'The Field of Blood', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, 'David Kane', 'Jayd Johnson, David Morrissey, Kelsey Griffin, Bronagh Gallagher, Matt Costello, Ron Donachie, Ford Kiernan', null, 'Adaptation of Denise Mina''s thriller set in 1982. When the story of a murder has huge implications for her family, newspaper copy boy Paddy Meehan battles prejudices to get to the truth. As she inches closer to revealing the truth, her investigations place her in mortal danger.', 'Adaptation of Denise Mina''s thriller set in 1982. When the story of a murder has huge implications for her family, newspaper copy boy Paddy Meehan battles prejudices to get to the truth. As she inches closer to revealing the truth, her investigations place her in mortal danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0BMFly1L3CZpwX43sWkRh7hjTQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61658'),
  ('1031332842549740246', 'The Fierce Wife', 2010, 'Drama, Family', 'Wang Pei Hua', null, 'Sonia Sui, James Wen, Chris Wang, Amanda Zhu, 吳怡臻, 關勇, Chia-Li Chou, Pan Li-li', 'NR', 'Beautiful housewife Xie An Zhen seems to be living the perfect life but finds her world crumbling after learning that her husband is cheating on her.', 'Beautiful housewife Xie An Zhen seems to be living the perfect life but finds her world crumbling after learning that her husband is cheating on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60qdqVlxBcdXmm6x5LrYGvNWFmq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40484'),
  ('549904727074057621', 'The Fiery Priest', 2019, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Park Jae-beom', 'Park Jae-beom', 'Kim Nam-gil, Lee Hanee, Kim Sung-kyun, Sung Joon, Seo Hyun-woo, Baek Ji-won, BIBI, Ko Kyu-pil', null, 'People commit variety of ugly crimes these days. However, they forgive themselves by giving testimony every week. They believe that they can repent just by having faith. But the truth is that they have faith to repeat the sins again and again without remorse. These people atone for their evil deeds just to feel comfortable and carefree. It is not about the victims who are suffering because of them. They say every people are equal before the religions. But it is time to discriminate people who only uses them for their interest. Screening if they are really good people, punishing if they deserve to be punished, and defending justice is needed for modern day religion. A priest with this sense of justice teams up with a detective and a prosecutor. They try to solve the mysterious death of an elderly priest and serve justice.', 'People commit variety of ugly crimes these days. However, they forgive themselves by giving testimony every week. They believe that they can repent just by having faith. But the truth is that they have faith to repeat the sins again and again without remorse. These people atone for their evil deeds just to feel comfortable and carefree. It is not about the victims who are suffering because of them. They say every people are equal before the religions. But it is time to discriminate people who only uses them for their interest. Screening if they are really good people, punishing if they deserve to be punished, and defending justice is needed for modern day religion. A priest with this sense of justice teams up with a detective and a prosecutor. They try to solve the mysterious death of an elderly priest and serve justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EDJlbB3S1vwOpsR3h1k0NMHiHY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86830'),
  ('229700295001461724', 'The Fifth Estate', 1976, 'Documentary, News', null, null, 'Bob McKeown, Gillian Findlay, Mark Kelley', 'NR', 'Each week the fifth estate brings in-depth investigations that matter to Canadians – delivering a dazzling parade of political leaders, controversial characters and ordinary people whose lives were touched by triumph or tragedy.', 'Each week the fifth estate brings in-depth investigations that matter to Canadians – delivering a dazzling parade of political leaders, controversial characters and ordinary people whose lives were touched by triumph or tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyrDP9LLB9dhZApYO8C9Kh25VIM.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:11317'),
  ('620857485262407779', 'The Fifth Woman', 2002, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Klas Abrahamsson, Birger Larsen', 'Rolf Lassgård, Marie Richardson, Lars Melin, Christer Fant, Kerstin Andersson, Klas-Gösta Olsson, Emy Storm, Palle Granditsky', null, 'The 5th woman unfolds autumn 1994. An elderly man found in a gillrad pitfall impaled to death on the sharp sharpened bamboo poles, ecstatic praise of crows. Shortly afterwards disappears a florist without a trace and he also found executed in the forest. Kurt Wallander and his colleagues will soon understand that the attacks is all about revenge.', 'The 5th woman unfolds autumn 1994. An elderly man found in a gillrad pitfall impaled to death on the sharp sharpened bamboo poles, ecstatic praise of crows. Shortly afterwards disappears a florist without a trace and he also found executed in the forest. Kurt Wallander and his colleagues will soon understand that the attacks is all about revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4NrUtyG3m0ps9khuioOzbkvYRV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73662'),
  ('463759016168976082', 'The Fight for Justice: Paolo Guerrero', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Nikko Ponce, Irene Eyzaguirre, Alex Amato, Rodrigo Palacios, Toño Vega, Tatiana Espinoza, Hugo Salazar, Carlos Solano', 'TV-14', 'Peruvian soccer star Paolo Guerrero wages a difficult legal battle after testing positive for cocaine months before the World Cup. Based on a true story.', 'Peruvian soccer star Paolo Guerrero wages a difficult legal battle after testing positive for cocaine months before the World Cup. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2t7RTdxdtYI8LUPvmwQ1Z478FZq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210071'),
  ('745108718512100296', 'The File Of Justice', 1992, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', '邓特希, Szeto Kam-Yuen', null, 'Michael Tao Tai-Yu, Bobby Au-Yeung Tsan-Wah, Jessica Hsuan, William So Wing-Hong, Felix Lok Ying-Kwan, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah, Flora Chan Wai-Shan', null, 'The Files of Justice is a series of Hong Kong legal drama produced by TVB. There were 5 seasons produced, the first was aired in 1992 spanning 13 episodes. The series revolves around a group of lawyers and legal personnel with stories interwoven between their personal lives and the court cases in which they’re engaged. This drama is Bobby Au Yeung''s TV debut.', 'The Files of Justice is a series of Hong Kong legal drama produced by TVB. There were 5 seasons produced, the first was aired in 1992 spanning 13 episodes. The series revolves around a group of lawyers and legal personnel with stories interwoven between their personal lives and the court cases in which they’re engaged. This drama is Bobby Au Yeung''s TV debut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZUdXghO3r9pziM0CVUEd7u342d.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:16964'),
  ('590233477775428632', 'The File of Young Kindaichi Returns', 2014, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Taiki Matsuno, Akiko Nakagawa, Jurota Kosugi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Kenichi Ono', null, 'High school student Hajime Kindaichi is the supposed grandson of famous private detective Kosuke Kindaichi. Visiting Hong Kong for a fashion event with Kindaichi, our hero''s girlfriend Miyuki is captured by a stranger in a case of mistaken identity. The journey to save Miyuki itself leads to yet another crime case...', 'High school student Hajime Kindaichi is the supposed grandson of famous private detective Kosuke Kindaichi. Visiting Hong Kong for a fashion event with Kindaichi, our hero''s girlfriend Miyuki is captured by a stranger in a case of mistaken identity. The journey to save Miyuki itself leads to yet another crime case...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zO2tblpedor1VPTIvByS8Iccjs5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69355'),
  ('114239648897440847', 'The Files of the Young Kindaichi', 1995, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Shunsuke Michieda, Moka Kamishiraishi, Ikki Sawamura, Iwasaki Taisho', null, 'A young man who showed little promise while a high school student becomes a master detective, just like his grandfather.', 'A young man who showed little promise while a high school student becomes a master detective, just like his grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nder3nwcfZycTIOZ6A68TALXhXo.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:36366'),
  ('238893715272706796', 'The Files of Young Kindaichi', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Shunsuke Michieda, Moka Kamishiraishi, Ikki Sawamura, Iwasaki Taisho', 'TV-MA', 'Kindaichi Hajime is a high school student and a private detective with an IQ of 180. He solves murder cases that are riddled with difficult clues. Kindaichi Hajime works with his childhood friend Nanase Miyuki and Kenmochi Isamu. Kenmochi Isamu is now the chief inspector of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department.', 'Kindaichi Hajime is a high school student and a private detective with an IQ of 180. He solves murder cases that are riddled with difficult clues. Kindaichi Hajime works with his childhood friend Nanase Miyuki and Kenmochi Isamu. Kenmochi Isamu is now the chief inspector of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFTzFjKNAMddnYiLtb3teDmb7ba.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194852'),
  ('670436807133104251', 'The Files of Young Kindaichi Neo', 2014, 'Crime', null, 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Ryosuke Yamada, Haruna Kawaguchi, Daiki Arioka, Yōsuke Asari', null, 'Kindaichi''s best friend is involved with the school film club where members are found murdered. Can he protect her before she become the next victim?', 'Kindaichi''s best friend is involved with the school film club where members are found murdered. Can he protect her before she become the next victim?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79WHyewhSEEcORmsYfOyV5HJg72.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67492'),
  ('40724276743090844', 'The Final Cut', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy, War & Politics', 'Andrew Davies', null, 'Ian Richardson, Diane Fletcher, Paul Freeman, Isla Blair, Nickolas Grace, Glyn Grain, Nick Brimble, Dorothy Vernon', null, 'Seasoned politician Francis Urquhart tries to establish his legacy before retirement by negotiating an end to the Cyprus, but the island hides secrets from his past that could destroy him.', 'Seasoned politician Francis Urquhart tries to establish his legacy before retirement by negotiating an end to the Cyprus, but the island hides secrets from his past that could destroy him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lQ6roAFARdKe9qGPF0KigYPASZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77041'),
  ('530489881711561101', 'The Final Score', 2022, 'Drama', 'C.S. Prince, Pablo González', 'Carlos Moreno', 'Laura Archbold, Carlos Mariño, Juan Pablo Urrego, John Alex Castillo, Patricia Tamayo, Victor-Mauricio Pizarro, Brian Vélez, Brayan Arboleda', 'TV-MA', 'The complicated relationship of several of the Colombian national team players with drug trafficking, one that culminated in the own goal and murder of one of the most beloved defenders in the world.', 'The complicated relationship of several of the Colombian national team players with drug trafficking, one that culminated in the own goal and murder of one of the most beloved defenders in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAYM4n8NJXLC5no3PkkjPb1ZYBb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213550'),
  ('596848288902091172', 'The Final Table', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Andrew Knowlton', null, 'Team of chefs vie to impress some of the world''s toughest palates as they whip up iconic dishes from different nations in this fast-paced competition.', 'Team of chefs vie to impress some of the world''s toughest palates as they whip up iconic dishes from different nations in this fast-paced competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJ6ODwOzGMquw2pCcuhve7D6tkg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84216'),
  ('343520547660630156', 'The Finder', 2012, 'Drama', 'Hart Hanson', null, 'Geoff Stults, Maddie Hasson, Mercedes Mason, Michael Clarke Duncan', 'TV-14', 'Walter Sherman, an Iraq War veteran, has the extraordinary ability to help people find the unfindable.', 'Walter Sherman, an Iraq War veteran, has the extraordinary ability to help people find the unfindable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ssqed8krPnhVJCxGtw6Z3KrINw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39360'),
  ('148630451811130936', 'The Fire Hunter', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Misaki Kuno, Shoya Ishige, Maaya Sakamoto, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Sachi Kokuryu, Saori Hayami, Megumi Yamaguchi', 'TV-14', 'Outside the magical barriers lies a world overrun by fiery beasts known as Flame Demons, and the only ones who can protect humanity are the Fire Hunters. In the dark woods where the beasts roam is where Touko, a young villager, is rescued from attack by one of these skilled trackers, Koushi. But their meeting was no accident, and a new destiny begins.', 'Outside the magical barriers lies a world overrun by fiery beasts known as Flame Demons, and the only ones who can protect humanity are the Fire Hunters. In the dark woods where the beasts roam is where Touko, a young villager, is rescued from attack by one of these skilled trackers, Koushi. But their meeting was no accident, and a new destiny begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adfYirjfMdN5mNJE1B0J4qD5DP0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156688'),
  ('855804511354559995', 'The Firm', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Lukas Reiter', null, 'Josh Lucas, Callum Keith Rennie, Molly Parker, Juliette Lewis', 'TV-14', 'As a young associate, Mitchell McDeere brought down the prestigious Memphis law firm of Bendini, Lambert & Locke, which operated as a front for the Chicago mob—and his life was never the same. After a difficult decade, which included a stay in the Federal Witness Protection program, Mitch and his family now emerge from isolation to reclaim their lives and their future—only to find that past dangers are still lurking and new threats are everywhere.', 'As a young associate, Mitchell McDeere brought down the prestigious Memphis law firm of Bendini, Lambert & Locke, which operated as a front for the Chicago mob—and his life was never the same. After a difficult decade, which included a stay in the Federal Witness Protection program, Mitch and his family now emerge from isolation to reclaim their lives and their future—only to find that past dangers are still lurking and new threats are everywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m3jenqRfwi97xRDD1vlj7rFD2j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39255'),
  ('154321528221005972', 'The First', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Beau Willimon', null, 'Sean Penn, Natascha McElhone, Oded Fehr, Anna Jacoby-Heron, Hannah Ware, LisaGay Hamilton, Keiko Agena, James Ransone', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the first human mission to Mars, exploring the challenges of taking the first steps toward interplanetary colonization. The story focuses not only on the astronauts, but also on their families and loved ones, as well as the ground team on Earth.', 'Follow the first human mission to Mars, exploring the challenges of taking the first steps toward interplanetary colonization. The story focuses not only on the astronauts, but also on their families and loved ones, as well as the ground team on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSnlOGjeDWWVbDMjQTdYCtavvBv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74159'),
  ('469956763521950977', 'The First 48', 2004, 'Documentary, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Dion Graham', 'TV-14', 'The First 48 follows detectives from around the country during these first critical hours as they race against time to find the suspect. Gritty and fast-paced, it takes viewers behind the scenes of real-life investigations with unprecedented access to crime scenes, autopsies, forensic processing, and interrogations.', 'The First 48 follows detectives from around the country during these first critical hours as they race against time to find the suspect. Gritty and fast-paced, it takes viewers behind the scenes of real-life investigations with unprecedented access to crime scenes, autopsies, forensic processing, and interrogations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6bSut4XPepaJ5VC6oG303iGKQU.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:5146'),
  ('457441216413548557', 'The First Family', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Byron Allen', null, 'Christopher B. Duncan, Kellita Smith, Jackée Harry, Khylin Rhambo, Layla Crawford', 'TV-PG', 'The First Family is an American sitcom that debuted in first-run syndication in the United States on September 22, 2012. Created by Byron Allen and produced by Allen''s production company Entertainment Studios, the series is the first situation comedy to air in first-run syndication since the 2000 cancellation of Malibu, CA.', 'The First Family is an American sitcom that debuted in first-run syndication in the United States on September 22, 2012. Created by Byron Allen and produced by Allen''s production company Entertainment Studios, the series is the first situation comedy to air in first-run syndication since the 2000 cancellation of Malibu, CA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swW8Q37ohdOsgyemP63wIAMdm3V.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:59542'),
  ('481443941629574389', 'The First Frost', 2025, 'Drama', 'Zhu Yi', null, 'Bai Jingting, Zhang Ruonan, Edward Chen, Zhang Miaoyi, Zhai Xiaowen, Yuan Ye, Chen Jianan, Fu Miao', null, 'Wen Yifan, by chance, ends up living with her high school classmate Sang Yan, whom she once rejected. They keep their distance until Wen Yifan learns from Sang Yan that she sleepwalks, intertwining their lives once more.', 'Wen Yifan, by chance, ends up living with her high school classmate Sang Yan, whom she once rejected. They keep their distance until Wen Yifan learns from Sang Yan that she sleepwalks, intertwining their lives once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywkwBd65CMvC33DDVFOQqr4mrVQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250060'),
  ('13043903566890300', 'The First Half of My Life', 2017, 'Soap', 'Shen Yan, Yi Shu', 'Qin Wen', 'Ma Yili, Jin Dong, Yuan Quan, Lei Jiayin, Wu Yue, Zhang Lingxin, Chen Daoming, Luan Yuanhui', null, 'A group of city dwellers who have to make choices about love and career. Based on Hong Kong novelist Yi Shu''s novel of the same name.', 'A group of city dwellers who have to make choices about love and career. Based on Hong Kong novelist Yi Shu''s novel of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9OCenjkHEbEzst0l1gzX8IF1wU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73028'),
  ('158626193627748060', 'The First Hundred Years', 1950, 'Drama', null, null, 'Nancy Malone, Nana Bryant, Robert Armstrong, Jimmy Lydon, Anne Sargent', null, 'The First Hundred Years is the first ongoing TV soap opera in the United States that began as a daytime serial, airing on CBS from December 4, 1950 until June 27, 1952. A previous daytime drama on NBC, These Are My Children, aired in 1949 but only lasted one month, and NBC''s Hawkins Falls began in June 1950 as a primetime "soap" and didn''t move to daytime until April 1951. The drama involved two couples who were next-door neighbors. The series did not succeed due to very low viewership, as few American households had television sets, and fewer still watched during the afternoon. The series was replaced with the television version of Guiding Light, which would prove to be much more successful, airing for 57 years.', 'The First Hundred Years is the first ongoing TV soap opera in the United States that began as a daytime serial, airing on CBS from December 4, 1950 until June 27, 1952. A previous daytime drama on NBC, These Are My Children, aired in 1949 but only lasted one month, and NBC''s Hawkins Falls began in June 1950 as a primetime "soap" and didn''t move to daytime until April 1951. The drama involved two couples who were next-door neighbors. The series did not succeed due to very low viewership, as few American households had television sets, and fewer still watched during the afternoon. The series was replaced with the television version of Guiding Light, which would prove to be much more successful, airing for 57 years.', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:13212'),
  ('720031576320059451', 'The First Lady', 2022, 'Drama, Family', 'Aaron Cooley', null, 'Viola Davis, Michelle Pfeiffer, Gillian Anderson, O-T Fagbenle, Dakota Fanning, Lily Rabe, Regina Taylor, Kiefer Sutherland', 'TV-MA', 'A revelatory reframing of American leadership through the lens of the First Ladies. Exploring everything from their journeys to Washington, family life, and world-changing political contributions, the impact of the White House''s women is no longer hidden from view.', 'A revelatory reframing of American leadership through the lens of the First Ladies. Exploring everything from their journeys to Washington, family life, and world-changing political contributions, the impact of the White House''s women is no longer hidden from view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4E8sayYfKqLfohq1gfXhNCbreC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99070'),
  ('32670751873776457', 'The First Night with the Duke', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', '全善英', null, 'Seohyun, Ok Taec-yeon, Kwon Han-sol, Seo Bum-june, Ji Hye-won, Lee Tae-seon, Seo Hyun-chul, Yun Yoo-sun', null, 'Reincarnated as a minor character in a novel, Cha Seon-taek unexpectedly spends a night with Prince Kyungsung, sparking an intense and unexpected romance.', 'Reincarnated as a minor character in a novel, Cha Seon-taek unexpectedly spends a night with Prince Kyungsung, sparking an intense and unexpected romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKpIpNJGT9MQpejVNpNXxP09eAr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278331'),
  ('638991396989781889', 'The First Responders', 2022, 'Drama', 'Min Ji-eun', 'Min Ji-eun', 'Kim Rae-won, Son Ho-jun, Gong Seung-yeon, Son Ji-yoon, Kang Ki-doong, Oh Eui-sik, Seo Hyun-chul, Ji Woo', null, 'A police station and a fire station adjoining each other cooperate in combating crime and fire in the most brutal and tragic cases.', 'A police station and a fire station adjoining each other cooperate in combating crime and fire in the most brutal and tragic cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccEYx9NoZvDJRw8Ji2E7yJYLXwt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:211261'),
  ('572019806476635925', 'The First Shot', 2024, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', null, 'Zhang Yuan''ang, Mailiyasi, Ma Yu Xin', 'Johnny Huang, Zhang Yu, Wang Ziqi, Chloe Xie, Lin Boyang, Liu Runnan, Zhao Yutong, Lian Shumei', null, 'In 1997, before the anti-drug bureau was established, Halan City in Northeast China formed a temporary elite team to tackle a sudden drug crisis. Despite their skills, they are unfamiliar with new drugs and must confront ruthless traffickers and devious smuggling methods while grappling with moral dilemmas and the tests of justice and humanity. United by their courage and determination, they create a stirring legend of fighting crime and corruption.', 'In 1997, before the anti-drug bureau was established, Halan City in Northeast China formed a temporary elite team to tackle a sudden drug crisis. Despite their skills, they are unfamiliar with new drugs and must confront ruthless traffickers and devious smuggling methods while grappling with moral dilemmas and the tests of justice and humanity. United by their courage and determination, they create a stirring legend of fighting crime and corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg5IaKa8gyOOSc5eVPdll8NYvh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253649'),
  ('1115663653760847420', 'The First Team', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Damon Beesley, Iain Morris', null, 'Jake Short, Shaquille Ali-Yebuah, Jack McMullen, Will Arnett, Chris Geere, Theo Barklem-Biggs, Tamla Kari, Paolo Sassanelli', null, 'The misadventures of three young football players Mattie, Jack and Benji, at a fictional Premier League club with terrifying team hard-man Petey, mercurial Italian manager Cesare and eccentric chairman Mark Crane.', 'The misadventures of three young football players Mattie, Jack and Benji, at a fictional Premier League club with terrifying team hard-man Petey, mercurial Italian manager Cesare and eccentric chairman Mark Crane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1u82B9XehB0D63RshdJd0fgMirH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104143'),
  ('1088917987920567592', 'The First World War', 2003, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, 'Hew Strachan', 'Ferdinand I of Bulgaria, Marie of Romania, Hermann Göring, Jonathan Lewis', null, 'This ten-part docuseries tells the comprehensive story of the First World War, featuring excerpts written by Winston Churchill, Karen Blixen, Georges Clémenceau, David Lloyd George, Siegfried Sassoon and Rudolf Hess.', 'This ten-part docuseries tells the comprehensive story of the First World War, featuring excerpts written by Winston Churchill, Karen Blixen, Georges Clémenceau, David Lloyd George, Siegfried Sassoon and Rudolf Hess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhSaKP54QxE7CZ7vQ0hvHX6mWWq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42086'),
  ('490167303429389797', 'The First Years', 2014, 'Soap, Drama', 'Raymond Grimbergen, Nicolien Kool, Eva Leysen', null, 'Shad Abdullah, Stella Muller, Joey Hooiveld, Jaidah Dawson, Kieran Adjei, Sara Feline Looij, Indy van der Spoel', null, 'The First Years is a Dutch series for young people in which real-life situations are recreated. The series sheds light on subjects that pupils in the first year of secondary school may be confronted with.', 'The First Years is a Dutch series for young people in which real-life situations are recreated. The series sheds light on subjects that pupils in the first year of secondary school may be confronted with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klPqN1oITjVub0Yss0Kqnx8NfY3.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:82708'),
  ('281326144129364692', 'The Five', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Harlan Coben', null, 'Tom Cullen, O-T Fagbenle, Lee Ingleby, Sarah Solemani, Lola Mae Loughran', 'TV-PG', 'When they were twelve years old, Mark, Pru, Danny and Slade were out together in the park. Mark’s five-year-old brother, Jesse, was annoying them. They were mean – told him to get lost. Jesse ran away. He was gone. Never seen again. Twenty years later, Danny – now a detective – learns some shocking news. Jesse’s DNA has been found at a murder scene. He is alive and out there. Somewhere.', 'When they were twelve years old, Mark, Pru, Danny and Slade were out together in the park. Mark’s five-year-old brother, Jesse, was annoying them. They were mean – told him to get lost. Jesse ran away. He was gone. Never seen again. Twenty years later, Danny – now a detective – learns some shocking news. Jesse’s DNA has been found at a murder scene. He is alive and out there. Somewhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAWDDSMkx0A1D9QbiBeUoV954qF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66238'),
  ('282552868992402672', 'The Five Juanas', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Jimena Romero', null, 'Zuria Vega, Renata Notni, Oka Giner, Juanita Arias, Sofía Engberg, Iván Amozurrutia, Jorge Antonio Guerrero, Ludyvina Velarde', 'TV-MA', 'Five women with the same birthmark set out to unravel the truth about their pasts and discover a tragic web of lies spun by a powerful politician.', 'Five women with the same birthmark set out to unravel the truth about their pasts and discover a tragic web of lies spun by a powerful politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFffOCcrtf5mSoGKd2J31d2b5yg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133086'),
  ('965100677167970397', 'The Fix', 2018, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Jimmy Carr, Mona Chalabi, Katherine Ryan, D.L. Hughley', null, 'Comedians Jimmy Carr, D.L. Hughley and Katherine Ryan tackle the world''s woes with help from a rotating crew of funny guests and an actual expert.', 'Comedians Jimmy Carr, D.L. Hughley and Katherine Ryan tackle the world''s woes with help from a rotating crew of funny guests and an actual expert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soXzI7IUQWHvFcG6pXgJX0DuRov.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30072'),
  ('474776535211002851', 'The Fix', 2019, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Sarah Fain, Marcia Clark, Elizabeth Craft', null, 'Robin Tunney, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Adam Rayner, Merrin Dungey, Breckin Meyer, Marc Blucas, Mouzam Makkar, Alex Saxon', 'TV-14', 'High-profile district attorney Maya Travis fled L.A. after devastating defeat when prosecuting an A-list actor for double murder. Eight years later, the same celebrity is under suspicion for another murder, and Maya is lured back to the DA’s office for another chance at justice.', 'High-profile district attorney Maya Travis fled L.A. after devastating defeat when prosecuting an A-list actor for double murder. Eight years later, the same celebrity is under suspicion for another murder, and Maya is lured back to the DA’s office for another chance at justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NfIhX3XjH7IBvUnctnhxoWnwRF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81922'),
  ('1003502313354673539', 'The Fixer', 2015, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Eric Dane, Kathleen Robertson, Andrew Airlie, Kyle Switzer', null, 'NTSB investigator Ellie Molaro, suspicious of the "official answers” to an oil rig disaster, spearheads a private investigation with a secret tipster named Carter who claims that a conspiracy of “Fixers” are behind the worst disasters in the country, all rigged to manipulate the stock market, and reap billions for a select few.', 'NTSB investigator Ellie Molaro, suspicious of the "official answers” to an oil rig disaster, spearheads a private investigation with a secret tipster named Carter who claims that a conspiracy of “Fixers” are behind the worst disasters in the country, all rigged to manipulate the stock market, and reap billions for a select few.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtYXIcKNDymxgdmaWPZplmKE53p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63854'),
  ('308008422672716669', 'The Fixies', 2011, 'Animation, Kids', 'Aleksandr Tatarskiy', null, 'Larisa Brokhman, Yakov Vasilyev', 'TV-G', '"And who are the fixies - a big, big secret!" - that''s what the song about the fixies sings. Until recently, people knew almost nothing about these little people who live inside cars and appliances. Fixies take care of machines from the inside, cleaning them, lubricating them, fixing minor malfunctions. They are skilled and diligent craftsmen. Fixies are used to hiding from people, but they are everywhere: in computers, refrigerators, TVs ... Everyone remembers the cases when a non-working device suddenly began to work if it is lightly tapped. It''s simple: a fixer woke up inside and made everything work. And now you can watch cartoons about these mysterious hard-working people and get to know them better...', '"And who are the fixies - a big, big secret!" - that''s what the song about the fixies sings. Until recently, people knew almost nothing about these little people who live inside cars and appliances. Fixies take care of machines from the inside, cleaning them, lubricating them, fixing minor malfunctions. They are skilled and diligent craftsmen. Fixies are used to hiding from people, but they are everywhere: in computers, refrigerators, TVs ... Everyone remembers the cases when a non-working device suddenly began to work if it is lightly tapped. It''s simple: a fixer woke up inside and made everything work. And now you can watch cartoons about these mysterious hard-working people and get to know them better...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96CHOc8JUbLQ6SROGt2BVwtsGjH.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:46105'),
  ('1051631651244881641', 'The Flame', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Cohen, Jérémie Galan, Florent Bernard', null, 'Jonathan Cohen, Ana Girardot, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Géraldine Nakache, Leïla Bekhti, Camille Chamoux, Pierre Niney, Youssef Hajdi', null, 'For nine weeks, thirteen contenders will have to compete in a beautiful villa to try to seduce Marc, an airline pilot, looking for love. Which of these women will manage to light the flame?', 'For nine weeks, thirteen contenders will have to compete in a beautiful villa to try to seduce Marc, an airline pilot, looking for love. Which of these women will manage to light the flame?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzZGn7aaAgBjP4hRMCLGwNe0Mpt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94626'),
  ('342423847830644954', 'The Flame''s Daughter', 2018, 'Drama', 'Ming Xiaoxi', 'Mobao Feibao', 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Vic Chou, Vin Zhang, Lai Yi, Ryan Zhang, Liu Ruilin, Gong Beibi, Dai Si', null, 'The story of Ruge and Zhang Feng whose lives are interchanged after they are switched at birth. They meet and fall in love but their relationship takes a tragic turn due to the machinations of a man hell-bent on revenge.', 'The story of Ruge and Zhang Feng whose lives are interchanged after they are switched at birth. They meet and fall in love but their relationship takes a tragic turn due to the machinations of a man hell-bent on revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qF7KtoyfvYvnDrIpOope79IGUJS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72603'),
  ('675194392143545880', 'The Flash', 1990, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Danny Bilson, Paul De Meo', null, 'John Wesley Shipp, Amanda Pays, Alex Désert', 'TV-PG', 'When a bolt of lightning crashes through a police crime lab, a mix of electrically charged substances bathes chemist Barry Allen, transforming him into the fastest man alive--The Flash.', 'When a bolt of lightning crashes through a police crime lab, a mix of electrically charged substances bathes chemist Barry Allen, transforming him into the fastest man alive--The Flash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fi1GEdCbyWRDHpyJcB25YYK7fh4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236'),
  ('100723415552659027', 'The Flash', 2014, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Geoff Johns, Greg Berlanti, Andrew Kreisberg', 'Dan Fisk', 'Grant Gustin, Candice Patton, Danielle Panabaker, Danielle Nicolet, Kayla Compton, Brandon McKnight, Jon Cor', 'TV-14', 'After being struck by lightning, CSI investigator Barry Allen awakens from a nine-month coma to discover he has been granted the gift of super speed. Teaming up with S.T.A.R. Labs, Barry takes on the persona of The Flash, the Fastest Man Alive, to protect his city.', 'After being struck by lightning, CSI investigator Barry Allen awakens from a nine-month coma to discover he has been granted the gift of super speed. Teaming up with S.T.A.R. Labs, Barry takes on the persona of The Flash, the Fastest Man Alive, to protect his city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZevl2vHQgmosfwUdVNzviIfaWS.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:60735'),
  ('957378683483635705', 'The Flash (2014)', 2014, 'Drama, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Eric Wallace, Lauren Certo, Sterling Gates, Grainne Godfree, Thomas Pound', 'Eric Wallace, Lauren Certo, Sterling Gates, Grainne Godfree, Thomas Pound, Dan Fisk, Judalina Neira, Kai Yu Wu, Andrew Kreisberg, Todd Helbing, Sam Chalsen, Gabriel Garza, Kelly Wheeler, Benjamin Raab, Alison Schapker, Zack Stentz, Katherine Walczak, Deric A. Hughes, Ben Sokolowski, Sarah Tarkoff, Bronwen Clark, Carina Adly MacKenzie, Andrew Wilder, Keto Shimizu, Ray Utarnachitt, Cortney Norris, Gabe Snyder, Mike Alber, Julian Meiojas, Chris Rafferty, Bryan Q. Miller, Emily Silver, Jaime Paglia, Lilah Vandenburgh, Greg Berlanti, Kristen Kim, Joshua V. Gilbert, Brooke Roberts, Christina M. Walker, Gabrielle Stanton, Jeff Hersh, Marc Guggenheim, Lauren Fields, Jonathan Butler, Aaron Helbing, Lauren Barnett, Jess Carson, Emily Palizzi, David Kob, Geoff Johns, Joe Peracchio, Alex Boyd, Arielle McAlpin', 'Grant Gustin, Candice Patton, Jesse L. Martin, Carlos Valdes, Danielle Nicolet', 'TV-14', 'Barry Allen was struck by lightning and fell into a coma. When he awakens from it 9 months later, he meets Cisco Ramon, Harrison Wells, and Caitlin Snow, and later he realizes that he that he has powers and how it had been caused by the explosion of the particle accelerator.', 'Barry Allen was struck by lightning and fell into a coma. When he awakens from it 9 months later, he meets Cisco Ramon, Harrison Wells, and Caitlin Snow, and later he realizes that he that he has powers and how it had been caused by the explosion of the particle accelerator.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FyZevl2vHQgmosfwUdVNzviIfaWS.jpg', 9, 'plex:tv:the-flash-2014'),
  ('796629972133377353', 'The Flash Band', 2021, 'Reality', 'Tong Wu', null, 'Yugang Li, Jam Hsiao, Ayal Komod, Laure Shang, Yadong Zhang, Zhou Xiaoou, Rainie Yang, Yang Kun', null, 'In the program, the musicians participated in the festival in the form of a band. During the process, they continued to run in and reorganize, and collided with music works that broke through the classics, and finally formed a shining band.', 'In the program, the musicians participated in the festival in the form of a band. During the process, they continued to run in and reorganize, and collided with music works that broke through the classics, and finally formed a shining band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhGgcLlZeg35q9ppANnOina3kuv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154215'),
  ('805477633416840953', 'The Flash: Chronicles of Cisco', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Carlos Valdes', 'TV-PG', 'Follows "The Flash" character Cisco Ramon as he works late at S.T.A.R. Labs making improvements to the Flash''s suit.', 'Follows "The Flash" character Cisco Ramon as he works late at S.T.A.R. Labs making improvements to the Flash''s suit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOtZcYsBkgwMJQ3ULweCW8wDpdM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74556'),
  ('381068564741989448', 'The Flatey Enigma', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Viktor Arnar Ingólfsson, Margrét Örnólfsdóttir', null, 'Sigurður Sigurjónsson, Lára Jóhanna Jónsdóttir, Þuríður Blær Jóhannsdóttir, Stefán Hallur Stefánsson', null, 'Spring of 1971, Johanna, a professor of Nordic Studies comes home from Paris to attend her father’s funeral. She’s also looking to find work at the University, but her feminist viewpoints about the systematic silencing of women’s voices in history does not go over well with the university board.', 'Spring of 1971, Johanna, a professor of Nordic Studies comes home from Paris to attend her father’s funeral. She’s also looking to find work at the University, but her feminist viewpoints about the systematic silencing of women’s voices in history does not go over well with the university board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3z2zpTEUSRH88IJMzfJtv5z9OD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90347'),
  ('354909075825272570', 'The Flatshare', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Jessica Brown Findlay, Anthony Welsh, Jonah Hauer-King, Shaniqua Okwok, Bart Edwards', null, 'Tiffany and Leon are two cash-strapped twenty somethings who share a bed, but have never met. The question is, can you fall in love with someone you''ve never set eyes on?', 'Tiffany and Leon are two cash-strapped twenty somethings who share a bed, but have never met. The question is, can you fall in love with someone you''ve never set eyes on?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pr6e4bmFVahfRt0Ue5LMeKSxk8d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211698'),
  ('46036428664220565', 'The Flatterer', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Ik-soo', null, 'Yoon Bo-ra, Kwak Dong-yeon, Bae Seul-ki, Lee Jae-jin, Exy, Song Yool-Kyu, Jo Yeon-woo, Moon Won-ju', null, 'Story about Park Gun, who starts attending a high school full of troublemakers and former dropouts. ~~ Based on a webtoon of the same name.', 'Story about Park Gun, who starts attending a high school full of troublemakers and former dropouts. ~~ Based on a webtoon of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jBGSvSn1IdUFOrp2zfMHm72oou.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69422'),
  ('763869606080476469', 'The Flight Attendant', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Steve Yockey', null, 'Kaley Cuoco, Zosia Mamet, Deniz Akdeniz, Mo McRae, Callie Hernandez, Griffin Matthews, J. J. Soria, Cheryl Hines', 'TV-MA', 'Flight attendant Cassandra Bowden wakes in her hotel room hungover from the night before in Dubai with a dead body lying next to her. Afraid to call the police, she continues her morning as if nothing happened. In New York, she is met by FBI agents who question her about her recent layover in Bangkok. Still unable to piece the night together, she begins to wonder if she could be the killer.', 'Flight attendant Cassandra Bowden wakes in her hotel room hungover from the night before in Dubai with a dead body lying next to her. Afraid to call the police, she continues her morning as if nothing happened. In New York, she is met by FBI agents who question her about her recent layover in Bangkok. Still unable to piece the night together, she begins to wonder if she could be the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCK0o8CWV46Z0PUdh7CKXnjD2Po.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93287'),
  ('441224665543497104', 'The Flintstone Comedy Show', 1980, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Henry Corden, Mel Blanc, Jean Vander Pyl, Gay Autterson, Russi Taylor, Michael Sheehan, Charles Nelson Reilly, Zelda Rubinstein', null, 'The Flintstone Comedy Show is a 90-minute Saturday morning animated series revival of The Flintstones produced by Hanna-Barbera and aired from November 22, 1980 to September 11, 1982 on NBC. Outside North America, the show was released under title of Flintstone Frolics. The show contained six segments: The Flintstone Family Adventures, Bedrock Cops, Pebbles, Dino and Bamm-Bamm, Captain Caveman, Dino and Cavemouse, and The Frankenstones.', 'The Flintstone Comedy Show is a 90-minute Saturday morning animated series revival of The Flintstones produced by Hanna-Barbera and aired from November 22, 1980 to September 11, 1982 on NBC. Outside North America, the show was released under title of Flintstone Frolics. The show contained six segments: The Flintstone Family Adventures, Bedrock Cops, Pebbles, Dino and Bamm-Bamm, Captain Caveman, Dino and Cavemouse, and The Frankenstones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXJV61A9N4nbN9b1K5ZYFuCUWVG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12947'),
  ('257698728528871169', 'The Flintstone Kids', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Scott Menville, Hamilton Camp, Julie McWhirter, B.J. Ward, Mel Blanc, Charlie Adler, Bumper Robinson, Lennie Weinrib', 'TV-G', 'Join Fred, Wilma, Dino, Barney and Betty in their formative years when they were precocious prehistoric preteens. Whether they’re riding to school on a brontosaurus’ back, skating down the street on wriggling dino boards or just rockin’ out, these kids are growing up the Bedrock way.', 'Join Fred, Wilma, Dino, Barney and Betty in their formative years when they were precocious prehistoric preteens. Whether they’re riding to school on a brontosaurus’ back, skating down the street on wriggling dino boards or just rockin’ out, these kids are growing up the Bedrock way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvyCcBrKrc0nhmOMY49iNE0Fu47.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4167'),
  ('455976814212291010', 'The Flintstones', 1960, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', 'Barry Blitzer, R.S. Allen, Michael Maltese', 'Alan Reed, Mel Blanc, Jean Vander Pyl, Gerry Johnson, Don Messick', 'TV-G', 'The misadventures of two modern-day Stone Age families, the Flintstones and the Rubbles.', 'The misadventures of two modern-day Stone Age families, the Flintstones and the Rubbles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30P6ifagQ3fguTsI33KMmDLTAx6.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1996'),
  ('354654864823907767', 'The Flip Wilson Show', 1970, 'Comedy', null, 'Norman Steinberg, Dick Hills, Sid Green', 'Flip Wilson', null, 'The Flip Wilson Show is an hour long variety show that aired in the U.S. on NBC from September 17, 1970 to June 27, 1974. The show starred American comedian Flip Wilson; the program was one of the first American television programs starring a black person in the title role to become highly successful with a white audience. Specifically, it was the first successful network variety series starring an African American. During its first two seasons, its Nielsen ratings made it the nation''s second most watched show. The show consisted of many skits over an hour. It also broke new ground in American television by using a ''Theatre-in-the-Round'' stage format, with the audience seated on all sides of a circular performance area. Wilson was most famous for creating the role of Geraldine Jones, a sassy, modern woman who had a boyfriend named Killer. Flip also created the role of Reverend Leroy, who was the minister of the Church of What''s Happening Now!. New parishioners were wary of coming to the church as it was hinted that Reverend Leroy was a con artist. Wilson popularized such catchphrases as "What you see is what you get", and "The devil made me do it!".', 'The Flip Wilson Show is an hour long variety show that aired in the U.S. on NBC from September 17, 1970 to June 27, 1974. The show starred American comedian Flip Wilson; the program was one of the first American television programs starring a black person in the title role to become highly successful with a white audience. Specifically, it was the first successful network variety series starring an African American. During its first two seasons, its Nielsen ratings made it the nation''s second most watched show. The show consisted of many skits over an hour. It also broke new ground in American television by using a ''Theatre-in-the-Round'' stage format, with the audience seated on all sides of a circular performance area. Wilson was most famous for creating the role of Geraldine Jones, a sassy, modern woman who had a boyfriend named Killer. Flip also created the role of Reverend Leroy, who was the minister of the Church of What''s Happening Now!. New parishioners were wary of coming to the church as it was hinted that Reverend Leroy was a con artist. Wilson popularized such catchphrases as "What you see is what you get", and "The devil made me do it!".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qUf7B8eBZKjwjhfgU63J9OvQsT.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:10663'),
  ('865974745263889081', 'The Floor', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Rob Lowe', 'TV-PG', 'A spectacular battle of the brains quiz show in which 100 contestants stand on 100 squares on a massive game show floor, competing for a whopping $250,000 prize.', 'A spectacular battle of the brains quiz show in which 100 contestants stand on 100 squares on a massive game show floor, competing for a whopping $250,000 prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3YkWWr7fD2bZXmvGxvxGzaclKk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:231730'),
  ('987283996737331866', 'The Floor (BG)', 2026, null, null, null, 'Julian Kostov', null, 'The Floor is a game show franchise that originated in the Netherlands in 2023. Versions have been developed in other countries. The game is based around a floor divided into a grid of squares initially each representing a different contestant with expertise in a different trivia category. The contestants compete with neighbouring contestants in head to-head trivia "duels" with the winner''s "territory" expanding into the square(s) of the floor that were controlled by the losing player.', 'The Floor is a game show franchise that originated in the Netherlands in 2023. Versions have been developed in other countries. The game is based around a floor divided into a grid of squares initially each representing a different contestant with expertise in a different trivia category. The contestants compete with neighbouring contestants in head to-head trivia "duels" with the winner''s "territory" expanding into the square(s) of the floor that were controlled by the losing player.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mxYBJJ5B528CakPtAGVaiwA0FM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315561'),
  ('781808860986846779', 'The Floor (PL)', 2025, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, 'Mikołaj Roznerski, Radosław Popłonikowski', null, '"The Floor" is a dynamic quiz show in which one hundred contestants face off in a series of duels in the world''s most spectacular quiz arena!', '"The Floor" is a dynamic quiz show in which one hundred contestants face off in a series of duels in the world''s most spectacular quiz arena!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxAZDB5DDJNQgtYwigSkurDnkAF.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:289214'),
  ('167536313494591023', 'The Flower in Prison', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jin Se-yeon, Go Soo, Kim Mi-sook, Jung Jun-ho, Park Joo-mi, Yoon Joo-hee, Jun Kwang-ryul, Choi Tae-joon', null, 'Jeonokseo, the most horrifying prison in Joseon, is where Ok Nyeo was born. This genius girl learns the art of living from the most eccentric people of the time. Despite the difficulties, Ok Nyeo grows up to introduce a human rights institution of Joseon to protect the weak.', 'Jeonokseo, the most horrifying prison in Joseon, is where Ok Nyeo was born. This genius girl learns the art of living from the most eccentric people of the time. Despite the difficulties, Ok Nyeo grows up to introduce a human rights institution of Joseon to protect the weak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exEyu7QoXweu45giEzIk6IqNfz8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66240'),
  ('154719497296823591', 'The Flowers of Evil', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Fuku Suzuki, ano, Aruno Nakanishi, Manami Igashira, Chihiro Sudō, Tomoharu Hasegawa, Noriko Nakagoshi, Mahiru Konno', null, 'Bookworm Takao falls in love with Nanako, but he cannot express his feelings through words. Instead he secretively acts out in a heat of passion which creates a huge scandal in his school. There is one person who knows his true nature, and this girl will do anything to nurture what this Charles Baudelaire hides.', 'Bookworm Takao falls in love with Nanako, but he cannot express his feelings through words. Instead he secretively acts out in a heat of passion which creates a huge scandal in his school. There is one person who knows his true nature, and this girl will do anything to nurture what this Charles Baudelaire hides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knzjmhE0DdN5GyzEcM1yNhveEgi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306640'),
  ('968395435081428106', 'The Flying Doctors', 1986, 'Drama', null, null, 'Robert Grubb, Lenore Smith, Nikki Coghill, David Reyne, Christopher Stollery, Sarah Chadwick', null, 'The Flying Doctors is an Australian drama series produced by Crawford Productions that revolved around the everyday lifesaving efforts of the real Royal Flying Doctor Service of Australia. It was initially a 1985 mini-series based in the fictional outback town of Cooper''s Crossing starring Andrew McFarlane as the newly arrived Dr. Tom Callaghan. The success of the mini series led to its return the following year as an on-going series with McFarlane being joined by a new doctor, Chris Randall, played by Liz Burch. McFarlane left during the first season and actor Robert Grubb came in as new doctor Geoff Standish. The series'' episodes were mostly self-contained but also featured ongoing storylines, such as Dr. Standish''s romance with Sister Kate Wellings. Other major characters included pilot Sam Patterson, mechanic Emma Plimpton, local policeman Sgt. Jack Carruthers and Vic and Nancy Buckley, who ran the local pub/hotel, The Majestic. Andrew McFarlane also later returned to the series, resuming his role as Dr. Callaghan. The popular series ran for nine seasons and was successfully screened internationally.', 'The Flying Doctors is an Australian drama series produced by Crawford Productions that revolved around the everyday lifesaving efforts of the real Royal Flying Doctor Service of Australia. It was initially a 1985 mini-series based in the fictional outback town of Cooper''s Crossing starring Andrew McFarlane as the newly arrived Dr. Tom Callaghan. The success of the mini series led to its return the following year as an on-going series with McFarlane being joined by a new doctor, Chris Randall, played by Liz Burch. McFarlane left during the first season and actor Robert Grubb came in as new doctor Geoff Standish. The series'' episodes were mostly self-contained but also featured ongoing storylines, such as Dr. Standish''s romance with Sister Kate Wellings. Other major characters included pilot Sam Patterson, mechanic Emma Plimpton, local policeman Sgt. Jack Carruthers and Vic and Nancy Buckley, who ran the local pub/hotel, The Majestic. Andrew McFarlane also later returned to the series, resuming his role as Dr. Callaghan. The popular series ran for nine seasons and was successfully screened internationally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aj4xa7lo9RwTV6DpZ3Pcjgp26Ht.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:4014'),
  ('880615658487567944', 'The Flying Nun', 1967, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Marie Teresa Ríos, Bernard Slade, Harry Ackerman', null, 'Sally Field, Marge Redmond, Madeleine Sherwood, Alejandro Rey', 'TV-G', 'Young Sister Bertrille uses her ability to become airborne to help others, whether they want it or not. Although her aims are always benevolent, her means are often bemoaned by Mother Superior. The other Sisters must cope with their beloved Sister''s aerodynamics and antics as she flies in and out of trouble.', 'Young Sister Bertrille uses her ability to become airborne to help others, whether they want it or not. Although her aims are always benevolent, her means are often bemoaned by Mother Superior. The other Sisters must cope with their beloved Sister''s aerodynamics and antics as she flies in and out of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LkhFq3yKKXvv81pkbkPqPfYMeh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2117'),
  ('328662007047805124', 'The Following', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kevin Williamson', null, 'Kevin Bacon, James Purefoy, Shawn Ashmore, Jessica Stroup, Sam Underwood, Zuleikha Robinson, Gregg Henry', 'TV-14', 'Notorious serial killer Joe Carroll, after being found guilty of murdering 14 female students on the Virginia college campus where he taught literature, escapes from death row. The FBI calls former agent Ryan Hardy to consult on the case, as he was the one responsible for Carroll’s capture in 2003. Ryan, working closely with an FBI team, including Mike Weston and FBI Specialist Debra Parker, piece together the ever-growing web of murders orchestrated by the devious Carroll.', 'Notorious serial killer Joe Carroll, after being found guilty of murdering 14 female students on the Virginia college campus where he taught literature, escapes from death row. The FBI calls former agent Ryan Hardy to consult on the case, as he was the one responsible for Carroll’s capture in 2003. Ryan, working closely with an FBI team, including Mike Weston and FBI Specialist Debra Parker, piece together the ever-growing web of murders orchestrated by the devious Carroll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkyQduQCbHFkXCThIQEnqsgl2CP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45094'),
  ('120835651614268530', 'The Food Diary of Miss Maid', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kana Ichinose, Chihiro Suno, Maki Kawase, Shizuka Ishigami, Hiromi Igarashi, Daisuke Sakuma', null, 'After a mysterious incident drives her from her job at a British mansion, Suzume moves into a small apartment and begins a new life in Japan. Curious about her new surroundings, she dives into the country’s vibrant food culture. From local diners to street stalls, Suzume discovers new flavors, meets colorful people, and finds joy in life one meal at a time.', 'After a mysterious incident drives her from her job at a British mansion, Suzume moves into a small apartment and begins a new life in Japan. Curious about her new surroundings, she dives into the country’s vibrant food culture. From local diners to street stalls, Suzume discovers new flavors, meets colorful people, and finds joy in life one meal at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRjnQ8ZvmJn7DzVrx4MsCi1lrXr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:299134'),
  ('1010302389612462239', 'The Food That Built America', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Campbell Scott, Adam Richman', 'TV-PG', 'The fascinating stories of the families behind the food that built America, those who used brains, muscle, blood, sweat and tears to get to America''s heart through its stomach, those who invented new technologies and helped win wars.', 'The fascinating stories of the families behind the food that built America, those who used brains, muscle, blood, sweat and tears to get to America''s heart through its stomach, those who invented new technologies and helped win wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ipyh4VHk8r3tgba1BMEUBlBsr6.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:92371'),
  ('391443352967261014', 'The Foolish Angel Dances with the Devil', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Ayane Sakura, Shuichiro Umeda, Shunichi Toki, Nao Toyama, Rie Kugimiya, Kazuhiro Yamaji', null, 'Determined to protect his demon world from heavenly angels, demon Masatora Akutsu heads to earth in search of a charismatic human to rally his kin. Masquerading as a high schooler for his recruitment mission, he''s captivated by the lovely Lily Amane. But he''s in for a wild celestial surprise, because she''s his archnemesis—an angel—and she''s set on reforming his demonic ways!', 'Determined to protect his demon world from heavenly angels, demon Masatora Akutsu heads to earth in search of a charismatic human to rally his kin. Masquerading as a high schooler for his recruitment mission, he''s captivated by the lovely Lily Amane. But he''s in for a wild celestial surprise, because she''s his archnemesis—an angel—and she''s set on reforming his demonic ways!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyay9L58bSNIxVUXIGNxkjKMRuD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231357'),
  ('78241926839016623', 'The Football Interview', 2025, 'Talk', null, null, 'Kelly Somers', null, 'The biggest names in sport and entertainment join host Kelly Somers for bold, in-depth conversations about the nation’s favourite sport.', 'The biggest names in sport and entertainment join host Kelly Somers for bold, in-depth conversations about the nation’s favourite sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QxdXLK9jxWXFnQyK2xHiqnLgdD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:298545'),
  ('227896821429736466', 'The Forbidden Marriage', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', null, 'Cheon Ji-hye', 'Kim Young-dae, Park Ju-hyun, Kim Woo-seok, Kim Min-ju, Uhm Hyo-seop, Park Sun-young, Yang Dong-geun, Cha Mi-kyeong', 'TV-14', 'A hilarious royal scheme begins when a fraud pretends to bring back the crown princess with spirit possession.', 'A hilarious royal scheme begins when a fraud pretends to bring back the crown princess with spirit possession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzlMB1nGJtMhr2GnecpHIh7XUZe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201330'),
  ('1125606506854144391', 'The Ford Television Theatre', 1952, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'This show started in New York City, with Broadway actors and actresses. It then moved to Hollywood, California, where Hollywood actors and actresses headed the cast.', 'This show started in New York City, with Broadway actors and actresses. It then moved to Hollywood, California, where Hollywood actors and actresses headed the cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNrVFRTdmtuvRhNrVMKtzYLcWD3.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:122461'),
  ('539571247316675695', 'The Forest', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Delinda Jacobs', 'Delinda Jacobs', 'Samuel Labarthe, Suzanne Clément, Alexia Barlier, Frédéric Diefenthal, Patrick Ridremont', 'TV-MA', 'In a small quiet village in the Ardennes, a sixteen-year-old girl disappears into the forest after calling her teacher in the middle of the night. Captain Gaspard Deker, a former soldier and newly arrived single father is conducting the investigation with Virginie Musso, the local cop. Also helping is the teacher, Eve Mendel, a solitary young woman with a mysterious past: she was found as a child by the villiage doctor wandering silently in the same forest.', 'In a small quiet village in the Ardennes, a sixteen-year-old girl disappears into the forest after calling her teacher in the middle of the night. Captain Gaspard Deker, a former soldier and newly arrived single father is conducting the investigation with Virginie Musso, the local cop. Also helping is the teacher, Eve Mendel, a solitary young woman with a mysterious past: she was found as a child by the villiage doctor wandering silently in the same forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gomZ0inbIl5zm9jdMqcdzMvjKdp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71967'),
  ('302452361862827578', 'The Forest of Love: Deep Cut', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sion Sono', null, 'Kippei Shiina, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Eri Kamataki, Kyoko Hinami, Natsuki Kawamura, YOUNG DAIS, Yuzuka Nakaya, Denden', 'TV-MA', 'Nothing''s as it seems when a charismatic conman and an aspiring film crew delve into the lives of two emotionally scarred women.', 'Nothing''s as it seems when a charismatic conman and an aspiring film crew delve into the lives of two emotionally scarred women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7VsDn1WJ8AT55snAjvxNxTvHNt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102846'),
  ('854850338080231751', 'The Forgotten', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mark Friedman', null, 'Christian Slater, Rochelle Aytes, Bob Stephenson, Heather Stephens, Michelle Borth, Anthony Carrigan', 'TV-14', 'A team of dedicated amateurs work on cases involving unidentified victims. After the police have given up, this group must first solve the puzzle of the victim''s identity in order to then help catch the killer. They work to give the deceased back their names, lest they become—The Forgotten.', 'A team of dedicated amateurs work on cases involving unidentified victims. After the police have given up, this group must first solve the puzzle of the victim''s identity in order to then help catch the killer. They work to give the deceased back their names, lest they become—The Forgotten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beZJ5QIUkWAjhCb2O8kEc51eF5O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30704'),
  ('70360089246599005', 'The Forgotten Army', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Kabir Khan, Heeraz Marfatia', null, 'Sunny Kaushal, Sharvari, TJ Bhanu, Rohit Chaudhary, Akhil Iyer, Sam Mohan, Amala Akkineni, Shruti Seth', 'TV-MA', 'The dynamic story of Lt. Sodhi and his daredevil band of men and women who fought a heroic battle for the independence of India as part of the Indian National Army which was forged out of British defeat in Singapore during WWII and led by the charismatic, indomitable Indian leader Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose.', 'The dynamic story of Lt. Sodhi and his daredevil band of men and women who fought a heroic battle for the independence of India as part of the Indian National Army which was forged out of British defeat in Singapore during WWII and led by the charismatic, indomitable Indian leader Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DNHbHlAWPMQYQzjoWsw0IqobT2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96853'),
  ('513435581846984903', 'The Forgotten Valley', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Daniel Rocha, Caroline Abras, Felipe Velozo, Jiddú Pinheiro, Rodrigo Bolzan, Thais Lago, Maidê Mahl, James Turpin', 'TV-MA', 'A group of youngsters get lost while hiking in the woods and are suddenly attacked. Wounded and with one of them have being captured, they find shelter in an eerie village shrouded in an eternal mist, a place from where no one can escape.', 'A group of youngsters get lost while hiking in the woods and are suddenly attacked. Wounded and with one of them have being captured, they find shelter in an eerie village shrouded in an eternal mist, a place from where no one can escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFqV774B19cDRzpXa7eLJXZ2ZzB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209493'),
  ('921810450885492988', 'The Forsyte Saga', 2002, 'Drama', 'John Galsworthy, Stephen Mallatratt', null, 'Damian Lewis, Rupert Graves, Gina McKee, Alistair Petrie, Gillian Kearney, Amanda Root, Ben Miles, Julian Ovenden', null, 'The Forsyte Saga is a British-American drama television serial based on John Galsworthy''s novel series of the same name. Taking place from the 1870s to the 1920s, three generations of the upper-middle-class Forsyte family are explored.', 'The Forsyte Saga is a British-American drama television serial based on John Galsworthy''s novel series of the same name. Taking place from the 1870s to the 1920s, three generations of the upper-middle-class Forsyte family are explored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvcdVpJjUMb086r6y9eR9YxTQVJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:19077'),
  ('151426116123085217', 'The Forsytes', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Francesca Annis, Jack Davenport, Tom Durant-Pritchard, Jamie Flatters, Millie Gibson, Danny Griffin, Susan Hampshire, Owen Igiehon', null, 'Chronicles the lives of four generations of an upper-class family of stockbrokers, set against the backdrop of a rapidly evolving late-Victorian world.', 'Chronicles the lives of four generations of an upper-class family of stockbrokers, set against the backdrop of a rapidly evolving late-Victorian world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpLmjeJJMIJfxCSNEDfedIV4Q8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286255'),
  ('751899347992031660', 'The Fortress', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Linn-Jeanethe Kyed, John Kåre Raake', null, 'Tobias Santelmann, Selome Emnetu, Russell Tovey, Dominic Allburn, Rebekka Nystabakk, Nina Yndis, Hallvard Holmen, Elvinas Juodkazis', null, '2037, the inhabitants of Norway enjoy sheltered lives in a self-sufficient Nordic paradise. But when a deadly pandemic breaks out, they soon realize the wall supposed to protect them is now holding them prisoner.', '2037, the inhabitants of Norway enjoy sheltered lives in a self-sufficient Nordic paradise. But when a deadly pandemic breaks out, they soon realize the wall supposed to protect them is now holding them prisoner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtJrI0PnS4RUyKsz28V0hs0mO47.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215577'),
  ('937605985986458871', 'The Fosters', 2013, 'Drama', 'Bradley Bredeweg, Peter Paige', null, 'Teri Polo, Sherri Saum, Hayden Byerly, Noah Centineo, David Lambert, Maia Mitchell, Danny Nucci, Cierra Ramirez', 'TV-14', 'Stef Foster, a dedicated police officer, and her partner Lena Adams, a school vice principal, have built a close-knit, loving family with Stef''s biological son from a previous marriage, Brandon, and their adopted twins, Mariana and Jesus. Their lives are disrupted in unexpected ways when Lena meets Callie, a hardened teen with an abusive past who has spent her life in and out of foster homes. Lena and Stef welcome Callie and her brother, Jude, into their home thinking it''s just for a few weeks, until a more permanent placement can be found. But life has something else in store for the Fosters.', 'Stef Foster, a dedicated police officer, and her partner Lena Adams, a school vice principal, have built a close-knit, loving family with Stef''s biological son from a previous marriage, Brandon, and their adopted twins, Mariana and Jesus. Their lives are disrupted in unexpected ways when Lena meets Callie, a hardened teen with an abusive past who has spent her life in and out of foster homes. Lena and Stef welcome Callie and her brother, Jude, into their home thinking it''s just for a few weeks, until a more permanent placement can be found. But life has something else in store for the Fosters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRCmazqaUNNsgZyR6tNDl88pXp3.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:46880'),
  ('779600553526673697', 'The Foundation', 1984, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Barbara Yung, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Mitra King Toi-Yam, Lau Kong, Chun Wong, Lisa Lui Yau-Wai, Kwan Hoi-San', null, 'The Foundation is a TVB television series, premiered in 1984. Theme song "In Dream Several Sorrow" composition and arrangement by Joseph Koo, lyricist by Wong Jim, sung by Michelle Pau, and the sub theme song "I Cannot See My Tears Flow" composition and arrangement by Joseph Koo, lyricist by Wong Jim, sung by Michelle Pau.', 'The Foundation is a TVB television series, premiered in 1984. Theme song "In Dream Several Sorrow" composition and arrangement by Joseph Koo, lyricist by Wong Jim, sung by Michelle Pau, and the sub theme song "I Cannot See My Tears Flow" composition and arrangement by Joseph Koo, lyricist by Wong Jim, sung by Michelle Pau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hylNJJJIKC2x492xmrFZOSmaIHV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8521'),
  ('834677491148763104', 'The Founder of Diabolism', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Mo Xiang Tong Xiu', 'Liang Sha, Liu Xing, Zhu Ke', 'Ajie, Jiang Bian, Guo Haoran, Titus Jin, Su Shangqing, Shao Tong, Chen Zhangtaikang, Wang Chenguang', null, 'A feared outlaw is reborn in another’s body and joins an old rival to unravel ghostly mysteries—and maybe his own past.', 'A feared outlaw is reborn in another’s body and joins an old rival to unravel ghostly mysteries—and maybe his own past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atEXUa6I6w7IZ1TWKFloysoL4hS.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80732'),
  ('167052553377720918', 'The Founder of Diabolism Q', 2020, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Mo Xiang Tong Xiu', null, 'Ajie, Jiang Bian, Guo Haoran, Liu Sanmu, Titus Jin, Su Shangqing, Yang Tianxiang, Li Shimeng', null, 'Lan Wangji blushing, Wei Wuxian grinning, Jiang Yanli doting—relive the sweetest moments with your favorite characters in adorable chibi form.', 'Lan Wangji blushing, Wei Wuxian grinning, Jiang Yanli doting—relive the sweetest moments with your favorite characters in adorable chibi form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWmUBiEQKwU7l61UxaZfMcfVDzo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106650'),
