  ('106772511996380634', 'The Gentlemen''s League', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Lee Chan-hyeong, Youn Sang-hyun, Ahn Jung-hwan, Kim Nam-il, 조원희, Kim Yong-man, Kim Sung-joo, Lee Dong-gook', null, 'These former sports superstars were record-breaking Olympians; but on the soccer field, they’re all just middle-aged dads trying to do their best.', 'These former sports superstars were record-breaking Olympians; but on the soccer field, they’re all just middle-aged dads trying to do their best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bo4f0ZkyEmqItgvxo1WCz9jUD8b.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:90534'),
  ('1018883890090693402', 'The George Burns and Gracie Allen Show', 1950, 'Comedy', null, null, 'George Burns, Gracie Allen, Harry von Zell, Bea Benaderet, Larry Keating', 'TV-G', 'Burns and Allen, an American comedy duo consisting of George Burns and his wife, Gracie Allen, worked together as a comedy team in vaudeville, films, radio and television and achieved great success over four decades.', 'Burns and Allen, an American comedy duo consisting of George Burns and his wife, Gracie Allen, worked together as a comedy team in vaudeville, films, radio and television and achieved great success over four decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvCVEK1AeNTBbY5OREw2YdRa9bF.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:30667'),
  ('841375139307891501', 'The Get Along Gang', 1984, 'Animation', 'Andy Heyward, Jean Chalopin', null, 'Scott Menville, Don Messick, Nicky Katt, Sparky Marcus, Frank Welker, Timothy Gibbs, Chuck McCann, Georgi Irene', null, 'The Get Along Gang are characters created in 1983 by American Greetings'' toy design and licensing division, "Those Characters from Cleveland", for a series of greeting cards. The Get Along Gang are a group of twelve pre-adolescent anthropomorphic animal characters in the fictional town of Green Meadow, who form a club that meets in an abandoned caboose and who have various adventures whose upbeat stories intended to show the importance of teamwork and friendship. The success of the greeting card line led to a Saturday morning television series, which aired on CBS for 13 episodes in the 1984-1985 season, with reruns from January until June 1986.', 'The Get Along Gang are characters created in 1983 by American Greetings'' toy design and licensing division, "Those Characters from Cleveland", for a series of greeting cards. The Get Along Gang are a group of twelve pre-adolescent anthropomorphic animal characters in the fictional town of Green Meadow, who form a club that meets in an abandoned caboose and who have various adventures whose upbeat stories intended to show the importance of teamwork and friendship. The success of the greeting card line led to a Saturday morning television series, which aired on CBS for 13 episodes in the 1984-1985 season, with reruns from January until June 1986.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awxnldwwtugtkH25TPuzopKmSst.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11054'),
  ('931499044464760637', 'The Get Down', 2016, 'Drama', 'Baz Luhrmann', null, 'Justice Smith, Shameik Moore, Herizen F. Guardiola, Skylan Brooks, Jaden Smith, Tremaine Brown Jr., Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Jimmy Smits', 'TV-MA', 'In 1977 New York City, the talented and soulful youth of the South Bronx chase dreams and breakneck beats to transform music history.', 'In 1977 New York City, the talented and soulful youth of the South Bronx chase dreams and breakneck beats to transform music history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeEeNDklukfG1Y6jKgfCm0cgI97.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65345'),
  ('979061936764244166', 'The Ghost & Mrs. Muir', 1968, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jean Holloway', null, 'Edward Mulhare, Hope Lange, Charles Nelson Reilly, Reta Shaw, Kellie Flanagan', 'TV-PG', 'Derived from the 1947 movie with the same name, a house is haunted by a deceased sea captain who wreaks havoc with the new tenants who were not advised of his existence.', 'Derived from the 1947 movie with the same name, a house is haunted by a deceased sea captain who wreaks havoc with the new tenants who were not advised of his existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyL5WmA6PnXLF74sjGRCx6eZZmv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12883'),
  ('1001808096675034536', 'The Ghost and Molly McGee', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Bill Motz, Bob Roth', null, 'Ashly Burch, Dana Snyder, Jordan Klepper, Sumalee Montano, Michaela Dietz', 'TV-Y7', 'When a curse from Scratch backfires, he finds himself forever bound to Molly. Despite that, Scratch and Molly form an unlikely friendship that guides each of them through the ups and downs of their respective worlds!', 'When a curse from Scratch backfires, he finds himself forever bound to Molly. Despite that, Scratch and Molly form an unlikely friendship that guides each of them through the ups and downs of their respective worlds!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u86g1KKPwsysQx6gA9LJt93xrtA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:92649'),
  ('924600245093517045', 'The Ghost Bride', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama, Family', 'Yangsze Choo', 'Dan Hamamura, Yasmin Yaacob, Kai Yu Wu', 'Kuang Tian, Baily Oh, Wu Kang-ren, Teresa Daley, Huang Pei-jia, Ludi Lin, Janet Hsieh', 'TV-14', 'In 1890s Malacca, Li Lan finds herself in the afterlife and becomes mired in a mystery linked to the sinister, deceased son of a wealthy family.', 'In 1890s Malacca, Li Lan finds herself in the afterlife and becomes mired in a mystery linked to the sinister, deceased son of a wealthy family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/if27EYCdFPSh45WbUqPLo47wb1o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98492'),
  ('705898551240673569', 'The Ghost Busters', 1975, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Marc Richards', null, 'Larry Storch, Forrest Tucker, Linda Gary, Susan Blu, Pat Fraley, Peter Cullen, Alan Oppenheimer, Erika Scheimer', null, 'The Ghost Busters was a live-action children''s television series that ran in 1975, about a team of bumbling detectives who would investigate ghostly occurrences. Only 15 episodes were created. This series reunited Forrest Tucker and Larry Storch in roles similar to their characters in F Troop. Tucker played Jake Kong, and Storch played zoot suit-wearing Eddie Spencer. The third member of the trio was Tracy the Gorilla, played by actor Bob Burns. The series was unrelated to the 1984 film Ghostbusters.', 'The Ghost Busters was a live-action children''s television series that ran in 1975, about a team of bumbling detectives who would investigate ghostly occurrences. Only 15 episodes were created. This series reunited Forrest Tucker and Larry Storch in roles similar to their characters in F Troop. Tucker played Jake Kong, and Storch played zoot suit-wearing Eddie Spencer. The third member of the trio was Tracy the Gorilla, played by actor Bob Burns. The series was unrelated to the 1984 film Ghostbusters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6870w2UUqIu1Ndza5xaG5ULia5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:964'),
  ('670112496691559412', 'The Ghost Detective', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Crime', null, 'Han Ji-wan', 'Choi Daniel, Park Eun-bin, Lee Ji-ah, Kim Won-hae, Lee Jae-kyoon, Lee Joo-young, Shin Jae-ha, Chae Ji-An', null, 'Da Il, a ghost detective, meets a mysterious woman named Woo Hye and gets drawn into a strange case.', 'Da Il, a ghost detective, meets a mysterious woman named Woo Hye and gets drawn into a strange case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbGOIFF4QNyTDygDBqMQSc76Anr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81957'),
  ('1007718360553267533', 'The Ghost Town Terror', 2022, 'Mystery, Documentary, Reality', 'Neil Fernández', null, 'Sapphire Sandalo, Tim Wood, Sarah Lemos, Scott Di Lalla', null, 'After more than a year of paranormal attacks, including unexplained scratches, apparitions, disembodied voices and poltergeist activity, Karen and her family - daughter Chloe, 20, and sons Cameron, 21, and Colby, 15 - are distraught and in dire need of help. Paranormal investigator Tim Wood and paranormal researcher Sapphire Sandalo come to their aid and soon discover the entire town has a disturbingly dark history, and an oppressive energy has taken over.', 'After more than a year of paranormal attacks, including unexplained scratches, apparitions, disembodied voices and poltergeist activity, Karen and her family - daughter Chloe, 20, and sons Cameron, 21, and Colby, 15 - are distraught and in dire need of help. Paranormal investigator Tim Wood and paranormal researcher Sapphire Sandalo come to their aid and soon discover the entire town has a disturbingly dark history, and an oppressive energy has taken over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nE2XSq6uKwHcd8SmJUFTDguh8zQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:194511'),
  ('490410225395495499', 'The Giants', 1978, 'Drama', null, 'Wong Jing', 'Paul Chu Kong, Danny Lau Dan, Louise Lee Si-Kei, Chow Yun-Fat, Maggie Chan Mei-Kei, Seung Yee, Wong Wan-Choi, Wong San', null, 'The Giants is a TVB television series, premiered on 15 May 1978. Theme song "The Giants" composition and arrangement by Joseph Koo, lyricist by Wong Jim, sung by Roman Tam.', 'The Giants is a TVB television series, premiered on 15 May 1978. Theme song "The Giants" composition and arrangement by Joseph Koo, lyricist by Wong Jim, sung by Roman Tam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uquxCqDFL29aY3SbHTA1YVymqFx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109620'),
  ('90020830412760919', 'The Gift', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nuran Evren Şit', null, 'Beren Saat, Mehmet Günsür, Melisa Şenolsun, Civan Canova, Tim Seyfi, Metin Akdülger, Başak Köklükaya, Senan Kara', 'TV-MA', 'A painter in Istanbul embarks on a personal journey as she unearths universal secrets about an Anatolian archaeological site and its link to her past.', 'A painter in Istanbul embarks on a personal journey as she unearths universal secrets about an Anatolian archaeological site and its link to her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQasevgdY0sEc4KHWmIWAxxdM1J.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:96348'),
  ('1080584221823104092', 'The Gift', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Thanwa Suriyajak, Nuttacha Chayangkanont, Sasina Phanomthornnitkul, Thanakorn Sribanjong, Samitpong Sakulpongchai, Sirin Kohkiat', null, 'Boonsita, who has always seen the future, suddenly gains the ability to glimpse the past when she meets Warat, a man haunted by dreams of a mysterious woman. Together, they uncover long-hidden secrets of love and destiny, confronting truths that have been concealed across time.', 'Boonsita, who has always seen the future, suddenly gains the ability to glimpse the past when she meets Warat, a man haunted by dreams of a mysterious woman. Together, they uncover long-hidden secrets of love and destiny, confronting truths that have been concealed across time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBJcKcCihJjz2JxDOt9EGzfMcvu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:309044'),
  ('605192094789966904', 'The Gifted', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Matt Nix', null, 'Stephen Moyer, Amy Acker, Natalie Alyn Lind, Percy Hynes White, Sean Teale, Blair Redford, Emma Dumont, Jamie Chung', 'TV-14', 'A suburban couple''s ordinary lives are rocked by the sudden discovery that their children possess mutant powers. Forced to go on the run from a hostile government, the family joins up with an underground network of mutants and must fight to survive.', 'A suburban couple''s ordinary lives are rocked by the sudden discovery that their children possess mutant powers. Forced to go on the run from a hostile government, the family joins up with an underground network of mutants and must fight to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nshCqszjTNuqhrB53vrSqWO18sE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69629'),
  ('514602498022251509', 'The Gifted', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dhammarong Sermrittirong', null, 'Korapat Kirdpan, Ladapa Thongkham, Patchata Janngeon, Chatchawit Techarukpong, Pumipat Paiboon, Katreeya English, Wachirawit Ruangwiwat, Harit Cheewagaroon', null, 'The class of the gifted at Ritdha High School is not what it seems, and as its students discover the amazing potential within them, a conspiracy starts to unravel.', 'The class of the gifted at Ritdha High School is not what it seems, and as its students discover the amazing potential within them, a conspiracy starts to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHeE3FSbRlw1GX8U6GMKLuiUmph.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85751'),
  ('859829509929685083', 'The Gifted: Graduation', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Patrick Finkler, Chayapol Jutamas, Patchata Janngeon, Chanikarn Tangkabodee, Phuwin Tangsakyuen, Chatchawit Techarukpong, Chayakorn Jutamas, Korapat Kirdpan', null, 'Two years have passed and the new school year begins again. With it comes the resurrection of the Gifted program, and a hidden threat from the Ministry led by Darin, a new teacher. Time, a promising new student and member of the newest gifted generation, seek change within the school while upholding its hierarchical structure. Filled with danger and more complications than it seems, what will the final battle be like? Who will be victorious? Will Pang and his companions be able to maintain their friendship and ideals? Can they defeat Director Supot? Or They Will Fail?', 'Two years have passed and the new school year begins again. With it comes the resurrection of the Gifted program, and a hidden threat from the Ministry led by Darin, a new teacher. Time, a promising new student and member of the newest gifted generation, seek change within the school while upholding its hierarchical structure. Filled with danger and more complications than it seems, what will the final battle be like? Who will be victorious? Will Pang and his companions be able to maintain their friendship and ideals? Can they defeat Director Supot? Or They Will Fail?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wOT4t4tqc9PRO0cbhdTRMZtvp4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108985'),
  ('1030186249683915170', 'The Gilded Age', 2022, 'Drama', 'Julian Fellowes', null, 'Carrie Coon, Morgan Spector, Louisa Jacobson, Denée Benton, Taissa Farmiga, Harry Richardson, Blake Ritson, Simon Jones', 'TV-14', 'It’s 1882 and the Gilded Age is in full swing when Marian Brook, a young orphaned daughter of a Southern general, moves in with her rigidly conventional aunts in New York City. With the help of Peggy Scott, an African-American woman masquerading as her maid, Marian gets caught up in the dazzling lives of her rich neighbors as she struggles to decide between adhering to the rules or forging her own path.', 'It’s 1882 and the Gilded Age is in full swing when Marian Brook, a young orphaned daughter of a Southern general, moves in with her rigidly conventional aunts in New York City. With the help of Peggy Scott, an African-American woman masquerading as her maid, Marian gets caught up in the dazzling lives of her rich neighbors as she struggles to decide between adhering to the rules or forging her own path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zXlBCc1rNTDtrfMCBFIGKWlwnC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:81723'),
  ('776509578903681176', 'The Girl', 2016, 'Documentary, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Clara María Ochoa, Juana Uribe', 'Juana Uribe', 'Ana María Estupiñán, Variel Sánchez, Marcela Benjumea, Fernando Arévalo, Laura Perico, Diego Vásquez, Juan Sebastián Aragón, Sebastián Eslava', 'TV-MA', 'A young woman who was part of the guerrilla group is now seeking a better life in the city. She wants to study medicine, to heal rather than harm, but she will face a challenge, because being part of outlaw groups always has consequences.', 'A young woman who was part of the guerrilla group is now seeking a better life in the city. She wants to study medicine, to heal rather than harm, but she will face a challenge, because being part of outlaw groups always has consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzNOxyNt1WIXt9KBRKytiqQZ02y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70824'),
  ('835061629858530043', 'The Girl Before', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Gugu Mbatha-Raw, David Oyelowo, Jessica Kate Plummer, Rakhee Thakrar, Ben Hardy, Ian Conningham, Kayla Meikle, Amanda Drew', 'TV-MA', 'A traumatized woman falls in love with an extraordinary minimalist house, which remains under the spell of the architect who originally designed it, but everything may not be as it seems.', 'A traumatized woman falls in love with an extraordinary minimalist house, which remains under the spell of the architect who originally designed it, but everything may not be as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11FAvHhce6xrMqgumguAVZWmvSI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152365'),
  ('918993751418807657', 'The Girl Downstairs', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Su Shangqing, Liu Yuanyuan, Cai Na, Qing Liu, Liu Yiming, Tong Yin, Xiaofeng Lai', 'TV-14', 'Freshman Yuan Juntang applied for Minsong University in order to get closer to Zhu Zhu, whom he has had a crush on. At the university, he meets Li Shiya who used to be his idol and took a temporary absence from school. Li Shiya takes the initiative to approach Yuan Juntang and they become friends and form a trio of friends with Zhu Zhu. Zhu Zhu is clearly aware of Yuan Juntang’s affection for her, but she has no courage to accept him and tries to avoid being intimate and only keeps a certain distance with him. At the same time, Yuan Juntang and Li Shiya are getting closer, more than just friends.', 'Freshman Yuan Juntang applied for Minsong University in order to get closer to Zhu Zhu, whom he has had a crush on. At the university, he meets Li Shiya who used to be his idol and took a temporary absence from school. Li Shiya takes the initiative to approach Yuan Juntang and they become friends and form a trio of friends with Zhu Zhu. Zhu Zhu is clearly aware of Yuan Juntang’s affection for her, but she has no courage to accept him and tries to avoid being intimate and only keeps a certain distance with him. At the same time, Yuan Juntang and Li Shiya are getting closer, more than just friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7urz5tn4INZtbtnwNMxyTiFF2cB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223515'),
  ('683309850435974197', 'The Girl from Plainville', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Liz Hannah, Patrick Macmanus', null, 'Elle Fanning, Chloë Sevigny, Colton Ryan, Cara Buono, Kai Lennox, Norbert Leo Butz, Aya Cash, Kylie Liya Page', 'TV-MA', 'The controversial case of Michelle Carter, who was convicted in 2017 of involuntary manslaughter for encouraging the suicide of her then-boyfriend via texts and phone calls.', 'The controversial case of Michelle Carter, who was convicted in 2017 of involuntary manslaughter for encouraging the suicide of her then-boyfriend via texts and phone calls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywYvAZlJYh5yKoYafFPeur0C3KH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107114'),
  ('752712430788080313', 'The Girl from Tomorrow', 1992, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Mark Shirrefs, John Thomson', null, 'Katharine Cullen, Melissa Marshall, James Findlay, Andrew Clarke, Helen O''Connor, John Howard, Miles Buchanan, Jeremy Scrivener', 'TV-Y7', 'Alana, a girl from the year 3000, is kidnapped by Silverthorn, a criminal from the year 2500, and brought back in time to the year 1992. While in the past, Alana befriends Jenny, who helps her adapt to life in a time unfamiliar to her, and to find a way back to her own time.', 'Alana, a girl from the year 3000, is kidnapped by Silverthorn, a criminal from the year 2500, and brought back in time to the year 1992. While in the past, Alana befriends Jenny, who helps her adapt to life in a time unfamiliar to her, and to find a way back to her own time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8ePfR2xJv8ukNSzDF3BMwGQ4Ww.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:681'),
  ('504178771418429307', 'The Girl He Never Noticed', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Marco Gumabao, Tess Pang, Ebi Shankara, Caitanya Tan, Michael Thomas McGovern, Bridget Fernandez, Jason Godfrey', null, 'Faced with dreadful financial circumstances, Jade takes up a job as a personal secretary to the son of the most affluent shipping tycoon – Eros, but things get complicated when in a desperate bid to secure his place as a suitable heir to the company, Eros asked Jade to be his fake fiancée! Will they be able to keep their “relationship” strictly professional? Meanwhile, Eros finds Jade oddly familiar, but he just can’t place his finger on it.', 'Faced with dreadful financial circumstances, Jade takes up a job as a personal secretary to the son of the most affluent shipping tycoon – Eros, but things get complicated when in a desperate bid to secure his place as a suitable heir to the company, Eros asked Jade to be his fake fiancée! Will they be able to keep their “relationship” strictly professional? Meanwhile, Eros finds Jade oddly familiar, but he just can’t place his finger on it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssyV3gIqPSxpjjX6SmkV1txGmJW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210729'),
  ('1014483829750730079', 'The Girl I Like Forgot Her Glasses', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Masahiro Ito, Shion Wakayama', 'TV-14', 'Komura starts his school year with a new seat neighbor in homeroom—the bespectacled Mie. Before long, he''s nursing a raging crush on his quirky classmate who''s always forgetting her glasses! While this might be ideal for Komura to get to know Mie better, will his poor heart give out from the daily strain of being up close and personal with the girl he likes?!', 'Komura starts his school year with a new seat neighbor in homeroom—the bespectacled Mie. Before long, he''s nursing a raging crush on his quirky classmate who''s always forgetting her glasses! While this might be ideal for Komura to get to know Mie better, will his poor heart give out from the daily strain of being up close and personal with the girl he likes?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkL7KQzJ3YFcKiNBc4QXrJbYJV8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218263'),
  ('661956284718602932', 'The Girl in the Mirror', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Sergio G. Sánchez', null, 'Mireia Oriol, Álex Villazán, Pol Monen, Javier Morgade, Claudia Roset, Nil Cardoner, María Caballero, Milena Smit', 'TV-MA', 'After losing her memory in a bizarre accident that kills most of her classmates, Alma tries to unravel what happened that day — and regain her identity.', 'After losing her memory in a bizarre accident that kills most of her classmates, Alma tries to unravel what happened that day — and regain her identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xI0gpmNljWQRCkB8UgSraXRB56.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127424'),
  ('896518877693472008', 'The Girl in the Woods', 2021, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Stefanie Scott, Sofia Bryant, Misha Osherovich, Will Yun Lee, Kylie Liya Page, Erica Sullivan, Cody Burns, Leonard Roberts', 'TV-PG', 'Carrie is a mysterious warrior who escaped from a cult-like colony that guards the world from monsters hidden behind a secret door in the woods.', 'Carrie is a mysterious warrior who escaped from a cult-like colony that guards the world from monsters hidden behind a secret door in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPWL324evebfthe8noIBaJkP6Vp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135187'),
  ('689911881760212442', 'The Girl in Twilight', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nao Toyama, Marina Inoue, Ami Koshimizu, Lynn, Tomoyo Kurosawa', null, 'Girls who live in a provincial city perform a certain ritual. The girls are in the "Crystal Radio Club." It is an interest circle that Asuka Tsuchimiya, a girl known for her cheerfulness, started with friends in her high school. That ritual was considered just an urban legend. However, with several conditions coincidentally falling into place, it stops being fun and games...', 'Girls who live in a provincial city perform a certain ritual. The girls are in the "Crystal Radio Club." It is an interest circle that Asuka Tsuchimiya, a girl known for her cheerfulness, started with friends in her high school. That ritual was considered just an urban legend. However, with several conditions coincidentally falling into place, it stops being fun and games...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df2BpzYyo4p4UrD12NGu1mKhkMc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82682'),
  ('1019762964489433556', 'The Girl Named Feriha', 2011, 'Family, Drama', 'Fatih Aksoy', 'Sırma Yanık', 'Çağatay Ulusoy, Metin Çekmez, Deniz Uğur, Yusuf Akgün, Ceyda Ateş, Sedef Şahin, Feyza Civelek, Zeynep Çamcı', null, 'Adını Feriha Koydum is a Turkish television drama series produced by Med Yapım. The series broadcast on Show TV and it is written by duo Melis Civelek and Sırma Yanık.', 'Adını Feriha Koydum is a Turkish television drama series produced by Med Yapım. The series broadcast on Show TV and it is written by duo Melis Civelek and Sırma Yanık.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrUjxYcx0DVUJeDj4iMleTVrSTa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:47711'),
  ('990871697594210121', 'The Girl Who Leapt Through Space', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'MAKO, Aya Endo, Yui Makino, Ai Nonaka, Jun Fukuyama, Takaya Kuroda, Akiko Kimura, Yukari Tamura', null, 'In the year 311 of the Orbital Calendar, humanity has migrated to countless colony clusters in space. A space colony girl named Akiha Shishidou encounters a malevolent artificial intelligence named Leopard that has been installed on a colony.', 'In the year 311 of the Orbital Calendar, humanity has migrated to countless colony clusters in space. A space colony girl named Akiha Shishidou encounters a malevolent artificial intelligence named Leopard that has been installed on a colony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lACcvPSqM32keQiljf281y7fXXy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42903'),
  ('1011259934475673412', 'The Girl Who Sees Smells', 2015, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Crime', 'Man Chwi, Lee Hee-myung', 'Lee Hee-myung', 'MICKY Yoochun, Shin Sae-kyeong, Namkoong Min, Yoon Jin-seo, Song Jong-ho, Lee Won-jong, Choi Tae-joon, Jo Hee-bong', null, 'With help from a young woman with synesthesia, a cop who lost his sense of pain tracks down the serial killer who brought tragedy to both their lives.', 'With help from a young woman with synesthesia, a cop who lost his sense of pain tracks down the serial killer who brought tragedy to both their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uC95QIWiPq2ts558aki8NC5rXHN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62301'),
  ('1016745019345787590', 'The Girl''s Guide to Depravity', 2012, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Rebecca Blumhagen, Chasty Ballesteros, Meg Braden, Tessa Harnetiaux', null, 'The Girl''s Guide to Depravity is a comedy/drama series based on Heather Rutman''s popular book and blog of the same name. The show debuted in the US on Cinemax in February of 2012, and has aired internationally in Latin America, Spain, Canada, and Japan.', 'The Girl''s Guide to Depravity is a comedy/drama series based on Heather Rutman''s popular book and blog of the same name. The show debuted in the US on Cinemax in February of 2012, and has aired internationally in Latin America, Spain, Canada, and Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99JwHZ8ksCqKPszDgwVxAfVcBJU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:43989'),
  ('184275745207650619', 'The Girlfriend', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Naomi Sheldon, Gabbie Asher', null, 'Robin Wright, Olivia Cooke, Laurie Davidson, Waleed Zuaiter, Karen Henthorn, Tanya Moodie, Shalom Brune-Franklin', 'TV-MA', 'Laura has it all: a glittering career, a loving husband, and her precious son, Daniel. But her perfect life unravels when Daniel brings home Cherry, a girlfriend who changes everything. After a tense introduction, Laura becomes convinced Cherry is hiding something. Is she a manipulative social climber, or is Laura just paranoid? The truth is a matter of perspective.', 'Laura has it all: a glittering career, a loving husband, and her precious son, Daniel. But her perfect life unravels when Daniel brings home Cherry, a girlfriend who changes everything. After a tense introduction, Laura becomes convinced Cherry is hiding something. Is she a manipulative social climber, or is Laura just paranoid? The truth is a matter of perspective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktrp3tdZ5IQpFux4nLy8z70bt3n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253376'),
  ('797565041705504396', 'The Girlfriend Experience', 2016, 'Drama', 'Amy Seimetz, Lodge Kerrigan, Anja Marquardt', 'Brian Koppelman, David Levien', 'Julia Goldani Telles', 'TV-MA', 'Explore the relationships between exclusive escorts and their clients, for whom they provide far more than just sex. Known as GFEs, they are women who provide “The Girlfriend Experience”—emotional and sexual relationships at a very high price.', 'Explore the relationships between exclusive escorts and their clients, for whom they provide far more than just sex. Known as GFEs, they are women who provide “The Girlfriend Experience”—emotional and sexual relationships at a very high price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkXG4uqXQVwfwmE6CUSPFvz6MLn.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64387'),
  ('933283738855305526', 'The Girls at the Back', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo', 'Maria Rodríguez Soto, Itsaso Arana, Mariona Terés, Godeliv Van den Brandt, Mónica Miranda, Javier Rey', 'TV-MA', 'Five women in their 30s, friends since their school days, go on their annual getaway. But this year, one of them has just been diagnosed with cancer.', 'Five women in their 30s, friends since their school days, go on their annual getaway. But this year, one of them has just been diagnosed with cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIzKsObZDR7iTDL9phgwllxDnB2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207704'),
  ('1082721955999793635', 'The Girls Next Door', 2005, 'Reality', 'Kevin Burns, Hugh Hefner', null, 'Hugh Hefner, Holly Madison, Bridget Marquardt, Kendra Wilkinson', 'TV-PG', 'The Girls Next Door, also known as The Girls of the Playboy Mansion, is a reality television series which originally aired on E! from August 7, 2005 until August 8, 2010. The series was created by executive producer Kevin Burns and Hugh Hefner, founder and editor-in-chief of Playboy magazine. The show was followed by two spin-offs, Kendra and Holly''s World.', 'The Girls Next Door, also known as The Girls of the Playboy Mansion, is a reality television series which originally aired on E! from August 7, 2005 until August 8, 2010. The series was created by executive producer Kevin Burns and Hugh Hefner, founder and editor-in-chief of Playboy magazine. The show was followed by two spin-offs, Kendra and Holly''s World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBTePNXQGJEJI13BsBBFgog9Uay.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:12158'),
  ('814807129596657022', 'The Girls on the Bus', 2024, 'Drama', 'Julie Plec, Amy Chozick', null, 'Melissa Benoist, Carla Gugino, Natasha Behnam, Christina Elmore, Brandon Scott, Griffin Dunne, Mark Consuelos, Scott Foley', 'TV-MA', 'Four female journalists follow every move of a parade of flawed presidential candidates, while finding friendship, love, and scandal along the way.', 'Four female journalists follow every move of a parade of flawed presidential candidates, while finding friendship, love, and scandal along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2ZqWIqf0hbxshHoRY9bJtXAY67.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105532'),
  ('540708723347975079', 'The Glades', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Clifton Campbell', null, 'Matt Passmore, Kiele Sanchez, Carlos Gómez, Michelle Hurd, Jordan Wall, Uriah Shelton', 'TV-14', 'This crime series follows Jim, a Chicago cop who gets kicked off the force after being shot and wrongfully accused by his ex-captain of having an affair with his wife. After receiving his payout, Jim decides to moves to a small Florida town to join the state police.', 'This crime series follows Jim, a Chicago cop who gets kicked off the force after being shot and wrongfully accused by his ex-captain of having an affair with his wife. After receiving his payout, Jim decides to moves to a small Florida town to join the state police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44mkq0KpOngpJSs22m0LdP37Jpp.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:33091'),
  ('912585215625297493', 'The Glamorous Night', 2026, 'Drama', 'Chen Ying', 'Chen Ying', 'Maggie Jiang, Tong Dawei, Zhang Chao, Lyric Lan, Kan Qingzi, Yuan Wenkang, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Ling Zhuo', null, 'At a lavish banquet, long-suppressed tensions within GST Liquor Company suddenly erupt, triggering a crisis that puts everyone’s survival at risk. As seven key figures each take on different roles in the chaos, their actions expose the complexities of human nature and the harsh realities of corporate life.', 'At a lavish banquet, long-suppressed tensions within GST Liquor Company suddenly erupt, triggering a crisis that puts everyone’s survival at risk. As seven key figures each take on different roles in the chaos, their actions expose the complexities of human nature and the harsh realities of corporate life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/208mntcZYYJqtihyQVex9pRCodT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259554'),
  ('1099009910339163263', 'The Glass Dome', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Camilla Läckberg', 'Axel Stjärne, Amanda Högberg', 'Leonie Vincent, Johan Hedenberg, Johan Rheborg, Ia Langhammer, Cecilia Nilsson, Emil Almén, Emma Broomé, Oscar Töringe', null, 'When her friend''s daughter goes missing, criminologist Lejla joins the search — and must confront the haunting trauma of her own childhood abduction.', 'When her friend''s daughter goes missing, criminologist Lejla joins the search — and must confront the haunting trauma of her own childhood abduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yn4PIMnXJ42lObinYtmIvQ9lVtm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275388'),
  ('68075714798420920', 'The Glee Project', 2011, 'Reality', 'Ryan Murphy', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Performers compete for a multi-episode guest-starring role on season three of hit series Glee. Over the course of the competition, the winner will be determined from eliminations of twelve finalists and be awarded a role in a seven episode arc as part of the cast of Fox Network''s musical drama series Glee.', 'Performers compete for a multi-episode guest-starring role on season three of hit series Glee. Over the course of the competition, the winner will be determined from eliminations of twelve finalists and be awarded a role in a seven episode arc as part of the cast of Fox Network''s musical drama series Glee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWMV3cY96ieuimjP7pdAnOUKDI7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:35268'),
  ('1111272343583015191', 'The Glen Campbell Goodtime Hour', 1969, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Glen Campbell, John Hartford', 'TV-PG', 'The Glen Campbell Goodtime Hour is an American network television music and comedy variety show hosted by singer Glen Campbell from January 1969 through June 1972 on CBS. He was offered the show after he hosted a 1968 summer replacement for The Smothers Brothers Comedy Hour. Campbell used "Gentle on My Mind" as the theme song of the show. The show was one of the few rural-oriented shows to survive CBS''s rural purge of 1971.', 'The Glen Campbell Goodtime Hour is an American network television music and comedy variety show hosted by singer Glen Campbell from January 1969 through June 1972 on CBS. He was offered the show after he hosted a 1968 summer replacement for The Smothers Brothers Comedy Hour. Campbell used "Gentle on My Mind" as the theme song of the show. The show was one of the few rural-oriented shows to survive CBS''s rural purge of 1971.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWN7PZIBSonPBFqGjYa9abSrmzT.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:11275'),
  ('698731840508446510', 'The Gloaming', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Victoria Madden', null, 'Emma Booth, Ewen Leslie, Aaron Pedersen, Rena Owen, Anthony Phelan, Nicole Chamoun, Ditch Davey, Max Brown', null, 'When an unidentified woman is found brutally murdered, Detective Molly McGee teams up with fellow cop, Alex O’Connell—with whom she shares a tragic past—to solve the crime.', 'When an unidentified woman is found brutally murdered, Detective Molly McGee teams up with fellow cop, Alex O’Connell—with whom she shares a tragic past—to solve the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgPN0Ur45f3upig342nu3cPzz5C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97082'),
  ('314030999969522618', 'The Glory', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kim Eun-sook, An Gil-ho', 'Kim Eun-sook', 'Song Hye-kyo, Lee Do-hyun, Lim Ji-yeon, Yeom Hye-ran, Park Sung-hoon, Jung Sung-il, Kim Hieora, Cha Joo-young', 'TV-MA', 'Years after surviving horrific abuse in high school, a woman puts an elaborate revenge scheme in motion to make the perpetrators pay for their crimes.', 'Years after surviving horrific abuse in high school, a woman puts an elaborate revenge scheme in motion to make the perpetrators pay for their crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUM4LVlPgIrww07OoEKrGWlS1Ej.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136283'),
  ('975274919884560842', 'The Glory', 2025, 'Drama', 'Qian Shan Cha Ke', null, 'Chen Duling, Xin Yunlai, He Hongshan, Yu Entai, Wen Zhengrong, Wang Yan, Liu Xuwei, Liu Min', null, 'Zhuang Hanyan, abandoned as a child and raised in the countryside, returns to her family in the capital, catching the attention of Fu Yunxi, a magistrate seeking a capable wife. As they grow closer, Hanyan finds warmth in family bonds as their relationship deepens.', 'Zhuang Hanyan, abandoned as a child and raised in the countryside, returns to her family in the capital, catching the attention of Fu Yunxi, a magistrate seeking a capable wife. As they grow closer, Hanyan finds warmth in family bonds as their relationship deepens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBeX7H6T4tQfGD8JVHtT7RalBVC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257782'),
  ('723206441391135229', 'The Glory of Tang Dynasty', 2017, 'Drama', 'Yin Tao', null, 'Jing Tian, Ren Jialun, Wan Qian, Qin Junjie, Ma Cheng Cheng, Calvin Yu, Shu Chang, Mao Zijun', null, 'The life of an intelligent and kind woman who becomes a concubine of the inner court whose love for the people enables her to do great things for the country.', 'The life of an intelligent and kind woman who becomes a concubine of the inner court whose love for the people enables her to do great things for the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snIzMXyo9pzNRxA0PaXm20GAwyV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70030'),
  ('406971673033213016', 'The God of High School', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tatsumaru Tachibana, Ayaka Ohashi, Kentaro Kumagai, Koki Uchiyama', 'TV-14', 'Jin Mori has proclaimed himself the strongest high schooler. His life changes when he''s invited to participate in "God of High School," a tournament to determine the strongest high schooler of all. He''s told that if he wins, any wish he makes will be granted... All the participants are powerful contenders who fight their hardest for their own wishes. What awaits them at the end of the tournament? A chaotic battle between unbelievably strong high school students is about to begin!', 'Jin Mori has proclaimed himself the strongest high schooler. His life changes when he''s invited to participate in "God of High School," a tournament to determine the strongest high schooler of all. He''s told that if he wins, any wish he makes will be granted... All the participants are powerful contenders who fight their hardest for their own wishes. What awaits them at the end of the tournament? A chaotic battle between unbelievably strong high school students is about to begin!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfa79lR34s6eyNkKjqC76uQEihh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99778'),
  ('813958336963862993', 'The God of War Dominates', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Zhang Lihua', null, 'Zezong Tang, Chen Shuai, Fan Wu, Sun Ke', null, 'The protagonist Qin Chen, who was originally the top genius in the military domain, was conspired by the people to fall into the death canyon in the forbidden land of the mainland. Qin Chen, who was inevitably dead, unexpectedly triggered the power of the mysterious ancient sword. Three hundred years later, in a remote part of the Tianwu mainland, a boy of the same name accidentally inherited Qin Chen’s will. As the beloved grandson of King Dingwu of the Daqi National Army, due to the birth father’s birth, the mother and son were treated coldly in Dingwu’s palace and lived together. In order to rewrite the myth of the strong man in hope of the sun, and to protect everything he loves, Qin Chen resolutely took up the responsibility of maintaining the five kingdoms of the world and set foot on the road of martial arts again.', 'The protagonist Qin Chen, who was originally the top genius in the military domain, was conspired by the people to fall into the death canyon in the forbidden land of the mainland. Qin Chen, who was inevitably dead, unexpectedly triggered the power of the mysterious ancient sword. Three hundred years later, in a remote part of the Tianwu mainland, a boy of the same name accidentally inherited Qin Chen’s will. As the beloved grandson of King Dingwu of the Daqi National Army, due to the birth father’s birth, the mother and son were treated coldly in Dingwu’s palace and lived together. In order to rewrite the myth of the strong man in hope of the sun, and to protect everything he loves, Qin Chen resolutely took up the responsibility of maintaining the five kingdoms of the world and set foot on the road of martial arts again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiiDyfu3CXhqJMqD303KjMctNVG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110181'),
  ('5942444985330591', 'The Goes Wrong Show', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Sayer, Henry Shields, Henry Lewis', 'Henry Shields, Henry Lewis, Jonathan Sayer', 'Henry Shields, Henry Lewis, Jonathan Sayer, Dave Hearn, Charlie Russell, Bryony Corrigan, Nancy Zamit, Chris Leask', 'TV-PG', 'What’s the worst that could happen? A troupe of am dram actors take on some prestige productions. If you wouldn''t mind ignoring the pratfalls, crumbling sets and tortured thespians ...', 'What’s the worst that could happen? A troupe of am dram actors take on some prestige productions. If you wouldn''t mind ignoring the pratfalls, crumbling sets and tortured thespians ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sWhuKuzDJW29QoDBkscMbVJpNs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96826'),
  ('857318332866933643', 'The Gokusen', 2004, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Kozueko Morimoto', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Norio Wakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Seizo Kato, Hiroaki Yoshida', null, 'Kumiko "Yankumi" Yamaguchi enters Shirokin Gakuen Private School to become a math teacher. She''s assigned as the homeroom teacher for class 2-4, populated by a gang of delinquents. At first, the class tries everything to rattle her cage, but to no avail. In a short period of time, Yankumi gains the respect of the class. But what the school doesn''t know is that she''s the heir to the Oedo Group, a powerful Yakuza clan. So while Yankumi struggles to excel in her career as a teacher, she must also keep her Yakuza background a secret.', 'Kumiko "Yankumi" Yamaguchi enters Shirokin Gakuen Private School to become a math teacher. She''s assigned as the homeroom teacher for class 2-4, populated by a gang of delinquents. At first, the class tries everything to rattle her cage, but to no avail. In a short period of time, Yankumi gains the respect of the class. But what the school doesn''t know is that she''s the heir to the Oedo Group, a powerful Yakuza clan. So while Yankumi struggles to excel in her career as a teacher, she must also keep her Yakuza background a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjkXdEvuQmV7fjSuB0EddS7hw7Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24913'),
  ('270209493600979837', 'The Gold', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Neil Forsyth', null, 'Hugh Bonneville, Tom Cullen, Charlotte Spencer, Emun Elliott, Stefanie Martini, Sam Spruell, Stephen Campbell Moore', null, 'On 26 November 1983, six armed men break into the Brink''s-Mat security depot, stumbling across gold bullion worth £26m.', 'On 26 November 1983, six armed men break into the Brink''s-Mat security depot, stumbling across gold bullion worth £26m.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JY9Gza4HQhXjIPXg9uSy8FeiSM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:218351'),
  ('310489923344073757', 'The Goldbergs', 2013, 'Family, Comedy', 'Adam F. Goldberg', null, 'Wendi McLendon-Covey, Sean Giambrone, Troy Gentile, Hayley Orrantia, Patton Oswalt, Sam Lerner', 'TV-14', 'Before there were parenting blogs, trophies for showing up, and peanut allergies, there was a simpler time called the ''80s. For geeky 11-year old Adam these were his wonder years and he faced them armed with a video camera to capture all the crazy. The Goldbergs are a loving family like any other, just with a lot more yelling.', 'Before there were parenting blogs, trophies for showing up, and peanut allergies, there was a simpler time called the ''80s. For geeky 11-year old Adam these were his wonder years and he faced them armed with a video camera to capture all the crazy. The Goldbergs are a loving family like any other, just with a lot more yelling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aQipkhSCHUmaHjImqEqT80k6GP.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:49009'),
  ('224621219832807091', 'The Golden Eyes', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Zhang Yuan Ang', 'Zhang Yixing, Wang Zixuan, Wang Yuexin, Chen Jiawen, Meng Asai, Hong Xuan, Lee Li-Chun, Hong Jiantao', null, 'An ordinary man working at a pawnshop accidentally encounters an incident that affects his eyes and ignites changes in his life that start him on a tomb-raiding adventure.', 'An ordinary man working at a pawnshop accidentally encounters an incident that affects his eyes and ignites changes in his life that start him on a tomb-raiding adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hy9L74bsoHEj8hwnQFWoLr2yQvQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87133'),
  ('956580167298877905', 'The Golden Girls', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Susan Harris', null, 'Bea Arthur, Betty White, Rue McClanahan, Estelle Getty', 'TV-PG', 'Four Southern Florida seniors share a house, their dreams, and a whole lot of cheesecake. Bright, promiscuous, clueless and hilarious, these lovely, mismatched ladies form the perfect circle of friends.', 'Four Southern Florida seniors share a house, their dreams, and a whole lot of cheesecake. Bright, promiscuous, clueless and hilarious, these lovely, mismatched ladies form the perfect circle of friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qoHn5J0Qclte98j1olNbOQOXVz.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1678'),
  ('323149416130463392', 'The Golden Palace', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Susan Harris', null, 'Betty White, Rue McClanahan, Estelle Getty, Don Cheadle, Cheech Marin, Billy L. Sullivan', 'TV-PG', 'The Golden Palace begins where The Golden Girls had ended, in the quartet''s now-sold Miami house. With Dorothy Zbornak having married and left in the previous series finale, the three remaining cast members (Dorothy''s mother, Sophia Petrillo, Rose Nylund, and Blanche Devereaux) decide to invest in a Miami hotel that is up for sale. The hotel, however, is revealed to have been stripped of all of its personnel in an effort to appear more profitable, leaving only two employees: Roland Wilson, the hotel''s manager, and Chuy Castillos, the hotel''s chef. This requires the women to perform all the tasks of the hotel''s staff.', 'The Golden Palace begins where The Golden Girls had ended, in the quartet''s now-sold Miami house. With Dorothy Zbornak having married and left in the previous series finale, the three remaining cast members (Dorothy''s mother, Sophia Petrillo, Rose Nylund, and Blanche Devereaux) decide to invest in a Miami hotel that is up for sale. The hotel, however, is revealed to have been stripped of all of its personnel in an effort to appear more profitable, leaving only two employees: Roland Wilson, the hotel''s manager, and Chuy Castillos, the hotel''s chef. This requires the women to perform all the tasks of the hotel''s staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ej1EQd50VZKvzoXzOsXR21D2u02.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3068'),
  ('407463351914409111', 'The Golden Spoon', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Yoon Eun-kyung, Kim Seon-soo', 'Yook Sung-jae, Lee Jong-won, Jung Chae-yeon, Yeon Woo, Choi Won-young, Son Yeo-eun, Choi Dae-chul, Han Chae-a', null, 'Would you trade your poor but loving family for a life of riches? When Seung Cheon gets his hands on a magical spoon that allows him to switch lives with his rich best friend, he thinks it’s a no-brainer. But life-altering decisions are always accompanied by a sense of doubt, and with only three chances to change his mind, Seung Cheon has to decide which of his two possible futures is worth keeping.', 'Would you trade your poor but loving family for a life of riches? When Seung Cheon gets his hands on a magical spoon that allows him to switch lives with his rich best friend, he thinks it’s a no-brainer. But life-altering decisions are always accompanied by a sense of doubt, and with only three chances to change his mind, Seung Cheon has to decide which of his two possible futures is worth keeping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fJcOnUsRlpiCSt3J35T1Ga9UHV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157383'),
  ('577640335434446088', 'The Gone', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Simone Nathan, Karl Zohrab', null, 'Richard Flood, Acushla-Tara Kupe', null, 'It follows Theo Richter, an Irish detective who teams with Kiwi cop Diana Huia to find a young Irish couple vanish from an infamous rural North Island New Zealand town. Amidst the search and a race against time, the pair have to contend with a community’s growing disquiet that the disappearances may be linked to a series of historical murders.', 'It follows Theo Richter, an Irish detective who teams with Kiwi cop Diana Huia to find a young Irish couple vanish from an infamous rural North Island New Zealand town. Amidst the search and a race against time, the pair have to contend with a community’s growing disquiet that the disappearances may be linked to a series of historical murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pZqO6Dxtn0V54MWPWVrCY4Xibo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:217831'),
  ('1046681087246097725', 'The Gong Show', 2017, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Mike Myers, Amy Gunther', 'TV-14', 'Unique performers demonstrate their artistry in front of Hollywood judges in this update of the kitschy ''70s talent show, which features the worst performances being cut short by bangs on the titular gong.', 'Unique performers demonstrate their artistry in front of Hollywood judges in this update of the kitschy ''70s talent show, which features the worst performances being cut short by bangs on the titular gong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61L3YhmBjwZW39tZEwhHxiCb3Og.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72368'),
  ('432319447143455483', 'The Good Bad Mother', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sim Na-yeon, Bae Se-young', null, 'Ra Mi-ran, Lee Do-hyun, Ahn Eun-jin, Yoo In-soo, Choi Moo-seong, Jung Woong-in, Hong Bi-ra, Seo Yi-sook', 'TV-MA', 'A tragic accident leaves an ambitious prosecutor with the mind of a child – forcing him and his mother to embark on a journey to heal their relationship.', 'A tragic accident leaves an ambitious prosecutor with the mind of a child – forcing him and his mother to embark on a journey to heal their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtDLhvpTk1xcaBCKubSH0if575G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214999'),
  ('1067478584658194962', 'The Good Cop', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andy Breckman', null, 'Josh Groban, Tony Danza, Monica Barbaro, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Bill Kottkamp', 'TV-PG', 'Honest cop Tony Jr. gets advice from his unscrupulous father, retired NYPD officer Tony Sr., about everything from his job to his love life.', 'Honest cop Tony Jr. gets advice from his unscrupulous father, retired NYPD officer Tony Sr., about everything from his job to his love life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dksu4Xhq5HE6MuR0NQdvxef6v35.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80308'),
  ('960195180649636388', 'The Good Detective', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Cho Nam-guk, Choi Jin-won', 'Choi Jin-won', 'Son Hyun-joo, Jang Seung-jo, Kim Hyo-jin, Jung Moon-sung, Cha Rae-hyung, Jung Soon-won, Kim Ji-hoon, Kim Myeong-jun', 'TV-MA', 'A drama about the race between people who want to get closer to the truth and those who want to cover it up. Jang Seung Jo will take on the role of Oh Ji Hyuk, an elite detective of nine years who does not share his feelings with others due to pain he experienced when he was young. He is not swayed by money and power, even with the huge wealth he inherited from his uncle.', 'A drama about the race between people who want to get closer to the truth and those who want to cover it up. Jang Seung Jo will take on the role of Oh Ji Hyuk, an elite detective of nine years who does not share his feelings with others due to pain he experienced when he was young. He is not swayed by money and power, even with the huge wealth he inherited from his uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oj9zTCRn8tfuXTcqa0UbOCO2DZX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99480'),
  ('832185968778651017', 'The Good Doctor', 2017, 'Drama', 'David Shore', null, 'Freddie Highmore, Fiona Gubelmann, Will Yun Lee, Christina Chang, Paige Spara, Bria Samoné Henderson, Noah Galvin, Chuku Modu', 'TV-14', 'Shaun Murphy, a young surgeon with autism and savant syndrome, relocates from a quiet country life to join a prestigious hospital''s surgical unit. Unable to personally connect with those around him, Shaun uses his extraordinary medical gifts to save lives and challenge the skepticism of his colleagues.', 'Shaun Murphy, a young surgeon with autism and savant syndrome, relocates from a quiet country life to join a prestigious hospital''s surgical unit. Unable to personally connect with those around him, Shaun uses his extraordinary medical gifts to save lives and challenge the skepticism of his colleagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luhKkdD80qe62fwop6sdrXK9jUT.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:71712'),
  ('1125904426025121278', 'The Good Fight', 2017, 'Drama', 'Michelle King, Robert King, Phil Alden Robinson', null, 'Christine Baranski, Audra McDonald, Sarah Steele, Nyambi Nyambi, Michael Boatman, Charmaine Bingwa, Andre Braugher, John Slattery', 'TV-MA', 'Picking up one year after the events of the final broadcast episode of "The Good Wife", an enormous financial scam has destroyed the reputation of a young lawyer, Maia Rindell, while simultaneously wiping out her mentor and godmother Diane Lockhart''s savings. Forced out of her law firm, now called "Lockhart, Deckler, Gussman, Lee, Lyman, Gilbert, Lurie, Kagan, Tannebaum & Associates", they join Lucca Quinn at one of Chicago''s preeminent law firms.', 'Picking up one year after the events of the final broadcast episode of "The Good Wife", an enormous financial scam has destroyed the reputation of a young lawyer, Maia Rindell, while simultaneously wiping out her mentor and godmother Diane Lockhart''s savings. Forced out of her law firm, now called "Lockhart, Deckler, Gussman, Lee, Lyman, Gilbert, Lurie, Kagan, Tannebaum & Associates", they join Lucca Quinn at one of Chicago''s preeminent law firms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qoOHOfbUbrCcHZnDVxGcwOWinV.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:69158'),
  ('20492123405618259', 'The Good Guys', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Matt Nix', null, 'Bradley Whitford, Colin Hanks, Jenny Wade, Diana Maria Riva', 'TV-14', 'Once upon the 1970s, Dan Stark and his partner, Frank Savage, were big-shot Dallas detectives. So big, in fact, that they were lauded as American heroes after saving the Governor''s son. Thirty years later, Dan Stark is a washed-up detective who spends most of his time drunk or re-hashing his glory days. Dan''s new partner, Jack Bailey, is an ambitious, by-the-book and overall good detective, but is sometimes a bit too snarky for his own good. His habit of undermining himself has earned him a dead-end position in the department, and he is stuck solving annoying petty theft cases that nobody else wants. Worse, he''s been given the thankless task of babysitting Dan, the drunk pariah who can never keep partners for long.', 'Once upon the 1970s, Dan Stark and his partner, Frank Savage, were big-shot Dallas detectives. So big, in fact, that they were lauded as American heroes after saving the Governor''s son. Thirty years later, Dan Stark is a washed-up detective who spends most of his time drunk or re-hashing his glory days. Dan''s new partner, Jack Bailey, is an ambitious, by-the-book and overall good detective, but is sometimes a bit too snarky for his own good. His habit of undermining himself has earned him a dead-end position in the department, and he is stuck solving annoying petty theft cases that nobody else wants. Worse, he''s been given the thankless task of babysitting Dan, the drunk pariah who can never keep partners for long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/si8ODKd2DKmwrt96LmQvod4JANQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32085'),
  ('856693411336829425', 'The Good Karma Hospital', 2017, 'Drama', 'Dan Sefton', null, null, null, 'The story of British-Asian junior doctor Ruby Walker who arrives at the run-down Good Karma Hospital to join a dedicated team of over-worked medics. Run by a gloriously eccentric Englishwoman, Lydia Fonseca, this under-funded but creatively resourceful cottage hospital is the beating heart of the local community. It’s much more than just a medical outpost - it’s a home.', 'The story of British-Asian junior doctor Ruby Walker who arrives at the run-down Good Karma Hospital to join a dedicated team of over-worked medics. Run by a gloriously eccentric Englishwoman, Lydia Fonseca, this under-funded but creatively resourceful cottage hospital is the beating heart of the local community. It’s much more than just a medical outpost - it’s a home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1JuFDNI5Zh5ngFqsPgunGU4YW5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:70112'),
  ('543016363483991558', 'The Good Life', 1975, 'Comedy', 'John Esmonde, Bob Larbey', 'John Esmonde, Bob Larbey', 'Richard Briers, Felicity Kendal, Paul Eddington, Penelope Keith', 'TV-PG', 'Tom and Barbara Good escape the rat race and pursue a self-sufficient lifestyle in Surbiton, much to the concern, frustration and sometimes envy of their neighbours Margo and Jerry Leadbetter. Entitled ‘Good Neighbors’ when shown in the USA.', 'Tom and Barbara Good escape the rat race and pursue a self-sufficient lifestyle in Surbiton, much to the concern, frustration and sometimes envy of their neighbours Margo and Jerry Leadbetter. Entitled ‘Good Neighbors’ when shown in the USA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ll4SdFLqWCK2Ss2mYSAN6zJCzxZ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2765'),
  ('894829769830684569', 'The Good Lord Bird', 2020, 'Drama, Western, War & Politics', 'Mark Richard, Ethan Hawke', null, 'Ethan Hawke, Joshua Caleb Johnson, Hubert Point-Du Jour, Beau Knapp, Nick Eversman, Ellar Coltrane, Jack Alcott, Mo Brings Plenty', 'TV-MA', 'Told from the perspective of Henry ''Little Onion'' Shackleford, a newly freed teenager who joins abolitionist John Brown on a holy crusade to end slavery. Onion encounters Frederick Douglass and Harriet Tubman, and he finds himself as a part of the famous 1859 raid at Harpers Ferry.', 'Told from the perspective of Henry ''Little Onion'' Shackleford, a newly freed teenager who joins abolitionist John Brown on a holy crusade to end slavery. Onion encounters Frederick Douglass and Harriet Tubman, and he finds himself as a part of the famous 1859 raid at Harpers Ferry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNFcWrxlnFXvrjJezId6bAoePzT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87523'),
  ('593185092474381462', 'The Good Mothers', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Stephen Butchard', 'Stephen Butchard', 'Gaia Girace, Micaela Ramazzotti, Valentina Bellè, Barbara Chichiarelli, Simona Distefano, Francesco Colella, Marco Zingaro, Nicole Sorace', 'TV-MA', 'The true story of three courageous women inside the notorious Calabrian ‘Ndrangheta mafia, working with newly-minted female prosecutor, Alessandra Cerreti, to bring down down the criminal empire.', 'The true story of three courageous women inside the notorious Calabrian ‘Ndrangheta mafia, working with newly-minted female prosecutor, Alessandra Cerreti, to bring down down the criminal empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WwKoGbQETx7erXfh5w1OW0BHEC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119064'),
  ('946177893997592794', 'The Good Place', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Michael Schur', null, 'Kristen Bell, Ted Danson, William Jackson Harper, Jameela Jamil, Manny Jacinto, D''Arcy Carden', 'TV-14', 'Eleanor Shellstrop, an ordinary woman who, through an extraordinary string of events, enters the afterlife where she comes to realize that she hasn''t been a very good person. With the help of her wise afterlife mentor, she''s determined to shed her old way of living and discover the awesome (or at least the pretty good) person within.', 'Eleanor Shellstrop, an ordinary woman who, through an extraordinary string of events, enters the afterlife where she comes to realize that she hasn''t been a very good person. With the help of her wise afterlife mentor, she''s determined to shed her old way of living and discover the awesome (or at least the pretty good) person within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIhsuhoIYR5yTnDta0IL4senbeN.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:66573'),
  ('494211518359921547', 'The Good Ship Murder', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Shayne Ward, Catherine Tyldesley, Geoffrey Breton, Zak Douglas', null, 'Former police detective Jack Grayling, pursuing his dream of becoming a cabaret singer on a luxury Mediterranean cruise ship, investigates a series of murders on board with the help of the ship''s first officer, Kate Woods.', 'Former police detective Jack Grayling, pursuing his dream of becoming a cabaret singer on a luxury Mediterranean cruise ship, investigates a series of murders on board with the help of the ship''s first officer, Kate Woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AjntsRc9qJcdK8jt7OCkr8fL0w.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:236572'),
  ('1056730331074425777', 'The Good Thieves', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Family, Comedy', null, 'Cha Yi-Young, Son Young-Mok', 'Kim Ji-hoon, Seohyun, Ji Hyun-woo, Im Joo-eun, An Kil-kang, Han Eun-seong, Jung Kyung-soon, Kim Jung-tae', null, 'There are thieves who come from different backgrounds and situations, but were not born as thieves. For the most part, they lived by the rules even while growing up poor and worked hard to better their lives. They are actually generous people. But the cruel realities of society have pushed them to the edge. And to ensure that their past problems do not hamper their own children, they fight to exact revenge from those in power, search for their long-lost family members and commit one last heist to mete out justice. This TV show will entertain viewers with a story revolving around thieves from the low rungs of society who burglarize the home of powerful men in order to unmask them. They do this to put an end to those who stand above the law and get away with thievery scot-free.', 'There are thieves who come from different backgrounds and situations, but were not born as thieves. For the most part, they lived by the rules even while growing up poor and worked hard to better their lives. They are actually generous people. But the cruel realities of society have pushed them to the edge. And to ensure that their past problems do not hamper their own children, they fight to exact revenge from those in power, search for their long-lost family members and commit one last heist to mete out justice. This TV show will entertain viewers with a story revolving around thieves from the low rungs of society who burglarize the home of powerful men in order to unmask them. They do this to put an end to those who stand above the law and get away with thievery scot-free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twQLMej5SAPVwNfhpFzponN62T2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71640'),
  ('283445064275698651', 'The Good Wife', 2009, 'Drama', 'Michelle King, Robert King', null, 'Julianna Margulies, Christine Baranski, Matt Czuchry, Alan Cumming, Cush Jumbo, Jeffrey Dean Morgan', 'TV-14', 'Alicia Florrick boldly assumes full responsibility for her family and re-enters the workforce after her husband''s very public sex and political corruption scandal lands him in jail.', 'Alicia Florrick boldly assumes full responsibility for her family and re-enters the workforce after her husband''s very public sex and political corruption scandal lands him in jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lasNCd45fpPLirlA7QxkuopWro.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1435'),
  ('1082264808308724790', 'The Good Wife', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Han Sang-un', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Yoo Ji-tae, Yoon Kye-sang, Kim Seo-hyung, Kim Tae-woo, Nana, Lee Won-keun, Choi Seung-yoon', null, 'A husband works as a successful prosecutor and his future appears bright, but he gets arrested for corruption in a political scandal. His wife worked as an attorney prior to their marriage, now resumes her career after a 13 year hiatus. She begins to find her true identity. An adaptation of the American TV series aired on CBS of the same title.', 'A husband works as a successful prosecutor and his future appears bright, but he gets arrested for corruption in a political scandal. His wife worked as an attorney prior to their marriage, now resumes her career after a 13 year hiatus. She begins to find her true identity. An adaptation of the American TV series aired on CBS of the same title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rowNWM1P4cplxUrKPC9ElenkW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66781'),
  ('391207005773807204', 'The Good Witch', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Yoon Young-mi', 'Lee Da-hae, Ryu Soo-young, An Woo-yeon, Bae Soo-bin, Yoon Se-a, Shin Hye-jeong, Shim Hyung-tak, Ahn Sol-bin', null, 'Cha Sun-Hee is a housewife and she is married to Bong Cheon-Dae. Her husband is currently unemployed. She has a twin sister, Cha Do-Hee, who works as a flight attendant. Although they are identical twins, they have completely opposite personalities. Cha Do-Hee becomes involved in a situation which leads to Cha Sun-Hee pretending to be her flight attendant sister. She then meets co-pilot Song Woo-Jin.', 'Cha Sun-Hee is a housewife and she is married to Bong Cheon-Dae. Her husband is currently unemployed. She has a twin sister, Cha Do-Hee, who works as a flight attendant. Although they are identical twins, they have completely opposite personalities. Cha Do-Hee becomes involved in a situation which leads to Cha Sun-Hee pretending to be her flight attendant sister. She then meets co-pilot Song Woo-Jin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kquxcZ8Nz5XcqnlxN67cKEpgTVm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77287'),
  ('219396754418329198', 'The Goode Family', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mike Judge, Dave Krinsky, John Altschuler', null, 'Mike Judge, Nancy Carell, David Herman, Linda Cardellini, Brian Doyle-Murray', null, 'Meet Gerald and Helen Goode, a couple who live by the motto WWAGD ("What Would Al Gore Do?"). Gerald, a college administrator, and Helen, a community activist, are determined to obliterate their carbon footprint on the planet: They''re zealous vegans, they drive a hybrid, and they recycle everything possible.', 'Meet Gerald and Helen Goode, a couple who live by the motto WWAGD ("What Would Al Gore Do?"). Gerald, a college administrator, and Helen, a community activist, are determined to obliterate their carbon footprint on the planet: They''re zealous vegans, they drive a hybrid, and they recycle everything possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGh1qxCxugpzq4KBNrLN1W4n4XK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7366'),
  ('181707760656062970', 'The Goodies', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Bill Oddie, Tim Brooke-Taylor, Graeme Garden', null, 'Tim Brooke-Taylor, Graeme Garden, Bill Oddie', null, 'A British television comedy series of the 1970s and early 1980s, combining surreal sketches and situation comedy.', 'A British television comedy series of the 1970s and early 1980s, combining surreal sketches and situation comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNpIKitxIioFlHU0JxOuEMLW4A9.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:3501'),
  ('506064647152270173', 'The Goodwin Games', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Carter Bays, Craig Thomas, Chris Harris', null, 'Becki Newton, Scott Foley, T.J. Miller, Melissa Tang, Jerrod Carmichael', 'TV-14', 'The Goodwin siblings return home after their father''s death, and unexpectedly find themselves poised to inherit a vast fortune – if they adhere to their late father''s wishes. Where there''s a will, there''s a way. And when that will''s worth more than 20 million dollars, you can bet someone''s going to find a way to get the cash.', 'The Goodwin siblings return home after their father''s death, and unexpectedly find themselves poised to inherit a vast fortune – if they adhere to their late father''s wishes. Where there''s a will, there''s a way. And when that will''s worth more than 20 million dollars, you can bet someone''s going to find a way to get the cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhLk63LAnYCWxEKhKx92iGlFXKa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44008'),
  ('552019515828199405', 'The Goop Lab', 2020, 'Documentary, Talk', null, null, 'Gwyneth Paltrow', null, 'Leading with curiosity and keeping it real, Gwyneth Paltrow and her goop team look at psychedelics, energy work and other challenging wellness topics.', 'Leading with curiosity and keeping it real, Gwyneth Paltrow and her goop team look at psychedelics, energy work and other challenging wellness topics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33F17SSRglzIdBH1zsGA6Rv5QT1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97390'),
  ('184435940347827910', 'The Gorilla God''s Go-To Girl', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kanna Nakamura, Takeo Otsuka', 'TV-14', 'Sophia Reeler, a timid noble, received the Gorilla God’s blessing—the ultimate combat power. Now her dream of a peaceful student life is shattered as the royal knights recruit her unrivaled strength. Juggling school, the knight life, and her overwhelming power, Sophia learns the hard way that gorilla strength isn’t so simple.', 'Sophia Reeler, a timid noble, received the Gorilla God’s blessing—the ultimate combat power. Now her dream of a peaceful student life is shattered as the royal knights recruit her unrivaled strength. Juggling school, the knight life, and her overwhelming power, Sophia learns the hard way that gorilla strength isn’t so simple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsVUjE78BP7v2KayDnlAKbiY3Av.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278816'),
  ('3966974029353946', 'The Graham Norton Show', 2007, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Graham Norton', 'TV-14', 'Each week celebrity guests join Irish comedian Graham Norton to discuss what''s being going on around the world that week. The guests poke fun and share their opinions on the main news stories. Graham is often joined by a band or artist to play the show out.', 'Each week celebrity guests join Irish comedian Graham Norton to discuss what''s being going on around the world that week. The guests poke fun and share their opinions on the main news stories. Graham is often joined by a band or artist to play the show out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrbqaBXB8AALynQzpWz6JdCPEJS.jpg', 33, 'tmdb:tv:1220'),
  ('450685862901385001', 'The Grammys', 1959, 'Reality, Talk', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'An awards show honoring the achievements of the members of the professional music recording industry. The members of the Recording Academy vote on who they think is most deserving of an award in 108 categories as specified by the academy.', 'An awards show honoring the achievements of the members of the professional music recording industry. The members of the Recording Academy vote on who they think is most deserving of an award in 108 categories as specified by the academy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2itSpL4aBPoJXQ4QVtBFxQyz0j0.jpg', 64, 'tmdb:tv:25298'),
  ('564339515670671305', 'The Grand Canal', 1987, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Idy Chan Yuk-Lin, Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Margie Tsang Wah-Sin, Michael Tao Tai-Yu, Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah, Rebecca Chan', null, 'The drama is a story that details the fall of the Sui Dynasty, and what it took to lead to the eventual rise of the Tang Dynasty.', 'The drama is a story that details the fall of the Sui Dynasty, and what it took to lead to the eventual rise of the Tang Dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oauXtKNfKKGwaL1hch6qQhT2qJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99314'),
  ('971904001639050885', 'The Grand Mansion Gate', 2001, 'Drama', 'Guo Baochang', null, 'Chen Baoguo, Jiang Shan, Tong Ruixin, He Saifei, Liu Bei, Yu Feihong, Han Tongsheng, Wang Qian', null, 'This Chinese period drama series follows the fortunes of a prominent merchant family engaged in Traditional Chinese Medicine during the waning years of the Ching dynasty. The affairs of this family of doctors/pharmacists (which in those days were one and the same) are intimately linked with social upheavals of the time such as the encroachment of Christian missionaries and foreign imperialism as well as conflicts that inevitably emerge in a large upper class family. Comparable in scope and production value to such recent titles as "Downton Abbey", the lives and character of both masters and servants intertwine in plot lines that spans more than a generation.', 'This Chinese period drama series follows the fortunes of a prominent merchant family engaged in Traditional Chinese Medicine during the waning years of the Ching dynasty. The affairs of this family of doctors/pharmacists (which in those days were one and the same) are intimately linked with social upheavals of the time such as the encroachment of Christian missionaries and foreign imperialism as well as conflicts that inevitably emerge in a large upper class family. Comparable in scope and production value to such recent titles as "Downton Abbey", the lives and character of both masters and servants intertwine in plot lines that spans more than a generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4FrnoPSRQtcR6Q165HtbnkxRTC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:49203'),
  ('117195122769166880', 'The Grand Tour', 2016, 'Reality, Comedy, Talk', 'Jeremy Clarkson, Richard Hammond, James May', null, 'Jeremy Clarkson, Richard Hammond, James May', 'TV-14', 'Jeremy Clarkson, Richard Hammond and James May are back with a show about adventure, excitement and friendship... as long as you accept that the people you call friends are also the ones you find extremely annoying. Sometimes it''s even a show about cars. Follow them on their global adventure.', 'Jeremy Clarkson, Richard Hammond and James May are back with a show about adventure, excitement and friendship... as long as you accept that the people you call friends are also the ones you find extremely annoying. Sometimes it''s even a show about cars. Follow them on their global adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Pcqu6QliBWJ8vsOVClVLddPnZw.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:67557'),
  ('147823697907277680', 'The Gray House', 2026, 'Drama, War & Politics, Action & Adventure', 'Roland Joffé, Darrell Fetty, Leslie Greif', 'John Sayles, Leslie Greif, Darrell Fetty', 'Mary-Louise Parker, Daisy Head, Amethyst Davis, Ben Vereen, Paul Anderson, Christopher McDonald, Hannah James, Ian Duff', null, 'The untold true story of four brave women who served as key espionage agents and turned the tide of the American Civil War in favor of the North, risking life and liberty to help win the war and preserve democracy. A Richmond Socialite and her daughter, a formerly enslaved African-American, and a courtesan build the first successful female spy ring.', 'The untold true story of four brave women who served as key espionage agents and turned the tide of the American Civil War in favor of the North, risking life and liberty to help win the war and preserve democracy. A Richmond Socialite and her daughter, a formerly enslaved African-American, and a courtesan build the first successful female spy ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wE5jZDeQuiulaAtjeaEq0y8tpey.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211178'),
  ('765820989184465195', 'The Great', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tony McNamara', 'Ava Pickett', 'Elle Fanning, Nicholas Hoult, Phoebe Fox, Gwilym Lee, Adam Godley, Douglas Hodge, Belinda Bromilow, Bayo Gbadamosi', 'TV-MA', 'A genre-bending, anti-historical ride through 18th century Russia following the rise of Catherine the Nothing to Catherine the Great and her explosive relationship with husband Peter, the emperor of Russia.', 'A genre-bending, anti-historical ride through 18th century Russia following the rise of Catherine the Nothing to Catherine the Great and her explosive relationship with husband Peter, the emperor of Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpz9UQ3hUwYufNcKWVW00FCjWyc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:93812'),
  ('907122583232422267', 'The Great Adventure', 1963, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'The Great Adventure is a historical anthology series that appeared on CBS for the 1963-1964 television season. The series, narrated each week by Van Heflin, and featuring theme music by Richard Rodgers, presented a weekly one-hour dramatization of the lives of famous Americans and important historical events in American History.', 'The Great Adventure is a historical anthology series that appeared on CBS for the 1963-1964 television season. The series, narrated each week by Van Heflin, and featuring theme music by Richard Rodgers, presented a weekly one-hour dramatization of the lives of famous Americans and important historical events in American History.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxsVGvSS8cvIuYM2d9d6qGn1DMW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1247'),
  ('946485892625144889', 'The Great Adventurer Wesley', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Michelle Hu, Yang Rong, Philip Ng Wan-Lung, Yasuaki Kurata', null, 'Aliens have secretly infiltrated the Earth for years. Wesley, an Interpol Special Adviser, catches aliens with a high-tech weapons to keep the Earth safe. One day, a severed hand appears at Bai''s house. Wesley and Bai''s daughter investigate it and find Deng Shi who can decompose the body freely. Subsequently, in Egypt, a mummified Pharaoh disembarks, leading them to a mysterious tomb. What awaits them in the mysterious tomb?', 'Aliens have secretly infiltrated the Earth for years. Wesley, an Interpol Special Adviser, catches aliens with a high-tech weapons to keep the Earth safe. One day, a severed hand appears at Bai''s house. Wesley and Bai''s daughter investigate it and find Deng Shi who can decompose the body freely. Subsequently, in Egypt, a mummified Pharaoh disembarks, leading them to a mysterious tomb. What awaits them in the mysterious tomb?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1l0l4TPa0eFoDEG2ZK3llolGLn.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:78756'),
  ('820662812694819100', 'The Great British Bake Off', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mel Giedroyc, Sue Perkins, Mary Berry, Paul Hollywood', 'TV-PG', 'This British television baking competition selects from amongst its competitors the best amateur baker. The series is credited with reinvigorating interest in baking throughout the UK, and many of its participants, including winners, have gone on to start a career based on baking.', 'This British television baking competition selects from amongst its competitors the best amateur baker. The series is credited with reinvigorating interest in baking throughout the UK, and many of its participants, including winners, have gone on to start a career based on baking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNa02AorKSBRfWfVPmsL7SJrdfs.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:34549'),
