  ('454809280692172578', 'The Great Cleric', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Reiji Kawashima, Akio Otsuka, Tomoaki Maeno, Daisuke Ono, Hina Tachibana, Manaka Iwami, Rika Kinugawa', 'TV-PG', 'After his untimely death, this salaryman gets another shot at life! When Luciel is reborn into a magical new land, he becomes a healer in hopes of leading a peaceful life. However, he quickly learns that being a healer is much more challenging than he expected. With strict and strenuous training in store, this new life is turning out to be anything but peaceful.', 'After his untimely death, this salaryman gets another shot at life! When Luciel is reborn into a magical new land, he becomes a healer in hopes of leading a peaceful life. However, he quickly learns that being a healer is much more challenging than he expected. With strict and strenuous training in store, this new life is turning out to be anything but peaceful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkzYTYdhaNqRaGyKsBunt3y5vs0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220779'),
