  ('63738440312260185', 'The Great White Tower', 2003, 'Drama', 'Toyoko Yamasaki', null, 'Toshiaki Karasawa, Yosuke Eguchi, Hitomi Kuroki, Akiko Yada, Maki Mizuno, Masatô Ibu, Koji Ishizaka, Atsuko Takahata', null, 'Two surgeons with contrasting objectives are asked to work together in a city hospital. While one of them strives to achieve fame and power through his work, the other wants to save human lives.', 'Two surgeons with contrasting objectives are asked to work together in a city hospital. While one of them strives to achieve fame and power through his work, the other wants to save human lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcpE3FOBkIILSlYGjtxuEjXJ4Et.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38242'),
  ('717138463937838756', 'The Greatest American Hero', 1981, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Stephen J. Cannell', null, 'William Katt, Robert Culp, Connie Sellecca, Faye Grant, Michael Paré, Jesse D. Goins, Don Cervantes', 'TV-14', 'The chronicles of teacher Ralph Hinkley''s adventures after a group of aliens gives him a red suit that gives him superhuman abilities. Unfortunately, Ralph, who hates wearing the suit, immediately loses its instruction booklet, and thus has to learn how to use its powers by trial and error, often with comical results.', 'The chronicles of teacher Ralph Hinkley''s adventures after a group of aliens gives him a red suit that gives him superhuman abilities. Unfortunately, Ralph, who hates wearing the suit, immediately loses its instruction booklet, and thus has to learn how to use its powers by trial and error, often with comical results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sViWrklUxxYw4ZYuGsrthnS63X2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1909'),
  ('318513523659271894', 'The Greatest Demon Lord Is Reborn as a Typical Nobody', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Toshinari Fukamachi, Wakana Maruoka', 'TV-14', 'In his past life, he was known as Demon Lord Varvatos, an all-powerful magic user and ruler. But he was lonely after the loss of his friends and loved ones during his rise to power, so in his dying moments, Varvatos cast a reincarnation spell so that he''d get a second chance at just being a normal guy. At first it looks like that''s going to work – he''s reborn thousands of years later as villager Ard. Unfortunately for him, his memories are still intact and he''s not aware just how much has been lost over the time he spent not existing, and it looks like that''s going to cost him his normal life.', 'In his past life, he was known as Demon Lord Varvatos, an all-powerful magic user and ruler. But he was lonely after the loss of his friends and loved ones during his rise to power, so in his dying moments, Varvatos cast a reincarnation spell so that he''d get a second chance at just being a normal guy. At first it looks like that''s going to work – he''s reborn thousands of years later as villager Ard. Unfortunately for him, his memories are still intact and he''s not aware just how much has been lost over the time he spent not existing, and it looks like that''s going to cost him his normal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtULGP3qRi932NzYGsp7u6q6zAS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120155'),
  ('539661626230554812', 'The Greatest Event in Television History', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Naomi Scott, Adam Scott', null, 'Jeff Probst, Amanda Anka', 'TV-14', 'Adam Scott is determined to make the greatest event in television history by remaking the opening sequences of TV shows.', 'Adam Scott is determined to make the greatest event in television history by remaking the opening sequences of TV shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abiiLt0LCFItR6VPtn5MT3NwJKK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120516'),
  ('546147540730776962', 'The Greatest Love', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran', 'Cha Seung-won, Gong Hyo-jin, Yoon Kye-sang, Yoo In-na, Han Jin-hee, Park Won-sook, Choi Hwa-jeong, Jeong Jun-ha', 'NR', 'Can you confidently love a person who you like but others don''t? Muster up the courage and a love that seems like the worst to others can become the best for you. The most-liked guy in the country, who is loved by everyone, and the most-disliked woman in the country, who is criticized by everyone, squeeze out that courage as their feelings for each other grow.', 'Can you confidently love a person who you like but others don''t? Muster up the courage and a love that seems like the worst to others can become the best for you. The most-liked guy in the country, who is loved by everyone, and the most-disliked woman in the country, who is criticized by everyone, squeeze out that courage as their feelings for each other grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foIZZlM7H8aB2AlA9xujrCdxDar.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39273'),
  ('638479670307972132', 'The Greatest Marriage', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', null, null, 'Park Si-yeon, Bae Soo-bin, No Min-woo, Cho Eun-ji, Jung Ae-yeun, Lee Jeong-kil, Park So-jin, Heo Joon-seok', null, 'Cha Ki Young was once a successful news anchor living the good life, but everything changed when she defied expectations and became a single mother. Jo Eun Cha was also once a news anchor, but left his career to campaign unsuccessfully for office. Though nothing quite pans out as expected for either Ki Young or Eun Cha, they''ve yet to discover what fate has in store for them. Meanwhile, four other couples grapple with whether or not they can really have it all in modern romance.', 'Cha Ki Young was once a successful news anchor living the good life, but everything changed when she defied expectations and became a single mother. Jo Eun Cha was also once a news anchor, but left his career to campaign unsuccessfully for office. Though nothing quite pans out as expected for either Ki Young or Eun Cha, they''ve yet to discover what fate has in store for them. Meanwhile, four other couples grapple with whether or not they can really have it all in modern romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIPJgwACKzrSeHLm6F3L1L7j1x4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61486'),
  ('1008293459699890484', 'The Greatest Teacher', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Shogo Muto', 'Tsubaki Masataka', 'Mayu Matsuoka, Mana Ashida, Daiken Okudaira, Seishirou Katou, Ami Touma, Mizuki Kayashima, Soma Santoki, Hitomi Honda', null, 'Kujo Rina is a chemistry teacher and the homeroom teacher for the 3rd grade D class at Horai High School. She doesn''t have a bond with her students. On the school''s graduation day, Kujo Rina is pushed from the 4th floor and falls down. She is able to glimpse a school uniform sleeve on the person that pushed her. At that time, she wonders why she was pushed and that she does not want to die.', 'Kujo Rina is a chemistry teacher and the homeroom teacher for the 3rd grade D class at Horai High School. She doesn''t have a bond with her students. On the school''s graduation day, Kujo Rina is pushed from the 4th floor and falls down. She is able to glimpse a school uniform sleeve on the person that pushed her. At that time, she wonders why she was pushed and that she does not want to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTDDEtGTfkL4nU5CcwL8tZSkKIC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:228921'),
  ('8794144446617159', 'The Greed of Man', 1992, 'Drama', 'Wai Ka-Fai', null, 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Amy Kwok', null, 'Told in reverse chronological order, the story starts in the present (June 7, 1994), when the stock market rebounded after the market became volatile and crashed for the weekend. After the stock market stopped trading for the weekend, the Ting''s make the wrong bet and their entire fortune is wiped out, compounded by ending up in billions of dollars in debt. Ting Hai forces his sons to commit suicide by jumping off from the top of the stock exchange building before following after them.', 'Told in reverse chronological order, the story starts in the present (June 7, 1994), when the stock market rebounded after the market became volatile and crashed for the weekend. After the stock market stopped trading for the weekend, the Ting''s make the wrong bet and their entire fortune is wiped out, compounded by ending up in billions of dollars in debt. Ting Hai forces his sons to commit suicide by jumping off from the top of the stock exchange building before following after them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ib3bGoQojw1YaSv902xjcZ9SXOL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:20382'),
  ('354365244848333112', 'The Green Glove Gang', 2022, 'Crime, Comedy', null, 'Bartosz Kozera', 'Magdalena Kuta, Małgorzata Potocka, Anna Romantowska, Krzysztof Tyniec, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Karolina Rzepa, Andrzej Grabowski, Beata Bandurska', 'TV-MA', 'When their latest heist goes wrong, three older female burglars evade officials by hiding out in a nursing home — where they uncover a sinister secret.', 'When their latest heist goes wrong, three older female burglars evade officials by hiding out in a nursing home — where they uncover a sinister secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xKTVxgny782RvjxCD5LfG7UqGL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:210750'),
