  ('518729242880830716', 'The King of The Cattle', 1996, 'Soap, Drama, Family', 'Benedito Ruy Barbosa', 'Edmara Barbosa, Edilene Barbosa', 'Antônio Fagundes, Patricia Pillar, Raul Cortez, Glória Pires, Sílvia Pfeifer, Fábio Assunção, Lavínia Vlasak, Almir Sater', null, 'In the struggle for land a vicious feud erupts between two men, who commit their families to a war without truce. Over two generations they are moved by love and by hatred in this epic saga of love for the land.', 'In the struggle for land a vicious feud erupts between two men, who commit their families to a war without truce. Over two generations they are moved by love and by hatred in this epic saga of love for the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfOMaSn1A6FLgk3qTM7hIhKYtgA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41731'),
  ('243432063346082866', 'The King of TV', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ricardo Grynszpan, Marcus Baldini, André Barcinski', null, 'José Rubens Chachá, Leona Cavalli, Larissa Nunes, Daniela Paschoal', null, '1988. Diagnosed with a serious ailment that could bring an end to his career in front of the cameras, Brazilian TV presenter Silvio Santos looks back on his journey to becoming one of the biggest presenters in all of Brazil.', '1988. Diagnosed with a serious ailment that could bring an end to his career in front of the cameras, Brazilian TV presenter Silvio Santos looks back on his journey to becoming one of the biggest presenters in all of Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqXqKDQVoLPDSVcOA9BugkX7vUB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:124714'),
  ('382267926616731126', 'The King of Warsaw', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Michał Żurawski, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Borys Szyc, Aleksandra Pisula, Lena Góra, Paweł Wolak, Mikołaj Kubacki', null, '1937 Warsaw, Poland. The Jewish mafia rules the city. Head honcho is gangster socialist, Buddy Kaplica. His right-hand man, boxer, Jakub Szapiro who dreams of taking over Buddy''s top spot as King of Warsaw.', '1937 Warsaw, Poland. The Jewish mafia rules the city. Head honcho is gangster socialist, Buddy Kaplica. His right-hand man, boxer, Jakub Szapiro who dreams of taking over Buddy''s top spot as King of Warsaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owzRrtwGAJ8u8DzyuBT1HH4uuP5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88201'),
  ('752108204089859924', 'The King Who Never Was', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Emanuele Filiberto di Savoia, Vittorio Emanuele di Savoia', 'TV-14', 'This docuseries sheds light on the killing of a German teenager in ''78 through the accounts of his sister and the royal family involved in the case.', 'This docuseries sheds light on the killing of a German teenager in ''78 through the accounts of his sister and the royal family involved in the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqRKaSNmKdXyQXwBfqLnUe88TU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229193'),
  ('764167425421923251', 'The King: Eternal Monarch', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Kim Eun-sook', 'Lee Min-ho, Kim Go-eun, Woo Do-hwan, Kim Kyung-nam, Jung Eun-chae, Lee Jung-jin, Jeon Moo-song, Kim Yeong-ok', null, 'Korean emperor Lee Gon tries to close the doors to a parallel world which was opened by demons; a detective tries to protect the people and the one she loves.', 'Korean emperor Lee Gon tries to close the doors to a parallel world which was opened by demons; a detective tries to protect the people and the one she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SLlbkzOJb8v9wXVYIcqozx2hxe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93846'),
  ('1074329532585874207', 'The King''s Affection', 2021, 'Drama', 'Han Hee-jung', 'Han Hee-jung', 'Park Eun-bin, Rowoon, Nam Yoon-su, Bae Yoon-kyung, Choi Byung-chan, Lee Pil-mo, Baek Hyun-joo, Ko Kyu-pil', 'TV-14', 'When the crown prince is killed, his twin sister assumes the throne while trying to keep her identity and affection for her first love a royal secret.', 'When the crown prince is killed, his twin sister assumes the throne while trying to keep her identity and affection for her first love a royal secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Qim2grFzfNJ4h3QSTzxi8CsKdG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129478'),
  ('483306737787052194', 'The King''s Avatar', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Hudie Lan', null, 'Ajie, Tong Xinzhu, Qiao Shiyu, Ching Ip, Wei Chao, Titus Jin, Su Shangqing, Baomu Zhongyang', null, 'In the multiplayer online game Glory, Ye Xiu is regarded as a textbook and a top-tier pro-player. However, due to a myriad of reasons, he is kicked from the team. After leaving the pro scene, he finds work in an Internet Cafe as a manager. When Glory launches its tenth server, he throws himself in to the game once more. Possessing ten years of experience, the memories of his past, and an incomplete, self-made weapon, his return along the road to the summit begins!', 'In the multiplayer online game Glory, Ye Xiu is regarded as a textbook and a top-tier pro-player. However, due to a myriad of reasons, he is kicked from the team. After leaving the pro scene, he finds work in an Internet Cafe as a manager. When Glory launches its tenth server, he throws himself in to the game once more. Possessing ten years of experience, the memories of his past, and an incomplete, self-made weapon, his return along the road to the summit begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVEAM1xYLnvNRi8xeUnJCnLERIN.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71194'),
  ('1099206158364937028', 'The King''s Avatar', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Qiao Bing Qing', 'Yang Yang, Maggie Jiang, Daisy Li, Lai Yumeng, Jiang Long, Lai Yi, Fan Jinwei, Sun Ning', null, 'When an elite gamer is forced out of his professional team, he becomes a manager of an Internet café and reinvents himself to return to online glory.', 'When an elite gamer is forced out of his professional team, he becomes a manager of an Internet café and reinvents himself to return to online glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmSxnAQ0YeQKh3Rm2VwqKZhkTt6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91470'),
  ('1033606198622836894', 'The King''s Face', 2014, 'Drama, History', null, null, 'Seo In-guk, Jo Yoon-hee, Lee Sung-jae, Shin Sung-rok, Ahn Suk-hwan, Im Ji-eun, Kim Gyu-ri, Go Won-hee', null, 'Since Kwanghae was born from a concubine and only appointed as Crown Prince in a desperate measure, many dissatisfied officials from Northerner faction often plotted for his assassination and dethronement for 16 years. He also often quarreled with his father, King Seonjo, especially regarding Kim Ga Hee. Both son and father will fight against each other in favor of her. However, he eventually managed to overcome the obstacles by the help of Physiognomist, Kim Do Chi and become the next king. Meanwhile, Gwiin Kim is King Seonjo’s royal concubine.', 'Since Kwanghae was born from a concubine and only appointed as Crown Prince in a desperate measure, many dissatisfied officials from Northerner faction often plotted for his assassination and dethronement for 16 years. He also often quarreled with his father, King Seonjo, especially regarding Kim Ga Hee. Both son and father will fight against each other in favor of her. However, he eventually managed to overcome the obstacles by the help of Physiognomist, Kim Do Chi and become the next king. Meanwhile, Gwiin Kim is King Seonjo’s royal concubine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgtH6WjKeELPr6VIskv10al0usz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61830'),
  ('739813260345643784', 'The King''s Woman', 2017, 'Drama', null, '진혜여', 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Vin Zhang, Liu Chang, Li Tai, Natalie Zhang, Wang Ting, Sabrina Qiu, Wang Tonghui', null, 'Gong Sunli is the grand-daughter and disciple of military commander Gong Sunyu. Jing Ke and Li have been in love with each other since they were children. While trying to protect Li during an attack, Jing Ke is poisoned. Li’s beauty has seized the interest of the Qin Emperor, Ying Zheng, and Li agrees to marry him to save Jing Ke.', 'Gong Sunli is the grand-daughter and disciple of military commander Gong Sunyu. Jing Ke and Li have been in love with each other since they were children. While trying to protect Li during an attack, Jing Ke is poisoned. Li’s beauty has seized the interest of the Qin Emperor, Ying Zheng, and Li agrees to marry him to save Jing Ke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2w4iIlTZWKz10giIjMtgaGIQiZ8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72487'),
  ('631982473833095694', 'The Kingdom', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Lars von Trier', 'Lars von Trier', 'Søren Pilmark, Ghita Nørby, Birgitte Raaberg, Peter Mygind, Solbjørg Højfeldt, Udo Kier, Birthe Neumann, Henning Jensen', 'TV-MA', 'The Kingdom is the most technologically advanced hospital in Denmark, a gleaming bastion of medical science. A rash of uncanny occurrences, however, begins to weaken the staff''s faith in science – a phantom ambulance pulls in every night, but disappears; voices echo in the elevator shaft; and a pregnant doctor''s fetus seems to be developing much faster than is natural.', 'The Kingdom is the most technologically advanced hospital in Denmark, a gleaming bastion of medical science. A rash of uncanny occurrences, however, begins to weaken the staff''s faith in science – a phantom ambulance pulls in every night, but disappears; voices echo in the elevator shaft; and a pregnant doctor''s fetus seems to be developing much faster than is natural.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Z0Hc9o6HIydmGOHok2e4FoWhXD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4267'),
  ('1081249819661196384', 'The Kingdom', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Claudia Piñeiro, Marcelo Piñeyro', null, 'Diego Peretti', 'TV-MA', 'After his running mate''s murder, a controversial televangelist becomes Argentina''s presidential candidate. But nothing about him is as holy as he seems.', 'After his running mate''s murder, a controversial televangelist becomes Argentina''s presidential candidate. But nothing about him is as holy as he seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1P8oDpDUb3mDtz2bFYwSQeTupiu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:130364'),
  ('547801445702606633', 'The Kingdom', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Patrick Mahomes, Travis Kelce, Andy Reid, Chris Jones, Isiah Pacheco, Clark Hunt, George Karlaftis, Trent McDuffie', 'TV-MA', 'In 2024, the two-time defending champion Kansas City Chiefs aimed to make history by becoming the first NFL team to win three straight Super Bowls. "The Kingdom" – a new six-part ESPN Original Series – chronicles the Chiefs’ dramatic pursuit of a three-peat, the legacy of the franchise, and the unforgettable characters who built its modern-day football dynasty.', 'In 2024, the two-time defending champion Kansas City Chiefs aimed to make history by becoming the first NFL team to win three straight Super Bowls. "The Kingdom" – a new six-part ESPN Original Series – chronicles the Chiefs’ dramatic pursuit of a three-peat, the legacy of the franchise, and the unforgettable characters who built its modern-day football dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TNOPyT73MLAkILou5QgRMTuA9k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287609'),
  ('834044761604380782', 'The Kingdom of the Wind', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Choi Wan-gyu, Park Jin-Woo', 'Song Il-gook, Choi Jung-won, Kim Jung-hwa, Park Gun-hyung, Jung Jin-young, Lee Si-young, Jin Hee Kim, Kim Hye-seong', 'NR', 'The Kingdom of The Wind, also known as The Land of The Wind, is a 2008 South Korean historial drama, broadcast on KBS from 10 September 2008 to 15 January 2009. It was directed by Kang Il-soo, written by Choi Wan-gyu, Jung Jin-ok, Park Jin-woo; adapted from manhwa by Kim Jin.', 'The Kingdom of The Wind, also known as The Land of The Wind, is a 2008 South Korean historial drama, broadcast on KBS from 10 September 2008 to 15 January 2009. It was directed by Kang Il-soo, written by Choi Wan-gyu, Jung Jin-ok, Park Jin-woo; adapted from manhwa by Kim Jin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRJzWr8PhiHOUVLAqQOPc80pRih.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38932'),
  ('914084961688558173', 'The Kingdoms of Ruin', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaito Ishikawa, Azumi Waki, Ryoko Shiraishi, Satoshi Hino, Hikaru Tono, Kisho Taniyama', 'TV-14', 'Witches were once respected for the wisdom and magic they gifted to humans. But with the rise of the Gear Expansion era, the new science community deemed them as enemies who hindered the progress of society. Thus began the slaughter of all witches, including one who had mentored a human boy named Adonis. After witnessing her death, Adonis vows to bring bloodshed and terror to the human race.', 'Witches were once respected for the wisdom and magic they gifted to humans. But with the rise of the Gear Expansion era, the new science community deemed them as enemies who hindered the progress of society. Thus began the slaughter of all witches, including one who had mentored a human boy named Adonis. After witnessing her death, Adonis vows to bring bloodshed and terror to the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHSFGSZFR1VH3nG5x48gImWePeL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219673'),
  ('554083573008899625', 'The Kings', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Roberto Durán, Marvin Hagler, Thomas Hearns, Sugar Ray Leonard', null, 'A four-part series featuring four champions who ushered in a boxing renaissance. The series showcases the dominance of Roberto Duran, Marvelous Marvin Hagler, Thomas Hearns and Sugar Ray Leonard and their battles in and out of the ring.', 'A four-part series featuring four champions who ushered in a boxing renaissance. The series showcases the dominance of Roberto Duran, Marvelous Marvin Hagler, Thomas Hearns and Sugar Ray Leonard and their battles in and out of the ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDiqDkx4Ej9dYSK1djOAlMW3wq5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126954'),
  ('299181177333248912', 'The Kings of Tupelo: A Southern Crime Saga', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Paul Kevin Curtis, Laura Curtis, Jimmy Blaylock, Elois Curtis, Steve Holland, Jim H. Johnson, Jack Curtis, Karen Delray Thornton', 'TV-MA', 'An Elvis impersonator''s conspiracy theory sets off a feud that spirals into an attempted presidential assassination.', 'An Elvis impersonator''s conspiracy theory sets off a feud that spirals into an attempted presidential assassination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsAMK2p6hzEvxQLHgkj0AGyl6RR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:277789'),
  ('19193778915672889', 'The Kirlian Frequency', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Cristian Ponce, Hernán Bengoa', null, 'Nicolás van de Moortele', 'TV-14', 'In the midnight hour, a lone DJ broadcasts the strangest and scariest tales from the outer edges of Kirlian, a lost city somewhere in Argentina.', 'In the midnight hour, a lone DJ broadcasts the strangest and scariest tales from the outer edges of Kirlian, a lost city somewhere in Argentina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdZWEWtasVgG6wU0YiYZyt57FgR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86825'),
  ('364982033863051682', 'The Kitchen', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vasily Kutsenko, Igor Tudvasev, Dimitry Jan', null, 'Dmitri Nazarov, Dmitriy Nagiev, Sergey Epishev, Olga Kuzmina, Viktor Horinyak, Marina Mogilevskaya, Sergey Lavygin, Mikhail Tarabukin', null, 'Maksim "Max" Lavrov wants to become a great chef. But he finds out that the kitchen isn''t the place for an easy career. And at restaurant "Claude Monet," this job looks to be harder and much more complicated than just cooking.', 'Maksim "Max" Lavrov wants to become a great chef. But he finds out that the kitchen isn''t the place for an easy career. And at restaurant "Claude Monet," this job looks to be harder and much more complicated than just cooking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swsQXJvk5mgYyp4tJGj6YKQcj13.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:45994'),
  ('1055718499883828685', 'The Kitchen', 2014, 'Reality, Family, Talk, Drama', null, null, 'Sunny Anderson, Katie Lee Biegel, Jeff Mauro, Marcela Valladolid, Geoffrey Zakarian, Alex Guarnaschelli', 'TV-G', 'Spend a fun and food-filled morning in The Kitchen with hosts Sunny Anderson, Katie Lee, Jeff Mauro, Marcela Valladolid, and Geoffrey Zakarian. From simple supper ideas, food trend discussions, and family meal tips to trivia games and viewer questions, they''ll cover all things fun in food.', 'Spend a fun and food-filled morning in The Kitchen with hosts Sunny Anderson, Katie Lee, Jeff Mauro, Marcela Valladolid, and Geoffrey Zakarian. From simple supper ideas, food trend discussions, and family meal tips to trivia games and viewer questions, they''ll cover all things fun in food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/G2PN9AnF4DqQVenuFabUqtW4hS.jpg', 40, 'tmdb:tv:62128'),
  ('158347852134567613', 'The Kitchen. War for the Hotel', 2019, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Dmitriy Nagiev, Dmitri Nazarov, Elena Ksenofontova, Grigorij Sijatvinda, Vladislav Tsenev, Aleksey Grishin, Yuliya Frants, Olga Vasilieva', null, 'Having suffered a fiasco in the hotel business and saying goodbye to the Eleon Hotel, Eleanor retreats to Tuscany. Everything changes when the ex-fiance Dmitry Nagiyev, who is guilty of her bankruptcy, begins construction of the grandiose Resort complex in Sochi. To take revenge on the showman for all the insults, Eleanor buys a hotel that Nagiyev has his eye on, hires her ex-husband, chef Viktor Barinov, their daughter Katya and manager Mikhail Dzhekovich.', 'Having suffered a fiasco in the hotel business and saying goodbye to the Eleon Hotel, Eleanor retreats to Tuscany. Everything changes when the ex-fiance Dmitry Nagiyev, who is guilty of her bankruptcy, begins construction of the grandiose Resort complex in Sochi. To take revenge on the showman for all the insults, Eleanor buys a hotel that Nagiyev has his eye on, hires her ex-husband, chef Viktor Barinov, their daughter Katya and manager Mikhail Dzhekovich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jxhWBU76lSR4NO9rr3Tf3ePaZ4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95910'),
  ('58098549938284432', 'The Kite', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Liu Yunlong', 'Yang Jian', 'Liu Yunlong, Luo Haiqiong, Li Xiaoran, Qi Huan, Li Bin', null, 'Zheng Yao-Xian is a CCP spy code-named Kite and lurks in the Nationalist secret service.', 'Zheng Yao-Xian is a CCP spy code-named Kite and lurks in the Nationalist secret service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYJ3aaGMXWLdO8MxPdaHSH8hwUJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75956'),
  ('1134336689090644298', 'The Klutzy Class Monitor and the Girl with the Short Skirt', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Riko Akechi, Junya Enoki, Hayato Dojima, Jun Fukuyama, Yuina Ito, Ayaka Fukuhara, Yuhko Kaida, Tetsu Inada', null, 'Every morning, Sakuradaimon-kun enforces the rules at the school gate, stopping Poem-chan for her too-short skirt. But when they’re thrown together in remedial class, she discovers his secret—the serious, uptight Sakuradaimon-kun is hopeless at studying! As they clash, bicker, and stumble through school life together, the two opposites slowly draw closer and form an unexpected friendship.', 'Every morning, Sakuradaimon-kun enforces the rules at the school gate, stopping Poem-chan for her too-short skirt. But when they’re thrown together in remedial class, she discovers his secret—the serious, uptight Sakuradaimon-kun is hopeless at studying! As they clash, bicker, and stumble through school life together, the two opposites slowly draw closer and form an unexpected friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2BbxAm4O6UgEXauSnnmI0ppwR8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:288551'),
  ('579408180861174169', 'The Knick', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jack Amiel, Michael Begler', null, 'Clive Owen, Charles Aitken, André Holland, Jeremy Bobb, Juliet Rylance, Eve Hewson, Eric Johnson, Michael Angarano', 'TV-MA', 'Set in downtown New York in 1900, ''The Knick'' is centered on the Knickerbocker Hospital and its staff, notably Dr. John Thackery, the hospital''s brilliant chief surgeon who pushes medicine''s boundaries, pioneering new procedures despite a severe drug addiction.', 'Set in downtown New York in 1900, ''The Knick'' is centered on the Knickerbocker Hospital and its staff, notably Dr. John Thackery, the hospital''s brilliant chief surgeon who pushes medicine''s boundaries, pioneering new procedures despite a severe drug addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeEqDSIVOi6q0GcZj8L9Q6G7fGC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61014'),
  ('205044657037354428', 'The Knight', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Clara Cleymans, Dahlia Pessemiers, Michaël Pas, Michael Vergauwen, Lucas Van den Eynde, Lynn Van Royen, Louis Talpe, Joris Van den Brande', null, 'De Ridder is a Flemish crime series that is broadcasted by the network één since 2013. The series is set in the court of Ghent where Helena De Ridder, played by Clara Cleymans, is a public prosecutor.', 'De Ridder is a Flemish crime series that is broadcasted by the network één since 2013. The series is set in the court of Ghent where Helena De Ridder, played by Clara Cleymans, is a public prosecutor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v03ZGbL4hIYq4vzrAtnOifLWK8w.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61554'),
  ('956451643520707157', 'The Knight in the Area', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shizuka Itoh, Yuko Sanpei, Jun Fukuyama, Akira Ishida, Takehito Koyasu, Atsushi Kakehashi, Noriko Hidaka, Shin-ichiro Miki', null, 'Kakeru and Suguru are brothers who both have a flaming passion for soccer. However, while Suguru becomes a rising star in the Japanese youth soccer system, Kakeru decides to take on a managerial role after struggling on the field. But due to a cruel twist of fate, Kakeru ends up reevaluating the role he has chosen. In hopes of one day being able to enter the World Cup by becoming a member of the national team, Kakeru trains harder than anyone else. He isn’t alone in this quest for glory, though. Kakeru''s childhood friend, Nana, is a soccer prodigy of her own, with the wicked nickname “Little Witch”. She is a top-ranked player and is already playing for Nadeshiko Japan, the Japanese women’s national team. Nana''s success gives Kakeru the extra push he needs to reach for his goals.', 'Kakeru and Suguru are brothers who both have a flaming passion for soccer. However, while Suguru becomes a rising star in the Japanese youth soccer system, Kakeru decides to take on a managerial role after struggling on the field. But due to a cruel twist of fate, Kakeru ends up reevaluating the role he has chosen. In hopes of one day being able to enter the World Cup by becoming a member of the national team, Kakeru trains harder than anyone else. He isn’t alone in this quest for glory, though. Kakeru''s childhood friend, Nana, is a soccer prodigy of her own, with the wicked nickname “Little Witch”. She is a top-ranked player and is already playing for Nadeshiko Japan, the Japanese women’s national team. Nana''s success gives Kakeru the extra push he needs to reach for his goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIclZ7srQb4bi7WOb4ZKGXWd3VP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45186'),
  ('679124074866992955', 'The Knockout', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, 'Junyi Zhu', 'Zhang Yi, Zhang Songwen, Li Yitong, Zhang Zhijian, Ni Dahong, Han Tongsheng, Li Jianyi, Shi Zhaoqi', null, '20 years of perseverance, hot-blooded teenagers finally become the people''s hero.', '20 years of perseverance, hot-blooded teenagers finally become the people''s hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SIY6lVRZ9W1C4GU3Dvi3l4MSFs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210757'),
  ('86494875821585222', 'The Kollective', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Leonardo Fasoli, Maddalena Ravagli, Femke Wolting', null, 'Natascha McElhone, Céline Buckens, Felix Mayr, Gregg Sulkin, Grégory Montel, Gijs Blom, Karel Roden, Cassiopée Mayance', 'TV-MA', 'After a sudden tragedy, a group of intrepid young citizen journalists find themselves sucked into a web of government lies and corruption.', 'After a sudden tragedy, a group of intrepid young citizen journalists find themselves sucked into a web of government lies and corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqCDLvhm7czEf739tiwganFK23t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292664'),
  ('794397063436957721', 'The Kominsky Method', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chuck Lorre', null, 'Michael Douglas, Sarah Baker, Nancy Travis, Kathleen Turner', 'TV-MA', 'Acting coach Sandy Kominsky and best friend Norman Newlander keep each other laughing as they navigate the ups and downs of getting older.', 'Acting coach Sandy Kominsky and best friend Norman Newlander keep each other laughing as they navigate the ups and downs of getting older.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnK8b6bNl1koSthTGbzgMPnh7Ky.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:81290'),
