  ('593267281171212149', 'The L Word', 2004, 'Drama, Soap', 'Ilene Chaiken', null, 'Jennifer Beals, Kate Moennig, Mia Kirshner, Leisha Hailey, Laurel Holloman, Daniel Sea, Pam Grier, Rose Rollins', 'TV-MA', 'A group of lesbian friends struggle with romance and careers in Los Angeles.', 'A group of lesbian friends struggle with romance and careers in Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuBhtv4P5nY9loJ6kXb1hsyc9EA.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:3475'),
  ('896274202379454980', 'The L Word: Generation Q', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ilene Chaiken', null, 'Jennifer Beals, Kate Moennig, Leisha Hailey, Arienne Mandi, Leo Sheng, Jacqueline Toboni, Rosanny Zayas, Sepideh Moafi', 'TV-MA', 'In this sequel to The L Word, we continue to follow the intermingled lives of Bette Porter, Alice Pieszecki and Shane McCutcheon, along with a new generation of diverse, self-possessed LGBTQIA+ characters experiencing love, heartbreak, sex, setbacks and success in L.A.', 'In this sequel to The L Word, we continue to follow the intermingled lives of Bette Porter, Alice Pieszecki and Shane McCutcheon, along with a new generation of diverse, self-possessed LGBTQIA+ characters experiencing love, heartbreak, sex, setbacks and success in L.A.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riq4xVG3FflKAB7JlIQPs9bkFw5.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:89630'),
  ('1012027150323713208', 'The L.A. Complex', 2012, 'Soap, Drama', 'Martin Gero', null, 'Jonathan Patrick Moore, Joe Dinicol, Andra Fuller, Cassie Steele, Michael Levinson, Georgina Reilly, Jewel Staite', 'TV-14', 'Six young performers having been dubbed “most likely to succeed” in their hometowns now face the challenges and opportunities of a lifetime in the City of Angels.', 'Six young performers having been dubbed “most likely to succeed” in their hometowns now face the challenges and opportunities of a lifetime in the City of Angels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dD0QtR3RIjM84nIh0OqceAj972q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:43197'),
  ('172654348434407833', 'The Ladder of Love', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Rui, Zhang Meng, Zhou Tingwei, Huo Zhengyan, Yang Chengcheng, Zhang Weina, Dilraba Dilmurat, Ying Haoming', null, 'Being a wealthy heir is not always without hardships. Zhang Hao Tian is the heir of a large corporation who faces conspiracies all around him from those who want to bring him down. Although his heart belongs to the sweet Chen Qiu Yan, Hao Tian is entrapped into marrying Song Zi Han while Luo Shan is helpless to stop it. Meanwhile, Hao Tian’s college friends, Lu Feng and Chu Yao Hui, each face their own challenges as they try to pursue their own happiness in life.', 'Being a wealthy heir is not always without hardships. Zhang Hao Tian is the heir of a large corporation who faces conspiracies all around him from those who want to bring him down. Although his heart belongs to the sweet Chen Qiu Yan, Hao Tian is entrapped into marrying Song Zi Han while Luo Shan is helpless to stop it. Meanwhile, Hao Tian’s college friends, Lu Feng and Chu Yao Hui, each face their own challenges as they try to pursue their own happiness in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDwwe0MRXGhIHOw4HjPLXLFogT5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90709'),
  ('379490145335335898', 'The Ladies'' Paradise', 2015, 'Comedy, Soap, Drama', null, null, 'Valentina Ghelfi, Francesca Del Fa, Roberto Farnesi, Pietro Masotti, Filippo Scarafia, Gloria Radulescu, Elia Marangon, Simone Montedoro', 'NR', 'Follow Teresa Iorio, a young woman who leaves her rural Sicilian hometown for Milan to find work--and much more--at a newly opened department store: The Ladies'' Paradise.', 'Follow Teresa Iorio, a young woman who leaves her rural Sicilian hometown for Milan to find work--and much more--at a newly opened department store: The Ladies'' Paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XKjPCtprWqjKhTiyYORVwgWePA.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:73362'),
  ('852579938726318210', 'The Lady and the Dale', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Elizabeth Carmichael, Susan Stryker', 'TV-14', 'This documentary series explores an audacious 1970s auto scam centered around mysterious transgender entrepreneur Elizabeth Carmichael, who rose to prominence when she released the Dale, a fuel-efficient three-wheeled vehicle during the 1970s gas crisis.', 'This documentary series explores an audacious 1970s auto scam centered around mysterious transgender entrepreneur Elizabeth Carmichael, who rose to prominence when she released the Dale, a fuel-efficient three-wheeled vehicle during the 1970s gas crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crMJcKrkrVLPhWU69AgxMB8LFtY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116111'),
  ('1040237519187991692', 'The Lady from Vendaval', 2012, 'Soap, Drama', 'Camilo Hernandez, Gabriela Ortigosa, Antonio Abascal', null, 'Ariadne Díaz, José Ron, Florencia de Saracho, Thelma Madrigal, María Marcela, Jaume Mateu, José Carlos Farrera, Agustín Arana', 'TV-14', 'La Mujer Del Vendaval is a 2012 Mexican telenovela produced by Mapat L. de Zatarain for Televisa. It is a remake of the Venezuelan telenovela Un Esposo para Estela. Ariadne Díaz and José Ron star as the main protagonists, while Chantal Andere, Marco Muñoz, Manuel Flaco Ibañez and Florencia del Saracho as the main antagonists.', 'La Mujer Del Vendaval is a 2012 Mexican telenovela produced by Mapat L. de Zatarain for Televisa. It is a remake of the Venezuelan telenovela Un Esposo para Estela. Ariadne Díaz and José Ron star as the main protagonists, while Chantal Andere, Marco Muñoz, Manuel Flaco Ibañez and Florencia del Saracho as the main antagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ep2Xr4CC6foyFnVrGMEDmwGrVUC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46926'),
  ('988827288268414', 'The Lady in Dignity', 2017, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Baek Mi-kyoung', 'Kim Hee-seon, Kim Seon-a, Jung Sang-hoon, Lee Ki-woo, Kim Yong-geon, Jung Da-hye, Lee Tae-im, Oh Yeon-ah', null, 'Woo Ah-Jin lives a luxurious life due to her wealthy father-in-law, but her father-in-law''s finances become decimated and her husband betrays her. Woo Ah-Jin''s life hits rock bottom. Park Bok-Ja is a mysterious woman and she hides her heartbreaking story. She brings about fierce hardship on Woo Ah-Jin.', 'Woo Ah-Jin lives a luxurious life due to her wealthy father-in-law, but her father-in-law''s finances become decimated and her husband betrays her. Woo Ah-Jin''s life hits rock bottom. Park Bok-Ja is a mysterious woman and she hides her heartbreaking story. She brings about fierce hardship on Woo Ah-Jin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7UKAlTPRcLA93VAedVzQ9GX2y8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71497'),
  ('251091051309992972', 'The Lady In The Cubicle', 2014, 'Drama', null, null, 'Nathan Lee, Ron Ng Cheuk-Hai, Tang Yan, Monica Mok Siu-Kei, Zhang Xiyuan, Jiang Bing, Tang Qun, Ren Quan', null, 'Adapted from the novel of the same name, The Lady in the Cubicle describes the life of white-collar worker Tan Bin, who is approaching the dreaded thirtieth birthday. As she struggles with challenges in work and love, particularly when she becomes involved with her superior Cheng Ruimin, she uncovers the real meaning of true happiness. The drama will also revolve around the lives of two other career women: Mini, who is Tan Bin’s constant rival, and Jessica, a pampered young woman who has just entered the workforce.', 'Adapted from the novel of the same name, The Lady in the Cubicle describes the life of white-collar worker Tan Bin, who is approaching the dreaded thirtieth birthday. As she struggles with challenges in work and love, particularly when she becomes involved with her superior Cheng Ruimin, she uncovers the real meaning of true happiness. The drama will also revolve around the lives of two other career women: Mini, who is Tan Bin’s constant rival, and Jessica, a pampered young woman who has just entered the workforce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpXc2qoCrLd2vkAGjyHCvjMbLuO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86068'),
  ('910136731368559729', 'The Lady Musketeer', 2004, 'Action & Adventure', 'Steve Boyum, Sandra Weintraub', 'Sandra Weintraub', 'Susie Amy, Gérard Depardieu, Nastassja Kinski, Michael York, Christopher Cazenove, John Rhys-Davies, Allan Corduner, Caspar Zafer', null, 'When the bride-to-be of King Louis XIV is kidnapped, the sons of the original three musketeers rally to rescue her. Much to their surprise, a fourth musketeer joins the fray. And this brilliant swordsman—the most gifted of the lot—turns out to be D''Artagnan''s daughter.', 'When the bride-to-be of King Louis XIV is kidnapped, the sons of the original three musketeers rally to rescue her. Much to their surprise, a fourth musketeer joins the fray. And this brilliant swordsman—the most gifted of the lot—turns out to be D''Artagnan''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeJHYjm68q1Wkps10j9anFomGLM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76518'),
  ('132908869272094428', 'The Lady of Iron', 1991, null, null, 'Sandy Shaw Lai-King', 'Ha Yue, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Lee Ji-Kei, Candy Man, Amy Wu Mei-Yee, Kwok Tak-San, Choi Kwok-Hing', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6D7HSS2CeCRcJcZQrJAPlqUwe7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109195'),
  ('375537065473578881', 'The Lady with the Black Veil', 2015, 'Drama', 'Carmine Elia', null, 'Miriam Leone, Giusy Frallonardo, Lino Guanciale, Andrea Bosca, Germano Bellavia, Lucrezia Lante della Rovere, Paolo Mazzarelli, Francesco Salvi', null, 'Clara is a young and noblewoman with a free and rebellious spirit who was separated from her twin brother and forced into an arranged marriage. Despite this, she falls in love with her husband and fights to win his love. Clara however, falls victim to her aunt’s and cousin’s conspiracies, as they are determined to steal her inheritance.', 'Clara is a young and noblewoman with a free and rebellious spirit who was separated from her twin brother and forced into an arranged marriage. Despite this, she falls in love with her husband and fights to win his love. Clara however, falls victim to her aunt’s and cousin’s conspiracies, as they are determined to steal her inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4GIuKFfqhA7INdfKTTUiABmhmY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63309'),
  ('939958668461703591', 'The Lady''s Companion', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gema R. Neira, María José Rustarazo', null, 'Nadia de Santiago, Álvaro Mel, Isa Montalbán, Zoe Bonafonte, Iratxe Emparan', 'TV-MA', 'Hired to find husbands for three wealthy sisters, chaperone Elena Bianda is drawn into a late 19th-century world of love, scandal and comic intrigue.', 'Hired to find husbands for three wealthy sisters, chaperone Elena Bianda is drawn into a late 19th-century world of love, scandal and comic intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3C4MQlp0yWyVErSGVzHBObvFbMX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280890'),
  ('724487110949354972', 'The Lair', 2007, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Fred Olen Ray', null, 'David Shae, Colton Ford, Brian Nolan, Peter Stickles, Dylan Vox, Frankie Valenti, Jake Manabat, Beverly Lynne', 'TV-MA', 'The Lair is an American gay-themed vampire television series produced by here! in 2007. The first season, consisting of six episodes, wrapped production in January of that year. The first two episodes premiered on June 1, 2007. Season 2, consisting of 9 episodes debuted on September 5, 2008. A third season of 13 episodes was announced in September 2008 and Colton Ford confirmed that filming took place in October and November 2008. Season 3 premiered September 4, 2009. All three seasons also currently air online at Gay.com.', 'The Lair is an American gay-themed vampire television series produced by here! in 2007. The first season, consisting of six episodes, wrapped production in January of that year. The first two episodes premiered on June 1, 2007. Season 2, consisting of 9 episodes debuted on September 5, 2008. A third season of 13 episodes was announced in September 2008 and Colton Ford confirmed that filming took place in October and November 2008. Season 3 premiered September 4, 2009. All three seasons also currently air online at Gay.com.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTCIB5kfrvQRmFhSWZPYGRoKaaP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4811'),
  ('1096902695252466359', 'The Lair: OnlyFangs', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'William Clift', 'Emrhys Cooper, Ernest Pierce, Jhon Mejía, Andrew Cereghino, Charlie Harding, Enrique Sapene, Hunter Nance, Mel England', 'TV-MA', 'In this thrilling revival of Here TV''s iconic series "The Lair," gay vampires and gay werewolves clash in an electrifying war for dominance in modern-day Hollywood. Prepare for a riveting saga of bloodlust and moonlit mayhem as these supernatural factions vie for control in the heart of Tinseltown.', 'In this thrilling revival of Here TV''s iconic series "The Lair," gay vampires and gay werewolves clash in an electrifying war for dominance in modern-day Hollywood. Prepare for a riveting saga of bloodlust and moonlit mayhem as these supernatural factions vie for control in the heart of Tinseltown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMyafCkswaeUQpmrX0Ovh2adloO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243882'),
  ('617670913186533389', 'The Lake', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julian Doucet', null, 'Jon Dore, Travis Nelson, Carolyn Scott, Declan Whaley, Natalie Lisinska, Terry Chen, Brielle Robillard, Kaitlyn Bernard', 'TV-14', 'After returning from abroad after a break-up with his long-term partner, Justin plans to connect with his teenage daughter he gave up for adoption. His plans to make new memories with his daughter at the family cottage go awry when he discovers his parents left it to his picture-perfect step-sister, Maisy-May.', 'After returning from abroad after a break-up with his long-term partner, Justin plans to connect with his teenage daughter he gave up for adoption. His plans to make new memories with his daughter at the family cottage go awry when he discovers his parents left it to his picture-perfect step-sister, Maisy-May.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucCICS60CK5tfA50BXoQbEf8rKN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:158051'),
  ('1006102197368870882', 'The Lake Erie Murders', 2018, 'Crime, Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Jeremy Bobb', null, 'Lake Erie is home to some of North America’s darkest and deadliest murder cases. Dive deep into its most notorious mysteries and hear insight from the detectives working on the frontline of these shocking investigations.', 'Lake Erie is home to some of North America’s darkest and deadliest murder cases. Dive deep into its most notorious mysteries and hear insight from the detectives working on the frontline of these shocking investigations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAQSozNEhuSaqJKmVdyoMPqltI8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86217'),
  ('503438887549796297', 'The Lakes', 1997, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Jimmy McGovern', null, 'John Simm, Charles Dale, Kaye Wragg, Elizabeth Bennett, Robert Pugh, Mary Jo Randle, Paul Copley, James Thornton', null, 'The Lakes is a mystery drama created and written by Jimmy McGovern for BBC1. The first series – comprised of four episodes – broadcast from 14 September to 5 October 1997. A second series of ten episodes ran from 10 January to 14 March 1999. Danny Kavanagh leaves Liverpool for the Lake District, finding work at a hotel and love with a local girl named Emma. Yet Danny remains an outsider in the close-knit community, and through the machinations of fate, he finds himself implicated in a tragedy. The secrets, lies, and crimes, of the seemingly tranquil community continue to be revealed.', 'The Lakes is a mystery drama created and written by Jimmy McGovern for BBC1. The first series – comprised of four episodes – broadcast from 14 September to 5 October 1997. A second series of ten episodes ran from 10 January to 14 March 1999. Danny Kavanagh leaves Liverpool for the Lake District, finding work at a hotel and love with a local girl named Emma. Yet Danny remains an outsider in the close-knit community, and through the machinations of fate, he finds himself implicated in a tragedy. The secrets, lies, and crimes, of the seemingly tranquil community continue to be revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPCYCwke0VK1ILpVTYZsqRu1722.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3627'),
  ('77089789326363629', 'The Land Before Time', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tony Geiss, Charles Grosvenor, Judy Freudberg', null, 'Aria Noelle Curzon, Jeff Bennett, Anndi McAfee, Rob Paulsen, Max Burkholder, Anthony Skillman, Cody Arens, Meghan Strange', 'TV-G', 'Follow young dinosaurs Littlefoot, Cera, Spike, Ducky and Petrie, on their first journey together - an exciting quest to find the lush, legendary Great Valley.', 'Follow young dinosaurs Littlefoot, Cera, Spike, Ducky and Petrie, on their first journey together - an exciting quest to find the lush, legendary Great Valley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4eUTWcyh5U62Y26HkALQQjdwMF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3817'),
  ('440023430324637133', 'The Land of the Cyclops', 2021, 'Talk', null, null, 'Christopher Garplind', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RdT6wPcTBlIAMEnf78fuY8AnTc.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:153663'),
  ('346687957282353284', 'The Land of Warriors', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Tang Jia San Shao', null, 'Zhou Yiran, Zhang Yuxi, Chen Muchi, Kong Xue''er, Ding Jiayi, Zhou Jingbo, Cao Zishuo', null, 'After the final match of the Continental Advanced Soul Master Academy Elite Tournament, Tang San and his friends reluctantly bid each other farewell, promising to reunite in five years. They then set off on their separate life journeys until Bibi Dong from the Spirit Hall secretly plotted to dominate the Douluo Continent by sweeping away the major sects. In response, Tang San gathered his friends to establish the Tang Sect, committed to the pursuit of justice and determined to shoulder the heavy responsibility.', 'After the final match of the Continental Advanced Soul Master Academy Elite Tournament, Tang San and his friends reluctantly bid each other farewell, promising to reunite in five years. They then set off on their separate life journeys until Bibi Dong from the Spirit Hall secretly plotted to dominate the Douluo Continent by sweeping away the major sects. In response, Tang San gathered his friends to establish the Tang Sect, committed to the pursuit of justice and determined to shoulder the heavy responsibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fbdoK5xw7BOuUPVHnoYqviNMPf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:277520'),
  ('1041883599395880798', 'The Lane Way', 2026, 'Kids, Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Blossom Lane', null, 'Blossom Lane, Chance Lane, Stormi Lane, Lil Champ, Sophia Carter', null, '"The Lane Way is an award-winning, high-energy animated musical series created to empower and educate the next generation. The show stars 12-year-old prodigy Blossom Lane as the voice of Bloom, a bright and ambitious girl who uses ''Manual Magic''—the power of her voice and heart—to solve problems and celebrate her community."', '"The Lane Way is an award-winning, high-energy animated musical series created to empower and educate the next generation. The show stars 12-year-old prodigy Blossom Lane as the voice of Bloom, a bright and ambitious girl who uses ''Manual Magic''—the power of her voice and heart—to solve problems and celebrate her community."', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:316853'),
  ('26904913924102605', 'The Langoliers', 1995, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Stephen King', 'Tom Holland', 'Patricia Wettig, Dean Stockwell, Kate Maberly, David Morse, Bronson Pinchot, Mark Lindsay Chapman, Frankie Faison, Christopher Collet', null, 'A jet leaves on a red-eye flight from Los Angeles to Boston. But early in the flight, ten passengers awaken to a startling realization: All of the other passengers have vanished.', 'A jet leaves on a red-eye flight from Los Angeles to Boston. But early in the flight, ten passengers awaken to a startling realization: All of the other passengers have vanished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcySnh6hHc98G94dF8sXNJuD0Rp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18197'),
  ('1012747798276858514', 'The Larkins', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Bradley Walsh, Joanna Scanlan, Liam Middleton, Lydia Page, Lola Shepelev, Francesca Wilson Waterworth, Tok Stephen, Amelia Bullmore', null, 'Set in the late 1950’s, The Larkins follows the golden-hearted wheeler dealer Pop Larkin and his wife Ma, together with their six children, including the beautiful Mariette, as they bask in their idyllic and beautiful patch of paradise in Kent.', 'Set in the late 1950’s, The Larkins follows the golden-hearted wheeler dealer Pop Larkin and his wife Ma, together with their six children, including the beautiful Mariette, as they bask in their idyllic and beautiful patch of paradise in Kent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiGbAeGUVizwCV1O2tVajRNOk0H.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136137'),
  ('111646633958619803', 'The Larry Sanders Show', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Garry Shandling, Dennis Klein', 'John Markus, Victor Levin, Maya Forbes', 'Garry Shandling, Jeffrey Tambor, Wallace Langham, Rip Torn, Penny Johnson Jerald, Mary Lynn Rajskub, Scott Thompson', 'TV-MA', 'Comic Garry Shandling draws upon his own talk show experiences to create the character of Larry Sanders, a paranoid, insecure host of a late night talk show. Larry, along with his obsequious TV sidekick Hank Kingsley and his fiercely protective producer Artie, allows Garry Shandling and his talented writers to look behind the scenes and to show us a convincing slice of behind the camera life.', 'Comic Garry Shandling draws upon his own talk show experiences to create the character of Larry Sanders, a paranoid, insecure host of a late night talk show. Larry, along with his obsequious TV sidekick Hank Kingsley and his fiercely protective producer Artie, allows Garry Shandling and his talented writers to look behind the scenes and to show us a convincing slice of behind the camera life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAYwC1jnIgwjaIAhy4SE9nnRgwN.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1915'),
  ('304150588340820021', 'The Last Alaskans', 2015, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Heimo Korth, Edna Korth', 'TV-14', 'In 1980, the U.S. government banned new human occupation in the Arctic National Wildlife Refuge in Alaska, a protected area, home to thousands of native animals and pristine terrain spanning roughly the size of South Carolina. Currently, only a handful of families spread across seven permitted cabins are allowed to remain in the refuge. Within less than 100 years, all remaining permits will reach expiration, and there will be no human presence left.', 'In 1980, the U.S. government banned new human occupation in the Arctic National Wildlife Refuge in Alaska, a protected area, home to thousands of native animals and pristine terrain spanning roughly the size of South Carolina. Currently, only a handful of families spread across seven permitted cabins are allowed to remain in the refuge. Within less than 100 years, all remaining permits will reach expiration, and there will be no human presence left.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iY7oyaLFw5LrT2wvi6vcT9df9Mo.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65043'),
  ('548343262067945735', 'The Last Bastion', 2018, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Eduardo Adrianzén, María Luisa Adrianzén', null, 'Giovanni Arce, Mayella Lloclla, Rodrigo Palacios, Priscila Espinoza, Mayra Najar, Sergio Galliani, Laly Goyzueta, Diego Lombardi', 'TV-PG', 'The Robles family, born and raised in the Americas, experiences the highs and lows of the revolutionary drive to Peru''s independence.', 'The Robles family, born and raised in the Americas, experiences the highs and lows of the revolutionary drive to Peru''s independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bnCaA3v38kz56TSXy0FrQK41At.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119731'),
  ('1038179627533896548', 'The Last Bus', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Paul Neafcy', null, 'Laura Crowhurst, Daniel Frogson, Carys John, Amber-Rose Perry, Phoebe De Silva, Marlie Morrelle, Curtis Kantsa, Lauryn Ajufo', 'TV-PG', 'After embarking on a life-changing field trip, a group of whip-smart students fight to save humanity from an army of ruthless drones.', 'After embarking on a life-changing field trip, a group of whip-smart students fight to save humanity from an army of ruthless drones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tv1jyfYC0ZClQod9v6IbhwP6ak.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:169590'),
  ('517793835071264951', 'The Last Cinderella', 2013, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Ryoko Shinohara, Haruma Miura, Naohito Fujiki, Nene Otsuka, Shozo Endo, Nanao, Satoshi Hashimoto, Kaoru Hirata', null, 'Sakura is a single 39-year-old woman who works as the assistant manager at a beauty salon. She spends her days making her customers look beautiful but doesn’t pay much attention to her own appearance. All of that changes when she goes to a party and meets Hiroto, a much younger man who is a biker. Will Sakura revel in the attention of the handsome but dangerous Hiroto or notice the constant interest of her hard-talking and hard-drinking salon manager, Rintaro?', 'Sakura is a single 39-year-old woman who works as the assistant manager at a beauty salon. She spends her days making her customers look beautiful but doesn’t pay much attention to her own appearance. All of that changes when she goes to a party and meets Hiroto, a much younger man who is a biker. Will Sakura revel in the attention of the handsome but dangerous Hiroto or notice the constant interest of her hard-talking and hard-drinking salon manager, Rintaro?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbKnwMQEFpaQ1hGMrL526zu5Qkz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65582'),
  ('212555022686940690', 'The Last Conquest', 1994, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Mary Hon Ma-Lee, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Bao Fang, Sher Ng Wing-Hung, Lily Chung Suk-Wai, Amy Wu Mei-Yee', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZWac8S2bFQD7yMEwnpBdd7T93d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109255'),
  ('591071701019485033', 'The Last Czars', 2019, 'Drama, War & Politics, Documentary', null, null, 'Robert Jack, Oliver Dimsdale, Samuel Collings, Ben Cartwright, Elsie Bennett, Susanna Herbert', 'TV-MA', 'When social upheaval sweeps Russia in the early 20th century, Czar Nicholas II resists change, sparking a revolution and ending a dynasty.', 'When social upheaval sweeps Russia in the early 20th century, Czar Nicholas II resists change, sparking a revolution and ending a dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quGmzISvzZeAd3ijCLbVMIfEHni.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90665'),
  ('1145296597065935363', 'The Last Dance', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Michael Tollin', null, 'Michael Jordan, Scottie Pippen, Dennis Rodman, Phil Jackson, Steve Kerr', 'TV-MA', 'A 10-part documentary chronicling the untold story of Michael Jordan and the Chicago Bulls dynasty with rare, never-before-seen footage and sound from the 1997-98 championship season – plus over 100 interviews with famous figures and basketball’s biggest names.', 'A 10-part documentary chronicling the untold story of Michael Jordan and the Chicago Bulls dynasty with rare, never-before-seen footage and sound from the 1997-98 championship season – plus over 100 interviews with famous figures and basketball’s biggest names.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVf4xGGbDtwVHiKn8uTuSriY7PH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79525'),
  ('493714317339249253', 'The Last Days of Pompeii', 1984, 'Drama', 'David Gerber', null, 'Linda Purl, Anthony Quayle, Duncan Regehr, Laurence Olivier, Benedict Taylor, Gerry Sundquist, Catriona MacColl, Malcolm Jamieson', null, 'The different aspects of life in Pompeii, a coastal luxury resort near Naples catering for the very rich of imperial Rome, mainly before but culminating in the eruption of the Vesuvian volcano, which wipes it from the face of the Earth. The residents of Pompeii include Diomed, a common upstart merchant whose self-made riches from trade allow him to consider running for political office against sitting city magistrate Quintus and an impoverished aristocratic marriage for his daughter Julia; the cultivated Greek Glaucus; the gladiator Lydon; the noble-born Antonius and his sister Ione, the evil Isis-priest Arbaces who is after (their) money and power; the persecution-fearing Christian slaves Petrus, his true love Chloe, and their secret leader Olinthus.', 'The different aspects of life in Pompeii, a coastal luxury resort near Naples catering for the very rich of imperial Rome, mainly before but culminating in the eruption of the Vesuvian volcano, which wipes it from the face of the Earth. The residents of Pompeii include Diomed, a common upstart merchant whose self-made riches from trade allow him to consider running for political office against sitting city magistrate Quintus and an impoverished aristocratic marriage for his daughter Julia; the cultivated Greek Glaucus; the gladiator Lydon; the noble-born Antonius and his sister Ione, the evil Isis-priest Arbaces who is after (their) money and power; the persecution-fearing Christian slaves Petrus, his true love Chloe, and their secret leader Olinthus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXg4HvdAgLQOrAFfwEDnXcydSgh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20755'),
  ('740006895815935450', 'The Last Days of Ptolemy Grey', 2022, 'Drama', 'Walter Mosley', null, 'Samuel L. Jackson, Dominique Fishback, Cynthia Kaye McWilliams, Damon Gupton, Marsha Stephanie Blake, Walton Goggins, Omar Benson Miller, Percy Daggs IV', 'TV-MA', 'Suddenly left without his trusted caretaker, Ptolemy Grey is assigned to the care of orphaned teenager Robyn. When they learn about a treatment that will restore Ptolemy’s dementia-addled memories, it begins a journey toward shocking truths.', 'Suddenly left without his trusted caretaker, Ptolemy Grey is assigned to the care of orphaned teenager Robyn. When they learn about a treatment that will restore Ptolemy’s dementia-addled memories, it begins a journey toward shocking truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r82gsvG8sAX6V3gWZL5hgVvu8un.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155493'),
  ('511251001973347076', 'The Last Detective', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Leslie Thomas, Richard Harris', null, 'Peter Davison, Sean Hughes, Rob Spendlove, Vineeta Rishi, Emma Amos, Charles De''Ath, Billy Geraghty', null, '"Dangerous" Davies always gets the cases no one else wants, and no one notices when he eventually succeeds. But his old-fashioned decency and dogged determination have won him legions of loyal fans.', '"Dangerous" Davies always gets the cases no one else wants, and no one notices when he eventually succeeds. But his old-fashioned decency and dogged determination have won him legions of loyal fans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZMAjnjm0oG5VEGrZZbum2ClAcL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:19880'),
  ('838788161196574421', 'The Last Don', 1997, 'Crime, Drama', 'Joyce Eliason, Mario Puzo', 'Joyce Eliason', 'Danny Aiello, Joe Mantegna, Rory Cochrane, Kirstie Alley, David Marciano, David Gianopoulos, Danny Mastrogiorgio, Mike Starr', 'TV-14', 'Spanning decades, a powerful Italian crime family battles internal strife when a ruthless grandson seeks control after a violent wedding sparks unintended chaos, testing loyalties as lines blur between family and criminal enterprise. Best selling author of Mario ''The Godfather'' Puzo''s blockbuster new novel comes to life in this epic saga of America''s most powerful crime family.', 'Spanning decades, a powerful Italian crime family battles internal strife when a ruthless grandson seeks control after a violent wedding sparks unintended chaos, testing loyalties as lines blur between family and criminal enterprise. Best selling author of Mario ''The Godfather'' Puzo''s blockbuster new novel comes to life in this epic saga of America''s most powerful crime family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvFib9i69BgFBJsUbHoHNTa7GSJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31050'),
  ('359510542897635132', 'The Last Don II', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Joyce Eliason, Mario Puzo', 'Jason Gedrick, Patsy Kensit, Kirstie Alley, David Marciano, James Wilder, Jason Isaacs, Joe Mantegna, Danny Aiello', null, 'As the elder don dies, his young heir moves into the position. He quickly proves to be as ruthless as he tries to discover who has launched a plot to overthrow his rule and may be infiltrating other families. In a left over plot line, his aunt discovers that the young don had her son murdered first setting her off in a plot to kill him. Then when she is stopped she is driven into the arms of a conflicted priest. Meanwhile, an undercover FBI agent moves into the family home as a teacher for the don''s handicapped daughter.', 'As the elder don dies, his young heir moves into the position. He quickly proves to be as ruthless as he tries to discover who has launched a plot to overthrow his rule and may be infiltrating other families. In a left over plot line, his aunt discovers that the young don had her son murdered first setting her off in a plot to kill him. Then when she is stopped she is driven into the arms of a conflicted priest. Meanwhile, an undercover FBI agent moves into the family home as a teacher for the don''s handicapped daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTVftAEYVYmVi7NiwJjMMNUxgWL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35490'),
  ('870551887688111400', 'The Last Drive-in with Joe Bob Briggs', 2019, 'Comedy, Talk', 'John Bloom', null, null, 'NR', 'The World’s Foremost Drive-in Movie Critic – actually he’s pretty much the world’s only Drive-in Critic – Joe Bob Briggs brings his iconic swagger to this firebrand of horror and drive-in cinema offering honest appreciation, hilarious insight, inside stories and of course, the Drive-in totals.', 'The World’s Foremost Drive-in Movie Critic – actually he’s pretty much the world’s only Drive-in Critic – Joe Bob Briggs brings his iconic swagger to this firebrand of horror and drive-in cinema offering honest appreciation, hilarious insight, inside stories and of course, the Drive-in totals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uf4zBRRQJ5nSLBn17YZxAaWWPr.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:88088'),
  ('135081029517810035', 'The Last Empress', 2018, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Park Young-soo, Kim Soon-ok', null, 'Jang Na-ra, Choi Jin-hyuk, Shin Sung-rok, Lee Elijah, Shin Eun-kyung, Oh Seung-yun, Oh Ah-Rin, Park Won-sook', null, 'In an alternate-reality South Korea, where a constitutional monarchical system prevails, Oh Sunny, a musical actress, becomes the empress of the country. Thus begins a dispute for power in the royal palace. Nothing is what it seems, and Oh Sunny is ready to fight until the end to uncover a mysterious homicide within the royal palace, fighting to protect those she loves the most and obtain happiness.', 'In an alternate-reality South Korea, where a constitutional monarchical system prevails, Oh Sunny, a musical actress, becomes the empress of the country. Thus begins a dispute for power in the royal palace. Nothing is what it seems, and Oh Sunny is ready to fight until the end to uncover a mysterious homicide within the royal palace, fighting to protect those she loves the most and obtain happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWJw89ce4gxGREKxaFSiQmETWQN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84107'),
  ('1028884133773332740', 'The Last Enemy', 2008, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Peter Berry', null, 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Max Beesley, Robert Carlyle, James Lance, Geraldine James, Paul Higgins, David Harewood, Kieran O''Brien', null, 'Stephen Ezard''s search for the truth about the death of his brother Michael catapults him into an international conspiracy and a passionate love affair.', 'Stephen Ezard''s search for the truth about the death of his brother Michael catapults him into an international conspiracy and a passionate love affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlBj7IPDHiIBFsGILZkG3LL8IlJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7096'),
  ('602187270818082722', 'The Last Frontier', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jon Bokenkamp, Richard D''Ovidio', null, 'Jason Clarke, Haley Bennett, Dominic Cooper, Simone Kessell, Dallas Goldtooth, Tait Blum, Alfre Woodard', 'TV-MA', 'When a prison transport plane crashes in the remote Alaskan wilderness—freeing dozens of violent inmates—the region''s lone marshal must protect the town he''s vowed to keep safe.', 'When a prison transport plane crashes in the remote Alaskan wilderness—freeing dozens of violent inmates—the region''s lone marshal must protect the town he''s vowed to keep safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4S2gS1mECZ5wDRBVAZE6KWmJHI3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221079'),
  ('424712207035807478', 'The Last Goodbye to Mama', 2021, 'Family', null, 'Gong Xue', 'Dong Jie, Yin Fang, Lu Fangsheng, Wang Churan, Zhao Wei, Cai Lu, Chen Jiawen, Jiang Xueming', null, 'A story of hope and despair surrounding the lives of a mother and son from a small town in Subei. The 18-year-old Ding Xiao Jun who lives with his mother Ding Bi Yun has been admitted to a university in Beijing. However, as soon as he entered university, he is ridiculed by his classmates. Ding Xiao Jun starts to rebel until he gets a warning that he will no longer graduate. Luckily, his mother gets through to him in time for him to pull himself together and earn enough credits to graduate.', 'A story of hope and despair surrounding the lives of a mother and son from a small town in Subei. The 18-year-old Ding Xiao Jun who lives with his mother Ding Bi Yun has been admitted to a university in Beijing. However, as soon as he entered university, he is ridiculed by his classmates. Ding Xiao Jun starts to rebel until he gets a warning that he will no longer graduate. Luckily, his mother gets through to him in time for him to pull himself together and earn enough credits to graduate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cs87epKZQzRX7UZEDDNCEu2VWPT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135354'),
  ('129209187786645866', 'The Last Hour', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Amit Kumar, Anupama Minz', 'Amit Kumar, Anupama Minz', 'Sanjay Kapoor, Karma Takapa, Shaylee Krishen, Lapchen Lepcha, Dewashish Lama, Vivek Pradhan, Sonam Thendup Barphungpa, Jatin Payeng', null, 'A mysterious young shaman, on the run protecting a secret gift, joins hands with a seasoned city cop to hunt down a dangerous figure from his dark past. But when he falls for the cop''s young daughter, he is torn between duty and love.', 'A mysterious young shaman, on the run protecting a secret gift, joins hands with a seasoned city cop to hunt down a dangerous figure from his dark past. But when he falls for the cop''s young daughter, he is torn between duty and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s98DaCdeIdB7QKvwLbWmKDN9toy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125481'),
  ('1140917869931633130', 'The Last Hours of Mario Biondo', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, null, 'Questions persist about the last night of Mario Biondo, the husband of Spanish TV host Raquel Sánchez Silva. This true-crime series uncovers new details.', 'Questions persist about the last night of Mario Biondo, the husband of Spanish TV host Raquel Sánchez Silva. This true-crime series uncovers new details.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iaJmWIKoS5LBVuvr9c54gwTq7D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231015'),
  ('984312184521306506', 'The Last Hunt for Nazi Gold', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Historian Guy Walters and Justine Ostrowska embark on a 4,000-kilometre journey across Europe, chasing legends of hidden Nazi treasure. From the mines of Germany and the Amber Room mysteries of Czechia, to stolen art in Austria, the Gold Train myths of Poland, bunker hunts in Italy, and the infamous waters of Lake Toplitz, their search combines discovery and eccentric encounters. Though every site yields more myth than treasure, the series reveals how obsession, paranoia, and history intertwine.', 'Historian Guy Walters and Justine Ostrowska embark on a 4,000-kilometre journey across Europe, chasing legends of hidden Nazi treasure. From the mines of Germany and the Amber Room mysteries of Czechia, to stolen art in Austria, the Gold Train myths of Poland, bunker hunts in Italy, and the infamous waters of Lake Toplitz, their search combines discovery and eccentric encounters. Though every site yields more myth than treasure, the series reveals how obsession, paranoia, and history intertwine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyhH9JiHUV31Eup1I8eRPPCtwBx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318960'),
  ('515102903330748533', 'The Last Immortal', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Xing Ling', 'Liu Fang', 'Zhao Lusi, Wang Anyu, Li Yunrui, Ying Er, Cao Feiran, Ganana, Xue Jianing, Cui Hang', null, 'Yin, a hardworking Shuining Beast, and Gu Jin, the son of the true God whose magic has been sealed, meet by chance and embark on a quest to find Feng Yin''s Immortal Essence. Alongside their companions, Hong Yi of the Fox Clan and Yan Shuang of the Eagle Clan, they face numerous challenges to collect the essence. Battling the villain Qing Lin and his followers, they overcome obstacles and, in the end, not only fulfill their mission to restore peace but also find love, friendship, and family.', 'Yin, a hardworking Shuining Beast, and Gu Jin, the son of the true God whose magic has been sealed, meet by chance and embark on a quest to find Feng Yin''s Immortal Essence. Alongside their companions, Hong Yi of the Fox Clan and Yan Shuang of the Eagle Clan, they face numerous challenges to collect the essence. Battling the villain Qing Lin and his followers, they overcome obstacles and, in the end, not only fulfill their mission to restore peace but also find love, friendship, and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33zNWhfS3r0xWp7EaXtO9LDoB5Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216264'),
  ('544061054847408205', 'The Last Kids on Earth', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'William Lau', null, 'Bruce Campbell, Mark Hamill, Nick Wolfhard, Keith David, Rosario Dawson, Garland Whitt, Catherine O''Hara, Montse Hernandez', 'TV-Y7', 'Young teenager Jack Sullivan and a group of friends live in a decked-out tree house, playing video games, eating candy, and fighting zombies in the aftermath of a monster apocalypse.', 'Young teenager Jack Sullivan and a group of friends live in a decked-out tree house, playing video games, eating candy, and fighting zombies in the aftermath of a monster apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTpGn2hgB0WGFGp6Q6ArkEWWTsk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:92684'),
  ('44111313140404902', 'The Last Kingdom', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'Stephen Butchard', null, 'Alexander Dreymon, Eliza Butterworth, Mark Rowley, Ruby Hartley, James Northcote, Arnas Fedaravičius, Harry Gilby, Timothy Innes', 'TV-MA', 'A show of heroic deeds and epic battles with a thematic depth that embraces politics, religion, warfare, courage, love, loyalty and our universal search for identity. Combining real historical figures and events with fictional characters, it is the story of how a people combined their strength under one of the most iconic kings of history in order to reclaim their land for themselves and build a place they call home.', 'A show of heroic deeds and epic battles with a thematic depth that embraces politics, religion, warfare, courage, love, loyalty and our universal search for identity. Combining real historical figures and events with fictional characters, it is the story of how a people combined their strength under one of the most iconic kings of history in order to reclaim their land for themselves and build a place they call home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eJf0hxgIhE6QSxbtuNCekTddy1.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:63333'),
  ('92952913910218525', 'The Last Leg', 2013, 'Talk', null, null, 'Adam Hills, Alex Brooker, Josh Widdicombe', null, 'Adam Hills and co-hosts Josh Widdicombe and Alex Brooker provide some offbeat commentary on the significant moments of the past seven days.', 'Adam Hills and co-hosts Josh Widdicombe and Alex Brooker provide some offbeat commentary on the significant moments of the past seven days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4euDsPzadRhz0m5CZhQlKcgbZGI.jpg', 34, 'tmdb:tv:63706'),
  ('1093801069225372666', 'The Last Man on Earth', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Will Forte', null, 'Will Forte, Kristen Schaal, Cleopatra Coleman, January Jones, Mel Rodriguez, Keith L. Williams, Mary Steenburgen', 'TV-14', 'The year is 2022, and after an unlikely event, only one man is left on earth: Phil Miller, who used to be just an average guy who loved his family and hated his job at the bank. Now, in his RV, Phil searches the country for other survivors.', 'The year is 2022, and after an unlikely event, only one man is left on earth: Phil Miller, who used to be just an average guy who loved his family and hated his job at the bank. Now, in his RV, Phil searches the country for other survivors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vONS5oceFmM93hsS3q3mvQ1iBC3.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61888'),
  ('680586845812588526', 'The Last Minister', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Roman Volobuev', 'Roman Volobuev, Dmitry Nelidov, Roman Nepomnyashchiy', 'Yan Tsapnik, Olga Sutulova, Sergey Epishev, Nelly Uvarova, Anna Shepeleva, Sofia Lebedeva, Aleksey Zolotovitskiy, Daria Nosik', null, 'When an active loser is appointed the Minister of Planning, no one can imagine what this will lead to. It turns out that the new minis- ter really wants to change people’s lives for the better and for this, together with the team, is actively promoting his own initiatives. True, these initiatives are not always reasonable, and the result is extremely unpredictable.', 'When an active loser is appointed the Minister of Planning, no one can imagine what this will lead to. It turns out that the new minis- ter really wants to change people’s lives for the better and for this, together with the team, is actively promoting his own initiatives. True, these initiatives are not always reasonable, and the result is extremely unpredictable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Wm3OkVGz0pAIeRC4clSo6oyI5Y.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101197'),
  ('1082866163028154842', 'The Last Movie Stars', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Emily Wachtel', null, 'Paul Newman, Joanne Woodward', 'TV-MA', 'A celebration of Paul Newman and Joanne Woodward’s iconic careers and decades-long partnership. Director Ethan Hawke brings life and color to this definitive history of their love, lives, and philanthropy.', 'A celebration of Paul Newman and Joanne Woodward’s iconic careers and decades-long partnership. Director Ethan Hawke brings life and color to this definitive history of their love, lives, and philanthropy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9L6AkTv9CDdxqwWICIB4OuLeNdM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157021'),
  ('741618505338391928', 'The Last Narc', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Hector Berrellez, Geneva Camarena, Jorge Godoy, Phil Jordan, Ramón Lira, Manny Madrano, Rene Lopez', 'TV-MA', 'In 1985, American DEA agent Enrique “Kiki” Camarena was kidnapped, tortured, and murdered by Mexico’s most notorious drug lords. Thirty-five years later, three former cartel insiders share unprecedented details. This is the story of Camarena, the drug cartel he infiltrated, and the narc who risked everything to discover the truth.', 'In 1985, American DEA agent Enrique “Kiki” Camarena was kidnapped, tortured, and murdered by Mexico’s most notorious drug lords. Thirty-five years later, three former cartel insiders share unprecedented details. This is the story of Camarena, the drug cartel he infiltrated, and the narc who risked everything to discover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8Jw1Z4VppYC78enToW0fHG4Bk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102831'),
  ('535187344068303644', 'The Last Nazis', 2009, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The generation of Nazis who fought during World War 2 is almost gone, their lives, their actions, and their crimes soon to be consigned to history forever. It''s the last chance to tell these stories, to speak to these men; to enter their worlds; and uncover the impact their existence has had on others.', 'The generation of Nazis who fought during World War 2 is almost gone, their lives, their actions, and their crimes soon to be consigned to history forever. It''s the last chance to tell these stories, to speak to these men; to enter their worlds; and uncover the impact their existence has had on others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ae8p0B1YxE4FtAdQHTCBIwg41qY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77173'),
  ('228372911223203108', 'The Last Night at Tremore Beach', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Oriol Paulo, Jordi Vallejo', null, 'Javier Rey, Ana Polvorosa, Guillermo Toledo, Pilar Castro, Josean Bengoetxea, Carla Quílez, Nora Navas, Ana Wagener', 'TV-MA', 'When a tormented pianist is struck by lightning, he begins having perilous visions of his future and a deadly threat seems to loom over his loved ones.', 'When a tormented pianist is struck by lightning, he begins having perilous visions of his future and a deadly threat seems to loom over his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1kwsyVHpC46af98UJr4J3MxZdg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242879'),
  ('930876079500332211', 'The Last O.G.', 2018, 'Comedy', 'John Carcieri, Jordan Peele', 'Ella Robinson Brooks', 'Tracy Morgan, Ryan Gaul, Taylor Mosby, Dante Hoagland, Anna Maria Horsford, Da''Vine Joy Randolph', 'TV-MA', 'An ex-felon is shocked to see just how much the world has changed when he is released from prison for good behavior after a 15-year stint and returns to his newly gentrified Brooklyn neighborhood.', 'An ex-felon is shocked to see just how much the world has changed when he is released from prison for good behavior after a 15-year stint and returns to his newly gentrified Brooklyn neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jJ4TfnhA6ph3NWic50bsF9Rwer.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:77485'),
  ('647507706577814704', 'The Last of Us', 2023, 'Drama', 'Neil Druckmann, Craig Mazin', null, 'Bella Ramsey, Gabriel Luna, Isabela Merced, Young Mazino', 'TV-MA', 'Twenty years after modern civilization has been destroyed, Joel, a hardened survivor, is hired to smuggle Ellie, a 14-year-old girl, out of an oppressive quarantine zone. What starts as a small job soon becomes a brutal, heartbreaking journey, as they both must traverse the United States and depend on each other for survival.', 'Twenty years after modern civilization has been destroyed, Joel, a hardened survivor, is hired to smuggle Ellie, a 14-year-old girl, out of an oppressive quarantine zone. What starts as a small job soon becomes a brutal, heartbreaking journey, as they both must traverse the United States and depend on each other for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmo6TYuuJgaYinXBPjrgG9mB5od.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100088'),
  ('214895079611877723', 'The Last Panthers', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jack Thorne', 'Jack Thorne', 'Goran Bogdan, Samantha Morton, Tahar Rahim, John Hurt, Igor Benčina, Yann Ebongé, Kobna Holdbrook-Smith, Moussa Maaskri', 'TV-MA', 'The six-part series opens with a daring diamond heist before quickly delving into the dark heart of Europe where a shadowy alliance of gangsters and ''banksters'' now rules. Naomi is the British loss adjustor charged with recovering the stolen diamonds whatever the cost. Also in pursuit is French-Algerian policeman Khalil.', 'The six-part series opens with a daring diamond heist before quickly delving into the dark heart of Europe where a shadowy alliance of gangsters and ''banksters'' now rules. Naomi is the British loss adjustor charged with recovering the stolen diamonds whatever the cost. Also in pursuit is French-Algerian policeman Khalil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43kAJvbomTZ27Rv0r4efs8MQt0D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63853'),
  ('651631345161231481', 'The Last Post', 2017, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Peter Moffat', null, 'Jessie Buckley, Stephen Campbell Moore, Amanda Drew, Ben Miles, Jeremy Neumark Jones, Jessica Raine, Ouidad Elma, Chris Reilly', 'TV-MA', 'Drama series set in the mid-sixties, in which a unit of Royal Military Police officers and their families deal with the challenges of politics, love and war in British-controlled Aden.', 'Drama series set in the mid-sixties, in which a unit of Royal Military Police officers and their families deal with the challenges of politics, love and war in British-controlled Aden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQPE4wB39N4oYM0dctVeI1bqAb5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74253'),
  ('527351480645137570', 'The Last Ship', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Hank Steinberg, Steven Kane', null, 'Eric Dane, Adam Baldwin, Charles Parnell, Travis Van Winkle, Marissa Neitling, Christina Elmore, Jocko Sims, Kevin Michael Martin', 'TV-14', 'Their mission is simple: Find a cure. Stop the virus. Save the world. When a global pandemic wipes out eighty percent of the planet''s population, the crew of a lone naval destroyer must find a way to pull humanity from the brink of extinction.', 'Their mission is simple: Find a cure. Stop the virus. Save the world. When a global pandemic wipes out eighty percent of the planet''s population, the crew of a lone naval destroyer must find a way to pull humanity from the brink of extinction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xH529hDtPxhslAEeCrN7gD64ZMX.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:60802'),
  ('598871192822308029', 'The Last Steep Ascent', 2012, 'Drama', 'Lee Tim-Sing', null, 'Edwin Siu, Aimee Chan, Moses Chan Ho, Suet Nei, Kenny Wong Tak-Ban, Maggie Cheung Ho-Yee, Samantha Ko, Kwan Ching', null, 'The Last Steep Ascent is a Hong Kong television drama produced by TVB under executive producer Lee Tim-shing.', 'The Last Steep Ascent is a Hong Kong television drama produced by TVB under executive producer Lee Tim-shing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rL9yOrgINyEUrKXroWMnGjZUQ9F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109874'),
  ('1034680264197351280', 'The Last Summoner', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yun Wei Yi, He Wenxiao, Yumeng Zhang, Wang Jinger, Jinwen Chen, Zhao Mingzhou, Jiang Bian, Qiu Qiu', null, 'A talented young cook''s encounter with a hungry girl who popped up in his kitchen changes his ordinary life forever. Dora, a summoned spirit and a truly cute goddess, now calls him master. However, he is not interested at all and trying everything he could to get away from the ghostly figure. As fate would have it, when he becomes a summoner by accident, there is no turn back in life.', 'A talented young cook''s encounter with a hungry girl who popped up in his kitchen changes his ordinary life forever. Dora, a summoned spirit and a truly cute goddess, now calls him master. However, he is not interested at all and trying everything he could to get away from the ghostly figure. As fate would have it, when he becomes a summoner by accident, there is no turn back in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7Ked7mAnvuuRPuehta2L4eHUfO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102927'),
  ('712700235375775641', 'The Last Templar', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Suzette Couture', 'Mira Sorvino, Victor Garber, Scott Foley, Rebecca Windheim, Ken Tran, Kenneth Welsh, Anthony Lemke, Omar Sharif', null, 'The Last Templar is a four-hour Canadian miniseries, based on the 2005 novel The Last Templar, which aired in the U.S. on January 25 and 26, 2009, starring Mira Sorvino, Scott Foley, Victor Garber, Anthony Lemke, Kenneth Welsh, Danny Blanco Hall and Omar Sharif. The miniseries is produced by Muse Entertainment Enterprises. Emmy Award-winning Robert Halmi Sr., along with Robert Halmi Jr., and Michael Prupas are the executive producers.', 'The Last Templar is a four-hour Canadian miniseries, based on the 2005 novel The Last Templar, which aired in the U.S. on January 25 and 26, 2009, starring Mira Sorvino, Scott Foley, Victor Garber, Anthony Lemke, Kenneth Welsh, Danny Blanco Hall and Omar Sharif. The miniseries is produced by Muse Entertainment Enterprises. Emmy Award-winning Robert Halmi Sr., along with Robert Halmi Jr., and Michael Prupas are the executive producers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dy2e64SqBDrM5gsScN2D1By8KTn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31760'),
  ('1146879917186645088', 'The Last Thing He Told Me', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Laura Dave, Josh Singer', 'Allegra Caldera', 'Jennifer Garner, Angourie Rice, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau', 'TV-MA', 'A woman must forge a relationship with her teenage stepdaughter in order to find her husband, who has mysteriously disappeared.', 'A woman must forge a relationship with her teenage stepdaughter in order to find her husband, who has mysteriously disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxRBl0zPdevzruEoIbsL2MMDkFN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:201289'),
  ('1042546940445426486', 'The Last Train', 1999, 'Drama', 'Matthew Graham', null, 'Nicola Walker, James Hazeldine, Zoe Telford, Christopher Fulford, Treva Etienne, Amita Dhiri, Sacha Dhawan, Dinita Gohil', null, 'The Last Train is a British six-part post-apocalyptic television drama serial first broadcast on the ITV network in 1999. It has since been repeated on ITV2 in 1999/2001 and on numerous occasions on the UK Sci-Fi Channel. The serial was written by Matthew Graham and produced for ITV by Granada Television. In the United States, the Fox Network purchased the rights to produce a new version of the series soon after its original UK transmission. Retitled The Ark, the idea did not progress beyond the pilot stage. As of May 2013, the series has not been released on DVD or any other format, and has never aired in the US.', 'The Last Train is a British six-part post-apocalyptic television drama serial first broadcast on the ITV network in 1999. It has since been repeated on ITV2 in 1999/2001 and on numerous occasions on the UK Sci-Fi Channel. The serial was written by Matthew Graham and produced for ITV by Granada Television. In the United States, the Fox Network purchased the rights to produce a new version of the series soon after its original UK transmission. Retitled The Ark, the idea did not progress beyond the pilot stage. As of May 2013, the series has not been released on DVD or any other format, and has never aired in the US.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHj5LPaoX3qiVkVtclzvY3LIxiN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:398'),
  ('1912838363787281', 'The Last Tycoon', 2017, 'Drama', 'Billy Ray', 'Katie Robbins, Desta Tedros Reff', 'Matt Bomer, Kelsey Grammer, Lily Collins, Dominique McElligott, Enzo Cilenti, Mark O''Brien, Rosemarie DeWitt, Koen De Bouw', 'TV-MA', 'From F. Scott Fitzgerald''s last work, The Last Tycoon follows Monroe Stahr, Hollywood''s Golden Boy as he battles father figure and boss Pat Brady for the soul of their studio. In a world darkened by the Depression and the growing influence of Hitler''s Germany, The Last Tycoon illuminates the passions, violence and towering ambition of 1930s Hollywood.', 'From F. Scott Fitzgerald''s last work, The Last Tycoon follows Monroe Stahr, Hollywood''s Golden Boy as he battles father figure and boss Pat Brady for the soul of their studio. In a world darkened by the Depression and the growing influence of Hitler''s Germany, The Last Tycoon illuminates the passions, violence and towering ambition of 1930s Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xFGbliDbSrJX1hUp9jKdQUY87A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67925'),
  ('884604250268848036', 'The Last Warrior. Heritage', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Viktor Horinyak, Elena Yakovleva, Vladislav Vetrov, Kirill Zaytsev, Tatyana Dogileva, Yulia Peresild, Aleksandra Ursulyak, Dmitry Lysenkov', null, 'Ivan, who just turned 50, has two daughters: the eldest, the heroic Mary, and the youngest, the novice sorceress Sophia. Everything in Belogorie goes on as usual, but the visit of the sorcerer Severin, who dreamed of a terrible disaster, brings confusion to the measured life of wizards. To save both Belogorie and her own father''s life, Sofia will have to go to Moscow of the past, where a young and unsuspecting Ivan still lives, and Marya will have to fight evil in the city itself.', 'Ivan, who just turned 50, has two daughters: the eldest, the heroic Mary, and the youngest, the novice sorceress Sophia. Everything in Belogorie goes on as usual, but the visit of the sorcerer Severin, who dreamed of a terrible disaster, brings confusion to the measured life of wizards. To save both Belogorie and her own father''s life, Sofia will have to go to Moscow of the past, where a young and unsuspecting Ivan still lives, and Marya will have to fight evil in the city itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GRZF3MzqvkJtANDLJA6XEf8MDq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247141'),
  ('940757780051329229', 'The Last Weekend', 2012, 'Drama', null, 'Mick Ford', 'Rupert Penry-Jones, Shaun Evans, Hugh Mitchell, Alexander Karim, Claire Keelan, Genevieve O''Reilly', null, 'When Ian and Em receive a surprise invitation from their old friend Ollie to spend a weekend in the Suffolk countryside, they expect an idyllic holiday. But the competitive edge to the men''s relationship soon rises to the surface, with irreversible consequences.', 'When Ian and Em receive a surprise invitation from their old friend Ollie to spend a weekend in the Suffolk countryside, they expect an idyllic holiday. But the competitive edge to the men''s relationship soon rises to the surface, with irreversible consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOhlvWjrWsjXYeAuJr1Xb3rTcJH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58276'),
  ('192600169245406564', 'The Last Will', 2025, 'Soap, Drama', 'Sandra Santos, Alexandre Castro', null, 'Patrícia Tavares, Bárbara Branco, José Mata, Ricardo Pereira, Mariana Monteiro, Dânia Neto, Cristovão Campos, Laura Dutra', null, 'It is possible to start over even after experiencing hell. An unexpected inheritance and a crime give an unjustly treated woman the opportunity to change her life.', 'It is possible to start over even after experiencing hell. An unexpected inheritance and a crime give an unjustly treated woman the opportunity to change her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enAlccSlmTGqOxoGdw9ihVFu1aH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:273050'),
  ('368643787378900993', 'The Last Word', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aron Lehmann, Carlos V. Irmscher', 'Burkhardt Wunderlich, Carolina Zimmermann, Aron Lehmann', 'Anke Engelke, Thorsten Merten, Nina Gummich, Aaron Hilmer, Johannes Zeiler, Juri Sam Winkler, Gudrun Ritter, Claudia Geisler-Bading', 'NR', 'A story about a funeral eulogy speaker who loses faith in her work and tries to sabotage her husband''s funeral.', 'A story about a funeral eulogy speaker who loses faith in her work and tries to sabotage her husband''s funeral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agF87jI4RaovHtt2upMreJ81UuM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110152'),
  ('1116815754355406126', 'The Late Late Show with Craig Ferguson', 2005, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Craig Ferguson', null, 'The Late Late Show with Craig Ferguson is an American late-night talk show hosted by Scottish American comedian Craig Ferguson, who is the third regular host of the Late Late Show franchise. It follows Late Show with David Letterman in the CBS late-night lineup, airing weekdays in the US at 12:37 a.m. It is taped in front of a live studio audience from Monday to Friday at CBS Television City in Los Angeles, California, directly above the Bob Barker Studio. It is produced by David Letterman''s production company Worldwide Pants Incorporated and CBS Television Studios. Since becoming host on January 3, 2005, after Craig Kilborn and Tom Snyder, Ferguson has achieved the highest ratings since the show''s inception in 1995. While the majority of the episodes focus on comedy, Ferguson has also addressed difficult subject matter, such as the deaths of his parents, and undertaken serious interviews, such as one with Desmond Tutu, which earned the show a 2009 Peabody Award.', 'The Late Late Show with Craig Ferguson is an American late-night talk show hosted by Scottish American comedian Craig Ferguson, who is the third regular host of the Late Late Show franchise. It follows Late Show with David Letterman in the CBS late-night lineup, airing weekdays in the US at 12:37 a.m. It is taped in front of a live studio audience from Monday to Friday at CBS Television City in Los Angeles, California, directly above the Bob Barker Studio. It is produced by David Letterman''s production company Worldwide Pants Incorporated and CBS Television Studios. Since becoming host on January 3, 2005, after Craig Kilborn and Tom Snyder, Ferguson has achieved the highest ratings since the show''s inception in 1995. While the majority of the episodes focus on comedy, Ferguson has also addressed difficult subject matter, such as the deaths of his parents, and undertaken serious interviews, such as one with Desmond Tutu, which earned the show a 2009 Peabody Award.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGC7zSDgG0FY0MbM1pjfhTCWQBI.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:14981'),
  ('245913912103956799', 'The Late Late Show with Craig Kilborn', 1999, 'Talk', null, null, 'Craig Kilborn', null, 'Craig Kilborn hosted this zany talk show, which followed David Letterman''s show, from 1999 until 2004. Kilborn left The Daily Show in 1999 to be this show''s host after Tom Synder retired. The segment "5 Questions" was carried over from when he was on The Daily Show. Kilborn was frequently beaten in the ratings by his NBC timeslot rival, Conan O''Brien. Kilborn left The Late Late Show to pursue new opportunities.', 'Craig Kilborn hosted this zany talk show, which followed David Letterman''s show, from 1999 until 2004. Kilborn left The Daily Show in 1999 to be this show''s host after Tom Synder retired. The segment "5 Questions" was carried over from when he was on The Daily Show. Kilborn was frequently beaten in the ratings by his NBC timeslot rival, Conan O''Brien. Kilborn left The Late Late Show to pursue new opportunities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fABKyKKX6r4FUuCjd7qKmgNOID.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:27213'),
  ('164556791405240383', 'The Late Late Show with James Corden', 2015, 'Talk', 'David Letterman, Peter Lassally', null, 'James Corden, Reggie Watts', 'TV-14', 'Once Craig Ferguson retires, James Corden will be taking over The Late Late Show. The show is a late night talk show that interviews celebrities and has its own bits. And of course, it''s all hosted by James Corden.', 'Once Craig Ferguson retires, James Corden will be taking over The Late Late Show. The show is a late night talk show that interviews celebrities and has its own bits. And of course, it''s all hosted by James Corden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPmVoG8G9tc1nN8ZwGV2zYcknit.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:62223'),
  ('661703449169981411', 'The Late Offices', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sümeyye Karaarslan', null, 'Ahmet Kural, Hande Soral, Kubat, Ulaş Çetin Köreken', 'TV-Y7', 'A Turkish mortician in his 30s, Baki is an introverted man content with his isolation from society. However, when he comes up against death at close range, a troubling question strikes him: who would wash his body after he dies? This realization pushes him to venture out into the world, hoping to connect with people and perhaps even find a spouse. Yet, his life-changing decision proves difficult to go through with, leading to a series of awkwardly humorous and sometimes bizarre situations.', 'A Turkish mortician in his 30s, Baki is an introverted man content with his isolation from society. However, when he comes up against death at close range, a troubling question strikes him: who would wash his body after he dies? This realization pushes him to venture out into the world, hoping to connect with people and perhaps even find a spouse. Yet, his life-changing decision proves difficult to go through with, leading to a series of awkwardly humorous and sometimes bizarre situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Xaw2vjMEn6KyENB6JksVrXIq8W.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:280030'),
  ('547347429388732158', 'The Late Show with Stephen Colbert', 2015, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Stephen Colbert', 'TV-14', 'Stephen Colbert brings his signature satire and comedy to The Late Show with Stephen Colbert, the #1 show in late night, where he talks with an eclectic mix of guests about what is new and relevant in the worlds of politics, entertainment, business, music, technology, and more. Featuring bandleader Jon Batiste with his band Stay Human, the Emmy Award-nominated show is broadcast from the historic Ed Sullivan Theater.', 'Stephen Colbert brings his signature satire and comedy to The Late Show with Stephen Colbert, the #1 show in late night, where he talks with an eclectic mix of guests about what is new and relevant in the worlds of politics, entertainment, business, music, technology, and more. Featuring bandleader Jon Batiste with his band Stay Human, the Emmy Award-nominated show is broadcast from the historic Ed Sullivan Theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jkThAGYj2yp8jsS6Nriy5mzKFT.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:63770'),
  ('961675417767470141', 'The Lava Field', 2014, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Reynir Lyngdal', 'Sveinbjörn I. Baldvinsson', 'Arna Magnea Danks, Salome R. Gunnarsdottir, Unnur Birna Jónsdóttir, Margrét Þorgeirsdóttir, Heida Reed, Jón Páll Eyjólfsson, Ragnar Jónsson, Valur Freyr Einarsson', 'TV-PG', 'When Reykjavik crime detective Helgi Marvin Runarsson is called in to investigate a suicide case on Snaefellsnes Peninsula, the case turns out to be far from simple. Pulled into a sinister trail of evidence, Helgi''s own deeply hidden secrets are unearthed. Will Helgi turn a blind eye to murder in order to save the life of his daughter.', 'When Reykjavik crime detective Helgi Marvin Runarsson is called in to investigate a suicide case on Snaefellsnes Peninsula, the case turns out to be far from simple. Pulled into a sinister trail of evidence, Helgi''s own deeply hidden secrets are unearthed. Will Helgi turn a blind eye to murder in order to save the life of his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kay5i8SUb8rtvQ69jNnV0Lltpz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65656'),
  ('640248985682464414', 'The Law According to Lidia Poët', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, War & Politics', 'Guido Iuculano, Davide Orsini', null, 'Matilda De Angelis, Sara Lazzaro, Eduardo Scarpetta, Pier Luigi Pasino, Nika Perrone, Sinead Thornhill, Alessia Spinelli', 'TV-MA', 'In late 19th-century Turin, the young Lidia Poët, fights against everything and everyone to get what is rightfully hers: to be enrolled in the official register of lawyers. A profession, at the time, reserved exclusively for men. Nevertheless, nothing could stop her dream of becoming the first female lawyer in Italy.', 'In late 19th-century Turin, the young Lidia Poët, fights against everything and everyone to get what is rightfully hers: to be enrolled in the official register of lawyers. A profession, at the time, reserved exclusively for men. Nevertheless, nothing could stop her dream of becoming the first female lawyer in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhTLskf3XNALpk3tZGm7lG2ChAx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:218896'),
  ('664284752628913943', 'The Law Cafe', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Im Ui-jung', 'Lee Seung-gi, Lee Se-young, Kim Nam-hee, Ahn Dong-gu, Kim Do-hoon, Jang Hye-jin, Baek Hyun-joo, Kim Seul-gi', null, 'A former prosecutor landlord and a former Miss Korea lawyer begin their crazy romance in a law office cafe.', 'A former prosecutor landlord and a former Miss Korea lawyer begin their crazy romance in a law office cafe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN0rKik0oCSfFmMFoH7qicPhcHj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156248'),
  ('1064595545741730722', 'The Law of the Sea', 2024, 'Drama', 'Flipy, Tatiana Rodríguez, Víctor Pedreira', null, 'Luis Tosar, Blanca Portillo, Sonia Almarcha, Víctor Clavijo, Àlex Monner, Pau Durà, Lamine Thior, Carlos Serrano', null, 'On July 14, 2006, the crew of the fishing boat Francisco y Catalina finds a skiff adrift in Mediterranean waters with several African immigrants on board.', 'On July 14, 2006, the crew of the fishing boat Francisco y Catalina finds a skiff adrift in Mediterranean waters with several African immigrants on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adbP0D0HjQTbmlHmjyS7xDM8z5W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227043'),
  ('498578939090480786', 'The Law of Ueki', 2005, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tsubasa Fukuchi', null, 'Romi Park, Tomoko Kawakami', 'TV-PG', 'The fate of the world rests on Ueki, an average junior high student. Average until he gains the power to change trash into trees. Granted to him by the enigmatic Mr K., Ueki’s strange power forces him to participate in the 100-fighter "Battle of Supernatural Powers." If Ueki wins the tournament, Mr. K will become the new King of the Celestial World while Ueki will receive the "Talent of Blank", allowing him to choose any power he desires. However, if Ueki gets too many penalties during the game, he will disappear!', 'The fate of the world rests on Ueki, an average junior high student. Average until he gains the power to change trash into trees. Granted to him by the enigmatic Mr K., Ueki’s strange power forces him to participate in the 100-fighter "Battle of Supernatural Powers." If Ueki wins the tournament, Mr. K will become the new King of the Celestial World while Ueki will receive the "Talent of Blank", allowing him to choose any power he desires. However, if Ueki gets too many penalties during the game, he will disappear!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nry8XaWoKiqVz5hLkBfeFkxUQEe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34852'),
  ('1139871849184382571', 'The Lawyer', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'David Berron, Geir Henning Hopland', null, 'Alexander Karim, Malin Buska, Thomas Bo Larsen, Liv Mjönes, Johannes Lassen, Nicolaj Kopernikus, Susanne Storm, Sara Hjort Ditlevsen', null, 'Frank Nordling is a young and exceptionally promising defense lawyer. When Frank learns the truth behind his parents'' death, his whole world unravels. As children, Frank and his sister Sara witnessed their parents die in an explosion caused by a car bomb. As Frank finds out, they were murdered by one of the leaders in Copenhagen''s criminal underworld, Thomas Waldman. In order to avenge his parents Frank must infiltrate Waldman''s organization and become his personal lawyer and trusted confidant. To avoid putting those close to him in danger, Frank has to keep up appearances and play the game. But can he handle it? Is it worth the price? And who''s really tricking whom?', 'Frank Nordling is a young and exceptionally promising defense lawyer. When Frank learns the truth behind his parents'' death, his whole world unravels. As children, Frank and his sister Sara witnessed their parents die in an explosion caused by a car bomb. As Frank finds out, they were murdered by one of the leaders in Copenhagen''s criminal underworld, Thomas Waldman. In order to avenge his parents Frank must infiltrate Waldman''s organization and become his personal lawyer and trusted confidant. To avoid putting those close to him in danger, Frank has to keep up appearances and play the game. But can he handle it? Is it worth the price? And who''s really tricking whom?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWh7jfPgTpN2J2JmKLNjSdeOydT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:77516'),
  ('740667492005112031', 'The Lazarus Project', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Joe Barton', null, 'Paapa Essiedu, Rudi Dharmalingam, Tom Burke, Anjli Mohindra, Caroline Quentin, Charly Clive, Brian Gleeson, Vinette Robinson', 'TV-MA', 'George wakes up to find himself several months in the past before being recruited for the Lazarus Project – a secret organization that turns back time when the world is at threat of extinction.', 'George wakes up to find himself several months in the past before being recruited for the Lazarus Project – a secret organization that turns back time when the world is at threat of extinction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xw7GkWtmPQDU8qzfKshFEN038sj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:194567'),
  ('323877375195611417', 'The League', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Jeff Schaffer, Jackie Marcus Schaffer', null, 'Mark Duplass, Stephen Rannazzisi, Nick Kroll, Paul Scheer, Jon Lajoie, Katie Aselton', 'TV-MA', 'The League is an American sitcom and semi-improvised comedy about a about a fantasy football league and its members and their everyday lives.', 'The League is an American sitcom and semi-improvised comedy about a about a fantasy football league and its members and their everyday lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6IAasjDdANmalOWkjKcENhirQR.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:31497'),
  ('1013244428284063890', 'The League of Gentlemen', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Steve Pemberton, Mark Gatiss, Reece Shearsmith', 'Mark Gatiss, Reece Shearsmith, Jeremy Dyson', 'Mark Gatiss, Steve Pemberton, Reece Shearsmith, Jeremy Dyson, Isabelle Estelle Corbusier', null, 'The League of Gentlemen is a British sitcom broadcast on BBC Two over three series from 1999 to 2002. In the fictional Northern England town of Royston Vasey—based on Bacup, Lancashire—the lives are explored of dozens of bizarre citizens, much of whom are played by three of the show''s four writers—Mark Gatiss, Steve Pemberton, and Reece Shearsmith—who, along with Jeremy Dyson, formed the titular comedy troupe in 1995. The programme was followed by a film in 2005, and a three-part revival miniseries in December 2017 to celebrate the group''s 20th anniversary.', 'The League of Gentlemen is a British sitcom broadcast on BBC Two over three series from 1999 to 2002. In the fictional Northern England town of Royston Vasey—based on Bacup, Lancashire—the lives are explored of dozens of bizarre citizens, much of whom are played by three of the show''s four writers—Mark Gatiss, Steve Pemberton, and Reece Shearsmith—who, along with Jeremy Dyson, formed the titular comedy troupe in 1995. The programme was followed by a film in 2005, and a three-part revival miniseries in December 2017 to celebrate the group''s 20th anniversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLAWxtYXvqUo4uVwiVsU7ACui6w.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2349'),
  ('1120431777658745123', 'The Least Expected Day: Inside the Movistar Team 2019', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Pro cycling’s Movistar Team sets their sights on victory while on the road as they face challenges, controversy and internal conflict.', 'Pro cycling’s Movistar Team sets their sights on victory while on the road as they face challenges, controversy and internal conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCX7CnjYBrK07k2Y559tuOT0OT1.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:101262'),
  ('340567240927431960', 'The Leftovers', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Damon Lindelof, Tom Perrotta', null, 'Justin Theroux, Amy Brenneman, Christopher Eccleston, Chris Zylka, Carrie Coon, Kevin Carroll, Jovan Adepo', 'TV-MA', 'When 2% of the world''s population abruptly disappears without explanation, the world struggles to understand just what they''re supposed to do about it. This is the story of the people who didn''t make the cut.', 'When 2% of the world''s population abruptly disappears without explanation, the world struggles to understand just what they''re supposed to do about it. This is the story of the people who didn''t make the cut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NKJdryIFHr245Umq6gXsf7oULW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:54344'),
  ('843545506636545301', 'The Legacy', 2014, 'Drama', 'Maya Ilsøe', 'Maya Ilsøe, Maya Ilsøe', 'Trine Dyrholm, Jesper Christensen, Carsten Bjørnlund, Mikkel Boe Følsgaard, Byron Gibson, Marie Bach Hansen, Trond Espen Seim, Annette Katzmann', 'TV-G', 'The death of a matriarch brings forgotten secrets out into the open and causes a prolonged battle for the family inheritance.', 'The death of a matriarch brings forgotten secrets out into the open and causes a prolonged battle for the family inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hS0sQKI5ybxTrFP5bPmRy9KPXMi.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:51823'),
  ('167018580836320844', 'The Legend and the Hero 2', 2009, null, null, null, 'Victor Huang, Ruby Lin, Alan Lau, Lou Qi, Ray Lui, Wang Like, Boya Yan, Miao Haojun', null, 'The Legend and the Hero 2 is a Chinese television series adapted from the classical novel Fengshen Bang by Xu Zhonglin and Lu Xixing. The series was first broadcast on TTV from September to October 2009, and was preceded by The Legend and the Hero in 2007.', 'The Legend and the Hero 2 is a Chinese television series adapted from the classical novel Fengshen Bang by Xu Zhonglin and Lu Xixing. The series was first broadcast on TTV from September to October 2009, and was preceded by The Legend and the Hero in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9qGBVX2MIU4CrHgVAiIOMiqGDp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100192'),
  ('321171597166737064', 'The Legend Liu Shan Men', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Raymond Lam Fung, Dilraba Dilmurat, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Sun Yaoqi, Luo Jin, He Zhonghua, Tu Liman, Shen Baoping', null, 'The Ming Emperor falls into a coma without naming a successor, which leaves the princes and Lord of Qi all vying for the throne. During this time, a series of murders was happening in the capital. Liu Shan Men, a government branch responsible for the safety of the capital, is ordered to investigate. The agents soon discover that the murders are only a precursor to a bigger conspiracy within the royal court.', 'The Ming Emperor falls into a coma without naming a successor, which leaves the princes and Lord of Qi all vying for the throne. During this time, a series of murders was happening in the capital. Liu Shan Men, a government branch responsible for the safety of the capital, is ordered to investigate. The agents soon discover that the murders are only a precursor to a bigger conspiracy within the royal court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRT0pv1ZKuYQgyLpEGd2q2cctpf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90707'),
  ('431179342468812849', 'The Legend of Anle', 2023, 'Drama', 'Xing Ling', 'Zhao Xuan', 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Gong Jun, Liu Yuning, Xia Nan, Pei Zitian, Chen Tao, Wang Yiting, Li Shuting', null, 'Legend has it that the Han and Di families together established the Great Jing. However, ten years ago, the Di family was convicted of treason, leaving behind only one orphaned girl imprisoned in Daishan. Ten years later, Han Ye, the determined crown prince who aimed to rescue the Di family''s lone survivor, unexpectedly crossed paths with a spirited and enchanting female pirate who claimed that she would marry none other than him. She called herself Ren Anle and brought with her a fleet of thirty thousand soldiers, arriving in the capital city to seek the prince''s hand in marriage. Throughout the process of relentlessly pursuing Han Ye, Ren Anle demonstrated remarkable wit and intelligence. As their shared values and national aspirations aligned, Han Ye couldn''t help but develop affection for Ren Anle.', 'Legend has it that the Han and Di families together established the Great Jing. However, ten years ago, the Di family was convicted of treason, leaving behind only one orphaned girl imprisoned in Daishan. Ten years later, Han Ye, the determined crown prince who aimed to rescue the Di family''s lone survivor, unexpectedly crossed paths with a spirited and enchanting female pirate who claimed that she would marry none other than him. She called herself Ren Anle and brought with her a fleet of thirty thousand soldiers, arriving in the capital city to seek the prince''s hand in marriage. Throughout the process of relentlessly pursuing Han Ye, Ren Anle demonstrated remarkable wit and intelligence. As their shared values and national aspirations aligned, Han Ye couldn''t help but develop affection for Ren Anle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/td2imRpNMZBbl3kXU2laYAFdqDL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134679'),
  ('844990451875183272', 'The Legend of Bruce Lee', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Qian Lin-sen, Zhang Jianguang', 'Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Wang Luoyong, Akasha Villalobos, Gary Daniels, Michael Jai White, Ray Park, Ning Li, Liu Tengyuan', 'TV-14', 'The story of the legendary martial arts icon Bruce Lee following him from Hong Kong to America and back again, leading up to his tragic death at the age of 32.', 'The story of the legendary martial arts icon Bruce Lee following him from Hong Kong to America and back again, leading up to his tragic death at the age of 32.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t79JopFvZUhg2jaWB6ojIuMgKDz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5953'),
  ('857020540577352914', 'The Legend of Chinese Gods', 1999, 'Kids', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cbjoMPJ8gC7mxJW1kZ2Sj4b4gD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115052'),
  ('318449498251072514', 'The Legend of Chusen', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Xiao Ding', null, 'Li Yifeng, Zhao Liying, Yang Zi, Tang Yixin, Ding Yi, Chen Chuang, Shu Chang, Cheng Yi', 'TV-14', 'Can a man love a woman but still take down her father? Zhang Xiao Fan and his childhood friend Lin Jing Yu were the only survivors of the Grass Village massacre that wiped out both of their families. Taken in by the Qing Yun Sect, the boys were trained in the ways of the Immortal Sword. Xiao Fan falls in love with Bi Yao, the daughter of the Ghost King. But when the Ghost King tries to grow his power by overthrowing the Qing Yun Sect, Xiao Fan must choose between protecting his people and hurting the woman he loves.', 'Can a man love a woman but still take down her father? Zhang Xiao Fan and his childhood friend Lin Jing Yu were the only survivors of the Grass Village massacre that wiped out both of their families. Taken in by the Qing Yun Sect, the boys were trained in the ways of the Immortal Sword. Xiao Fan falls in love with Bi Yao, the daughter of the Ghost King. But when the Ghost King tries to grow his power by overthrowing the Qing Yun Sect, Xiao Fan must choose between protecting his people and hurting the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaDwqHsXrTm4uF5Lz9Pn31PpFmh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67814'),
  ('1116418555061326719', 'The Legend of Condor Hero', 2001, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mie Sonozaki, Jouji Nakata, Shiho Kikuchi, Chieko Honda, Urara Takano, Daisuke Namikawa, Hikaru Ikeda, Hozumi Goda', null, 'The Legend of Condor Hero is a Japanese/Chinese animation. It''s an anime adaptation of The Return of the Condor Heroes, a wuxia novel by Louis Cha.', 'The Legend of Condor Hero is a Japanese/Chinese animation. It''s an anime adaptation of The Return of the Condor Heroes, a wuxia novel by Louis Cha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPL8h0wzGAGWMTCEF3xWI0Suxng.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37558'),
  ('268078152618673514', 'The Legend of Crazy Monk', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Benny Chan Ho-Man, Lam Tze-Chung, Lin Jiangguo, Zhang Baowen, Chen Zihan, Yang Xue, Liang Zhang, Ye Zuxin', null, 'Ji Gong, a reincarnated Arhat with a rebellious spirit and a heart for justice, uses his wit and courage to battle vengeful supernatural forces and protect the people., becoming a legendary monk celebrated for generations.', 'Ji Gong, a reincarnated Arhat with a rebellious spirit and a heart for justice, uses his wit and courage to battle vengeful supernatural forces and protect the people., becoming a legendary monk celebrated for generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyer48w4iG01F6yRuqHxADKh2uu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:111097'),
  ('976543762088056348', 'The Legend of El Cid', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'José Velasco, Luis Arranz', null, 'Jaime Lorente, Francisco Ortiz, Alicia Sanz, Jaime Olías, Lucía Guerrero, Pablo Álvarez, Adrián Salzedo, David Castillo', 'TV-14', 'The story of Rodrigo Díaz de Vivar, a Castilian nobleman and war hero in medieval Spain.', 'The story of Rodrigo Díaz de Vivar, a Castilian nobleman and war hero in medieval Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTDpdYASFxX45GWkGPHmS74BNvz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94167'),
  ('550124997857250633', 'The Legend of Hanuman', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Charuvi Agrawal, Jeevan J. Kang, Sharad Devarajan', 'Sharad Devarajan, Sarwat Chadda, Shivangi Singh', 'Sharad Kelkar', 'TV-14', 'When the power-hungry Ravan tore through the world to unleash evil, in his way stood a humble vaanar awoken to his divinity to become an immortal legend. The series follows Hanuman and his transformation from a mighty warrior to a god and how Hanuman became the beacon of hope amidst the harrowing darkness.', 'When the power-hungry Ravan tore through the world to unleash evil, in his way stood a humble vaanar awoken to his divinity to become an immortal legend. The series follows Hanuman and his transformation from a mighty warrior to a god and how Hanuman became the beacon of hope amidst the harrowing darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PBsrG43twpomowfSHjNfug7FWF.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:117736'),
  ('280010295294125623', 'The Legend of Hao Lan', 2019, 'Drama', null, 'Fei''er Di', 'Wu Jinyan, Mao Zijun, Nie Yuan, Ning Jing, Wang Zhifei, Hai Ling, Tong Mengshi, Tan Zhuo', null, 'Towards the end of the Warring States Era, the States of Qin and Zhao are engaged in a lengthy battle. Li Hao Lan, daughter of the Censor-in-chief of Zhao, is forced out of her own home after being set up by her stepmother. Having nothing to her name, she is sold as a slave and purchased by Lu Buwei, who is cleverly able to marry Hao Lan to Ying Yiren, a Qin royal who resides in Zhao as a hostage. However, Hao Lan and Buwei''s presence in the Zhao palace ignites a dangerous battle, as they rely on their wits to evade Princess Ya’s devious schemes.', 'Towards the end of the Warring States Era, the States of Qin and Zhao are engaged in a lengthy battle. Li Hao Lan, daughter of the Censor-in-chief of Zhao, is forced out of her own home after being set up by her stepmother. Having nothing to her name, she is sold as a slave and purchased by Lu Buwei, who is cleverly able to marry Hao Lan to Ying Yiren, a Qin royal who resides in Zhao as a hostage. However, Hao Lan and Buwei''s presence in the Zhao palace ignites a dangerous battle, as they rely on their wits to evade Princess Ya’s devious schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7448u15eLP1IqNKarztxDqC9BCv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86053'),
  ('552227249304714869', 'The Legend of Heroes', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Louis Cha', 'Cao Xiaotian', 'Zhou Yiwei, Gao Weiguang, Peter Ho, Ming Dao', null, 'In the late Southern Song Dynasty, as the Jin forces invaded, the Guo and Yang families faced tragedy. Taoist Qiu Chuji and the Seven Freaks of Jiangnan bet to train their descendants in martial arts. Guo Jing and Yang Kang, growing up under different circumstances, face various challenges. Guo Jing and Huang Rong develop a relationship amid turmoil, while Yang Kang''s actions affect those around him.', 'In the late Southern Song Dynasty, as the Jin forces invaded, the Guo and Yang families faced tragedy. Taoist Qiu Chuji and the Seven Freaks of Jiangnan bet to train their descendants in martial arts. Guo Jing and Yang Kang, growing up under different circumstances, face various challenges. Guo Jing and Huang Rong develop a relationship amid turmoil, while Yang Kang''s actions affect those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVOEMyOJx6pQ3ngacvkxiMZbnMD.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:235351'),
  ('361129178787725805', 'The Legend of Heroes: Trails of Cold Steel - Northern War', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Makoto Koichi, Yuichi Nakamura, Sarah Emi Bridcutt, Yuki Ono, Haruhiko Jo, Mie Sonozaki, Takayuki Kondo, Jun Fukushima', 'TV-14', 'To protect her hometown from the Erebonian Empire and to distinguish herself from her grandfather’s disloyalty, Lavie enlists in the Northern Jaegers where she’ll do whatever it takes to carry out the mission. Now this rule breaker must form a platoon to embark on a dangerous recon mission into enemy lines—will her mission be a success?', 'To protect her hometown from the Erebonian Empire and to distinguish herself from her grandfather’s disloyalty, Lavie enlists in the Northern Jaegers where she’ll do whatever it takes to carry out the mission. Now this rule breaker must form a platoon to embark on a dangerous recon mission into enemy lines—will her mission be a success?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAtZjluWUGDHXSTrnLFOKkkIYHi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120470'),
  ('789805801889898823', 'The Legend of Korra', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Bryan Konietzko, Michael Dante DiMartino', null, 'Janet Varney, David Faustino, P.J. Byrne, Seychelle Gabriel, J.K. Simmons, Dee Bradley Baker', 'TV-Y7', 'Avatar Korra, a headstrong, rebellious, feisty young woman who continually challenges and breaks with tradition, is on her quest to become a fully realized Avatar. In this story, the Avatar struggles to find balance within herself.', 'Avatar Korra, a headstrong, rebellious, feisty young woman who continually challenges and breaks with tradition, is on her quest to become a fully realized Avatar. In this story, the Avatar struggles to find balance within herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZgYvSfuh1YHDrJuILlVQ5oA2hF.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:33880'),
  ('361246937092354113', 'The Legend of Luo Xiaohei', 2011, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'MTJJ', 'MTJJ', 'Shan Xin, Wang Zhen, Sheng Feng, Teng Xin', null, 'The story begins on a rainy night, when a homeless little black cat is brought home by a young girl Luo Xiaobai. She names the cat Luo Xiao Hei. However, Luo Xiao Hei is no ordinary cat: he is a supernatural entity that hosts several small creatures called Heixiu. As Luo Xiao Hei new life soon threatened by the mysterious Diting, who commands three winged wolves.', 'The story begins on a rainy night, when a homeless little black cat is brought home by a young girl Luo Xiaobai. She names the cat Luo Xiao Hei. However, Luo Xiao Hei is no ordinary cat: he is a supernatural entity that hosts several small creatures called Heixiu. As Luo Xiao Hei new life soon threatened by the mysterious Diting, who commands three winged wolves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDhBjhFknuPx3mcCInuTa3XaQmw.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88319'),
  ('533334174545707681', 'The Legend of Prince Valiant', 1991, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Robby Benson, Noelle North, Michael Horton, Alan Oppenheimer, Efrem Zimbalist Jr., James Avery, Samantha Eggar, Tim Curry', null, 'After his kingdom is usurped, Prince Valliant sets out on a thrilling quest to find Camelot and join King Arthur''s Knights of the Round Table.', 'After his kingdom is usurped, Prince Valliant sets out on a thrilling quest to find Camelot and join King Arthur''s Knights of the Round Table.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1ozWw5J7oVL4BqGOA86Pyl2Wvi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:529'),
  ('882231791629450053', 'The Legend of Qin', 2007, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, War & Politics, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Lei Wu, Liu Yijia', null, 'The Legend of Qin follows the Qin dynasty from when the Emperor of the Qin, King Zheng conquered the other 6 nations and unified China, to the rise of the king of Western Chu, Xiang Yu, who capture the capital city, Xianyang.', 'The Legend of Qin follows the Qin dynasty from when the Emperor of the Qin, King Zheng conquered the other 6 nations and unified China, to the rise of the king of Western Chu, Xiang Yu, who capture the capital city, Xianyang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DbO3oDr5GxXYC2nQ3MHIcTsrRc.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:45279'),
  ('1077300297525638279', 'The Legend of ShenLi', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Zhao Liying, Lin Gengxin, Xin Yunlai, He Yu, Jackie Li, Zeng Li, Xuan Lu, Liu Guanlin', null, 'The ancient gods died, and there is only one last god in the world - Xingzhi. Rumor has it that this God of Action has lived alone in the heavens for tens of thousands of years, ruthless and lustless. In the battle of the immortals and demons, he turned the tide by himself, and since then, Du Men has been swept away, and his traces are hard to find. Hundreds of years are just a click away. As the queen who was born with a pearl in the devil world, Shen Li''s life was bright and dazzling. But on the occasion of her thousand-year-old birthday, the claws of political marriage were scratching their heads. On the way to escape from the marriage, Shen Li was beaten back to the original form of a phoenix and fell to the world with injuries. When she was seriously injured and comatose, the mortal hawker treated her as a fat chicken, plucked all the hair from her body, and locked her in a cage for sale. The fate of the two is tightly linked by a seemingly casual transaction.', 'The ancient gods died, and there is only one last god in the world - Xingzhi. Rumor has it that this God of Action has lived alone in the heavens for tens of thousands of years, ruthless and lustless. In the battle of the immortals and demons, he turned the tide by himself, and since then, Du Men has been swept away, and his traces are hard to find. Hundreds of years are just a click away. As the queen who was born with a pearl in the devil world, Shen Li''s life was bright and dazzling. But on the occasion of her thousand-year-old birthday, the claws of political marriage were scratching their heads. On the way to escape from the marriage, Shen Li was beaten back to the original form of a phoenix and fell to the world with injuries. When she was seriously injured and comatose, the mortal hawker treated her as a fat chicken, plucked all the hair from her body, and locked her in a cage for sale. The fate of the two is tightly linked by a seemingly casual transaction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVlSN6xr9IsTwRSNvZqkLg8ZLnl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:207668'),
  ('509634964091207265', 'The Legend of Tarzan', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Kids', 'Bill Motz, Bob Roth', null, 'Michael T. Weiss, Olivia D''Abo, Jeff Bennett, Jim Cummings, April Winchell', 'TV-Y7', 'The Legend of Tarzan picks up where the 1999 feature film left off, with the title character adjusting to his new role as leader of the apes following Kerchak''s death, and Jane adjusting to life in the jungle. Rounding out the cast are Jane''s father, Professor Archimedes Porter; Tantor, the germophobic elephant; and Terk, a wisecracking female gorilla and Tarzan''s old wrestling buddy.', 'The Legend of Tarzan picks up where the 1999 feature film left off, with the title character adjusting to his new role as leader of the apes following Kerchak''s death, and Jane adjusting to life in the jungle. Rounding out the cast are Jane''s father, Professor Archimedes Porter; Tantor, the germophobic elephant; and Terk, a wisecracking female gorilla and Tarzan''s old wrestling buddy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5mGLHBT59nFilSPgd5TgJnZ1ix.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2395'),
  ('640658591266603349', 'The Legend of the Blue Sea', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Park Ji-eun', 'Park Ji-eun', 'Gianna Jun, Lee Min-ho, Shin Hye-sun, Lee Hee-jun, Shin Won-ho, Hwang Shin-hye, Sung Dong-il, Moon So-ri', null, 'A mermaid from the Joseon period ends up in present-day Seoul, where she crosses paths with a swindler who may have ties to someone from her past.', 'A mermaid from the Joseon period ends up in present-day Seoul, where she crosses paths with a swindler who may have ties to someone from her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHrhnci45nyoqctI33lgB0iX9Zy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67018'),
  ('162583484271752590', 'The Legend of the Book and Sword', 1987, null, null, null, 'Nixon Pang, Jacqueline Law Wai-Guen, Fiona Leung Ngai-Ling, Kitty Lai Mei-Han, Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah, Barbara Chan, Simon Yam, Kwan Ching', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JO5VPlVWpZWTYUcAN7gyxV939s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96924'),
  ('531643576862449684', 'The Legend of the Condor Heroes', 1983, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Johnnie To', 'Johnnie To', 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Barbara Yung, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Sharon Yeung, Danny Lau Dan, Yeung Chak-Lam, Kenneth Tsang, Chun Wong', null, 'The Legend of the Condor Heroes is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. It was first broadcast on TVB Jade in Hong Kong in 1983. The 59 episodes long series is divided into three parts. This 1983 version is considered by many to be a classic television adaptation of the novel and features the breakthrough role of Barbara Yung, who played Huang Rong.', 'The Legend of the Condor Heroes is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. It was first broadcast on TVB Jade in Hong Kong in 1983. The 59 episodes long series is divided into three parts. This 1983 version is considered by many to be a classic television adaptation of the novel and features the breakthrough role of Barbara Yung, who played Huang Rong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM8VdOgMexR3matMup5DoFN6F4T.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:104'),
  ('723812943931846508', 'The Legend of the Condor Heroes', 1988, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Li Chao-Yung, Wang Chi-Sheng', null, 'Huang Wenhao, Idy Chan Yuk-Lin, 邱淑宜, Danny Poon Wang-Ban', null, 'During the Song Dynasty, a Mongolian raised Han Boy begins a path to becomes a legendary national hero in China.', 'During the Song Dynasty, a Mongolian raised Han Boy begins a path to becomes a legendary national hero in China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BvwWjVsnu7Z5XqCRxxkgOq7EAo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:129962'),
  ('122517097015336992', 'The Legend of the Condor Heroes', 1994, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Julian Cheung Chi-Lam, Athena Chu Yan, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Emily Kwan Bo-Wai, Felix Lok Ying-Kwan, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Danny Lau Dan, Chu Tit-Wo', null, 'The Legend of the Condor Heroes is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. The series was first broadcast on TVB Jade in 1994.', 'The Legend of the Condor Heroes is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel of the same title. The series was first broadcast on TVB Jade in 1994.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFc9q0aukqLipT1Oyt1fk4udjyV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80935'),
  ('122388081657748766', 'The Legend of the Condor Heroes', 2017, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Jeffrey Chiang', null, 'Yang Xuwen, Li Yitong, Chen Xingxu, Meng Ziyi, Zhao Lixin, Liu Zhiyang, Wang Kuirong, Xiao Yin', null, 'During the Southern Song dynasty, Guo Jing and Yang Kang, two boys orphaned by war, grow up on opposite paths—one becoming a patriotic hero, the other consumed by ambition and betrayal.', 'During the Southern Song dynasty, Guo Jing and Yang Kang, two boys orphaned by war, grow up on opposite paths—one becoming a patriotic hero, the other consumed by ambition and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCT2zw90GvrBCnZDGZqDlVoAuJU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69530'),
  ('32407575801980033', 'The Legend of the Galactic Heroes: Die Neue These', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Kenichi Suzumura, Yuuichirou Umehara, Ryota Takeuchi, Aya Endo, Toru Sakurai, Tasuku Hatanaka, Yuki Kaji', 'TV-MA', 'Caught in a 150-year-long war, interstellar nations reach the pinnacle of strategic combat at the hands of two genius leaders. Reinhard of the Galactic Empire, and Yang of the Free Planets Alliance lead the charge from opposing fronts. Fighting is their destiny, but in this vast universe torn by political intrigue, their greatest enemy may not be each other.', 'Caught in a 150-year-long war, interstellar nations reach the pinnacle of strategic combat at the hands of two genius leaders. Reinhard of the Galactic Empire, and Yang of the Free Planets Alliance lead the charge from opposing fronts. Fighting is their destiny, but in this vast universe torn by political intrigue, their greatest enemy may not be each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FI2S1UfV6Sm7zfR3D1i2cqwDEa.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:74018'),
  ('1152209970927891712', 'The Legend of the Legendary Heroes', 2010, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saki Fujita, Miyuki Sawashiro, Anri Katsu, Satoshi Hino, Atsushi Imaruoka, Ayahi Takagaki, Jun Fukuyama, Mikako Takahashi', 'TV-14', 'At his emperor''s command, Ryner Lute and his long-time comrade Ferris set out on a search for the Heroic Relics. During this journey, Ryner makes a shocking discovery - a deadly curse is spreading across the continent.', 'At his emperor''s command, Ryner Lute and his long-time comrade Ferris set out on a search for the Heroic Relics. During this journey, Ryner makes a shocking discovery - a deadly curse is spreading across the continent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEwhuJ0mQGFJI4oGGewXfMMnmNy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36089'),
  ('110328415518648606', 'The Legend Of The Song Dynasty: Zhao Kuang Yin', 2015, 'War & Politics', null, null, 'Chen Jianbin, Yin Tao, Shao Feng, Qiu Shuang, Wang Huichun, Tian Ling, Zhou Yang, Li Jianxin', null, 'Zhao Kuangyin was the founding emperor of imperial China''s Song Dynasty, reigning from 960 until his death. During his reign, he conquered the states of Southern Tang, Later Shu, Southern Han and Jingnan, thus reunifying most of China proper and effectively ending the tumultuous Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms period. He was succeeded by Emperor Taizong, his younger brother who possibly murdered him for the throne.', 'Zhao Kuangyin was the founding emperor of imperial China''s Song Dynasty, reigning from 960 until his death. During his reign, he conquered the states of Southern Tang, Later Shu, Southern Han and Jingnan, thus reunifying most of China proper and effectively ending the tumultuous Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms period. He was succeeded by Emperor Taizong, his younger brother who possibly murdered him for the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XxDjwEVtwX2Izb8ykTyv4JO4bX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128877'),
  ('89102116132473226', 'The Legend of Vox Machina', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chris Prynoski', null, 'Laura Bailey, Taliesin Jaffe, Ashley Johnson, Liam O''Brien, Marisha Ray, Sam Riegel, Travis Willingham', 'TV-MA', 'They''re rowdy, they''re ragtag, they''re misfits turned mercenaries for hire. Vox Machina is more interested in easy money and cheap ale than actually protecting the realm. But when the kingdom is threatened by evil, this boisterous crew realizes that they are the only ones capable of restoring justice.', 'They''re rowdy, they''re ragtag, they''re misfits turned mercenaries for hire. Vox Machina is more interested in easy money and cheap ale than actually protecting the realm. But when the kingdom is threatened by evil, this boisterous crew realizes that they are the only ones capable of restoring justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5A0qkGrZJTyVv3gT6b8clFEz9R.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:135934'),
  ('527509504568377823', 'The Legend of White Snake', 2019, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Zhi Lei', null, 'Ju Jingyi, Yu Menglong, Pei Zitian, Xiao Yan, Nie Zihao, Feng Jianyu, Yu Lang, Li Lin', 'TV-14', 'Provoked by the actions of a seemingly sly human, an ancient snake spirit takes on a human form, in order to prove him a fraud. Convinced she’s doing the world a favor, Bai Su Zhen challenges Xu Xuan to a contest of skill but what starts as a heated rivalry soon turns to burning passion. Faced with opposition from every side, Bai Su Zhen and Xu Xuan’s love is put to the test time and time again.', 'Provoked by the actions of a seemingly sly human, an ancient snake spirit takes on a human form, in order to prove him a fraud. Convinced she’s doing the world a favor, Bai Su Zhen challenges Xu Xuan to a contest of skill but what starts as a heated rivalry soon turns to burning passion. Faced with opposition from every side, Bai Su Zhen and Xu Xuan’s love is put to the test time and time again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZYBRDnpgMcDI3h5ZovCRS2NJvX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88146'),
  ('1117139098251579379', 'The Legend of Wong Tai Sin', 1986, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Gam Chi-Fai', null, 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Patrick Tse Yin, Sheren Tang Shui-Man, Kitty Lai Mei-Han, Rebecca Chan, Patricia Chong, Susanna Au-Yeung Pui-San, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan', null, 'The Legend of Wong Tai Sin is a TVB television series premiered in 1986 based on the story of Wong Tai Sin.', 'The Legend of Wong Tai Sin is a TVB television series premiered in 1986 based on the story of Wong Tai Sin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qA1QXHPDHlUhm0UhCytUXPOnNgB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108081'),
  ('289176076852953573', 'The Legend of Wuhun Continent', 2025, 'Animation', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1sUFEyyCLKyzczQiYlDac13orD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:300840'),
  ('726376841504478931', 'The Legend of Xiao Chuo', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', null, null, 'Tang Yan, Shawn Dou, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Jing Chao, Tan Kai, Liu Yijun, Lu Shan, Ji Chen', null, 'Late in the 10th century, the Liao dynasty is at the zenith of its power. The omnipotent Liao rule much of what is now Northeast China, Mongolia, Russia, and much of the Korean Peninsula. Prime Minister Xiao Si Wen and Princess Yan have three daughters, with the youngest, Xiao Chao, their favourite. Her heart belongs to the aspiring military commander, Han De Rang, whose family have served the Liao loyally for decades. However, her parents have other plans, sucessfully arranging her marriage to Liao Emperor, Jin Zhong, whom she eventually concedes to marry. As the Emperor’s queen, she becomes a fierce defender of the Liao by assisting in mobilizing the army, heading a 10,000-strong cavalry and providing support to the civil administration. Eventually, she will earn the title of Empress.', 'Late in the 10th century, the Liao dynasty is at the zenith of its power. The omnipotent Liao rule much of what is now Northeast China, Mongolia, Russia, and much of the Korean Peninsula. Prime Minister Xiao Si Wen and Princess Yan have three daughters, with the youngest, Xiao Chao, their favourite. Her heart belongs to the aspiring military commander, Han De Rang, whose family have served the Liao loyally for decades. However, her parents have other plans, sucessfully arranging her marriage to Liao Emperor, Jin Zhong, whom she eventually concedes to marry. As the Emperor’s queen, she becomes a fierce defender of the Liao by assisting in mobilizing the army, heading a 10,000-strong cavalry and providing support to the civil administration. Eventually, she will earn the title of Empress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gFLWSsC3JpvUkJvDnoP49jkHvg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112542'),
  ('237401012508012171', 'The Legend of Zorro', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Maria Kawamura, Toshihiko Seki, Rica Matsumoto, Jurota Kosugi, Kenyu Horiuchi, Kozo Shioya, Ai Orikasa, Ai Satou', null, 'Diego Vega returns from his study trip to discover his homeland is under the army''s dictatorship. Diego, refusing to watch idly, disguises himself as Zorro to protect the weak and oppressed. Diego is not a coward but he is unable to win the affections of his sweetheart, Lolita, who is attracted to other more noble men. Diego serenades Lolita as Zorro and fights the evils of his homeland, hoping to capture her heart.', 'Diego Vega returns from his study trip to discover his homeland is under the army''s dictatorship. Diego, refusing to watch idly, disguises himself as Zorro to protect the weak and oppressed. Diego is not a coward but he is unable to win the affections of his sweetheart, Lolita, who is attracted to other more noble men. Diego serenades Lolita as Zorro and fights the evils of his homeland, hoping to capture her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNxDr0pGaYqc1JllTAPXJTvTZUg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17017'),
  ('711750855163361886', 'The Legend of Zu', 2015, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yu Ting''er, Chen Zheyuan, Nicky Wu, Liu Yitong, Nie Zihao, Liu Sitong, Wei Chunguang, Bian Yuan', null, 'He was the chosen one. Lu Pao is a dangerous swordsman who is out to get his hands on the powerful Red Ghost Stone. The Sushan School, China’s most famous and influential martial arts school, is the guardian of the stone and protector of the world. The school’s headmaster puts the precious Red Ghost Stone into the body of the talented young swordsman Ding Yin in order to keep it from falling into Lu Pao’s hands. Ding Yin enters the Sushan School to train to become the best swordsman in the world and vows to keep the world safe from the evil doings of Lu Pao. But then Ding Yin meets Lu Pao’s daughter, Yu Wu Xing, who looks just like his dead wife. When Ding Yin falls in love with Wu Xing, will he be able to carry out his mission?', 'He was the chosen one. Lu Pao is a dangerous swordsman who is out to get his hands on the powerful Red Ghost Stone. The Sushan School, China’s most famous and influential martial arts school, is the guardian of the stone and protector of the world. The school’s headmaster puts the precious Red Ghost Stone into the body of the talented young swordsman Ding Yin in order to keep it from falling into Lu Pao’s hands. Ding Yin enters the Sushan School to train to become the best swordsman in the world and vows to keep the world safe from the evil doings of Lu Pao. But then Ding Yin meets Lu Pao’s daughter, Yu Wu Xing, who looks just like his dead wife. When Ding Yin falls in love with Wu Xing, will he be able to carry out his mission?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ADOi9I4QMvO3DaYCwms4euOyWZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65665'),
  ('1092228124834294815', 'The Legendary Four Aces', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', null, '關頌玲', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Esther Kwan Wing-Ho, Bobby Au-Yeung Tsan-Wah, Marco Ngai Chun-Git, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Yvonne Yung Hung, Annie Man Chung-Han, Nadia Chan Chung-Ling', null, 'Four scholarly people who find love. There is the smart and dashing Tang Bo Hu played by Nick Cheung. Greedy Chu Tse San (Bobby), noble and honest Wen Jing Ming (Gordon), and the guy who goes a long Chow Wen Bing (Macro).', 'Four scholarly people who find love. There is the smart and dashing Tang Bo Hu played by Nick Cheung. Greedy Chu Tse San (Bobby), noble and honest Wen Jing Ming (Gordon), and the guy who goes a long Chow Wen Bing (Macro).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPP4K3Fnah7erbFNrelx6Otz6qL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87602'),
  ('412358046828708364', 'The Legendary Hero Is Dead!', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Wataru Katoh, Shunichi Toki, Ayana Taketatsu, Hibiku Yamamura, Yurika Kubo, Yuichi Nakamura, Sayaka Ohara, Wataru Hatano', 'TV-14', 'Touka is just your average (slightly perverted) farmer in the village of Cheza. While he daydreams about being a hero and getting the girl, the real hero, Sion, is out battling demons that threaten to invade the world! But one day, Touka accidentally kills the hero…?! With the Legendary Hero dead, who''s going to save the world now?! Touka quickly buries Sion''s body to hide the evidence, but wakes up the next day to discover he is no longer in his own body…!!', 'Touka is just your average (slightly perverted) farmer in the village of Cheza. While he daydreams about being a hero and getting the girl, the real hero, Sion, is out battling demons that threaten to invade the world! But one day, Touka accidentally kills the hero…?! With the Legendary Hero dead, who''s going to save the world now?! Touka quickly buries Sion''s body to hide the evidence, but wakes up the next day to discover he is no longer in his own body…!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfROsNTtbheDWFrkzQiXm3kkcdo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200750'),
  ('976143013234209536', 'The Legendary Tavern', 2019, 'Drama', null, '高满堂, 李洲', 'Qin Hailu, Liu Hua, Chen Baoguo, Feng Lei, Cheng Yu, Feng Enhe, Wang Xiaochen, Gong Hanlin', null, 'Chen Huaihai leads his fellows to explore new lives in northeast China by running a tavern. They experience different situations and make a whole new life.', 'Chen Huaihai leads his fellows to explore new lives in northeast China by running a tavern. They experience different situations and make a whole new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie7wnR7KzrBxS8oAhw4G07xK0iP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92655'),
  ('1069029534127229298', 'The Legends', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Yang Qianzi', 'Bai Lu, Xu Kai, Dai Xu, Xiao Yan, Mi Lu, Fu Jia, Liu Yuqiao, Yang Ze', null, 'While attempting to take her predecessor’s Wanjun Sword, Lu Zhao Yao is ambushed by the ten immortal sects and mistakenly believes Li Chen Lan is related to the incident after he is revealed to be the previous cult leader’s son. Five years later, Li Chen Lan has taken over the position of cult leader, and Zhao Yao decides to exact revenge with the help of cultivator Qin Zhi Yan, though slowly falls in love with him instead.', 'While attempting to take her predecessor’s Wanjun Sword, Lu Zhao Yao is ambushed by the ten immortal sects and mistakenly believes Li Chen Lan is related to the incident after he is revealed to be the previous cult leader’s son. Five years later, Li Chen Lan has taken over the position of cult leader, and Zhao Yao decides to exact revenge with the help of cultivator Qin Zhi Yan, though slowly falls in love with him instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v03oi11BKxpjCCw8tOZmqy8k7cx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86291'),
  ('270473134406740562', 'The Legion of Extraordinary Dancers', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Jon M. Chu', null, 'Roger Aaron Brown', 'NR', 'Join seemingly ordinary people who discover they have extraordinary powers in a groundbreaking mythology about hope, greed, love and the force that moves us all.', 'Join seemingly ordinary people who discover they have extraordinary powers in a groundbreaking mythology about hope, greed, love and the force that moves us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5OWGTu2LZsytgNQu9vfwNquZLk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:34466'),
  ('134735232309973647', 'The Leopard', 2025, 'Drama', 'Richard Warlow', null, 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Benedetta Porcaroli, Saul Nanni, Paolo Calabresi, Astrid Meloni, Francesco Colella, Greta Esposito', 'TV-MA', 'Amid the unification of 1860s Italy, a Sicilian prince grapples with the collision between his family''s ancient privilege and revolutionary change.', 'Amid the unification of 1860s Italy, a Sicilian prince grapples with the collision between his family''s ancient privilege and revolutionary change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mbS9n5d98ULdTZREUf8TlgNNoD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225399'),
  ('1054245671760123897', 'The Lesson', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Dikla Keidar', null, 'Maya Landsmann, Doron Ben-David, Alma Zack, Dvir Benedek, Ronit Apel, Michelle Riaboy, Irit Kaplan, Moshe Folkenflick', null, 'In a sleepy high school in Kfar Sava, in a Citizenship class, 12th-grader Lianne and her teacher Amir get into a heated political confrontation that gets out of hand and soon reaches personal and painful places.', 'In a sleepy high school in Kfar Sava, in a Citizenship class, 12th-grader Lianne and her teacher Amir get into a heated political confrontation that gets out of hand and soon reaches personal and painful places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Arbgu9JZXuuDfua9MLFF1IdpIzt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155319'),
  ('246296368333068873', 'The Letdown', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Sarah Scheller, Alison Bell', null, 'Alison Bell, Duncan Fellows, Sacha Horler, Leon Ford, Lucy Durack, Celeste Barber, Leah Vandenberg, Xana Tang', null, 'Audrey is determined not to be defined by motherhood. In theory, this seems fairly easy. In practice, her career-focused husband, self-obsessed mother & fancy-free best friend, make it damn near impossible.', 'Audrey is determined not to be defined by motherhood. In theory, this seems fairly easy. In practice, her career-focused husband, self-obsessed mother & fancy-free best friend, make it damn near impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTG4W8IzKvsJshBVaN2aYfhGrfB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75297'),
  ('814162573471082931', 'The Letter for the King', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Family', 'William Davies', null, 'Amir Wilson, Ruby Ashbourne Serkis, Thaddea Graham, Islam Bouakkaz, Jonah Lees, Jack Barton, Nathanael Saleh, Gijs Blom', 'TV-PG', 'A young boy holds the fate of the kingdom in his hands when he embarks on a quest to deliver a secret message in this sweeping fantasy series.', 'A young boy holds the fate of the kingdom in his hands when he embarks on a quest to deliver a secret message in this sweeping fantasy series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Pwp6tqn0bKRQsbisuJ0t5rBub0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99356'),
  ('917535653286145875', 'the letter of the day', 2026, 'Kids', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GX2Kj9CBvqMYPyZBiyZvkXdHx0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312953'),
  ('566465651291742383', 'The Level', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Karla Crome, Laura Haddock, Robert James-Collier, Noel Clarke, Amanda Burton, Lindsey Coulson, Philip Glenister, Geoff Bell', 'NR', 'A police detective finds herself at the centre of the most dangerous case of her life when she is seconded on to the investigation into the murder of a drugs trafficker. What nobody around her knows is that she is the missing witness that the police and the killer are searching for.', 'A police detective finds herself at the centre of the most dangerous case of her life when she is seconded on to the investigation into the murder of a drugs trafficker. What nobody around her knows is that she is the missing witness that the police and the killer are searching for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gr6AXTokpsEOBoXUz9ghjq7Nvyv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68059'),
  ('88039231331312984', 'The Liar and His Lover', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kotomi Aoki', null, 'Lee Hyun-woo, JOY, Choi Min-soo, Lee Jung-jin, Kim In-kwon, Im Ye-jin, Lee Seo-won, Sung Joo', null, 'Kang Han-Kyeol is a great yet sullen composer who becomes inspired by the voices of others and keeps his identity secret from people. He meets Yoon So-Rim, a high school student who possesses beautiful singing, whilst under his secret identity, and she falls in love with him. Adaptation of the manga by Kotomi Aoki under the same name, which has been running since 2009.', 'Kang Han-Kyeol is a great yet sullen composer who becomes inspired by the voices of others and keeps his identity secret from people. He meets Yoon So-Rim, a high school student who possesses beautiful singing, whilst under his secret identity, and she falls in love with him. Adaptation of the manga by Kotomi Aoki under the same name, which has been running since 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCwhU9oTA08tDCGR8sRc13Bt1SV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70191'),
  ('455558869487082409', 'The Liberator', 2020, 'War & Politics, Drama, Animation', 'Jeb Stuart', null, 'Bradley James, Martin Sensmeier, Jose Miguel Vasquez, Mike Rowe', 'TV-MA', 'A diverse, dedicated, rough-and-tumble squad of soldiers spearheads the Allied invasion of Italy during World War II.', 'A diverse, dedicated, rough-and-tumble squad of soldiers spearheads the Allied invasion of Italy during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kivHJpsGFWgqnDMRDnnpOSgLD1s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111462'),
  ('732868918590191140', 'The Librarians', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Wayne Hope, Robyn Butler', null, 'Robyn Butler, Roz Hammond, Heidi Arena, Stephen Ballantyne, Keith Brockett, Bob Franklin, Kim Gyngell, Wayne Hope', null, 'Frances O''Brian, Head Librarian, is having a hellish time of it. And for once it''s not all of her making. Frances'' mother, suffering from both dementia and a really horrible personality, lands on the O''Brien doorstep. Adding to her woes, morale at the Middleton Interactive Learning Centre is at a new all time low. In order to stay open, the library is forced to run as a business and return an annual profit. As the staff has a hard enough time enforcing the return of a book, this latest initiative could spell the end of the library.', 'Frances O''Brian, Head Librarian, is having a hellish time of it. And for once it''s not all of her making. Frances'' mother, suffering from both dementia and a really horrible personality, lands on the O''Brien doorstep. Adding to her woes, morale at the Middleton Interactive Learning Centre is at a new all time low. In order to stay open, the library is forced to run as a business and return an annual profit. As the staff has a hard enough time enforcing the return of a book, this latest initiative could spell the end of the library.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SZujyNbJl6TKHcdq56V6u8gejM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10632'),
  ('1085826379309717069', 'The Librarians', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'John Rogers', null, 'Rebecca Romijn, Christian Kane, John Harlan Kim, Lindy Booth, John Larroquette', 'TV-14', 'A group of librarians set off on adventures in an effort to save mysterious, ancient artifacts. Based on the series of "The Librarian" movies.', 'A group of librarians set off on adventures in an effort to save mysterious, ancient artifacts. Based on the series of "The Librarian" movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnEzRcKFqaSXLAP87gVKTXawwGg.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61599'),
  ('867045048865743498', 'The Librarians: The Next Chapter', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dean Devlin, John Rogers', null, 'Callum McGowan, Jessica Green, Olivia Morris, Bluey Robinson, Caroline Loncq', 'TV-PG', 'A Librarian from the past time travels to the present and finds himself stuck here. When he returns to his castle, which is now a museum, he inadvertently releases magic across the continent. He is given a new team to help him clean up the mess he made, forming a new team of Librarians.', 'A Librarian from the past time travels to the present and finds himself stuck here. When he returns to his castle, which is now a museum, he inadvertently releases magic across the continent. He is given a new team to help him clean up the mess he made, forming a new team of Librarians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2PhnfYgY1yjxnUc1M4Jp5CjXvD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226749'),
  ('597060403934477418', 'The Library', 1990, null, null, null, null, null, 'Mr. Bean visits a rare book library (possibly the British Library), where he reads a rare tome that must be handled with gloves. Soon after he uses a pencil and a crayon to copy a page of the book by shading on a piece of tracing paper, he sneezes, and the tracing paper slips away. He doesn''t notice this, and continues to use a crayon for shading, but on the book instead of the tracing paper. When he notices this, he attempts to remove the crayon marks - first by erasing, and then by using correction fluid, but eventually ends up tearing out the pages he has defiled. To neaten up the stubs of the pages he has torn out, he uses a boxcutter knife, but doesn''t notice that while doing so, he cuts other pages.', 'Mr. Bean visits a rare book library (possibly the British Library), where he reads a rare tome that must be handled with gloves. Soon after he uses a pencil and a crayon to copy a page of the book by shading on a piece of tracing paper, he sneezes, and the tracing paper slips away. He doesn''t notice this, and continues to use a crayon for shading, but on the book instead of the tracing paper. When he notices this, he attempts to remove the crayon marks - first by erasing, and then by using correction fluid, but eventually ends up tearing out the pages he has defiled. To neaten up the stubs of the pages he has torn out, he uses a boxcutter knife, but doesn''t notice that while doing so, he cuts other pages.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:137046'),
  ('367371887775589876', 'The Lies Within', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, 'Won Yoo-jung, Jeon Yeong-shin', 'Lee You-young, Lee Min-ki, On Ju-wan, Lee Jun-hyeok, Kim Si-eun, Yun Jong-seok, Kim Jong-soo', null, 'Kim Seo-hui’s life is changed forever when her politician father dies in a car crash and her husband disappears – all in one day. She enters the world of politics and join hands with small-town detective Jo Tae-sik to uncover the truth when she finds out that the car crash might not have been an accident after all.', 'Kim Seo-hui’s life is changed forever when her politician father dies in a car crash and her husband disappears – all in one day. She enters the world of politics and join hands with small-town detective Jo Tae-sik to uncover the truth when she finds out that the car crash might not have been an accident after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qinSC5tPqck8BIveuXzG7y7LpDd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94425'),
  ('465044942424925651', 'The Lieutenant', 2012, 'Drama', 'Roberto González, Benjamín Salinas', 'Marcelo Tobar, Alejandro Gerber Bicecci, Ana Romero', 'María Fernanda Yepes, Armando Torrea, Sylvia Sáenz, Jorge Luis Vázquez, Matías Novoa, Hector Arredondo, Luis Cárdenas, Fernando Sarfatti', null, 'La Teniente takes a cinematic approach to scripted TV, using locations throughout Mexico and top Spanish-language TV actors as it depicts the adventures of a Special Operations unit of the Mexican Navy. Centering on Mexican Naval graduate Lieutenant Roberta Ballesteros (María Fernanda Yepes), the series shows the challenges facing her immediate and emotional entry into the elite Special Operations unit after a violent tragedy occurs to the group. The series follows her assimilation into the unit, which is filled with drama, action, love triangles, heroes and family.', 'La Teniente takes a cinematic approach to scripted TV, using locations throughout Mexico and top Spanish-language TV actors as it depicts the adventures of a Special Operations unit of the Mexican Navy. Centering on Mexican Naval graduate Lieutenant Roberta Ballesteros (María Fernanda Yepes), the series shows the challenges facing her immediate and emotional entry into the elite Special Operations unit after a violent tragedy occurs to the group. The series follows her assimilation into the unit, which is filled with drama, action, love triangles, heroes and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saUqcYWyahfH7y2igWz9ss6Gfmt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100260'),
  ('725571751161045494', 'The Life & Times of Tim', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Steve Dildarian', null, 'Nick Kroll, Matt Johnson, Peter Giles, Steve Dildarian, MJ Otto', 'TV-MA', 'The Life & Times of Tim is an HBO comedy animated television series, which premiered on September 28, 2008. The series was created by Steve Dildarian, and is about a hapless man in his mid-20''s named Tim who lives in New York City with his girlfriend Amy. Throughout the series, Tim constantly finds himself in increasingly awkward situations in both his work and personal life. The first season aired in 2008 and has since been aired in numerous countries, and has developed a cult following. The second season debuted on February 19, 2010 on HBO. On June 4, 2010, HBO announced it was canceling the show. There were rumors that it was going to be picked up by another network. On the 16th of August, 2010, it was announced HBO had reversed their original decision to cancel the show, and as a result, a third season was ordered. Season 3 of The Life and Times of Tim premiered on December 16, 2011. The first season was released on DVD on February 9, 2010, the second season was released on DVD on December 13, 2011, and the third season was released on DVD on December 18, 2012. On April 20, 2012, HBO cancelled the series after three seasons. The theme song is "I''ll Never Get Out of This World Alive" performed by country music star Hank Williams.', 'The Life & Times of Tim is an HBO comedy animated television series, which premiered on September 28, 2008. The series was created by Steve Dildarian, and is about a hapless man in his mid-20''s named Tim who lives in New York City with his girlfriend Amy. Throughout the series, Tim constantly finds himself in increasingly awkward situations in both his work and personal life. The first season aired in 2008 and has since been aired in numerous countries, and has developed a cult following. The second season debuted on February 19, 2010 on HBO. On June 4, 2010, HBO announced it was canceling the show. There were rumors that it was going to be picked up by another network. On the 16th of August, 2010, it was announced HBO had reversed their original decision to cancel the show, and as a result, a third season was ordered. Season 3 of The Life and Times of Tim premiered on December 16, 2011. The first season was released on DVD on February 9, 2010, the second season was released on DVD on December 13, 2011, and the third season was released on DVD on December 18, 2012. On April 20, 2012, HBO cancelled the series after three seasons. The theme song is "I''ll Never Get Out of This World Alive" performed by country music star Hank Williams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbMgK2e5HuOMqHFqBMDMahU7h4S.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:5921'),
  ('570331820779010826', 'The Life and Legend of Wyatt Earp', 1955, 'Drama, Western', null, 'Daniel B. Ullman', 'Hugh O''Brian', null, 'The Life and Legend of Wyatt Earp is a television western series loosely based on the life of frontier marshal Wyatt Earp. The half-hour black-and-white program aired for 229 episodes on ABC from 1955 to 1961 and featured Hugh O''Brian in the title role.', 'The Life and Legend of Wyatt Earp is a television western series loosely based on the life of frontier marshal Wyatt Earp. The half-hour black-and-white program aired for 229 episodes on ABC from 1955 to 1961 and featured Hugh O''Brian in the title role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sq7meZ5XvxFKZmsTcM54q28IqHp.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:12337'),
  ('1054614762316757784', 'The Life and Movies of Erşan Kuneri', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz, Zafer Algöz, Çağlar Çorumlu, Nilperi Şahinkaya, Merve Dizdar, Bülent Şakrak, Can Yılmaz, Celal Kadri Kınoğlu', 'TV-MA', 'Reexamining his own legacy, a renowned figure in erotic cinema decides to branch out and make movies in other genres, from sci-fi to medieval action.', 'Reexamining his own legacy, a renowned figure in erotic cinema decides to branch out and make movies in other genres, from sci-fi to medieval action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdmyBnD3GRBBAJ6F5EIcO6JjQO5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:197679'),
  ('610698922848923380', 'The Life and Times of Juniper Lee', 2005, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Judd Winick', null, 'Lara Jill Miller, Kath Soucie, Carlos Alazraqui, Candi Milo', 'TV-Y7', 'Destined from birth to be this world''s Protector, Juniper has to fight monsters to maintain the balance between the world of magic and humanity.', 'Destined from birth to be this world''s Protector, Juniper has to fight monsters to maintain the balance between the world of magic and humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Za5FSOQ06B7eqrhn0HxsPrs2i9.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:446'),
  ('585988232871475802', 'The Life of Birds', 1998, 'Documentary', null, 'David Attenborough', 'David Attenborough', null, 'In the documentary series produced by the BBC, The Life of Birds, Sir David Attenborough unveils a new investigation into the behaviour of birds, perfectly adapted animals that conquer the air. This ten-part series reveals the secret of the birds'' great success, their remarkable strategies for finding food, their complex social systems, and their ingenious and often bizarre ways of mating and breeding. From the high speed of large airborne hunters to long distance migrations or the bright colors of nectar feeding hummingbirds, this is the ultimate bird series that every ornithologist should not miss.', 'In the documentary series produced by the BBC, The Life of Birds, Sir David Attenborough unveils a new investigation into the behaviour of birds, perfectly adapted animals that conquer the air. This ten-part series reveals the secret of the birds'' great success, their remarkable strategies for finding food, their complex social systems, and their ingenious and often bizarre ways of mating and breeding. From the high speed of large airborne hunters to long distance migrations or the bright colors of nectar feeding hummingbirds, this is the ultimate bird series that every ornithologist should not miss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZ8jprJrmd9c4RZl1AjHzGraZaB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9554'),
  ('972336989286501094', 'The Life of Mammals', 2002, 'Documentary', null, 'David Attenborough', 'David Attenborough', 'TV-G', 'David Attenborough presents a nature documentary series looking at why mammals are the most successful creatures on the planet.', 'David Attenborough presents a nature documentary series looking at why mammals are the most successful creatures on the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIz2dFosGYx1e8xZUGVMkDjbK4Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9555'),
  ('620184355401874832', 'The Life We Lead', 2011, 'Soap, Drama', 'Lícia Manzo', 'Daniel Adjafre, Álvaro Ramos, Tati Bernardi', 'Fernanda Vasconcellos, Marjorie Estiano, Rafael Cardoso, Thiago Lacerda, Ana Beatriz Nogueira, Jesuela Moro, Nicette Bruno, Paulo Betti', null, 'This moving telenovela tells the story of an unconditional love that overcomes life’s unexpected turnarounds. Ana is a promising tennis player who counts on best friend and sister Manuela for support. After a terrible car accident, Ana goes into a deep coma and only emerges from it five years later. Now, she must struggle to recover the life that went on without her and that she no longer recognizes as her own.', 'This moving telenovela tells the story of an unconditional love that overcomes life’s unexpected turnarounds. Ana is a promising tennis player who counts on best friend and sister Manuela for support. After a terrible car accident, Ana goes into a deep coma and only emerges from it five years later. Now, she must struggle to recover the life that went on without her and that she no longer recognizes as her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7xX9E4AiypLuTEexfcdW4dvmvo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:59092'),
  ('186816340473734416', 'The Life You Wanted', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ivan Cotroneo, Monica Rametta', null, 'Vittoria Schisano, Giuseppe Zeno, Pina Turco, Alessio Lapice, Michele De Virgilio, Francesco Pellegrino, Bianca Nappi, Fabrizia Sacchi', null, 'Gloria is finally happy after transitioning and settling down — until a longtime friend reappears with disrupting news and throws her world into chaos.', 'Gloria is finally happy after transitioning and settling down — until a longtime friend reappears with disrupting news and throws her world into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MbDOh98R8bCfKuUNojWWY54gem.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253361'),
  ('57552491011973055', 'The Light in the Hall', 2022, 'Drama', 'Regina Moriarty', null, 'Sian Reese-Williams, Mark Lewis Jones, Nia Roberts, Robert Glenister', 'TV-MA', 'Sharon Roberts has never stopped grieving the loss of her murdered daughter, Ela, and journalist Cat, who grew up with Ela, has always been obsessed by her murder. The parole of her killer, Joe, leaves both women forced to confront the past.', 'Sharon Roberts has never stopped grieving the loss of her murdered daughter, Ela, and journalist Cat, who grew up with Ela, has always been obsessed by her murder. The parole of her killer, Joe, leaves both women forced to confront the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i57Z2Uwcd3REP0YW1h1G5JqXlnq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202140'),
  ('87953724272615322', 'The Light in Your Eyes', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Sok-yun, Lee Nam-kyu, Kim Soo-jin', 'Lee Nam-kyu, Kim Soo-jin', 'Han Ji-min, Kim Hye-ja, Nam Joo-hyuk, Son Ho-jun, Ahn Nae-sang, Lee Jung-eun, Jung Ji-hoon, Kim Hie-won', null, 'Time manipulation comes with a steep price for a young woman, who becomes 78 years old overnight after using a mysterious watch.', 'Time manipulation comes with a steep price for a young woman, who becomes 78 years old overnight after using a mysterious watch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HSrz6SH58YtU612iLb4aiRolTJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86546'),
  ('50761954156841354', 'The Likely Lads', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais', null, 'James Bolam, Rodney Bewes', null, 'Terry Collier and Bob Ferris are good friends. Terry was working class and secure in his life, whereas Bob was more aspirational, determined to work his way to a better place. Both viewed the others'' worldview with disdain, but they were united by events, generally revolving around the pursuit of women. Although 20 total episodes were filmed, only 10 are currently known to survive. There is one missing from the first season, three from the second, and six from the final run.', 'Terry Collier and Bob Ferris are good friends. Terry was working class and secure in his life, whereas Bob was more aspirational, determined to work his way to a better place. Both viewed the others'' worldview with disdain, but they were united by events, generally revolving around the pursuit of women. Although 20 total episodes were filmed, only 10 are currently known to survive. There is one missing from the first season, three from the second, and six from the final run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxHzFAreUiNUdDxppoTIGCCH4t7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2735'),
  ('245368560412753161', 'The Lincoln Lawyer', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'Manuel Garcia-Rulfo, Neve Campbell, Becki Newton, Angus Sampson, Jazz Raycole', 'TV-MA', 'Hotshot LA defense attorney Mickey Haller will do whatever it takes to win as he navigates the criminal justice system from his trademark Lincoln.', 'Hotshot LA defense attorney Mickey Haller will do whatever it takes to win as he navigates the criminal justice system from his trademark Lincoln.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jSaIqEU8CPBBNn4iVCK6wzPjSx.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:116799'),
