  ('298375047956198057', 'The Mask: Animated Series', 1995, 'Family, Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Steve Roberts, Alex Van, Dean Stefan', null, 'Rob Paulsen, Frank Welker, Heidi Shannon, Neil Ross, Jim Cummings, Mark L. Taylor', 'TV-Y7', 'Insecure bank clerk Stanley Ipkiss uses an ancient mask to gain superpowers while taking on the mischievous and cartoonish, but heroic and good-hearted personality of The Mask', 'Insecure bank clerk Stanley Ipkiss uses an ancient mask to gain superpowers while taking on the mischievous and cartoonish, but heroic and good-hearted personality of The Mask', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IuTg9XaviDwpfm99IXUUPukrVA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9957'),
  ('895234408926314611', 'The Masked Hearts', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tanakorn Chuen-arom, Vacharathorn Wongyai, Napat Sila, Worachai Areewong, Keetapat Chuthai, Korakamon Supasereepap, Rungtiwa Sangngern, Weerachai Hattakovit', null, 'A modern khon rivalry sparks when a cosplay enthusiast and a traditionalist club president discover their connection mirrors a forbidden past-life love.', 'A modern khon rivalry sparks when a cosplay enthusiast and a traditionalist club president discover their connection mirrors a forbidden past-life love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zteYp3C9P9p1NfrXKpQM7FmG72m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313963'),
  ('732232431566798596', 'The Masked Singer', 2019, 'Reality', 'Craig Plestis', null, 'Nick Cannon, Robin Thicke, Jenny McCarthy, Ken Jeong, Nicole Scherzinger, Rita Ora', 'TV-PG', 'Celebrities compete in a singing competition with one major twist: each singer is shrouded from head to toe in an elaborate costume, complete with full face mask to conceal his or her identity. One singer will be eliminated each week, ultimately revealing his or her true identity.', 'Celebrities compete in a singing competition with one major twist: each singer is shrouded from head to toe in an elaborate costume, complete with full face mask to conceal his or her identity. One singer will be eliminated each week, ultimately revealing his or her true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sT0TpxenCsghbRZ7NiEJg2ubzZx.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:84910'),
  ('534807253846947545', 'The Masked Singer', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Joel Dommett, Jonathan Ross, Davina McCall, Mo Gilligan, Maya Jama', null, 'A singing competition where celebrities compete with each other but with one particularity: their identity is hidden by full masks. The British adaptation of the worldwide hit.', 'A singing competition where celebrities compete with each other but with one particularity: their identity is hidden by full masks. The British adaptation of the worldwide hit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMLKuw9l499nhCjozTQatmx139V.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:96907'),
  ('1107413134155056352', 'The Master', 1984, 'Action & Adventure', 'Michael Sloan', null, 'Lee Van Cleef, Tim Van Patten, Sho Kosugi', null, 'An aging ninja master and his young pupil travel in a custom van helping people in need along the way.', 'An aging ninja master and his young pupil travel in a custom van helping people in need along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MGIjGfjwl22HL9G0eYOwbMqSTT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17324'),
  ('984709970901211917', 'The Master and Margarita', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Vladimir Bortko', null, 'Aleksandr Galibin, Anna Kovalchuk, Oleg Basilashvili, Aleksandr Abdulov, Kirill Lavrov, Alexander Adabashyan, Sergei Bezrukov, Semyon Strugachyov', null, 'The Master and Margarita is a Russian television production of Telekanal Rossiya, based on the novel The Master and Margarita, written by Soviet writer Mikhail Bulgakov between 1928 and 1940. Vladimir Bortko directed this adaptation and was also its screenwriter.', 'The Master and Margarita is a Russian television production of Telekanal Rossiya, based on the novel The Master and Margarita, written by Soviet writer Mikhail Bulgakov between 1928 and 1940. Vladimir Bortko directed this adaptation and was also its screenwriter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdHbRajsZmrs7TNmPF3NjjYCMaM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6395'),
  ('943132967986235969', 'The Master of Ragnarok & Blesser of Einherjar', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Koudai Sakai, Rie Suegara, Arisa Date, Maki Kawase, Aya Uchida, Kanon Takao, Aoi Yuuki, Ayana Taketatsu', null, 'Yuuto Suoh gets more than he bargained for when he joins his childhood friend Mitsuki Shimoya in testing out an urban legend. When he uses his phone to take a picture of himself with the local shrine''s divine mirror, he is whisked off into another world – one heavily steeped in the lore of the old Norse myths. Using his knowledge gained from school and from his solar-powered smartphone, he has the chance to bring the Wolf Clan, the same people who cared for him, to prominence, all while earning the adoration of a group of magic-wielding warrior maidens known as the Einherjar.', 'Yuuto Suoh gets more than he bargained for when he joins his childhood friend Mitsuki Shimoya in testing out an urban legend. When he uses his phone to take a picture of himself with the local shrine''s divine mirror, he is whisked off into another world – one heavily steeped in the lore of the old Norse myths. Using his knowledge gained from school and from his solar-powered smartphone, he has the chance to bring the Wolf Clan, the same people who cared for him, to prominence, all while earning the adoration of a group of magic-wielding warrior maidens known as the Einherjar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OVaM55ub5iIEZxLzGdOvFnhk3O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80670'),
  ('920075212626426851', 'The Master of Revenge', 2016, 'Drama', 'Park In-kwon', 'Chae Seung-dae', 'Chun Jung-myung, Cho Jae-hyun, Jeong Yu-mi, Lee Sang-yeob, Gong Seung-yeon, Kim Jae-young, Choi Jong-won, Lee Il-hwa', null, 'When Moo-Myung was young, he had an once-in-a-lifetime event. He walked into orphanage by himself. To take revenge, he attempts to become a God of Noodles.', 'When Moo-Myung was young, he had an once-in-a-lifetime event. He walked into orphanage by himself. To take revenge, he attempts to become a God of Noodles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3q2vc3Pqsbxxl08oclKRUCG9wKW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66068'),
  ('814405449836458614', 'The Masterful Cat Is Depressed Again Today', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Tamazo Yanagi', 'Yui Ishikawa, Hiroki Yasumoto, Ai Kakuma, Katsuyuki Konishi, Mao Ichimichi, Miyu Irino, Ayana Taketatsu', 'TV-14', 'When Saku took in a stray black cat, she never expected that he would become the equivalent of a housekeeping life partner. But Yukichi, a giant cat who towers over Saku, is not your ordinary feline. He takes great pride in his culinary skills, and a good sale at the supermarket always gets his whiskers twitching. Saku may not have her act together yet, but at least she has Yukichi!', 'When Saku took in a stray black cat, she never expected that he would become the equivalent of a housekeeping life partner. But Yukichi, a giant cat who towers over Saku, is not your ordinary feline. He takes great pride in his culinary skills, and a good sale at the supermarket always gets his whiskers twitching. Saku may not have her act together yet, but at least she has Yukichi!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fXOTVi4f3T9Ii2rljyCDuKnvVv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202821'),
  ('448848646391616839', 'The Matchmakers', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Ha Soo-jin', 'Rowoon, Cho Yi-hyun, Cho Han-cheul, Park Ji-young, Choi Kyung-hoon, Oh Ye-ju, Jung Bo-min, Heo Nam-jun', null, 'Set during the Joseon Dynasty, the story of the meeting between the young widow Jung Soon-deok and young widower Shim Jung-woo as well as the struggle the two go through together to marry off the four young maidens who represent Joseon.', 'Set during the Joseon Dynasty, the story of the meeting between the young widow Jung Soon-deok and young widower Shim Jung-woo as well as the struggle the two go through together to marry off the four young maidens who represent Joseon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n85CrEyD2G0fw5Fs6bqNdaRKFWk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230024'),
  ('230468748973607160', 'The Mating Game', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'The struggles and successes of a wide variety of animals as they take on one of life''s most vital challenges: finding a partner.', 'The struggles and successes of a wide variety of animals as they take on one of life''s most vital challenges: finding a partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gWrmRXHD2duGcp9uvpwLaDSoJA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135546'),
  ('33354358838941798', 'The Max Headroom Show', 1985, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Talk', 'Rocky Morton, Annabel Jankel, George Stone', 'David Hansen, Tim John', 'Matt Frewer, Paul Shearer', null, 'The Max Headroom Show started life in the UK in 1985. The show featured actor Matt Frewer playing the role as computer-generated talk-show host Max Headroom.', 'The Max Headroom Show started life in the UK in 1985. The show featured actor Matt Frewer playing the role as computer-generated talk-show host Max Headroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAULvzHt6zgHUimoLAhYtIbYmhT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43139'),
  ('969648146336306677', 'The Maxx', 1995, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Sam Kieth, William Messner-Loebs', null, 'Michael Haley, Glynnis Talken Campbell, Barry Stigler, Amy Danles, Tony Fucile', 'TV-14', 'Maxx is a purple-clad superhero living in a cardboard box. His only friend is Julie Winters, a freelance social worker. Maxx often finds himself shifting back and forth between the "real" world and a more primitive outback world where he rules, and protects Julie. Mr. Gone, a self-proclaimed "student of the mystic arts" seems to know more about Maxx and Julie and their strange relationship than they could ever guess, but he''s not exactly telling all....not yet, anyway.', 'Maxx is a purple-clad superhero living in a cardboard box. His only friend is Julie Winters, a freelance social worker. Maxx often finds himself shifting back and forth between the "real" world and a more primitive outback world where he rules, and protects Julie. Mr. Gone, a self-proclaimed "student of the mystic arts" seems to know more about Maxx and Julie and their strange relationship than they could ever guess, but he''s not exactly telling all....not yet, anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckDgOhXdWS9TZPydx2oqYtdh1YZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56021'),
  ('5139655331779272', 'The Mayfair Set', 1999, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The Mayfair Set is a series of programmes produced by Adam Curtis for the BBC, first broadcast in the summer of 1999. The programme looked at how buccaneer capitalists of hot money were allowed to shape the climate of the Thatcher years, focusing on the rise of Colonel David Stirling, Jim Slater, James Goldsmith, and Tiny Rowland, all members of London''s Clermont Club in the 1960s.', 'The Mayfair Set is a series of programmes produced by Adam Curtis for the BBC, first broadcast in the summer of 1999. The programme looked at how buccaneer capitalists of hot money were allowed to shape the climate of the Thatcher years, focusing on the rise of Colonel David Stirling, Jim Slater, James Goldsmith, and Tiny Rowland, all members of London''s Clermont Club in the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2RbQFbulia27AgsAJH03kDSWif.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19230'),
  ('417129773567276503', 'The Mayor', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Jeremy Bronson', null, 'Brandon Micheal Hall, Lea Michele, Yvette Nicole Brown, Marcel Spears, Bernard David Jones', 'TV-14', 'A struggling hip-hop artist runs for mayor to promote his mix-tape and wins.', 'A struggling hip-hop artist runs for mayor to promote his mix-tape and wins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSsHEe1YYuI2vVTd4AMMEFPz8N2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71727'),
  ('579236901996862367', 'The Mechanism', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'José Padilha, Elena Soarez', null, 'Selton Mello, Caroline Abras, Enrique Díaz, Jonathan Haagensen, Osvaldo Mil, Lee Taylor, Antonio Saboia, Emílio Orciollo Netto', 'TV-MA', 'A scandal erupts in Brazil during an investigation of alleged government corruption via oil and construction companies. Loosely inspired by true events.', 'A scandal erupts in Brazil during an investigation of alleged government corruption via oil and construction companies. Loosely inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVnmpjhELgmh7so237wgDUck7kO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76954'),
  ('842429619752678247', 'The Meeting Place Cannot Be Changed', 1979, 'Mystery, Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Stanislav Govorukhin', 'Georgiy Vayner, Arkadiy Vayner', 'Vladimir Konkin, Vladimir Vysotsky, Sergei Yursky, Viktor Pavlov, Natalya Fateyeva, Leonid Kuravlyov, Svetlana Svetlichnaya, Aleksandr Belyavskiy', null, 'After WWII is over, a young officer Volodya Sharapov returns to Moscow to work in MUR - Moskovskiy Ugolovny Rozysk (Moscow Criminal Police). There he meets Gleb Zheglov who is a chief of a squad which fights organized crime. Their main task is to track down a gang "Chernaya Koshka" (Black Cat) which terrorizes the city. Also, they have to find out who murdered Larisa Gruzdeva. Zheglov believes it was her husband Ivan Gruzdev, but Sharapov has his doubts about it...', 'After WWII is over, a young officer Volodya Sharapov returns to Moscow to work in MUR - Moskovskiy Ugolovny Rozysk (Moscow Criminal Police). There he meets Gleb Zheglov who is a chief of a squad which fights organized crime. Their main task is to track down a gang "Chernaya Koshka" (Black Cat) which terrorizes the city. Also, they have to find out who murdered Larisa Gruzdeva. Zheglov believes it was her husband Ivan Gruzdev, but Sharapov has his doubts about it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfzPMCnWbLsfQd1T5DDFP5OpE9v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75182'),
  ('650552918990588460', 'The Megan Mullally Show', 2006, 'Talk', null, null, 'Megan Mullally, Bret Simmons', 'TV-PG', 'Two-time Emmy Award-winner Megan Mullally, coming off eight seasons as wisecracking socialite Karen Walker on NBC''s "Will & Grace," moves into the driver''s seat as host for this daytime talk show. Each episode is an entertaining hour featuring a mix of celebrities, real people, music, and comedy. Megan will interview top celebrities and also introduce the world to guests of all kinds — from quirky characters to funny kids to offbeat experts.', 'Two-time Emmy Award-winner Megan Mullally, coming off eight seasons as wisecracking socialite Karen Walker on NBC''s "Will & Grace," moves into the driver''s seat as host for this daytime talk show. Each episode is an entertaining hour featuring a mix of celebrities, real people, music, and comedy. Megan will interview top celebrities and also introduce the world to guests of all kinds — from quirky characters to funny kids to offbeat experts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wijfK5Q5eFdUbCbxEvdt7lMZwWS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10269'),
  ('4494392974091615', 'The Melancholy of Haruhi Suzumiya', 2006, 'Comedy, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Aya Hirano, Minori Chihara, Yuko Goto, Daisuke Ono', 'TV-14', 'I thought that when I entered high school, my days of believing in aliens, time travelers and ESPers were going to be over. That is, until she introduced herself. Claiming to be interested in only aliens, time travelers, and ESPers, Haruhi Suzumiya was the strangest girl I''ve met in a long time... Before I knew what''s going on, I''ve been dragged into her weird club, and it looks like I''m not the only one who has been drafted into this "SOS Brigade" of hers, because there are three other students who don''t seem to be so ordinary themselves.', 'I thought that when I entered high school, my days of believing in aliens, time travelers and ESPers were going to be over. That is, until she introduced herself. Claiming to be interested in only aliens, time travelers, and ESPers, Haruhi Suzumiya was the strangest girl I''ve met in a long time... Before I knew what''s going on, I''ve been dragged into her weird club, and it looks like I''m not the only one who has been drafted into this "SOS Brigade" of hers, because there are three other students who don''t seem to be so ordinary themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bimn3hOUjibgQD6RZn8rv1jiEL6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42511'),
  ('254154331647683307', 'The Melancholy of Haruhi-chan Suzumiya', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Daisuke Ono, Yuki Matsuoka, Aya Hirano, Minori Chihara, Natsuko Kuwatani, Tomokazu Sugita, Yuko Goto', null, 'A parody series featuring the entire cast of The Melancholy of Haruhi Suzumiya in a smaller form factor. Among the changes are: Yuki plays eroge, Haruhi is even more obnoxiuous and loud, Mikuru is even more emotional and Koizumi harbors a deep love for Kyon. Kyon, on the other hand, is generally the same as ever.', 'A parody series featuring the entire cast of The Melancholy of Haruhi Suzumiya in a smaller form factor. Among the changes are: Yuki plays eroge, Haruhi is even more obnoxiuous and loud, Mikuru is even more emotional and Koizumi harbors a deep love for Kyon. Kyon, on the other hand, is generally the same as ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbnhIbwrBrjzBtH2RLHUc6TQ9WH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95710'),
  ('301599471848903200', 'The Melody of Oblivion', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Yoji Enokido', 'Masumi Asano, Sanae Kobayashi, Mamiko Noto, Houko Kuwashima, Kouki Harasawa, Ken Yamaguchi, Mitsuru Miyamoto, Issei Miyazaki', null, 'After a war occurred in the 20th century between humans and demons. Since that time, the monsters rule the world in fear but keep relatively hidden from public view. A boy named Bokka ponders the past and wonders what became of the Meros Warriors who defended the world so bravely against the demons.', 'After a war occurred in the 20th century between humans and demons. Since that time, the monsters rule the world in fear but keep relatively hidden from public view. A boy named Bokka ponders the past and wonders what became of the Meros Warriors who defended the world so bravely against the demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SixngrjwisTCH029k0fCjy0EAa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34802'),
  ('1015619701635881592', 'The Memorandum of Kyoko Okitegami', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Yui Aragaki, Masaki Okada, Rio Uchida, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Daiki Arioka', null, 'Okitegami Kyoko is a beautiful private detective who has a deep love for money. She is also known as the Forgetful Detective. Her memory is reset when she sleeps at night, which means she can strictly adhere to confidentiality requirements. She solves all her cases within a day, whatever they may be. She is the world''s fastest detective! There is something really important that Kyoko must never forget, and it is written on her body with a magic pen. “I am Okitegami Kyoko, detective. My memory is reset after one day.” Meanwhile, even though Yakusuke Kakushidate has a crush on Kyoko Okitegami, he is always mistaken by her as the culprit of a case. No matter how close he gets to Kyoko, she totally forgets about him by the next day.', 'Okitegami Kyoko is a beautiful private detective who has a deep love for money. She is also known as the Forgetful Detective. Her memory is reset when she sleeps at night, which means she can strictly adhere to confidentiality requirements. She solves all her cases within a day, whatever they may be. She is the world''s fastest detective! There is something really important that Kyoko must never forget, and it is written on her body with a magic pen. “I am Okitegami Kyoko, detective. My memory is reset after one day.” Meanwhile, even though Yakusuke Kakushidate has a crush on Kyoko Okitegami, he is always mistaken by her as the culprit of a case. No matter how close he gets to Kyoko, she totally forgets about him by the next day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ha2tpmrhgQhruNElxZmFNXLqPk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69407'),
  ('185131081624449068', 'The Men in Blazers Show', 2014, 'Talk', 'Roger Bennett, Michael Davies', null, 'Roger Bennett', 'TV-G', 'A celebration of the Premier League, the world''s greatest sporting telenovela, with Roger Bennett and Michael Davies.', 'A celebration of the Premier League, the world''s greatest sporting telenovela, with Roger Bennett and Michael Davies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzXhRjsDzzIMNlr5CWCCx6Thp6S.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:213372'),
  ('438727341694731373', 'The Men Who Built America', 2012, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tim Getman, Michael Chmiel, David Donahoe, Ray Reynolds, Eric Rolland, Adam Jonas Segaller, AJ Achinger, Alex Falberg', 'TV-PG', 'Influential builders, dreamers and believers whose feats transformed the United States, a nation decaying from the inside after the Civil War, into the greatest economic and technological superpower the world had ever seen. The Men Who Built America is the story of a nation at the crossroads and of the people who catapulted it to prosperity.', 'Influential builders, dreamers and believers whose feats transformed the United States, a nation decaying from the inside after the Civil War, into the greatest economic and technological superpower the world had ever seen. The Men Who Built America is the story of a nation at the crossroads and of the people who catapulted it to prosperity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmxok1OGUFLd2psEMzZ7mU0MjQi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56304'),
  ('574027041174890310', 'The Men Who Built America: Frontiersmen', 2018, 'Documentary', null, 'Adam Jonas Segaller', 'Jonathan C. Stewart, Gareth Reeves, Derek Charition, Joseph Carlson, Campbell Scott', 'TV-14', 'A look at the lives of iconic pioneers such as Daniel Boone, Lewis and Clark, Tecumseh, Davy Crocket and Andrew Jackson as they traveled across America.', 'A look at the lives of iconic pioneers such as Daniel Boone, Lewis and Clark, Tecumseh, Davy Crocket and Andrew Jackson as they traveled across America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g56tPsqTmqcLoNMSS66PdNnwtwv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78928'),
  ('850714594748627242', 'The Mentalist', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Bruno Heller', null, 'Simon Baker, Robin Tunney, Tim Kang, Rockmond Dunbar, Joe Adler, Josie Loren', 'TV-14', 'Patrick Jane, a former celebrity psychic medium, uses his razor sharp skills of observation and expertise at "reading" people to solve serious crimes with the California Bureau of Investigation.', 'Patrick Jane, a former celebrity psychic medium, uses his razor sharp skills of observation and expertise at "reading" people to solve serious crimes with the California Bureau of Investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acYXu4KaDj1NIkMgObnhe4C4a0T.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:5920'),
  ('303537477598488882', 'The Merchant: Gaekju 2015', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jang Hyuk, Han Chae-a, Kim Min-joung, Yu Oh-seong, Lee Duck-hwa, Park Eun-hye, Kim Kyu-chul, Jeong Tae-woo', null, 'Many great men come from humble beginnings. During the end of the tumultuous Chosun Dynasty, Chun Bong Sam is a poor peddler who inherits a run-down inn. Through hard work and perseverance against a corrupt bureaucracy, Bong Sam achieves great success and becomes a powerful merchant. Can he help shape the way that industry and business should be done in the emerging modern era? It is based on the novel “Gaekju” by Kim Joo Young.', 'Many great men come from humble beginnings. During the end of the tumultuous Chosun Dynasty, Chun Bong Sam is a poor peddler who inherits a run-down inn. Through hard work and perseverance against a corrupt bureaucracy, Bong Sam achieves great success and becomes a powerful merchant. Can he help shape the way that industry and business should be done in the emerging modern era? It is based on the novel “Gaekju” by Kim Joo Young.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmsE6ITQ2PeAvCu1E9ZEGEUNMfD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63955'),
  ('948797108536235845', 'The Mermaid Prince', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Moon Bin, Chae Won-been, Hwi Young, Moon Sang-min, Yoon Seo-bin, Jung Bo-min, Yoo Na-gyeol', null, 'Tells the romance story of a girl named Hye Ri. She goes to Gangwon Province on a graduation trip with her friends. There she meets a mysterious man Woo Hyuk who runs a guest house. She gets attracted and closer to him and decides to name him “the mermaid prince”.', 'Tells the romance story of a girl named Hye Ri. She goes to Gangwon Province on a graduation trip with her friends. There she meets a mysterious man Woo Hyuk who runs a guest house. She gets attracted and closer to him and decides to name him “the mermaid prince”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6laYnHXyyJwPJYC81Pv4PKP05D.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:101868'),
