  ('826933148268625252', 'The Modern World: Ten Great Writers', 1988, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'This documentary series uses drama and commentary to shed light on the lives and works of Joseph Conrad, Fyodor Dostoyevsky, T. S. Eliot, Henrik Ibsen, James Joyce, Franz Kafka, Thomas Mann, Luigi Pirandello, Marcel Proust and Virginia Woolf.', 'This documentary series uses drama and commentary to shed light on the lives and works of Joseph Conrad, Fyodor Dostoyevsky, T. S. Eliot, Henrik Ibsen, James Joyce, Franz Kafka, Thomas Mann, Luigi Pirandello, Marcel Proust and Virginia Woolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGUosWMFC4t5R1C3nx1F6Kkw5ZV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101356'),
  ('447837535794992283', 'The Mokhtar Narrative', 2010, 'Drama, War & Politics, Documentary', 'Davood Mir-Bagheri', 'Davood Mir-Bagheri', 'Fariborz Arabnia, Reza Kianian, Fariba Kowsari, Mehdi Fakhimzadeh, Reza Rouygari, Farhad Aslani, Jafar Dehghan, Zhale Olov', 'TV-G', 'The Mokhtar Narrative is an Epic/History television series directed by Davood Mirbagheri, based on the life of Al-Mokhtar. Over 140 actors were cast in it. Mokhtar Saqafi was a Shiite Muslim leader who sets up a rebellion movement in 686 A.D in the town of Kufa to avenge the martyrdom of Hussain (grandson of Islamic Prophet Muhammad).', 'The Mokhtar Narrative is an Epic/History television series directed by Davood Mirbagheri, based on the life of Al-Mokhtar. Over 140 actors were cast in it. Mokhtar Saqafi was a Shiite Muslim leader who sets up a rebellion movement in 686 A.D in the town of Kufa to avenge the martyrdom of Hussain (grandson of Islamic Prophet Muhammad).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zUdATUbXzmUwozQjvQZe6MEQRl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54467'),
  ('495418803591012204', 'The Mole', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ari Shapiro, Antonio Alejandro Castellanos, Quaylyn, Sean, Ryan Warner, Neesh Riaz, Muna Abdulahi, Michael O''Brien', null, 'A high-stakes competition series where twelve players work together in challenges to add money to a pot that only one of them will win at the end. Among the players is one person who has secretly been designated "the Mole" and tasked with sabotaging the group''s money-making efforts. In the end, one player will outlast their competition and expose the Mole to win the prize pot.', 'A high-stakes competition series where twelve players work together in challenges to add money to a pot that only one of them will win at the end. Among the players is one person who has secretly been designated "the Mole" and tasked with sabotaging the group''s money-making efforts. In the end, one player will outlast their competition and expose the Mole to win the prize pot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVipX97HY7UYiWIR6BdmnQLKEXy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:210939'),
  ('815913157695407258', 'The Moment I Met You', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ren Hao, Ireine Song, Li Yuhao, Yun Qianqian, Wang Junbi', null, 'Mao Buyu, heir to a legendary detective family, falls for Chu Yunshang, a flower seller hiding her true identity as the leader of a notorious thieves’ guild. As Mao Buyu vows to capture the elusive guild leader to earn a promotion and win Yunshang’s hand, a secret game of cat and mouse unfolds, where love, loyalty, and identity collide.', 'Mao Buyu, heir to a legendary detective family, falls for Chu Yunshang, a flower seller hiding her true identity as the leader of a notorious thieves’ guild. As Mao Buyu vows to capture the elusive guild leader to earn a promotion and win Yunshang’s hand, a secret game of cat and mouse unfolds, where love, loyalty, and identity collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzBrj9NUo4MZa2wOWqF23NDGKBv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295608'),
  ('810151533861526854', 'The Moment of Truth', 2008, 'Reality', 'Howard Schultz', null, 'Mark L. Walberg', null, 'One participant. Twenty-one questions. All that is required is the ability to tell the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth.', 'One participant. Twenty-one questions. All that is required is the ability to tell the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMlpuKuEEqSfxNiXAhMvV1rSUm0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14381'),
  ('1099006149130021114', 'The Monastery', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Alexander Molochnikov', 'Anastasiya Ivleeva, Filipp Yankovsky, Mark Eydelshteyn, Alexandra Babaskina, Leonid Telezhinskiy, Aleksey Rozin', null, 'Maria is a charming party girl who lives at someone else''s expense. One day in the Emirates, she goes to a nightclub with the billionaire''s wife, the party gets out of control, and now Maria is facing jail, she is being chased by dangerous people, and accounts are blocked. She has to flee to Russia, but she is not safe at home either — and the girl takes refuge in the walls of the monastery.', 'Maria is a charming party girl who lives at someone else''s expense. One day in the Emirates, she goes to a nightclub with the billionaire''s wife, the party gets out of control, and now Maria is facing jail, she is being chased by dangerous people, and accounts are blocked. She has to flee to Russia, but she is not safe at home either — and the girl takes refuge in the walls of the monastery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9d4PJzfkrEF8wB9uQVFOR9RmA6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214070'),
  ('252541798027398725', 'The Monkees', 1966, 'Comedy, Family', 'Bert Schneider, Bob Rafelson', null, 'Davy Jones, Micky Dolenz, Michael Nesmith, Peter Tork', 'TV-G', 'Micky, Mike, Peter, and Davy are four young men in mid-1960s LA, members of a struggling country-folk-rock band looking for their big break amid madcap encounters with a variety of people straight out of TV and movie central casting, with full knowledge that their existence is part of a weekly television series.', 'Micky, Mike, Peter, and Davy are four young men in mid-1960s LA, members of a struggling country-folk-rock band looking for their big break amid madcap encounters with a variety of people straight out of TV and movie central casting, with full knowledge that their existence is part of a weekly television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNhWFmfVGkNfF3o3kdKUKgvdnaN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7626'),
  ('991597840089569869', 'The Mononoke Lecture Logs of Chuzenji-sensei: He Just Solves All the Mysteries', 2025, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Kaori Maeda, Katsuyuki Konishi, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Shuuya Nishiji, Takanori Hoshino, Ai Furihata, Ai Kayano, Kaoru Sakura', null, 'In 1948 Tokyo, just right after the war, Kanna Kusakabe had just become a second-year at a high school when she meets the new language teacher, Akihiko Chuzenji. Mysterious supernatural things keep happening around Kanna. Once again today, Kanna is going to open the doors to the library prep room to seek help from the surly Chuzenji-sensei who is waiting inside.', 'In 1948 Tokyo, just right after the war, Kanna Kusakabe had just become a second-year at a high school when she meets the new language teacher, Akihiko Chuzenji. Mysterious supernatural things keep happening around Kanna. Once again today, Kanna is going to open the doors to the library prep room to seek help from the surly Chuzenji-sensei who is waiting inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OOqlrGSBRV31TlzzHSukuySqwz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275623'),
  ('358697605996320441', 'The Monster', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mehran Modiri', 'Amir Baradaran, Peyman Ghasemkhani', 'Farhad Aslani, Mehran Modiri, Shabnam Moghadami, Gohar Kheyrandish, Mohammad Bahrani, Nima Sha''aban-Nejad, Shila Khodadad, Sima Tirandaz', 'TV-PG', 'Houshang is a simple and honest teacher who is satisfied with his life and does not have much interest in the world, but unwittingly goes in a way that changes his life and enters the process of embezzlement and fraud. He unexpectedly owns wealth and wealth, and is outspoken from his former character.', 'Houshang is a simple and honest teacher who is satisfied with his life and does not have much interest in the world, but unwittingly goes in a way that changes his life and enters the process of embezzlement and fraud. He unexpectedly owns wealth and wealth, and is outspoken from his former character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJFpnaftMiUhR8xWgsOVAOl8nfY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90751'),
  ('1044766540071993143', 'The Monster of Florence', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Leonardo Fasoli, Stefano Sollima', null, 'Marco Bullitta, Valentino Mannias, Francesca Olia, Liliana Bottone, Giacomo Fadda, Antonio Tintis, Barbara Pitzianti', 'TV-MA', 'As a serial killer targets couples and strikes terror in Italy, authorities explore a case from 1968 that may be key to finding The Monster of Florence.', 'As a serial killer targets couples and strikes terror in Italy, authorities explore a case from 1968 that may be key to finding The Monster of Florence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RRBxq1hEC7rKIp4yac96F9ObL5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247756'),
