  ('102006677370575123', 'The Mopes', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nataly Kudiabor, Anke Greifeneder', 'Ipek Zübert', 'Roel Dirven, Nora Tschirner, Ugur Kaya, Kathrin Angerer, David Bredin, Anna Brüggemann, Jennifer Ulrich, Anton von Lucke', 'TV-MA', 'Singer-songwriter Mat’s relatively normal life implodes when his depression takes the form of Monika, a woman that only he can see and hear – and whose sole purpose is to make his reality worse.', 'Singer-songwriter Mat’s relatively normal life implodes when his depression takes the form of Monika, a woman that only he can see and hear – and whose sole purpose is to make his reality worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVoWxtzek66z6p9AWM0UzPGh0OZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122236'),
