  ('1061244468647580551', 'The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen: From Villainess to Savior', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Fairouz Ai, Haruka Tomatsu', null, 'Pride Royal Ivy is only eight years old when she realizes that she''s been reincarnated, destined to become the future wicked queen and final boss of an otome game. She''s got it all in this new life: razor-sharp wit, boss-tier powers, and influence over the kingdom as crown princess. Determined to sow despair and destruction across the land, she... Wait, what kind of a rotten future is that?! Princess Pride decides to drop the maniacal villainess plan and protect the male love interests instead, cheating her way to saving everyone she can! Will this final boss end up earning the adoration of her kingdom?', 'Pride Royal Ivy is only eight years old when she realizes that she''s been reincarnated, destined to become the future wicked queen and final boss of an otome game. She''s got it all in this new life: razor-sharp wit, boss-tier powers, and influence over the kingdom as crown princess. Determined to sow despair and destruction across the land, she... Wait, what kind of a rotten future is that?! Princess Pride decides to drop the maniacal villainess plan and protect the male love interests instead, cheating her way to saving everyone she can! Will this final boss end up earning the adoration of her kingdom?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6bMg0g9KDw9nTuMqORCYWHsMSe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213326'),
  ('855432861658148431', 'The Most Notorious "Talker" Runs the World''s Greatest Clan', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daiki Yamashita, Yu Serizawa, Yousuke Omomo, Shogo Sakata, Takehito Koyasu, Shunsuke Sakuya, Yoshiki Nakajima, Kaede Hondo', 'TV-14', 'Noel is the grandson of legendary Seeker Overdeath and dreams of surpassing his strength. But it turns out that Noel is nothing but a Talker, the weakest class of them all. Undeterred, he uses his silver tongue to gather allies, develop cunning strategies, and form the greatest clan around. Now, as the most notorious Talker, Noel will do whatever it takes to claim supremacy.', 'Noel is the grandson of legendary Seeker Overdeath and dreams of surpassing his strength. But it turns out that Noel is nothing but a Talker, the weakest class of them all. Undeterred, he uses his silver tongue to gather allies, develop cunning strategies, and form the greatest clan around. Now, as the most notorious Talker, Noel will do whatever it takes to claim supremacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vntXNezLAhIlh7CbXhrjirkSG3z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258580'),
  ('1100176340015407937', 'The Mothers of Penguins', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Masza Wągrocka, Barbara Wypych, Magdalena Różczka, Tomasz Tyndyk, Jan Lubas, Tola Będzikowska, Maksymilian Młodawski, Amelia Sarzyńska', 'TV-MA', 'When her seven-year-old son moves to a new school, an MMA fighter realizes that her toughest fight won''t be in the octagon, but in parenthood.', 'When her seven-year-old son moves to a new school, an MMA fighter realizes that her toughest fight won''t be in the octagon, but in parenthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pBeRmqnMEGlBgpjPK0OYqPw6Kg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:252747'),
  ('458389717303221155', 'The Motive', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Tali Shemesh, Asaf Sudri', 'Asaf Sudry, Tali Shemesh', 'Avi Samuel, Yossi Arnon, Yossi Cohen, Haim Siani, Shmuel Tiano, Mazal Freige, Irit Hachham Shalev', null, 'In Jerusalem 1986, a 14-year-old boy shoots his family point-blank in their beds. Yet questions persist. In this docuseries, insiders come forward.', 'In Jerusalem 1986, a 14-year-old boy shoots his family point-blank in their beds. Yet questions persist. In this docuseries, insiders come forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUl3WDHBjAQn0Wsf4zUeE7XHSRt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137004'),
